 engravings covering the surface and the captured elemental essence implicate Cho\'gall and his minions are behind this.$B$BIf you find more of these, please bring them to me or one of my associates. We need to learn more about what\'s behind this attack.',0),(25787,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not another one! $n, these devices have been springing up all around Azeroth. We know that they can instigate elemental disturbances in the area, including causing tears in the elemental planes.$B$BThe devices stink of Twilight\'s Hammer. The engravings covering the surface and the captured elemental essence implicate Cho\'gall and his minions are behind this.$B$BIf you find more of these, please bring them to me or one of my associates. We need to learn more about what\'s behind this attack.',0),(25789,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not another one! $n, these devices have been springing up all around Azeroth. We know that they can instigate elemental disturbances in the area, including causing tears in the elemental planes.$B$BThe devices stink of Twilight\'s Hammer. The engravings covering the surface and the captured elemental essence implicate Cho\'gall and his minions are behind this.$B$BIf you find more of these, bring them to me or one of my associates. We need to learn more about what\'s behind this attack.',0),(25790,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'THEY WHAT?!',19116),(25791,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'THEY WHAT?!',0),(25795,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! Is it true that you are the $gwestmaster:leader; the attack on the twilight dragon?$B$BTruly, you are the $gwestmaster:messenger; of the ancients!',19342),(25796,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'ll teach them. You\'ve softened the Splithoof up enough that we should be able to govern them now with a minimal guard presence from the Speedbarge.$B$BThat is, once we\'ve dealt with their supposed air elemental leader.',19116),(25797,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'ll teach them. You\'ve softened the Splithoof up enough that we should be able to govern them now with a minimal guard presence from the Speedbarge.$B$BThat is, once we\'ve dealt with their supposed air elemental leader.',0),(25798,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oil! Black gold! Tanaris Tea!$B$BWe\'re rich! We just have to clear out the remaining pesky centaur. I\'m sure with all the money we\'re going to make, we can relocate them to some other bluff.',19116),(25799,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oil! Black gold! Tanaris Tea!$B$BWe\'re rich! We just have to clear out the remaining pesky centaur. I\'m sure with all the money we\'re going to make, we can relocate them to some other bluff.',0),(25807,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я... жива.$B$BТе, кто пытались осквернить меня и похитить моих детей скоро испытают на себе остроту моих когтей, |3-6($c). Можешь не сомневаться.$B$BПродолжай продвигаться вглубь Хиджала. Я соберусь с силами и присоединюсь к другим Древним.',19342),(25810,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Так это правда – Авиана вернулась, и ты ее $gвестник:вестница;.$B$BНам предстоит много работы. Мы находимся в самом сердце Огненных Просторов. Сетрия перенесла сюда украденные на горе Хиджал яйца, чтобы тут высидеть хищников, обученных убивать.$B$BЯ надеюсь, ты $gготов:готова; нанести ответный удар!',19342),(25812,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A... a $R? Here?$B$BI must be mad...',0),(25813,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well then, let\'s see them get any kind of magical hocus pocus air support now when we take over!',19116),(25814,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well then, let\'s see them get any kind of magical hocus pocus air support now when we take over!',0),(25816,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fitzsimmons sent you, didn\'t he? It\'s been so long...',0),(25817,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The cries of anguish have been stifled...but the source of the curse still lurks.',0),(25818,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The key is rusted but it fits the lock neatly.',0),(25819,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Eye of Paleth? You say Fitzsimmons sent you out?$B$BBy the light...not again. Fitzsimmons is dead, lad. You\'ve not the first to come to me like this, either.',0),(25824,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, it\'s not encouraging, but it\'s something...',0),(25825,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is oil! You\'re really proving yourself to be invaluable, $n!$B$BToo bad I\'m going to have to send you off now.',19116),(25826,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is oil! You\'re the best, $n!$B$BToo bad I\'m going to have to send you off now.',0),(25830,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я… все еще… жив.',19342),(25832,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Aviana\'s face remains nonchalant when you tell her about events in the incubator.>$B$BMy eggs were stolen, |3-6($c). They were taken to a dark place to be desecrated there.$B$BMy children have been kidnapped, tortured... burned in a cauldron of fire... The Twilight Hammer will pay for it.$B$BBut I have to admit, there\'s a part of me that wants to take off and see... this whole world burn down.',19342),(25835,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad that Fizzle finally sent you here. We\'re helping the tauren to retake Freewind Post and push back the Grimtotem.',0),(25836,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am honored that you have come to help, $C. It was kind of Pozzik to send you.',0),(25842,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, |3-6($r).$B$BТеперь я могу уйти.$B$BВсе, что когда-то наполняло меня, весь этот лес... принадлежит тебе.',19342),(25843,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$R.$B$BI remember you $gSavior: Savior; my children.$B$BBthe remorse of revenge has come.',19243),(25849,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'See? Not bad, eh? Why, I almost wish all my finds decided to dig themselves up for me. It\'d make my job a lot easier!$B$BOf course, you made it easier too, $n. Much obliged.',0),(25850,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s showin\' em what for! Good on you.',0),(25852,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You say the Grimtotem are no longer a threat? That\'s great, but we\'ve got Horde all up our keesters!',0),(25853,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a relief! Maybe we can dig our way out of the hole we\'re still in, eh?$B$BNo, nevermind, just a bad joke.',0),(25854,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful! These should be ready to hatch within the day...$B$BNow I just need to cobble up a raptor pen before they all hatch nigh-simultaneously. What could go wrong?',0),(25855,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, wonderful! I\'ll be able to start reassembling these right away. Thank you so much!',0),(25856,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m much obliged, $C. This\'ll go a ways towards getting my family back on their feet.',0),(25857,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Amazing! You\'re a true hero, $n. I\'ll never forget what you\'ve done for me and my family.$B$BI know it\'s not much, but please, take this with my blessing.',0),(25864,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A job well done. Consider this reward not from me, but from Ironforge; the preservation of Khaz Modan is a matter that concerns every dwarf.',0),(25865,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done! The Ironforge Guard appreciates this, $n. You\'ve done our city a fine favor.$B$BBut something new has come up...',0),(25866,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t suppose they agreed to come along quietly? Didn\'t think so.',0),(25867,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should do it! The more gnolls those fools have to chase after, the easier it\'ll be to keep them in line.',0),(25868,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A job well done! You\'ve brought one of Ironforge\'s most wanted to justice today, $n. I\'d say you\'ve earned a mighty fine reward.',0),(25869,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Grim business, that.<Quentin coughs.>$B$BNo pun intended.',0),(25870,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s a good start. Normally, I wouldn\'t wish harm on any of the Earth Mother\'s creatures.$B$BBut attacking us at our most vulnerable moment?! They deserve to die!',0),(25871,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for freeing her, $n. Those Grimtotem monsters would have killed her in cold blood.',0),(25872,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for freeing him, $n. Those Grimtotem would have killed him in cold blood.',0),(25873,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A traitor amongst the tauren?$B$BI\'ve never heard of such a thing. Clan rivalries and warfare are one thing, but killing your own in cold blood.$B$B<Quentin shakes his head in disbelief.>',0),(25874,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The cliffwatcher was a Grimtotem spy?! No wonder we had no warning!$B$B<Thalia seethes with barely contained rage.>$B$BI don\'t want that damned thing. Throw it into the water and let the Longhorn name never be spoken again!',0),(25881,1,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gсобрал:собрала; всех выживших? Прекрасно. А оставшаяся часть горы исцелилась?$B$BРазрази меня гром! Мы снова оказались на передовой!',19243),(25883,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re confident that your assault on the naga armaments has made an impact on their effectiveness.',0),(25884,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The waters surrounding the Holding Pens are red with the blood of the naga.$B$BRendel would be proud!',0),(25885,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, yes. This is the stuff.$B$BMaybe I can gradually eat less of it and avoid that side-effect.$B$BThank you, $n.',0),(25886,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Изумительно! Силы культа Сумеречного Молота, конечно же, снова попробуют взять гору, вот только в бой их больше не поведут тугие на голову капитаны.',19243),(25887,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is as it should be.$B$BNow the way is clear to deal these naga a crippling blow.',0),(25888,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let us hope for the safety of those released prisoners.$B$BIn return for your noble efforts, please accept this gift.',0),(25892,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You made it! After the attack at the forward post, I thought we might be the only ones left. I\'m very glad to see you.',0),(25893,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impeccable timing. Like clockwork! Trouble comes. You come. Save the day. Clockwork!$B$BWe\'ve devised our brilliant plan. Gloriously simple, barring the hostility of local life. Simpler yet with a you available!',0),(25894,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Less gill goblins is good!$B$BI\'m glad that they\'re so primitive. I don\'t think I\'d want to be dealing with a race of aquatic tech-freaks right now. Not at all.',0),(25895,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me see, let me see... flare gun... balloon... no rope. Never any rope. Terribly impractical if you do ask me. Rope should be mandatory.',0),(25897,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is great! I love it. It should work per... ewww! Is this stuff braided with hair?$B$BDoesn\'t matter. Almost done. This thing will be ready in the twist of a rope.',0),(25898,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect! There\'s no way they missed that, fighting or not.',0),(25899,6,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,'Скольких ты $gубил:убила;? Неплохо. Очень даже неплохо. Думаю, мои люди больше не найдут никаких отговорок.',19243),(25901,1,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beautiful! They\'re still sharp. The plumage is covered in blood, but it\'s no trouble. Thank you, $n. We can defend the Hijal again.',19243),(25904,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это древняя сила.$BПримитивная.$BПростая.$B$BМы обратим ее против них.',19243),(25906,6,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебя послал бог-черепаха? Будь благословен его панцирь! Я уж думал, что останусь тут навечно!',19243),(25909,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Duarn looks at the crab and disguises a frown.>$B$BIt doesn\'t look very impressive, does it?',0),(25910,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Так вот, значит, как.$B$BОт осознания того, с какими жуткими существами вступил в союз Сумеречный Молот, у меня кровь в жилах вскипает и сворачивается.',19243),(25911,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That is the best news I\'ve heard in what seems like an eternity. We\'ll get the survivors moving over there to the surface as soon as possible. Perhaps we can forget that this whole nightmare ever happened.$B$BThank you, $n. I\'m not sure there\'s anything I can do to repay you for everything you\'ve managed to accomplish in this ocean, but I will try to find a way.$B$BYou should consider meeting us at the ships later, when you finish saying your goodbyes to the naga.',0),(25915,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О да… Секрет силы Немесиса находится в этих пещерах.$B$BТеперь мы знаем все, что нам нужно, $n. Пора покончить с этим.',19243),(25916,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I had assumed that the naga were only here for those pearls. No, this makes much more sense. If they had Nespirah\'s power under their control, the amount of damage the naga could do would be catastrophic!$B$BSomething must be done.',0),(25917,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n... is that you?',0),(25918,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Admiral Dvorek admires the polearms you present him.>$B$BOh, I\'m sorry. I was just imagining what these will look like with little bits of naga stuck to the ends of them. Thank you, $n. We\'ll put these to good use.',0),(25919,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hopefully we made some progress. I\'m not sure how we\'ll know when the creature wakes up, but something tells me that it will be pretty obvious when it does.',0),(25920,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brilliant work!$B$B<Valoren tucks the pearls away beneath her armor.>$B$BNow I just need you and Captain Taylor to get me safely out of here. I can handle the studies from there on.',0),(25921,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No need to bring me up to speed... Nespirah has been narrating your adventures as they happened, and Captain Taylor filled me in on the rest.$B$B<Duarn closes his eyes and nods.>$B$BNespirah says that she is quite grateful, and that she has a small surprise ready for the naga.',0),(25922,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It appears that I owe you my life, yet again. Thank the Light that you found me before you and your shaman activated those bio-defenses.',0),(25923,1,5,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Захватчик пал!$B$BСумеречный Молот мечтал создать собственный пантеон из оскверненных древних, чтобы править землей, водой и воздухом. С твой помощью нам удалось с ними покончить.$B$BТортолла должен узнать об этом!',19243),(25924,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not exactly the battle you had anticipated, I\'ll wager. But a battle nonetheless, as you shall soon see....',0),(25926,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahhh... yes. The swamp suffers less now.$B$BMore threats, though. More lurk. I can see them!',0),(25927,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes... the flames die. There is peace now. Peace for the land.',0),(25928,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gбыл:была; на Огненных Просторах?$B$BНемесис мертв?$B$BЕще одной угрозой меньше.$B$BБлагодарю тебя.',19243),(25929,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here you are, $C. With this you should find maneuvering in the sea to be nearly effortless. $B$BNow we must get to work. There is much to be done in little time.',0),(25936,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'While you were away, I was able to revive some of the fallen warriors.$B$BWe\'ll need every hand if we are to survive here.',0),(25939,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In sparing the land further suffering, you\'ve also helped us soothe the Greenwarden.$B$BMany thanks, $n.',0),(25941,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hear you, $R.$B$BI understand the urgency, but these men are in no condition to fight.',0),(25942,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let us hope that your work has bought us the time we need...',0),(25943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good grub.$B$BSoon we\'ll be back to fighting strength.',0),(25944,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well, $R.$B$BOur chances of survival are increasing.',0),(25945,1,25,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Пока ты в Когтистых горах и в армии Кром\'гара, будешь $gодет:одета; по форме! Ясно? Ты меня хорошо слышишь?! Увижу тебя без накидки с эмблемой Адского Крика – такого пинка отвешу, что шнурками подавишься.',20886),(25946,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Blood and Thunder!$B$BThis changes everything, $C!',0),(25950,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Chicken and rice, $n! That will show those sorry and sad snakes who\'s the ol\' pitch and toss!$B$BNow it\'s bird lime for that tiddlywink. Finger and thumb or plink plonk?',0),(25961,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brilliant! I can\'t have expected much more with the tools I gave you.$B$BI should be able to fill in the blanks and get this all written out shortly. There\'s no knowing if we will make it out of this place, but if it comes down to it, I will find a way to float this to the surface in hopes that it will one day be found.$B$BThank you again, $n. You\'re not bad.',0),(25975,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should be enough for now. We know where there\'s more should the need arise.',0),(25977,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice Uncle Bob of pokin\' their general.$B$B<The lieutenant shakes her head and grins.>',0),(25981,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, they\'re ugly, but they mostly look harmless. Smelly though.$B$BHere, let me clean the gilblin stuff out of these. I\'ve got an idea....',0),(25983,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s very disturbing news, but I believe our Earthen Ring friends here have a plan.$B$BAnd now that you\'re here....',0),(25985,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, you were sent here by Tiala? A wonderful student, she\'ll do many great things.$B$BAlthough I sense even greater potential from you.$B$BPlease, stay a while in our shrine. There\'s much to do, but you can\'t accomplish anything with a troubled mind.',0),(25987,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What happened? That thing wasn\'t completely dead! Maybe I should stick to mechanical stuff.$B$BIt gave you a vision? Of killing all of us?! That doesn\'t sound good.$B$BWell, in any case, that Earthen Ring fellow, Erunak Stonespeaker, wants these specimens all taken out to him. I\'ll make sure he gets them. I don\'t want them anywhere near me.',0),(25998,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank goodness you\'re here, $n. The airfield\'s been attacked by the Dark Irons and I don\'t think we can hold out much longer. ',0),(25999,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Saurboz looks you over.>$B$BYou have all of your limbs intact. This is a first.',0),(26001,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Blastgineer Fuzzwhistle is definitely dead. It\'s probably for the best.$B$BIt looks like he\'s holding a note in his hand.',0),(26002,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Damn shame... He was a good goblin.$B$B<Saurboz shakes his fist.>$B$BAs for you, $n, you\'ve done well. These attack plans will help us prepare. I want you to deliver the plans to Overlord Krom\'gar personally! There\'s sure to be a promotion in it for you.',0),(26003,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, brother! Now they will know that they cannot sneak up on the Horde!',0),(26004,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Overlord Krom\'gar takes the plans from you.>$B$BHmm. Perhaps this grunt is more than he would appear. Perhaps this grunt is in actuality a sergeant.$B$BLook now upon Krom\'gar Sergeant $n, soldiers. He has come to serve warning of a cowardly Alliance attack. An attack that we will CRUSH!',0),(26005,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You made it out! Good to see you, $n.$B$BIt\'s good to be out of the water for a bit, and to have some resources at our disposal again. I\'m sure many of the boys would give anything to turn around and head home after what we\'ve been though, but we still have a grim task ahead.$B$BWhat about you? Want to stick it through to the end with us? I wouldn\'t blame you if you\'ve had your fill.',0),(26007,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, it\'s not encouraging, but it\'s something...',0),(26008,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let us hope for the safety of those released prisoners.$B$BIn return for your noble efforts, please accept this gift.',0),(26009,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Much more blood shall be spilled upon this soil before this war is over. Alliance blood...',0),(26010,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lok\'tar! Alliance pigs!$B$B<Overlord Krom\'gar spits on the ground.>$B$BEnjoy the victory for it shall be short lived. Your bravery has given us more time to prepare, nothing more.',0),(26011,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did you find any suspicious documents at Paltrow\'s camp? Perhaps on his rotting corpse? Any insight into the Alliance\'s attack patterns would be extremely helpful in the battle for Stonetalon.',0),(26014,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Of course we haven\'t returned yet! We\'ve had our fair share of setbacks... not the least of which was the passing of my dear brother Oskar.$B$B<Humphrey sniffles loudly.>$B$BHe lost his grip and floated away, the poor lad! He thought he\'d grab some fish to bring back to the captain, but he floated off, and was eaten by one o\' those... those great-eels! Bwaaaah ha ha haaaah!',0),(26015,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Humphrey grabs the phosphora from you and attaches it to an unusual device.>$B$BThere ya go. It\'s beautiful! Oskar would be proud.',0),(26016,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gnomish flying machines? Our anti-air cannons are still not functional! We will be sitting ducks.$B$BI require time to plan... to think...$B$BThe hot air balloon and its payload cannot remain at Krom\'gar Fortress. I must make arrangements to move the balloon to another location. Our plans to destroy Windshear Hold with it are foiled.',0),(26017,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ya did good, $n! Ya did real good!',0),(26018,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Humphrey listens as you recount your fights with the Coldlight murlocs.>$B$BHmm... they sound like regular ol\' murlocs... just underwater. That\'ll make Cap\'n Glovaal happy.',0),(26019,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whaaa... an egg? An EEL egg?$B$B<Even upside-down, you can see the gears in Humphrey\'s head turning.>$B$BWe can definitely do something with this! Get ready kid, \'cause it\'s time for some good ol\'-fashioned Digsong revenge!',0),(26020,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Properly motivated? Wha... what does that mean? Listen, Sergeant, I have a built in mechanism for survival called self-interest. That is, it\'s in my best interest to NOT DIE. With that said, there\'s no fixing these guns without the right materials.',0),(26021,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oskar\'s alive? Wait... what did ya say? Ya let him FLOAT AWAY AGAIN?!$B$BWell... ya held up your end of the bargain, and I appreciate everything ya\'ve done, $n.$B$BHere... take this. I\'ve only been hanging onto it as ballast, but it doesn\'t seem to be doing much good.',0),(26022,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is but a prelude to the slaughter we will visit upon these lands. All will know our name.$B$BYou have done well, $n. Victory for Sylvanas!',0),(26023,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes... I was once Prince of the fallen kingdom of Stromgarde. I was cut down by the one seeking Trol\'kalar.$B$BI rue my foolish life now. I serve...only Sylvanas.',0),(26024,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You took down Marez Cowl? Well done, $n. Well done indeed!$B$BMarez menaced our Stromgarde defenders, and it is rumored she was an emissary between the Syndicate and some other, darker power. We are glad to see that she\'ll no longer ply her powers against us.',0),(26025,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My restless nights will turn to peaceful slumber when I have destroyed this orb. Thank you, $n. It is a chilling reminder of the terrible power the demons held over the orcs before Hellscream released them from their curse.',0),(26026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Clarissa claps excitedly.>$B$BMr. D you\'re gonna be ok! Hooray!$B$B<Clarissa expertly places all of the parts you collected into Large Daddy.>$B$BOh, Mr. D! I knew it!',0),(26027,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Cleared out properly? Good. I doubt we\'ll even bother to lurk in Stromgarde. That ramshackle hole needs to be razed into dust.$B$BThe land would make a decent spot for a new Undercity in its place.',0),(26028,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Overlord Krom\'gar coughs.>$B$BI am - perhaps for the first time in my life - at a loss for words.$B$BI am really not sure where Clarissa even came from...',0),(26029,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is the fate of all who would stand in our way.',0),(26030,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hated the Syndicate in life as much as I do in death. To see the sigil again is a small comfort.$B$BBut we have much more work to do... for Sylvanas.',0),(26031,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thoradin was the founder of Arathor. Just as I join these fragments together, he joined the scattered tribes of humans into their first great nation.$B$BBut I\'m sure you\'re not interested in such drivel. Forgive me. Old memories are often hard to bury.',0),(26032,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Valorcall was loyal to me in life. His death will not be something I bear lightly.$B$BBut bear it I must. I am Forsaken. My old existence means nothing.$B$BThe sigils are ours; Trol\'kalar awaits.',0),(26033,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Trol\'kalar, my father\'s blade... it seems like it\'s been an eternity since I saw it.',0),(26034,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Krasus listens intently as you relate your battle with Halion, and then his eyes go wide at the mention of Deathwing.>$B$BWe owe you a debt of gratitude, mortal, for driving the invaders from the Sanctum. But this news of the Destroyer is troubling beyond words. I have much to discuss with the other members of the Accord.$B$BTake these as a token of my thanks, as you gird yourselves for the coming storm.',0),(26035,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not bad. Since it\'s clear you\'ve got your head on straight, I was hoping you could help us with a more pressing job.',0),(26036,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brilliant, $n. One item down an\' three more to go, based on my list. The other three items are all in Stromgarde.$B$BTake a rest an\' get your strength back--the next phase of my plan\'ll require a little more time an\' effort. Come back to me after you\'ve gotten a warm meal an\' some rest.',0),(26037,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You amaze me, $n. Well done again.$B$BGive me a moment to cast the proper spell an\' you\'ll be ready.',0),(26038,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Malin couldn\'t\'ve asked a worthier person to come here an\' aid us, $n. You\'ve done a grand job!$B$BHe\'ll be pleased to see what an overwhelming success our mission\'s been.',0),(26039,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! You activated these shards. Already I feel more myself!$B$BBut alas, I am still far from free...',0),(26040,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, yes. This is the stuff.$B$BMaybe I can wean off of it and avoid the side-effect.$B$BThank you, $n.',0),(26041,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Myzrael speaks through the stone.>$B$BYou have done it! You opened the Stones of Binding! I can feel the shackles about me loosen, and freedom draws ever closer.$B$BYou are a noble $C, $n. My rescuer!',0),(26042,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You place the rod in the keystone. And a shudder is felt beneath you...',0),(26043,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A testament to the might of the Horde!',0),(26044,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Um... Well you see, it\'s quite simple... THIS CAVE IS SWARMING WITH SOULLESS KILLING MACHINES!',0),(26045,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll be damned! You managed to get the parts and not die. How are you only a sergeant?',0),(26046,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Get the parts, kill the elementals and rescue the peons... We get all of that done and we\'re as good as promoted!',0),(26047,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew it! You are a hero! If I have anything to do with it, you\'ll be promoted to legionnaire!',0),(26048,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just in time! The flying machines are starting to mass. Attack is imminent!',0),(26049,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As the eldritch shackles are placed around the Shards, an unhuman wail is heard from far below. The scream is followed by a roar.$B$BThe Shards of Myzrael no longer invoke feelings of warmth and security as they once did. Now they pulse with an open menace... as if the thing beneath them holds ill will toward the surface.',0),(26050,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The goggles work perfectly now! Well done, $n.',0),(26051,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Most superb, $n! The Captain will be very pleased! And just wait until word gets back to Fleetmaster Seahorn!',0),(26052,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So the little gnomes proved their worth after all? I knew we kept those ankle biters around for a reason!',0),(26053,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. The march of the Forsaken continues.',0),(26054,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sandfury trolls and the Cult of Twilight\'s Hammer, you say?$B$BAnd they meant to send some giant monster into the heart of the city?!$B$BWell done! Stormwind is in your debt.',0),(26055,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work out there, $n.$B$BThose scum deserved what they got. While nothin\' will ever bring me ship or me crew back, the death of those naga gives me some solace.',0),(26056,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I sure am glad you\'re here!',0),(26058,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have never seen such an act of bravery. You saved the base, sergeant - or should I say legionnaire! Lok\'tar!',0),(26059,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see that Krom\'gar has sent his best!$B$BGood, we have much work to do. The filth that is the Alliance have entered into a treaty with the Grimtotem. Now we fend off attacks from both forces.$B$BWe are spread thin across the Greatwood Vale and will soon fall beneath the concerted effort of our enemies. There is only one hope: VOODOO!',0),(26060,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. Once I have everything I need I will mix it all together and unleash the voodoo! Woe unto our enemies!',0),(26061,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. Once I have everything I need I will mix it all together and unleash the voodoo! Woe unto our enemies!',0),(26062,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Finally! Now I will create the charm that will hold the voodoo enchantment!',0),(26063,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Darn still not very happy, but Darn will reward you for what you have done.',0),(26064,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. These eggs should get us through the week.',0),(26066,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In times of crisis, a desperate act may be all that is needed to secure victory. Sending a swarm of kobolds at the enemy may be the edge that we need to win.',0),(26067,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Victory, at last! Though it stands to reason that without a stable supply line this victory will be short lived. Enjoy it while it lasts, $n.',0),(26068,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Devo laughs.>$B$BFascinating tale, friend. It would seem that our newfound kobold allies might be somewhat useful after all!',0),(26069,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The situation is grim, $R. We need all of the help that we can get!',0),(26070,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good enough for me.$B$BDon\'t get too complacent, $n. The hard part\'s about to come.',0),(26073,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lok\'tar ogar! You are the embodiment of what it means to be a Horde soldier, $n. If only we had more like you, this war would be over and Kalimdor would belong to the Horde - UNCONTESTED!$B$BRise now as a champion of Krom\'gar!',0),(26074,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Krom\'gar has sent his champion! Well you haven\'t a thing to worry about, Champion. We\'ll get the balloon all fueled up in no time. How about you lend a hand around here while you wait?',0),(26075,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I sure hope you didn\'t miss any. I don\'t think I can take much more of this!',0),(26076,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And they called me crazy. I knew this place was crawling with spies. Poop too.',0),(26077,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Chieftain Cliffwalker and his tauren seek to commit treason against the Horde! They claim that the ancient tree at the heart of Battlescar Valley is merely a school for druids. They are blind to the fact that desperate measures are taken during war time. My scouts have assured me that the night elves hide a weapon of great power within that tree. We\'re going to end this now!',0),(26078,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done! My men are working hard on getting our flying machines and steam tanks back into the fight. ',0),(26079,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Falconcrest and Otto? Wonderful!$B$BHere is your reward, $n. I am happy to pay it.',0),(26080,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see. Yes, I am rememberink now... Humphrey and Oskar vere not the strongest svimmers.$B$BThe reconnaissance is helpful, and the extra fish look very tasty. If you are seeink Mister Digsong before he returns, please send him my thanks.',0),(26081,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The news of your victory satisfies me, $C... a rare sensation. The Dark Lady herself has mused that our conquest of Lordaeron may be the only way the Forsaken can find true satisfaction, and pehaps even relief.$B$BBut it matters not. Our victory is inevitable. For your loyal service to the Forsaken, I award you in the name of Sylvanas.',0),(26082,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You possess quite a talent for destruction, $n. Whatever Alliance remain after your rampage across Battlescar Valley will be dealt with by the bomb.',0),(26083,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You friends with Goutgut! Him weird ogre. Smell funny.',0),(26084,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throm\'ka, $C. If your deeds for the undead are as great as you claim, I am honored to help you serve the Horde.',0),(26085,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The men are finding hidden reserves of strength and courage to deal with the Dark Iron onslaught. The airfield will not fall on our watch! ',0),(26093,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good, $n. The last thing we need with the undead looming is a gang of common thieves distracting us.',0),(26094,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The momentum is starting to shift, $n, largely due to your efforts. Now, it is time to strike at the Dark Iron leadership. ',0),(26095,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. We will inform the families of these fallen soldiers that they were killed in battle.$B$BIt will be grim news to bear, but it is better than the uncertainty of a missing loved one.',0),(26097,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Orthus is dead. He is clutching something in his hand.',0),(26098,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<High Chieftain Cliffwalker takes the insignia from you.>$B$B<High Chieftain Cliffwalker cries out in anger.>',0),(26099,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You saw with your own eyes, $n. General Grebo attacked us!$B$B$B$BNow what will we do? Surely the Warchief will have us all executed for treason.',0),(26100,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'WHAT? My General has been killed by the tauren? This is treason! HIGH TREASON! They will pay for this grievous error.',0),(26101,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The traitorous tauren will now stand by as we destroy his precious grove and burn his village to the ground!',0),(26102,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve done it! Without your help, Ironforge Airfield would surely be occupied by the enemy and the Dark Irons would have a clear road to Ironforge itself. The Council of Three Hammers must be informed of what happened here. ',0),(26103,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Engineer Hexascrub sticks a finger into each sample and sniffs it.>$B$BYes, I think this will do.',0),(26105,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did well, $n. We need to be especially wary of Horde attacks right now. The Pincer X2 has plenty of firepower at sea, but in the back of this cave, she is exceptionally vulnerable.',0),(26106,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Have you considered a career in science, $n? If you ever get tired of this $C nonsense, come see me! I could use an assistant with your devotion to experimentation and the scientific method.',0),(26107,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The lethargy that overcame me even after the camps fell was so strong, I refused this gift when it was first given to me.$B$BNow, I am proud to do my part in the name of the Horde.',0),(26108,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As Tor\'gan taught me, I transfer the power and the spirit of the raptors into this orb. It will imbue our warriors with the fiery strength and intelligence of the raptor.$B$BThe guile of the raptor is yours now as well, $C. Take it with pride, for the Horde!',0),(26110,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Apothecaries yet again. You think they\'d get the message. Let\'s see what it is this time...',0),(26112,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And just what is this? This is impossible! ',0),(26113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Refuge Pointe sent you? Good to know they\'re still there.$B$BWe\'ve got some interesting things to check into here, $C.',0),(26114,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The plague took our friends and family, but it was the Forsaken that took Phin. They\'re just as bad as the Scourge. I\'ll destroy every one of them with my own hands if I have to.$B$BWhen you\'re prepared, come let me know. We\'ll get started right away.',0),(26115,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now you truly know what it means to be a member of the Horde, $n.',0),(26116,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done a great service for us, $n. Thank you.$B$BI hope Kin wasn\'t too much of a handful down there. She\'s very friendly, but can be just as deadly when you\'re her enemy.',0),(26117,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I admit I\'m impressed, $C. It\'s a small comfort amidst all that\'s happened here.$B$BYou have fought the undead, struck back against the Horde, and honored the memory of the victims of Southshore. On behalf of the kingdom of Stromgarde, I present you with an official commendation, and this reward.',0),(26118,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The ambassador will trouble us no more. He is not the only Dark Iron $R whose heart still belongs to Twilight\'s Hammer. We must remember that and remain vigilant against their schemes, else my son will inherit only ruins and ashes.',0),(26120,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The orcs will know better than to press further west now. Well done.',0),(26121,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did well, $n. We need to be especially wary of Horde attacks right now. The Pincer X2 has plenty of firepower at sea, but in the back of this cave, she is exceptionally vulnerable.',0),(26124,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did well, $n. We need to be especially wary of Alliance attacks right now. The Verne\'s got plenty of firepower out at sea, but in the back of this cave, she\'s far too vulnerable.',0),(26125,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did well, $n. We need to be especially wary of Alliance attacks right now. The Verne\'s got plenty of firepower out at sea, but in the back of this cave, she\'s far too vulnerable.',0),(26127,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good show, lad, but we\'ve no time to celebrate. Thandol Span\'s in danger!',0),(26128,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And good riddance!$B$BThandol Span\'s safe thanks to you, $n, and hopefully Calamoth is down for good this time.',0),(26131,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You don\'t know how glad I am to see fresh faces from Ironforge. Perhaps sending Mountaineer Barleybrew wasn\'t a waste after all. ',0),(26132,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The last thing we needed was a bunch of summoned creatures swarming our forces during the final assault.',0),(26134,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Furien groans.>',0),(26137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, well met, $C.$B$BStormpike sent you? About the keg? Hoo boy...',0),(26139,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I suppose I owe Thargas a favor for sending such a bold hero my way.$B$BOr perhaps he just wanted to keep all the clean-up for himself. Regardless, you\'ll find much to do here for the Alliance.',0),(26145,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am quite impressed, $n. You have done the Dwarven race a great favor by defending our lands. King Magni Bronzebeard himself would be proud!',0),(26146,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n! You demonstrated uncanny courage on the battlefield. Our war against the Troggs will be won with efforts such as yours. You have served King Magni well.',0),(26147,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew the second I laid eyes on you, $n, that you would make Ironforge proud. You have served our people well. I salute you, $n.',0),(26148,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Most excellent, $n! You have brought hope to Loch Modan. With Grawmug dead, we stand a better chance of seeing the Troggs eliminated from the land.',0),(26150,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'William sent you? Bless his soul. I... I\'m ok... It\'s just... Well... ',0),(26152,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And justice is served! ',0),(26153,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice job, $n! Penny will be very excited for breakfast tomorrow!',0),(26157,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hah!  You Nethergarde nincompoops are always two steps behind me, and I\'m nowhere near as fast as I used to be.$b$bI don\'t need Mahar\'s note to know what\'s going on.  Why do you think I\'m cooped up in the back of this cave?  What I do need, however, is a strong $r like you.',19116),(26158,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent!  You\'ve managed to complete the simplest of tasks without dying.  Now that that\'s out of the way...',19116),(26159,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kasim eyes the blood hungrily.>$b$bMore than enough, and still warm!  Now, let\'s get this ritual started, shall we?',19116),(26160,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The blood ritual was a success; I can clearly see where we are going next.$b$bI\'m sorry, I misspoke.  What I meant to say is, I can see where YOU are going next...',19116),(26161,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... yes, I can work with this.$b$b<Kasim looks at the night elf\'s head.>$b$bLoramus Thalipedes, demon hunter.  I look forward to our reunion.',19116),(26162,53,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You... you fool!  What have you done?',19116),(26163,5,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,'No, no, no... not Kasim again!  This is madness!$b$bPlease, remain quiet.  If my commander learns that I still work for the short one, do you know how quickly I will be removed from the watch?$b$b<Grimeo takes the rune from you, presses it to his chest, closes his eyes, and sighs.>$b$bI see you speak the truth.  Let us begin our business quickly, so that it may end even quicker.',19116),(26164,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope this is what the gnome wanted.',19116),(26165,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There is no doubt about it, you have found demon blood.$b$bKasim\'s requests aside, I am sure that my Watch Commander is thankful for your efforts.  They have been struggling to deal with these demon distractions for some time now.',19116),(26166,396,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is sufficient.  If you see Grimeo again, you may tell him that he performed satisfactorily, but no... his debt is not yet cleared.  I will get to work on fashioning the stone knife of sealing.  There is no need for questions now.  All will be revealed in time.$b$bWhile I work, I have another task for you to complete.$b$bDon\'t look so upset!  This task will be fun... it involves collecting body parts.',19116),(26167,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kasim examines the amulet.>$b$bHe was an archmage, I can feel it.  I will hold the amulet for you while you collect the rest.',19116),(26168,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kasim hefts the amulet.>$b$bA warlock... and a powerful one at that.  I will hold onto this until the time is right.',19116),(26169,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kasim clutches the third amulet.>$b$bHe was a powerful warrior, this one.  I will keep the amulet until we are ready to proceed.',19116),(26170,397,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It would seem that we are prepared to face our demon, $n.  We have the amulet\'s blessing, we have the stone knife, and I alone know the demon\'s true name: Rakh\'likh.  Together, this may be enough to defeat the Defiler.',19116),(26171,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Loramus, resurrected!?  And then he trapped the demon inside his own body... by the Light...$b$bI see.  So this was Kasim\'s plan all along.  I suspected correctly, but I suppose I refused to believe it.$b$bAh, one last thing!  Kasim left one more instruction for me within his rune.  I did not understand it at first, but given the events that have taken place today, it now makes much more sense:$b$bHe asked me to let you choose from one of these.',19116),(26172,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are perfect, $n.  I will eat well for the next several days.',19116),(26173,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now you\'re doing great. $B$B<Commander moves closer and whispers:>$B$B$R... in case you\'re wondering, I have another small but responsible assignment...',19342),(26174,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебя точно никто не видел? Вот и славно.$B$B<Пустомар слушает, как вы пересказываете ему все, что узнали из документов.>$B$BГм… все вполне безобидно. То ли они там в Орде все идиоты и действительно ничего против нас не замышляют… то ли, наоборот, хитрые бестии и скрывают всю важную информацию гораздо лучше, чем я думал. Как бы там ни было, ты молодец.',19342),(26175,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Surwich, |3-6($r). Feel at home.',19342),(26176,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Glad to hear you\'ve been clearing out the troggs. Let\'s have a look at this report, and...$B$B...Is that a beer stain?',0),(26177,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These crabs look great! I will clean these up and make sure that the King hears about your contribution. Thanks!',0),(26181,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello again, $C.$B$BI felt L\'ghorek die. A shame that such a magnificent being is gone.$B$BIf we do not assist Neptulon, we will all meet the same fate.',0),(26183,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely $n. I will get to work right away on the cider.',0),(26184,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You say demons worshiped a tree? <Mayor\'s sighing hard. >> That\'s what I was afraid of...',19342),(26185,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хотя меня удивляет, что Конниспот все же решился осуществить свои планы, но лично я этому рада. Я знаю, что демоны сплотились вокруг Малдраза, и разделяю его опасения.',19342),(26186,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Major Charlton Connispot is watching with fear the tank you\'ve collected. >$b$bVery good, $n. Now we have everything we need to interrupt Marl\'s trance and put an end to both him and his experiment.',19342),(26187,396,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $n. Весь Сурвич у тебя в долгу.$B$BВыбери что-нибудь себе в награду. Мы не очень богаты, но тех, кто нас защищает, мы все-таки можем отблагодарить.',19342),(26189,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good to see you back in one piece, $n! You\'re quite a piece of work.$B$BI\'ll be tellin\' Captain Stoutfist how you took care of those orcs!',0),(26190,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. I will get to work scaling these for the King right away.',0),(26192,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These sacks look like just enough, $n. Can\'t wait to see the smiles on the orphans faces.',0),(26193,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'NO!$B$BThis is NOT over!',0),(26195,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the Greenwarden\'s grove, $C. I am glad Whelgar has told you of us.$B$BIf you are able to lend us your assistance, I will be most grateful.',0),(26196,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Supplies from Ferilon? Bless his heart.$B$BWe\'re good on food, but we\'re runnin\' out of bullets!',0),(26197,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, isn\'t it? It\'s a pleasure to finally meet you. While you were getting cleaned up, Nevin\'s team told me about your escape from Gnomeregan.',0),(26198,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You picked that one up quickly. I can\'t wait to show you some of my other favorite tricks.',0),(26199,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to meet you, $n. I\'m sure your time in Gnomeregan afforded you ample opportunity to practice your arts. Things are somewhat safer here, but your talents will never go to waste.',0),(26200,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n. You have a natural talent for our arts.',0),(26201,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As you continue to gain power, return to me and I will teach you new spells and techniques.',0),(26202,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, another one of Nevin\'s \"rescued\" survivors, eh? More than likely, you saved his life from the troggs down there. Did he stumble over his words when he mentioned me? The man has a healthy respect for the demonic powers we channel.',0),(26203,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For a $r who has spent so much time inside Gnomeregan, you look positively fit and healthy, $n. That\'s good. Before we can complete what Operation: Gnomeregan began, we\'re going to need more warriors like you. ',0),(26204,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work! Keep practicing your charge and you\'ll have an instant advantage at the start of battle.',0),(26205,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow, I never expected it to work on the first trial!$B$BUh, I mean, we\'ve succeeded! I wonder what other uses I we can find for this handy little guy.',0),(26206,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to meet you, $n. Nevin tells me that you managed to survive the dangers in Gnomeregan by using your wits. That\'s exactly what we need up here. Clever minds and quick blades.',0),(26207,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m not surprised to see you\'re such a quick study. I look forward to showing you more of our tricks of the trade.',0),(26208,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even now, only the S.A.F.E. teams dare to venture far into the city to search for survivors. Meanwhile, Thermaplugg has sent one of his followers, Crushcog, to distract us and buy time for him to dig in.',0),(26219,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vell done, Private $n.$B$BThe cavern is ours, but the beast escaped. Should it raise it\'s ugly head again, ve vill make with blastink it out of the vater.',0),(26222,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are fantastic! Let\'s see what we can put together. Would you be interested in testing out the prototype once I\'m done?',0),(26230,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У меня от запаха принесенной тобой снеди аж в животе заурчало! Сегодня пожрем как короли!',19342),(26234,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you are a skilled thief as well, $n. Don\'t worry, we will return the rice once we are done... or not.',0),(26264,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t wait to give this new technology a try! We\'ve lost more gnomes to radiation than we can count. It\'s time to turn that around!',0),(26265,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What a relief! Thank you for your help. I hope that gadget Engineer Grindspark was working on helps get the airfield cleaned up permanently.',0),(26269,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты меня очень здорово $gвыручил:выручила;, $n! Не знаю, как тебя и благодарить. Вот увидишь, скоро книга господина Эрнестуэя появится в каждой библиотеке по всему миру!$B$BЕсли когда-нибудь захочешь почитать ее целиком, всегда найдешь тут у меня экземпляр. Спасибо еще раз, $n!',23877),(26274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, mon! Dis stuff come easy to ya. ',0),(26278,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Keep up the good work, $C. Hellscream\'s eyes are upon you.',0),(26279,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you are good for more than simple egg-smashing duty. Good. The Horde can use a capable $R like you.',0),(26280,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work. Hopefully the raids will stop for now.$B$BI have one more task for you, $n.',0),(26281,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Aggro\'gosh salutes you.>$B$BThe Horde thanks you, $n. Grom\'gol is protected, if only for today.',0),(26284,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have me own thanks and th\' thanks of th\' men you rescued. I\'ve already had th\' boys start setting up the gear down inside the cave. It should be ready to go soon.',0),(26285,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, now, that\'s more like it. We may get around to blowin\' up somethin\' after all.',0),(26298,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are good tusks, $n. You prove that you have the strength to hunt the Bloodscalps.$B$BAnd that is good, because you are not done hunting them.',0),(26299,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. I will inspect these heads to ensure poor Yenniku was spared the headhunter\'s axe.',0),(26300,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You place the head of Nezzliok within the cauldron...',0),(26301,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes. These will serve me well. When my spirit is freed, I will enter the Nether with some fine servants indeed!$B$BYou are a credit to your $R clan, and you have appeased me.',0),(26302,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zanzil the Outcast??$B$BIf Yenniku is held by that troll, a vile and powerful witchdoctor, then I fear that only a faint hope remains. Faint. And tiny as the smallest insect.$B$BFortunately, I have some suspicions of my own. Suspicions which may lead to Yenniku\'s salvation.',0),(26303,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You retrieved the eye! Your might is the stuff of legends, $n!$B$BAnd in getting the Eye, you must have defeated Mai\'Zoth and sent him to the Nether. That is why the spirits would not mention him before.$B$BIt is good that he is gone from the world of flesh and bone, but now that he is in the realm of spirits...I fear he will begin a new reign.$B$BBut that is a worry for another time.',0),(26304,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My mother\'s spirit rests well tonight, $n.$B$BAs will I.',0),(26305,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it! You freed Yenniku from the will of Zanzil and the tyranny of the Skullsplitter, and completed the mission I had thought was so hopeless. Zanzil still looms a threat in the Cape of Stranglethorn, but for now, I at least know that the soul of my chief\'s son is free.$B$BOur tribe will remember your name in songs, $n, and we will etch your tale in stone so that it will live forever.',0),(26316,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It won\'t be tough to collapse th\' tunnel, but I\'m goin\' to need my team an\' my equipment \'afore I can get to th\' task.',0),(26317,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, the little one seems to have taken a liking to you. I suppose that one raptor alone and raised among orcs is much less deadly than a whole pack of them. Keep her, $n... she may come in handy.$B$BIn fact...',0),(26318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I could feel th\' explosion way up here! My boys did a fine job riggin\' up that blast, but it wouldn\'t have happened without your help. It\'s only fair that I split my contract payment with you for helpin\' me finish th\' job.',0),(26321,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'She looks bigger already! You can see, these raptors grow quickly. You are lucky to have found such a strong companion.$B$BKeep her by your side as long as you can, $n. I\'m sure she will prove to be an asset in the future.',0),(26322,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я немедленно пошлю в Западный Край батальон солдат! Если Братство Справедливости возродилось, то нашему королевству вновь угрожает опасность!',23877),(26323,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What do we have here? A young raptor, and her pet $R. Hah!$B$BMore importantly, what is that skull you have there? This was no ordinary troll. He was big...$B$B$B$B... and strong, too. Let\'s see what we can do with this one.$B$BDon\'t go anywhere.',0),(26325,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You drop the fetishes into the pot.>$B$BYes... yesss...$B$BMy spirit is strong again, $R, and I am ready to return to the world. Now I need a body.',0),(26327,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met! If you\'ve got a weapon on you, I\'ll take any help I can get clearing out these crazed fools!',0),(26329,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The high tinker reads Jessup\'s report.>$B$BSplendid news! With the troggs taken care of, we should be able to turn our attention to Crushcog\'s troublemaking.',0),(26330,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well, $R. Only one more step remains before I may return.',0),(26331,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should set back Crushcog\'s plans a bit, but we can\'t rest until he is defeated and Chill Breeze Valley is secure.',0),(26332,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You throw the mojo into the pot.>$B$BExcellent work, $R. You and your raptor have done a great thing. Hakkar would be most pleased...',0),(26333,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mekkatorque will be pleased to hear that you\'ve ruined Crushcog\'s plans to use our old weapons for his followers. Without the mechano-tanks under his command, he\'ll be weak and vulnerable.',0),(26334,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad to see you\'ve come to your senses.$B$BCome and visit us in Zul\'Gurub sometime, $R. I\'ll be watching...',0),(26336,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahoy, $C. Any friend of Skuerto is a friend of mine.$B$BYou\'ll find plenty of work needs doin\' around here. We\'re not sittin\' in this cove twiddlin\' our thumbs by choice.',0),(26338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Balance is restored - for now. We may call on you again in the future, $n.',0),(26339,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, yes, Kelsey told me to expect you. There\'s still much to do before we can take on Crushcog.',0),(26340,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm? Barnil\'s the name. And you are...?',0),(26341,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The shards pulse softly, and a whisper slowly echoes through your head.>$B$BHelp...',0),(26342,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve given us just the opening we\'ll need to get the drop on Crushcog. Excellent work, $n.',0),(26343,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, normal skins. In general, their appearance is not so important - they will still go to the lining. Nonetheless, quality comes first! Quality and convenience!$B$BIf you turn out to be harsh, soften with tiger blood. Well, you understand ... every professional has little professional tricks!',23877),(26344,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мои сапоги... они как копченая колбаса, $n. С виду приятна, прекрасна на вкус. Ты покупаешь мою колбасу, я тебя уверяю, что она приготовлена из свежайшего мяса, ты ее ешь с удовольствием, ты доволен и счастлив.$B$BИ тебе лучше не знать, из чего она сделана на самом деле. Так оно безопаснее и спокойней.',23877),(26345,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great! Thanks to your help I\'ll have this order filled and sent off to Director Riddlevox on the next boat to Undermine. Ahead of schedule, even!$B$BFor all your hard work, here, I made some extras, so take a pair. It\'s on Drizzlik.$B$BAnd remember, there\'s no boot so fine as one of Drizzlik\'s Excelsior line!',0),(26346,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Say no more, $n. I followed up with an... \"old friend\" while you were gone. I should\'ve known better than to send you to those shards.$B$BWe\'ve both made a grave mistake in involving ourselves in this. Luckily, I \"persuaded\" my boy Gerrig to tell me what to do if this happened.',0),(26350,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mandokir is alive, yes.$B$BYou are responsible, yes.$B$BYou may be able to stop him still, yes.',0),(26351,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You bring feathers, yes.$B$BYou can follow directions, yes.',0),(26352,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A fuel regulator? This seems important. At least, I hope it is.$B$BWe may not have ended the Venture Company\'s operations, but we at least slowed them down. Thank you, $n.',0),(26359,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What did Priestess tell you?$B$BThe raptor is daughter of Ohgan, heir to Mandokir\'s seat.$B$BHah!',0),(26364,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'re finally free of Razlo Crushcog and his interference! With the defeat of Crushcog and his forces, Thermaplugg can\'t afford to send any more of his followers to the surface. I can\'t wait for the day when we defeat him for good!',0),(26365,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They say the problems in the West End are above the roof. <Parker doesn\'t even turn to you. > But we have enough trouble here too. You see those gnolls over there? Looks like they\'re up to something again, and I don\'t like it. I don\'t like it at all.',23877),(26370,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пять лет трудов пошли коту под хвост в пять минут. Проклятое Братство!$B$BИ это еще только цветочки, $n! Нас ожидает долгая и трудная работа',23877),(26373,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If Gnomeregan Covert Operations is recommending you, then you must have made quite an impression. Your help will be most welcome here, as we\'ve a wealth of enemies and few enough mountaineers to face them.',0),(26378,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Убийства, новичок. Вот что творится в землях перед нашими глазами.',19342),(26383,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did the sentinels send you? Thank Elune. We need everyone we can get.',0),(26386,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You explain to Surkhan what has happened up to this point.>$B$BIt would seem that Jin\'do has survived, and he is rallying his brothers to once again summon Hakkar into this world. It was good of you to come to speak with me.$B$BThere is not much we can do now but to wait, and watch. Jin\'do is weak, and prime for striking, but I must wait for word from Rastakhan before issuing orders. Until then, you and your raptor will have to wait.',0),(26395,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A crate for Goldshire, eh?  People sure are getting lazy. Have you been to Goldshire before?  If so, then it\'s no problem, my friend.  I have plenty of gryphons trained to fly that route! ',0),(26396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great, you brought the armor!  We\'ll get this divvied to those who need it immediately. Thank you, $n.  Your efforts have been a great help to us.  And now that you\'re no stranger to gryphons, I hope you\'ll come and lend your aid to Goldshire often! ',0),(26397,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Grimtotem forced from Mulgore... if Baine speaks for this, you are indeed a fierce warrior.$B$BFrom this day, your strength is no longer your own. It belongs to me, and the Horde, as a weapon of war.$B$BHellscream\'s eyes are upon you, $n. Victory or death!',0),(26399,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Skeezy struggles fruitlessly to open the box.>$B$BThose ogres really know how to close a treasure chest, I\'ll tell you what. A box is useless to me, hero. We\'re going to need to find a way into this crate.',0),(26400,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The goblin peers inside.>$B$BWhaaaaaa?!?$B$BI\'m... I\'m going to have to send this to... to Flem... in the south. He\'ll know what to do with it.',0),(26401,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How horrible... for someone so young and full of promise to fall to demons!$B$BI beg your forgiveness for sending you into danger as well, $n. I hope you don\'t cross paths with that demoness again...',0),(26403,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great! Wonderful! I can get a bundle for these!!$B$BThat Venture Company sure picked the wrong jungle to mine in, didn\'t they? We\'d all be in better shape if they moved out of here.',0),(26404,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Skeezy sent you to the right place. Welcome to Hardwrench Hideaway!',0),(26405,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As promised, your reward. You do the troll nation proud.',0),(26407,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Far Seer makes sure to hold the item by the string, carefully avoiding the dead ogre\'s fist.>$B$BStrange indeed. I will pass this on to my contacts in the east, near the Mosh\'Ogg\'s main camp. I have a feeling that they\'ll be interested in these strange scars.$B$BYou have my thanks, $R.',0),(26408,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good to see a new face around here!$B$BThe forest crawls with Horde, but my assignment requires that I keep this outpost safe. I could really use someone who might be up for a good fight.',0),(26414,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work $n! I see you are quite the fisherman these days. Might just have to take you out on the boat soon and see what you can really do!',0),(26416,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hah! That Cromula cracks me up.$B$BOh, right, Stranglethorn. You\'re really going?',0),(26417,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Glad you could make it! Let\'s get to work, shall we?',0),(26420,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Those look like some nice bass, $n. Let\'s fry em\' up and see how they taste!',0),(26421,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to meet you, $n. You\'ve probably heard others speaking of Operation: Gnomeregan. Let me tell you a bit about what happened and why we left the dwarven city of Ironforge.',0),(26422,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to meet you, $n. You\'ve probably heard others speaking of Operation: Gnomeregan. Let me tell you a bit about what happened and why we left the dwarven city of Ironforge.',0),(26423,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to meet you, $n. You\'ve probably heard others speaking of Operation: Gnomeregan. Let me tell you a bit about what happened and why we left the dwarven city of Ironforge.',0),(26424,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to meet you, $n. You\'ve probably heard others speaking of Operation: Gnomeregan. Let me tell you a bit about what happened and why we left the dwarven city of Ironforge.',0),(26425,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to meet you, $n. You\'ve probably heard others speaking of Operation: Gnomeregan. Let me tell you a bit about what happened and why we left the dwarven city of Ironforge.',0),(26427,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'All right, help me get tied to the wheel.$B$B<Moody sips from the bottle.>',0),(26428,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You stand before me as a figure of vengeance, and I bow down before you in thanks.$B$BWith that cow\'s death, and knowing that their seed will no longer spread over the face of Azeroth, I can put my energy into something more lucrative. I hope you looted their farmstead after you finished them off.',0),(26429,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The signs of war are upon your garments, and sweat drips from your brow. Good, very good indeed.',0),(26433,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The goblin downs the water in one gulp.>$B$BAhh... do you know how hard it is to get fresh water in Stranglethorn? It\'s no wonder that the nagas guard their shrine so ferociously!$B$BOh, right... your artifact, and clarity. Clarity...$B$BI\'ve got it!',0),(26434,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Flem feels the hides and smiles to himself.>$B$BExcellent work, $n! These reagents will serve perfectly.',0),(26435,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fascinating!$B$BI\'ll need some time to study this. Why don\'t you have a look around Booty Bay and come back later?',0),(26442,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Looks like the traps are working! Thanks $n!',0),(26447,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dreadlords! They plan to attack us here at Splintertree Post?!$B$BNot while I still draw breath!$B$B<Valusha crumples the demon-scrawled plans in her fist.>$B$BNo. We will not allow this to happen! They are a blight upon our world!',0),(26448,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s better! There\'s nothing quite like ridding our world of a demon. And they make for worthy opponents as well, unlike the weak races of the Alliance.',0),(26449,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Never again will the Burning Legion make slaves of the orcs, or any other race of the Horde!$B$BBravely fought, $C! You have the true heart of the Horde beating inside of you! You give us much honor!',0),(26450,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work, $n. Now I\'ve just got to decide what to do with all of these...',0),(26451,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $R! Did you feel it? The rush of the melee? The true risk of free-for-all combat?$B$BAs today is your first day here, I\'ll let you perform in one more competition for another reward. If you return in the future, you may compete again, once a day. Your rewards will, of course, improve as you become stronger.',0),(26487,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey hey! Not bad, not bad at all! You may have a future in resource acquisition. Or hotel management.',0),(26488,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found it! I can\'t believe it was down there all those years! You have no idea how much this means to me $n.',0),(26489,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew you had it in you, boss-man. You know what they say: You can take the $R out of the islands, but you can\'t take the murderous tendencies out of $n.',0),(26493,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great! These look... disgusting. But probably pretty valuable. Let\'s get to splitting these up. Some for me, some for Jasper, some for Chabal...',0),(26494,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll file these away for now. Maybe we can experiment later.$B$B<Jasper looks over at you.>$B$BYeah, you\'ll do.',0),(26495,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The troll looks into the package.>$B$BYou have my thanks.$B$BI have been waiting for you to approach me, $R. I have identified you as the most promising $R here in this strange town. I have a task for you, if you would be willing to take it.',0),(26503,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Так я и знал! Это Изувой затеял всю эту возню, но смешней всего то, что мы регулярно убиваем гноллов с таким именем. Не знаю уж, сколько там сыновей было у самого первого Изувоя, но, видно, не меньше сотни.$B$BНу что ж, придется еще одного Изувоя убить.$B$BПотом надо будет доложить мировому судье Соломону.',23877),(26504,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A decent job is a worthy reward!$B$BLook, don\'t waste everything in one place, |3-6($c). Better spread it around, if you know what I mean.',23877),(26505,1,1,6,5,0,0,0,0,'<Peaceful Judge Solomon wears a monocle. >$B$BOh, you\'re not Conah. What do you got there?$B$B<Peaceful Judge Solomon takes Parker\'s report. >$B$BWhat the hell\'s the matter with him... Izuva? ONE more?!',23877),(26506,4,1,2,0,0,0,0,0,'ОТЛИЧНО!!! Прямо сейчас отправлю все это в кастрюлю, и скоро будет готов обед.$B$BСпасибо тебе,душечка!',23877),(26508,4,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, что нашли мое ожерелье, $gгосподин:госпожа:c; |3-6($c)… Вы $gтакой добрый:такая добрая;! И моя кошечка тоже спасибо говорит, да, Эфси?',23877),(26509,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Finally the menace is laid to rest! Thank you, $n, you have done me a great service. The garden shall be in full bloom this season!',0),(26510,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Превосходно! Давай-ка сейчас тут кое-что подправим, и можно будет приниматься за дело.',23877),(26511,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наконец-то кто-то проучил этих мурлоков. Надеюсь, в следующий раз, когда они решат напасть на наш город, они передумают.$B$BУж мы-то с тобой знаем, что такого больше не случится, да?',23877),(26512,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The gnomecorder crackles and pops.>$B$BCan you hear me, $n? Is this thing on? Ah, yes, I see you there now.$B$BLet\'s get to work!',0),(26513,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, citizen. Without you, we would have starved or worse, been forced to go out and get food for ourselves.',0),(26514,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The gnomecorder crackles and pops.>$B$BGood work, $n. I\'ve just been handed some important information. It would appear that our most hated enemy, the Blackrock orcs, have wised up...$B$B$B$BI\'ve transferred a few silver over to you for the gnome, erm, gnoll kills.',0),(26519,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The orb hisses as you touch it.>',0),(26520,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You used an ettin to remove the boulder that was crushing Foreman Oslow? Incredible work, $n! Oslow will be grateful once he regains his composure.',0),(26533,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Jasper carefully analyzes the strange compound.>$B$BThis mixture is... I don\'t understand it. Perhaps we need to run some clinical trials.',0),(26534,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You don\'t say! Well, that certainly is interesting. In that case...$B$BForget understanding how the stuff works! I gotta get my hands on that recipe!',0),(26535,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is fascinating! Just think of all the applications!$B$BJust so we\'re clear, I\'m not thinking about using this to make an army of slaves or anything like that. No, no... I\'m much more interested in the ogre explosions!',0),(26536,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These perch look great $n. Why don\'t you join us for a fish fry tonight?',0),(26544,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The gnomecorder buzzes and whirs.>$B$BJust put the missive in the little compartment and I\'ll read it. I am fluent in orcish.$B$B<You hear a distraught yell in the background.>$B$BIt looks like these orcs are here under the direct command of Yowler. That means Yowler must have the orc invasion plan.',0),(26545,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Magistrate Solomon takes the plans from you and begins reading.>$B$BShadowhide army!? Damn those orcs to hell! These invasion plans speak of a massive build up of orcish and gnoll forces in the east. Looks like Gath\'Ilzogg, the Blackrock general, is preparing to march his armies across Lakeshire and attack Stormwind directly!',0),(26550,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is as I suspected. Zanzil is too haughty to interfere with the squabbles between the Bloodscalps and the Skullsplitters. No, he is playing a part in a grander scheme... Jin\'do the Hexxer is using him to help bring Hakkar back to Zul\'Gurub.$B$BIt\'s good that we found this out now, because it offers us a simple solution.',0),(26555,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I ask you to slay Zanzil the Outcast, a lowly, hermetic exile of the Gurubashi, and what do you do? You dash headfirst into the Gurubashi capital and eliminate one of their High Priests! Very nearly two! Only one word suffices to explain such a rash and foolhardy endeavor:$B$BHeroism.$B$BJin\'do the Hexxer still walks within Zul\'Gurub\'s walls, but he lost one of his legs when you crushed Jeklik. Today\'s battle is ours.',0),(26560,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know where they\'re holding Krakauer and Danforth. We gotta hurry. They were prepping those two for a sacrifice!',0),(26561,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wha... Where am I? What happened? Messner? Jorgensen?$B$BOH MY GOSH! We have to get to Danforth! It might already be too late!',0),(26562,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s about time you showed up! My hands are already starting to leak.',19342),(26563,66,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'<Colonel Trotman salutes. >$B$BI don\'t believe it, $n. You\'re $gmanaged:managed; saved the entire Bravo team from the Black Mountain Orcs? So, Kishan`s comrades are saved, we returned his things to him too - no, now he certainly won`t refuse us!',19342),(26566,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So the high tinker himself has heard of my little project? Splendid! I\'ve almost finished my latest prototype, but maybe you can help me chase down those last few parts.',0),(26567,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Help you? Help these people? These people that would rather spit on me than crack a smile?',0),(26568,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Troteman sighs.>$B$BI\'m not giving up on him, $n, and I\'m not giving up on Redridge. We need to boost his spirits... Rouse the slumbering monster within him!',0),(26569,4,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты молодчина, $n! Они очень пригодятся для нашего следующего проекта, для Приозерского СВЕРХМОСТА, длиной во все озеро Безмолвия! Лет 20 на его постройку уйдет. Ну, плюс-минус еще пара десятилетий.',19342),(26570,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gвыиграл:выиграла; нам еще день, а то и два. Спасибо тебе, $n.',19342),(26571,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The gnomecorder buzzes with energy.>$B$BCome in, $n. Do you copy? Troteman here! Great job on getting Keeshan\'s weapons back! Now there\'s one final mission you have to run. Are you up to the challenge?',0),(26573,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надеюсь, что эти вещи и вся его команда, которая счастливо спаслась, поднимут ему настроение. Нам не выиграть эту битву без Кишана.',19342),(26577,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are Diamant\'s chosen.$B$BSo small. So fragile.$B$BDo you realize that your actions shall be the basis by which your entire, \"Earthen Ring\" is judged? You truly think you can stand for so many?$B$BYou are a fool. A confident fool. We shall see if you are a capable fool as well.',0),(26578,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have appealed to Diamant. He is patient. Trusting. Perhaps too much so. You have much to prove if you wish my favor, $R.$B$BStill, this is a start.',0),(26579,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You carry with you a certain degree of potency. I can find some respect for such strength, especially in your kind.$B$BMy concerns are not yet abated. Not for the source of the overgrowth, and not for you.',0),(26580,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good to see you again, brother. I see that your efforts go well. The Stone Lords appear to be showing you some degree of trust.$B$BWe\'ve come to help. We might be of some aid in tracking down the source of this sudden growth. I highly suspect your giant friend\'s aggressions are focused in the wrong direction.',0),(26581,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You let the mist touch your skin? I hope there weren\'t any adverse affects.',0),(26582,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The stone troggs? And I am to trust you at your word?$B$BI have no love for the Verlok anyway. Suspicion is more than enough reason to lay waste to them. We shall see if your word is true.',0),(26583,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $R.$B$BGorsik shall hear of your deed. Therazane shall hear of your deed.$B$BYou are quite vicious for one so small... and so soft.',0),(26584,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done fleshling. Your presence complimented my brothers well.',0),(26585,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So your words prove true. You have my gratitude, $R.',0),(26586,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Keeshan? You mean JOHNNY\'S ALIVE? You bet your sweet behind I\'ll help, but first you gotta get me out of this damned cage.',0),(26587,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'IT\'S PAYBACK TIME!',0),(26589,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Peace, friend. I wish we could have met under less troubling circumstances.',0),(26590,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The goblin downs the water in one gulp.>$B$BAhh... do you know how hard it is to get fresh water in Stranglethorn? It\'s no wonder that the nagas guard their shrine so ferociously!$B$BOh, right... that artifact. Clarity...$B$BI\'ve got it!',0),(26592,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Flem weighs the gems in his hands and nods in approval.>$B$BYes, these will do. Now to perform the analysis...$B$B<The goblin clacks the gems together for a while, then looks up at you.>$B$BOh, you\'re still here? You don\'t think I\'m a fraud or something, do you?',0),(26593,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ack! Where\'d you get these? No, don\'t tell me. I don\'t want to know!$B$BWho sent you? Sea Wolf?',0),(26594,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Heh heh, well done! And when you showed Shaky those giblets, how hard did he shake?$B$BHah! He\'s so easy to read, when I play cards with him I can\'t help but win!$B$BThanks for your help, $n. Now it\'s your turn to get paid...',0),(26595,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great!  I can get a good price for these, especially for what\'s inside Maury\'s foot!  Thanks much, $n!\r\n\r\nI hope those three learned their lesson: don\'t bet something you can\'t afford to lose.\r\n\r\nAnd maybe it\'s too late for them, but...they should be careful of who they gamble with. ',0),(26596,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah? Whaddya need?',0),(26607,1,1,25,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kishan takes a bundle from you and opens it. >$B$BMy bow... And my knife! Where are you... $B$BThe amulet of Jade... My dear Jade.>$B$BTime to hit the Orcs!',19342),(26616,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пора убивать орков.',19342),(26618,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не думай, что легко $gотделался:отделалась;. В лесах таятся и куда более серьезные опасности.',23877),(26620,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ммм-ммм! Грудинка – это лучшая часть туши волка. Хотя это и не традиционный способ готовить эти котлеты.$b$bВот, держи рецепт. Он немного отличается, но когда тебе действительно потребуется еда, мясо с волчьих боков будет достать проще.',23877),(26623,432,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О, отличные кусочки! Дай-ка я замариную их особым составом, – не подсматривай! – потом хорошенько подрумяню на сковородке…$B$BТемные пирожки с крабами – мое коронное блюдо, и рецептом я делиться не готов, но вот тебе рецепт другого кушанья, не хуже.',23877),(26627,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, wanderer... I\'d offer you something, but there\'s a rolling ball... Can you do one errand for the poor old hermit?',23877),(26628,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We survived the attack!$B$BWe could not have done it without you, $n.$B$BWe\'ll be heading out as soon as the tide rises. If you weren\'t such a promising hero I\'d offer you a place on my crew. But I can tell you have bigger fish to fry.$B$BEven if you are a puny $R....',0),(26629,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well blow me down! Now there\'s something ya don\'t see too often.$B$B<Yancey reaches out and shakes your hand.>$B$BWelcome aboard, $n. Plunder and booty await ye.',0),(26630,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should fool that Bloodsail dimwit.\r\n\r\nThis was fun, $n.',0),(26631,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes... yes... I see... well, everything appears to be in order.$B$BSlayer of the great Seahorn, eh? That doesn\'t matter on MY ship. Only thing you\'re gonna be slaying is deck stains. Grab a mop.',0),(26633,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I heard the most furious mopping sounds from down here, mate. That\'s EXACTLY what your Captain likes to hear.',0),(26634,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll distribute these right away, $R. And I\'ll see what I can do to put in the good word for you.',0),(26635,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks, $n. I\'d been hearing whispers about \"Pretty Boy\" and a \"boo-box\". I don\'t think I want to go in the boo-box.',0),(26636,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice job, rookie. I\'m gonna go ahead and put the camo in the box. We should be ready soon.',0),(26637,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect. Those orcs won\'t know what hit \'em - literally. I\'ll need a few minutes to get these in working order and then I\'ll put them in the Bravo Company field kit.',0),(26638,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $n. We need to move quickly before they send for reinforcements.',0),(26639,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brubaker is dead. It looks like the orcs are attempting to send a message with this grizzly display. Upon closer examination you notice something in Brubaker\'s pouch.',0),(26640,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Keeshan reads the report.>$B$BDAMN IT! This just got complicated. We\'ve got prisoners of war to rescue before we can blow up the valley. Not to mention the orcs have black dragons on their side.$B$BAre you ready, $n?',0),(26642,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A fresh recruit from Orgrimmar is it?$B$B<Kargal sizes you up.>$B$BI\'ll take what I can get. Keeping the roads open has been a nightmare.',0),(26644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So ye be the one that did ol\' Seahorn? Yancey sent word, but I wanted to make sure he hadn\'t been telling his tall tales again.$B$BI\'ll make it brief. Ye did well on Keelhaul\'s crew, but I expect ye to do even better on mine. I\'ve got an entire fleet to attend to, so you\'ll be helpin\' to run the day-to-day of me ship.$B$BWelcome aboard the Crimson Veil, sailor.',0),(26645,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасно, $n. За твою помощь жителям Темнолесья ты $gзаслужил:заслужила; награду.',23877),(26646,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The radio on the Bravo Company field kit crackles.>$B$BLooks like the P.O.W.s are free. Time to initiate Operation: End All.',0),(26647,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I like the cut of your gib, $n.',0),(26648,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. The eternal battle wages on, but we\'ve tipped the scales in favor of the pirates today. Firallon will be happy to hear the news.',0),(26649,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahahaha! Blasted \'em clear off their rigging! I\'ll drink to that!$B$BYou\'ve got a bright future, kid.',0),(26650,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You see a set of plans unrolled on the table. They explain everything!$B$BThese are the details of the impending attack on Booty Bay. Battle formations, plans of attack, and something about a group called the \"Brashtide Crew\".',0),(26651,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And now, we blow the whole damned thing up.',0),(26652,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что это? Гребень? Какая прелесть! И он спокойно скользит по моим волосам, хотя они давно сбились в ужасный слипшийся колтун.$B$BАх, мне бы в зеркало посмотреться...',23877),(26653,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, so you need a thread of ghost hair? I\'m afraid my supplies are exhausted, but I can do more... If you bring me ghost hair.',23877),(26654,432,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну, из этого выйдет целая катушка нити из призрачных волос, да еще и останется несколько прядей. Прими эти монеты в уплату за лишние пряди.',23877),(26655,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beautiful! It\'ll be perfect... Here, $n, take it as a payment for the noble deed.',23877),(26660,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебе нужен сок зомби, да? Хмм… это сильная штука, ее не часто спрашивают.',23877),(26661,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, ты $gсумел:сумела; добыть цветки гнили.$b$bЯ быстро приготовлю для тебя сок зомби… предупреждаю, он очень крепкий.',23877),(26662,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Brashtide Crew aren\'t just pirates... they\'re worgen pirates! And they\'re joining in on the attack!$B$BRevilgaz is definitely going to want to know about this.',0),(26663,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve set the pirates back several days\' work. Hopefully this will delay their attack.',0),(26664,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The fewer Bloodsail Buccaneers that Booty Bay has to fight, the better. However, it might be best to stop slaughtering your supposed allies before you draw suspicion to yourself.',0),(26665,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Brashtide!? I thought they were dead and gone YEARS ago!$B$B<Revilgaz listens intently as you relay the information you gathered.>$B$BNo, that absolutely makes sense. And it\'s not good news either. The Brashtide are formidable foes, and if their numbers are anywhere near what they were before they disappeared, we\'re in for a nasty battle.',0),(26666,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Чем я могу помочь?',23877),(26667,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ничего себе… ты действительно $gотправился:отправилась; туда и $gнашел:нашла; их?$b$bЯ потрясен. Полагаю, я должен поблагодарить тебя за возвращение утраченной части моего архива.',23877),(26668,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did you see those orcs explode? THAT\'S HOW WE DO IT IN BRAVO COMPANY! Now to clean up the rest of these jackasses.',0),(26669,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это все, что ты $gнашел:нашла;? Боюсь, это плохие новости…',23877),(26670,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You actually went and got it?!$B$BI don\'t know whether to call you brave or insane. But once again, my archives thank you.',0),(26671,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t thank you enough... I had hoped for this to be a joyous reunion, but the more I learn, the less glad I am to have asked.$B$BBut I must know.',0),(26672,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How interesting. It\'s been quite a while since I\'ve seen such a ring...',0),(26674,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Master Harris may have been right. I would have been better to leave the past behind.$B$BI\'ve got a new life now. Whether it\'s that of a monster or a man is up to me.$B$BAs for you, I cannot thank you enough for your assistance, regardless of the outcome. Please, take this with my thanks.',0),(26676,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тысяча благодарностей, $n. Твоя глу... то есть твоя доброта согрела сердце старика!$B$BВот, $gдружище:дорогая;, прими это в знак моей благодарности.',23877),(26677,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, thanks. These will do just the trick!',0),(26678,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This must be the doublerum. You pour a glass for Revilgaz, then consider pouring one for yourself...',0),(26679,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Baron quickly empties his cup.>$B$BAH! Much better, $n. Now, let\'s get down to business. I believe that you and I have a town to save.',0),(26680,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank the Nec-...well, thank YOU, $n! You have more than earned your reward.$B$BAha! Happy! Happy nights ahead!!',0),(26681,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ello looks at the letter, and immediately pales.>$B$BYou fool! You\'ve doomed us all!',0),(26682,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. We\'ll be able to focus on greater threats here now.',0),(26683,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s right, I used to have a mirror.',23877),(26684,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасно! Это идеально подойдет. Я глубоко признателен!',23877),(26685,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну наконец-то! Устройство для изучения звезд готово! Спасибо тебе, $n. Теперь я могу продолжить исследования...',23877),(26686,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Darkwood residents thank you, $n. You showed; a great ally; Night watch.',23877),(26687,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What now, soldier?$B$BReinforcements? For the Barrens? We\'ve been bleeding supplies and men there for months!$B$BDoes someone need to remind Twinbraid of the attack on Northwatch? Our losses at Honor\'s Stand? What happened to the men I sent to Fort Triumph? We\'ve nothing to spare!$B$BListen $n, if you want to help out our cause, you\'ll focus your efforts here in Dustwallow. Between the deserters and the Horde encroachment... we could use a hand.',19116),(26688,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Твои успехи впечатляют, $n. Похоже, ты на многое $gспособен:способна;. Пожалуй, твоим талантам следует найти более достойное применение.',23877),(26689,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты отлично $gвыступил:выступила; против тенеткачей, $n. Но даже теперь, спустя годы после их первого появления и несмотря на то, что мы их убиваем, их остается слишком много.$b$bЯ положусь на мастера Карвина. Он наверняка сумеет покончить с этой проблемой.',23877),(26690,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, to tell you the truth, I didn\'t believe you\'d be able to get this far, but you\'re certainly |3-6($c), with $g which:c; worth counting. If you really want to join Master Carvin\'s battle, I would be happy to write you a letter of introduction.',23877),(26691,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прости за холодный прием, $n, ты ведь понимаешь, что я очень занятой человек. Вижу, ты $gпроизвел:произвела; впечатление на Калора. Уверяю тебя, это нелегко. Так или иначе, он рекомендует принять тебя в наши ряды.$b$bВокруг полно ненадежных людей, а нам нужна помощь тех, на кого можно положиться. Мы бьемся против демонов, нежити и их пособников. Не теряй бдительности, осторожности и не доверяй никому, кто не хочет нам помочь.$b$bДа озарит тебя Свет!',23877),(26692,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'re closing in on the Blackrock high command. There\'s nowhere left for those dogs to run.',0),(26693,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Keeshan comes in over the Bravo Company field kit.>$B$BNow that the easy part is over, it\'s time for phase two.',0),(26694,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He teleported away? Mentioned Darkblaze? What the hell is going on here.$B$BLooks like it\'s time to strap in and finish this nonsense.',0),(26695,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You brought them! I\'m beginning to think the tide is turning in our favor, $n.',0),(26696,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah? What can I do for ya?',0),(26697,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope those mongrels know how to doggy paddle!$B$BActually, I take that back.',0),(26698,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I should have known these Brashtide were alive and up to no good. I\'d written them off years ago.',0),(26699,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We need to keep moving, $n. Booty Bay won\'t hold out for much longer.',0),(26700,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Attacking your former crewmen...$B$BYou really have grown into a real pirate, $n!',0),(26701,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lok\'tar, $R. Welcome to Brackenwall.',0),(26702,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Theramore.',0),(26703,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! You\'re awake! We found you bobbing in the harbor, shortly after the remaining attackers had turned tail. We were worried about you for a while there...$B$BI\'ve been meaning to thank you, $n. Not only did you provide us with the intelligence to prepare for this attack, but you helped fight off the Bloodsail AND the Brashtide. Your name will always be remembered here in Booty Bay.$B$BWe here in Booty Bay pride ourselves on our booty. Care to take first pick?',0),(26707,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thank you, $C... and I\'m sure the worgen that may be returned to sanity with the potion this will make would thank you too.',0),(26708,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The only thing left to deal with now are the orcs holding out at Stonewatch Keep.',0),(26709,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You returned. This is good. The Stone Lords have been asking after you.',0),(26712,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, it\'s you, sir! Sorry, I didn\'t recognize you at first with all of these commoners milling about.$B$BYou people cool your heels! $n is here!$B$BHere are your macaroons, sir. Come back anytime if you need more.',0),(26713,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Bravo Company field kit beeps loudly.>$B$BCome in, $n. Are you there? If you can hear me: Blackrock has the upper hand. I repeat. Blackrock has the upper hand. GET BRAVO COMPANY OUT OF TH...',0),(26714,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<A single tear rolls down Troteman\'s left cheek.>$B$BThey died in defense of the Alliance. In defense of our kingdom! Heroes, all of them, and they will be laid to rest as such.',0),(26717,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sounds like a close call! But he ran off without harming you further...$B$BHe might be still fighting it. Master Harris must know!',0),(26719,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to our humble camp. I wouldn\'t call it pleasant, but it\'s at least somewhat private.$B$BBeg your pardon? A worgen at the farm?',0),(26720,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve got him!$B$BNo time to lose, then. We\'ll prepare to administer the serum right away.$B$BJITTERS! Get ready!',0),(26721,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh thank you, thank you! You\'ve saved me from having to go out in the woods with those awful things!$B$BAt least for a day, that is...',0),(26722,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<In the darkest depths of this earthen tunnel, you spy the faintest gleam. The last piece is found!>',0),(26723,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'His clothes and bloodstains? If it\'s not tricks, it\'s something worse...',0),(26724,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s heartening to see one so recently recovered be so concerned with the plight of others. Sven spares himself suffering by not dwelling on his own misfortune.',0),(26725,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Buried in the cold dirt, you find a brilliant metal shaft. But there are holes where pieces of the artifact are clearly missing.>',0),(26726,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They will never be forgotten, $n. What you and the rest of Bravo Company sacrificed in order to save Redridge will be a tale told for ages to come.$B$BWhile I can in no way make up for the loss of your friends, I feel that you must be rewarded for such a heroic deed. These are Keeshan\'s possessions - the only things we found when we dredged the lake for his body. Troteman has informed me that Keeshan would have wanted you to take something as the lone surviving member of Bravo Company. Remember them, $n!',0),(26727,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank the light, he\'s gone...$B$BI\'ll say you\'ve made amends by helping save the lives of those here, $n.',0),(26728,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Они прислали нам на подмогу тебя?$b$b<Алтея вздыхает.>$b$bНадеюсь, у тебя получится.',23877),(26729,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do for my purposes. Though we can\'t activate the altar with bracers alone...',0),(26730,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have what we need. Are you ready to activate the Altar of Naias, $n?',0),(26731,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My colleagues within the Kirin Tor will be happy to learn that the heart is ours.$B$BThank you for your assistance, $n. I couldn\'t have done it without you.',0),(26732,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично сработано, $n. Сейчас мы узнаем, что там у них за эликсир...',23877),(26733,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, just what you need. Thanks. Wait a while, and I\'ll do a quick analysis.',23877),(26734,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Brother Nimez opens the sack so you can put the crystal down there. >$B$BI knew they\'d have this stuff. I want to send it to my friends at Fort Livingston, south. Hopefully they\'ll have more luck with that substance. $B$BThank you for everything, $n.',23877),(26735,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Они его УБИЛИ? А я все это время думал, что они у него под железной пятой и даже пикнуть не смеют...',23877),(26736,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, $n. Похоже, мои подозрения подтверждаются... Эти трое заключенных избежали безумия, которое охватило Курцена и его людей.$B$BПеред твоим прибытием Эмерина телепортировала их в Штормград – восстановиться после перенесенных мучений. Они обещали скоро вернуться.',23877),(26737,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n. Об остальных мы позаботимся сами.$B$BТеперь, когда Курцен больше не мешает, мы продолжим экспедицию в Тернистую долину, которая... ох...$B$BЛадно, ничего. Ты посмотри, что у нас тут есть в запасе – может, выберешь себе что-то подходящее.',23877),(26738,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, this kid seems to be very attached to you. You are lucky - at this age they are still calm and peaceful, and they can be easily trained. Leave the cub to yourself, $n ... It will still be useful to you.$B$BBy the way ...',23877),(26739,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There, now we\'re growing! You see, these lizards are growing fast. You\'re lucky to have a pet. Try to keep it around for as long as you can, $n. I\'m sure you won\'t regret it later.',23877),(26740,5,1,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, I see - a faulty pot of Krazek! Excellent device, but sometimes the springs or gears fail. Let\'s see what happened to this thing... $B$BAha! The steam generator\'s rusty, the oil seal\'s flying, and the cheater\'s teeth broke off. It\'s weird how they managed to at least boil a turnip!$B$BCan I fix it? Of course! $B$BBut not for free. All that\'s free is cheese in a mousetrap...',23877),(26742,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Berrin studies the inscriptions on the totem.>$B$BI think I can read this text... Fascinating!$B$BTsul\'kalu, Mahamba, Pogeyan... what are these names?',0),(26743,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'First you save me from the madman\'s jail cell, and now you bring me some keys to understanding trollish shamanism.$B$BThis is turning out to be a pretty good week!$B$BThank you again, $n. I will see to it that you have the support of the Wildhammer clan as you continue on your journeys.',0),(26744,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Честно говоря, я сообщал об этом в Штормград – жене и сыну. Они любят истории о моих делах в джунглях, а видимся мы редко. Так что мне любая помощь кстати.$B$BСпасибо тебе, $n.',23877),(26745,71,153,396,0,0,0,0,0,'Так, что тут у нас? Молодой ящер со своим любимцем |3-4($r). Ха!$B$BЛадно, сейчас важнее понять, что это за череп. Так, не обычный тролль. Он был очень большим... $B$B<Осборн стучит по черепу.>$B$BИ очень сильным. Знаешь, я как-то хотел освоить магию троллей. Интересно, насколько она сильна? Давай опробуем ее на этом приятеле, а?',23877),(26746,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will provide a bit of... what\'s the troll word? Voodoo? Juju? Tiklabang?$B$BIt doesn\'t matter. If we\'re going to re-build a troll, we need troll magic, and these fetishes are full of it.',0),(26747,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well, $R. We have a head, a body, and some juju-voodoo-mojo nonsense. Now, just a little shock of electricity to get things started, and...',0),(26748,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad to see you\'ve come to your senses.$B$BCome and visit us in Zul\'Gurub sometime, $R. I\'ll be watching...',0),(26749,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mandokir is alive, yes.$B$BYou are responsible, yes.$B$BYou may be able to stop him still, yes.',0),(26750,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you\'ve come.$B$BFleshlings just like you killed my daughter... my only daughter. With no provocation.$B$BNot sated at stripping me of my family, more of you flocked to Deathwing to serve him in ravaging my home.$B$BYou\'re quite arrogant to come before me asking for MY help. I\'m tempted to crush you where you stand.',0),(26751,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Balance is restored - for now. We may call on you again in the future, $n.',0),(26752,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ya\'ve done well, brotha. Da Stonemother be listenin\' and da World Pillar is not far from our reach.',0),(26753,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<In the dirt of this alcove, your eye catches the shine of brilliant metal. You\'ve found another piece of the artifact!>',0),(26754,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the disgusting monster stay dead this time!$B$BI\'ll head down there and scatter his remains to ash myself, $n. You\'ve done a great thing; perhaps in time Duskwood can return to its former peaceful state.',0),(26760,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Success... Finally! I can\'t thank you enough for giving me the chance to work the cure myself.$B$BOur new friend may be in need of some help as well. You might want to speak with him.',0),(26761,1,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Я слышал о том, что Братство Справедливости снова активировалось. Я надеялся на новости получше, но оказалось, что Приозерье атакуют! Мы то и дело теряем жителей. Наши собственные войска рассредоточены и не могут взять ситуацию в свои руки. Нам нужен герой, который бы нам помог!',23877),(26763,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, эти подойдут. Погоди-ка минутку.$B$B<Кразек бросает камни в котел и трясет его некоторое время.>$B$BНу, вот и готово!',23877),(26765,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Он как новый! Отлично, теперь можно готовить ужин! Большое спасибо, $n.$B$BНадеюсь, с Кразеком все прошло гладко.',23877),(26769,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Nozzlepot snatches the bag of gems from you.>$B$BGazlowe calls this 10%? You tell him I\'m going to weigh these!$B$BI suppose he expects me to pay you a delivery fee, as well? Fine, fine. Have some spoils!',0),(26772,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You bring feathers, yes.$B$BYou can follow directions, yes.',0),(26773,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What did Priestess tell you?$B$BThe raptor is daughter of Ohgan, heir to Mandokir\'s seat.$B$BHah!',0),(26776,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You explain to Ghaliri what has happened up to this point.>$B$BIt would seem that Jin\'do has survived, and he is rallying his brothers to once again summon Hakkar into this world. It was good of you to come to speak with me.$B$BThere is not much we can do now but to wait, and watch. Jin\'do is weak, and prime for striking, but I must wait for word from Rastakhan before issuing orders. Until then, you and your raptor will have to wait.',0),(26777,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have brought peace to those who knew only misery, $n. Be proud.',0),(26778,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The cries grow softer for now. Light bless you, $n.',0),(26779,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As promised, your reward. You do the troll nation proud.',0),(26780,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can see the difference already. I can\'t wait until later tonight, when I get to perform my observations again!',0),(26781,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You retrieved the eye! Your might is the stuff of legends, $n!$B$BAnd to think my brother and sister said we wouldn\'t find anything of worth here in the Vale. Hah! And I\'m just getting started!',0),(26782,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wulfred peers into the box.>$B$BThis... this is not like what I expected. I had thought it would be a... a...$B$B<His eyes glaze over.>$B$BAhem! I\'m sorry. I\'m not sure what came over me. I\'ll be sending this south, to the Explorers\' League Digsite in the Cape. Maybe they\'ll know what to do with it...',0),(26783,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wulfred peers into the box.>$B$BThis... this is not like what I expected. I had thought it would be a... a...$B$B<His eyes glaze over.>$B$BAhem! I\'m sorry. I\'m not sure what came over me. I\'ll be sending this south, to the Explorers\' League Digsite in the Cape. Maybe they\'ll know what to do with it...',0),(26785,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tobias is staying in town still?$B$BMaster Harris warned him not to pursue his brother\'s fate. We all lead new lives now, after all. But the past is hard to let go of...',0),(26787,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you! Oh, thank you. I never thought I\'d be happy to smell those brains, but I am now that I didn\'t have to get them!$B$BHere\'s your reward as promised...',0),(26793,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Morgan Ladimore?$B$BAhh, yes, of course. His was a long and sorrowful tale. I knew him, well, before he left for the war, but that was the last time I saw him. A noble and good man, he was, but he suffered a bad end.$B$BHere, I should have something here that can tell the tale better than my own recollections...',0),(26794,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Morgan Ladimore? Never heard of...$B$BOh, you mean Mor\'Ladim! I guess you haven\'t heard the story?$B$BWell, I\'ll give you the short version. A powerful undead calling itself Mor\'Ladim has been wandering Duskwood. From what we\'ve gathered, it appears to be the undead body of Morgan Ladimore, of whom you apparently know. He\'s been causing us all sorts of problems, attacking Watchmen on patrol and killing people.$B$B<She sizes you up.>$B$BYou seem to be capable enough, maybe you could lay him to rest.',0),(26795,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You killed him? That\'s no small accomplishment, $n! On behalf of the people of Darkshire and the Night Watch, I thank you.$B$BAh... there is one small matter, however...',0),(26796,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes? My father...$B$B<Her eyes become downcast.>$B$BI wish... there was something I could have done for him... If only I had talked to him before he...',0),(26797,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<A ghostly voice sounds on the wind...>$B$BThis is...? Sarah? Could it be she\'s still alive? The weight is removed from my shoulders...$B$B$n. Take my sword, Archeus. As my soul is put to rest, I have no more need for it. It was forged to do good, and though I have proved myself unworthy to hold it, perhaps you will carry on the Light through it.$B$BLys, my love...',0),(26803,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you need to get to Razor Hill in a hurry? That\'s no problem at all. One of my wind riders will get you there very quickly and it only costs a few coins to hire one.',0),(26804,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Eitrigg sent you? The warchief must be getting anxious to read my reports. I\'d\'ve sent them long ago, but each day we discover more about the Alliance\'s plans for invading Durotar.',0),(26805,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wulfred has a good eye. I think you\'ll do just fine here at my camp.',0),(26806,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ready to return to Orgrimmar with those reports? I can arrange a flight for you right away.',0),(26807,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Eitrigg examines the reports.>$B$BThe Alliance has grown bolder than we\'d thought! I\'ll talk to the warchief about sending reinforcements right away. Thank you for getting these reports to me so quickly. I hope this coin is enough to cover your travel expenses.',0),(26808,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Troll expands the bundle. >$B$BThank you very much. Say $gto his young yard friend:his young yard friend; that I\'m not upset about anything. I\'m just waiting. Waiting for you.$B$BYou are here the most promising: the most promising: r; |3-6($r) in all this strange city. I have a job for you, if you\'re interested.',23877),(26809,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Так я и думала. Занзил слишком высокого о себе мнения, чтобы впутываться в дрязги между Кровавым Скальпом и Дробителями черепов. Нет, у него планы помасштабнее... Мастер проклятий Джин\'до хочет с его помощью вернуть Хаккара в Зул\'Гуруб.$B$BХорошо, что мы узнали об этом сейчас. Теперь ясно, как нужно действовать.',23877),(26810,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gопоздал:опоздала;. Занзил ушел из Абораза.',23877),(26811,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You arrived successfully at Zul\'Gurub, the ruined capital of the once mighty Gurubashi Empire.',23877),(26812,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You stopped Zanzila from resurrecting High Priestess Jacklick. Without one of the priestesses, Jin\'do will probably be difficult to summon Hakkar.',23877),(26813,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found yourself in the depths of Zul\'Guruba. Snake statues tell us that you\'ve reached the terrace of the high priest Venoxis, the main follower of the serpent god Hetis.',23877),(26814,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебе нужно было убить Занзила Отверженного, ничтожного отшельника, изгнанного племенем Гурубаши, а ты что $gсделал:сделала;? $GВорвался:Ворвалась; в столицу Гурубаши и $gубил:убила; одного из их верховных жрецов! Даже почти двух! Такое безрассудное и наглое поведение можно назвать только одним словом:$B$BГероизм.$B$BМастер проклятий Джин\'до все еще бродит в стенах Зул\'Гуруба, но после того, как ты $gубил:убила; Джеклик, он потерял одну из своих ног. Эту битву мы выиграли.',23877),(26815,463,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Dusk carefully examines the contents of the vessel. >$B$BThis mixture is just... gorgeous! Let\'s see what she does with this artifact of Titans!',23877),(26816,1,397,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Поразительно! Только представь, сколько еще этому можно найти применений!$B$BЕще раз спасибо, $n. Если тебе нужно будет что-нибудь смешать – ЧТО УГОДНО – ты всегда можешь обратиться к Пузырю.',23877),(26817,7,1,0,0,0,2000,0,0,'Ты не представляешь, как трудно найти пресную воду в Тернистой долине! Неудивительно, что наги так ревностно охраняют свое святилище!$B$BТак, ладно, начнем кашеварить!',23877),(26818,273,1,24,0,0,0,0,0,'<Lenzie feels the hides and smiles. >$B$BHow soft and fluffy! Buyers will be delighted!',23877),(26819,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ура! Мы так давно не видели акириса!',23877),(26820,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эти статуи прекрасны...$B$BНу и ну, а я и не знала, что эти наги такие мастера! Спасибо, $n!',23877),(26821,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Потрясающе!$B$BМне потребуется время, чтобы это изучить. Ты, может, пойдешь прогуляешься по Пиратской Бухте и зайдешь попозже?',23877),(26822,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кхм! А-а-а... ну...$B$BХорошая работа! Поздравляю, то есть спасибо, что всех $gперебил:перебила;.$B$BВот, держи.',23877),(26823,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично! Первый пункт – добыча ингредиентов – выполнен. Переходим ко второму пункту – добыть еще ингредиентов!',23877),(26824,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Так и знал, что от алхимика никакого толку. Все равно спасибо за помощь, $n. Ты $gсделал:сделала; все, что $gмог:могла;.',23877),(26825,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So once again, it falls upon tiny Dask to get the Explorers\' League work done! Alright... let\'s see what you\'ve got in there.',0),(26827,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done what I thought not possible. Quite impressive, $C.',0),(26828,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And so you arrive, fleshling. As promised.',0),(26829,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Their blood upon the earth is a sweet thing. I shall cherish every moment, slowly extinguishing the stragglers from my realm.',0),(26831,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good that you were here. I find my size to be inhibiting when it comes to dragon riding, strangely.',0),(26832,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You let Lorthuna escape? I warned you of this.$B$BStill, their forces are shattered and their resources cut off. There is little they can do to me or my allies.',0),(26833,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorsik has arrived. All of the pieces of the World Pillar are here, thanks to you.$B$BWhat you have done for us is immeasurable. These final moments shall be the most crucial. I hesitate to ask more of you, but I\'d like you to stay with us and see this through.$B$BThe Twilight\'s Hammer was devastated by your attacks, but not destroyed. It\'s no stretch to assume they will try to stop us from completing our ritual.',0),(26838,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to our camp, $C. You couldn\'t have arrived at a better time.',0),(26841,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will be your mentor and guide for now. It is my duty to teach you the arcane arts and how you might best fit in among our people. As you learn and grow in power, you will learn an immense variety of spells that should allow you to deal with nearly any situation. But until then, return to me as often as you like and I will teach you what I can in the ways of our kind. ',0),(26854,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here is the corpse of a dwarf -- mauled, frozen, and picked clean by mountain scavengers.  Clutched in its hand is a book containing the roughly scribbled notes of Mori Hildelve.  And around its frame, still in superior condition, is a Brigadier\'s Vest. This grisly scene must have been where the Siege Engine pilot met his end. ',0),(26855,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is grim news, for Hildelve was a good friend.  And I wish I could have been there with you when you found the beast, Mangeclaw! Thank you, $n. Your deed will be remembered by the pilots of the Ironforge Siege Brigade. ',0),(26856,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it, $n! You\'ve upturned the Searing Blade\'s invasion before it could even start! Take this, as a token of my thanks.',0),(26858,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My children will sing songs of your glories, $n!',0),(26862,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $C. The Molten Elementals\' spirits are finally back to rest.',0),(26865,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been expecting your arrival, $n.',0),(26866,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been expecting your arrival, $n.',0),(26867,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been expecting your arrival, $n.',0),(26875,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Twilight forces continue to stream in, but it looks like the Earthen Ring defenders can handle them.',0),(26878,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, $C? What brings you to this place?',0),(26890,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent! These will do nicely. Here\'s a reward for your hard work.',0),(26894,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did Commander Grimfang send you? I\'ve asked him to find suitable recruits to aid me here.',0),(26895,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Another proud $C, lured by the promise of fame! Of wealth! Of VIOLENCE!$B$BYes, welcome, friend. Welcome... to THUNDERDROME!',0),(26896,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Another proud $C, lured by the promise of fame! Of wealth! Of VIOLENCE!$B$BYes, welcome, friend. Welcome... to THUNDERDROME!',0),(26898,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank Elune you\'re here! We could use all the help we can get.',0),(26901,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n! Это именно то, что нужно!',23877),(26903,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks again, friend! I told you I\'d make it worth your while.',0),(26904,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As you continue to gain power, return to me and I will teach you new spells and techniques.',0),(26905,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прими от меня этот дар. Сегодня ты $gзаслужил:заслужила; мое благословение.',23877),(26906,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< The spirit of Agamaghana is looking at you. You have his voice in your head.$B$BI\'ve been waiting for you. I was waiting for you to come.',23877),(26907,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сегодня ты $gпотрудился:потрудилась; на славу. Советники Чарлги представляли для нас немалую угрозу.',23877),(26908,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Only a veteran like you could brave the dangers lurking here.',19116),(26909,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The shards pulse softly, and a whisper slowly echoes through your head.>$B$BHelp...',0),(26911,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know, $n. I should not have sent you.$B$BForgive me... the whispers of the past are sometimes too strong.',0),(26912,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As the eldritch shackles are placed around the Shards, an unhuman wail is heard from far below. The scream is followed by a roar.$B$BThe Shards of Myzrael no longer invoke feelings of warmth and security as they once did. Now they pulse with an open menace... as if the thing beneath them holds ill will toward the surface.',0),(26913,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a quick learner, $n. Return to me as you grow stronger and I\'ll show you other combat techniques.',0),(26915,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve caught on quickly, $n, and a quick mind will serve you well. Return to me as you grow in power and I will show you new techniques.',0),(26918,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a quick learner, $n. Return to me as you grow stronger and I\'ll teach you more about using the Light to vanquish your enemies and strengthen your allies. ',0),(26919,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a quick learner, $n, and the wounded are fortunate to have your aid. Return to me as you grow stronger and I\'ll teach you other spells.',0),(26920,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s about time you arrived, $C.',0),(26921,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You may not act quickly, but at least you do not fail me.$B$BVery well. I will have a more important task for you, $n, when the time is right.',0),(26922,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These grenades are all explosives, nothing more. Even as a member of the Royal Apothecary Society, I recognize that some problems are not solved by throwing more plague at them.',0),(26923,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With the behemoths out of the way, our victory against the Scourge is inevitable.$B$BOur current chances against the Alliance aren\'t quite as favorable... but that\'s no concern of yours. Not yet, anyhow.',0),(26924,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellently done, $n. And now, with the leader of the Scourge forces eliminated from Andorhal, we bide our time.',0),(26925,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Araj dead... this is good. The Royal Apothecary Society has done its part. As have you, $n.',0),(26926,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word arrived shortly before you did, $n. With the Scourge ejected from Andorhal, the Forsaken has cemented its foothold in Lordaeron.',0),(26930,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Burning bodies? No survivors? I guessed correctly.$B$BAll the better! We\'re better off without the Scarlet taint upon Lordaeron. They epitomized all the worst things about humans.',0),(26931,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s a relief to have those hunters out of the way. We\'re not done killing Alliance, however...',0),(26933,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha ha! I hope that they come back as zombies.',0),(26934,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Glorious! This is the last bit I need.$B$BActually, stick around, $n. Let me tell you a little bit more about our plan.',0),(26935,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the North Ridge, |3-6($c).',19342),(26936,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Felstone is cleared and the bombs are set. I hope you\'re ready. I recommend covering your ears.$B$B<Derrington looks down and places his finger on an ignition switch.>$B$BEVERYBODY, PREPARE FOR IGNITION! IN 3...$B$B2....$B$B1...',0),(26937,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am able to communicate with you through the Val\'kyr, $n. You have done well.$B$BRemain on Felstone Field. We must now teach these newly-converted Forsaken how to fight.',0),(26938,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When Koltira gives his word, I will bring these val\'kyr into Andorhal. We will win. And yet another piece of Lordaeron will fall to the might of the Forsaken.',0),(26939,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надеюсь, ты еще не совсем $gвыдохся:выдохлась;. У нас впереди еще много работы!',19342),(26940,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew you would master this lesson quickly. You are a credit to the highborn and to all our kin. Remember, as you grow in power, return to me and will instruct you further. ',0),(26941,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что-то ты долго $gвозился:возилась;. Иди ко мне, за колонну. А то засветишь укрытие, и хана нам обоим!',19342),(26942,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я бы и рад пригласить тебя остаться в команде \"Г\", но тебя ведь ждут другие приключения.$B$BУверен, мы еще встретимся – тогда и поговорим на эту тему. Вот тебе награда за труды.',19342),(26943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Never thought I\'d see a $R like you down here. Any particular reason you\'re risking life and limb?',0),(26944,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Never thought I\'d see a $R like you down here. Any particular reason you\'re risking life and limb?',0),(26945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve proven a capable student. When it is time to resume your training, return to me and I will show you other techniques. ',0),(26946,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve learned quickly. If you are as sharp as you seem to be, you may prove to be one of my best students yet. Return to me when you are in need of further training. ',0),(26949,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You will find no lack of allies in need of healing. Return to me when you need further training.',0),(26950,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What do you mean Thalnos was an undead? That\'s impossible. This is a holy place, the Scarlet Crusade would never allow...$B$BTake this as a reward, and get some rest. The crypts must have gotten the best of your nerves.',0),(26951,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks, $c.  The spirits can rest now.  As long as we show them respect they will bless us and our new home for a long time.  Spirits be with you, $n. ',0),(26952,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $C. As you can see, our camp is a joint expedition between Argent Crusade members and Cenarion Circle druids, but we welcome all who wish to help heal the land.',0),(26953,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Похоже, Зен\'Кики еще не совсем освоил превращения.',23877),(26954,1,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну, хоть что-то. Сколько птиц уничтожил Зен\'Кики?$B$BНи одной? Ты $gсам:сама; всех $gубил:убила;?$B$BЛадно, думаю, мы сумеем приспособить его к чему-нибудь другому. Дам тебе знать, как придет время.',23877),(26955,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'By the grace of the Earthmother, he\'s done it! Thank you, $n!$B$BI admit, I had nearly given up hope on Zen\'Kiki. It is only due to your patience and diligence that he has come into his own as a druid and member of the Cenarion Circle. And that\'s without even mentioning the good you\'ve done for nature.$B$BYou have my admiration and respect.',0),(26956,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо за помощь, $n. Конечно, прополка растений – это не самая почетная и героическая обязанность, но даже за скромную работу полагается вознаграждение.',23877),(26957,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It would appear that I arrived before you, $n.$B$BField Agent Kaartish gave me the details about my old home. It seems my battles with the Scourge aren\'t quite over yet.',0),(26958,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Keep that technique handy, $n. I find myself using it all the time. Return when you\'re ready for further training.',0),(26959,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew I could count on you! These fools will never know what hit them.',0),(26962,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Herod is slain! The Armory will fall!',0),(26963,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Keep that technique handy, $n. I find myself using it all the time. Return when you\'re ready for further training. ',0),(26967,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes! The Scarlet Monastery now belongs to the Forsaken! None can escape our wrath!$B$BYou\'ve completed your task with the precision of a true champion. Take this as a reward, courtesy of the Banshee Queen.',0),(26968,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve mastered the use of this new spell quickly, $n. I only wish all of my students were as talented. Return to me when you find yourself in need of further training. ',0),(26969,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is a pleasure to teach such a capable student. As long as you continue the traditons faithfully, the shamanic arts will never be lost to our people again. Return to me when you need further training.',0),(26970,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ll often find your skills as a healer in demand, $n. Do not hesitate to return when you need more training.',0),(26971,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Maruut said when all dis started dat he would gladly give his life ta see our task done. He would be proud of dis success... of dis death.$B$BDa rift be closed on dis side. Deepholm should calm down a bit. It\'ll be takin\' time for Thrall to mend da wound in Azeroth, and we\'ll be needin\' to remain until he finishes.$B$BThank you for all ya\'ve done. I don\'t tink we could have been accomplishin\' dis so soon without you.',0),(26972,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What do you mean Thalnos was an undead? That\'s impossible. The entire mission of the Scarlet Crusade is to destroy the undead! There\'s just no way...$B$BYou have muddied my thoughts. Please take this reward for your achievement and leave me to rest.',0),(26974,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So he\'s really dead? That means...I, Joseph, am the new Scarlet Champion!!!$B$BTake this. I don\'t have a need for such possessions anyways! I\'m the Scarlet Champion, after all.',0),(26975,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< Graves bows respectfully to the prince. >$B$BBOur Highness, please understand - my people work around the clock, but this project is huge!$B$BHowever, we will try to finish it as soon as possible. I give you my word.',19342),(26978,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Dithers practically glimmers with excitement.>$B$BThe drums are placed? In their positions?$B$BVery well then, I will give the word to the High Executor. When the time is ready, he will be the one to press the ignition switch.',0),(26979,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n. The Dark Lady watches over you.',0),(26980,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stoutfist sent you, eh? He\'s a good captain, runs his men well. Just wish he\'d stop starin\' at my midriff.$B$BDon\'t let me catch you doin\' it either. We\'ve work to take care of here!',0),(26981,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $C. We\'ve got raptor problems for sure... sort of.$B$BMore like the entire dig site deciding to attack us. I\'ve never seen rocks and fossils get so upset!',0),(26982,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Nials sent you? I haven\'t seen her in ages! How is she? Did she get my letter?$B$BOh, you\'re not here for that. Well then, let\'s get down to business!',0),(26983,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You came here from Southshore, eh? I bet you hunger for revenge against the vile Forsaken that trashed the place. The Scarlet Crusade can help take care of that!$B$BRight after you help me realign their misguided souls, that is.',0),(26984,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You look pretty tough, $C. There are wrongs to be righted here. Let\'s get started.',0),(26985,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wait, you were sent here by THE Shandris Feathermoon? I can barely believe my ears! To know that my cause is supported by her massive army...$B$BYes, yes, you will be perfect. You\'re the key to my future!',0),(26986,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It looks like Darthalia sent an able $C, as I requested.',0),(26987,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m surprised to see Huntsman Markhor working with me for once. He\'s usually quite stubborn. He does tend to a strong hatred for magic, though.$B$BI hope you do, too, $C, because we\'re going to strip the Scarlet Crusade of theirs.',0),(26988,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yayo\'jin is correct, you helping me here will aid her in the Hinterlands as well.$B$BAll the more reason to get started immediately.',0),(26990,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sandfury trolls and the Cult of Twilight\'s Hammer, you say?$B$BAnd they meant to send some giant monster into the heart of the city?!$B$BWell done! Thunder Bluff is in your debt.',0),(26991,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nazeer is a strong warrior - his hatred for our enemies rivals my own. You are welcome help to my forces.',0),(26999,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Этого более чем достаточно, $n. А теперь прошу меня извинить – я пойду изучать образцы.',23877),(27000,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что ж, сдается, они и правда боятся мустангов, но все равно так просто не уйдут. Я не могу заставить тебя все время гонять на лошади вокруг лесопилки. Да ты и не станешь.$B$BОтлично! Значит, без кровопускания не обойтись.',19342),(27001,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a completely different knee! Now my lumberjacks are back to work. You\'re good in the saddle, $n. That\'s what you look like riding that mustang - a sight!',19342),(27002,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n. Nice to meet you.$B$BI know you\'re very young: young; and you have a lot to learn, but I follow your progress. There are reasons for that. We at the Silver Vanguard always look out for promising youth. So to speak, we\'re looking for talents to enlarge our staff. And you have good potential. Right now there are no tasks for you, I just wanted to get to know you in person, see and understand what you are for |3-6($r).$B$BT So you can look around in Dolnoe Hearth and enjoy its beauty for now. We\'ll meet again, $n. And now you can go.',19342),(27005,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The examiner takes a look at the plans that you hand to him.>$B$BThis is just gibberish!$B$BWhat does this even say? What language is that?',0),(27008,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A waygate?! They unearthed a Titan waygate.$B$BThis is very interesting and potentially very bad.',0),(27011,396,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я положу это обратно, к остальным бревнам. А Натаниэль, наверно, даже и не узнает про кражу.',19342),(27012,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $n. Брошу все это в огонь, чтобы гноллы не смогли забрать оружие обратно.',19342),(27013,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь у меня на душе стало спокойнее, $n. Спасибо тебе!',19342),(27014,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have arrived at last. During your training in Camp Narache, I will guide you in the ways of the $c. You have much to learn and I look forward to counting you among my students. ',0),(27017,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This... Gloria used to read from this prayer book every night! How had I forgotten? She was so devout, $n.$B$B$B$BOh...$B$BThis painting... my daughter, Andrea... she loved to... to paint...',0),(27021,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well, $n. Return to me when you are in need of further training. ',0),(27026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Okay, yes, I have already been informed that bobcats are much smaller than I was assuming. But that\'s still pretty dangerous for gnomes!$B$BYou\'ve done a good thing for the safety of this lodge, $n!',0),(27027,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. I see you will have no trouble mastering our more advanced arts as you gain experience. Return to me when you need further training.',0),(27028,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lovely specimens you\'ve got there! Here\'s my wager, lad.',0),(27032,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Skystrider sits silent, its chance to fly gone. An obvious hatch on the front is marked \"SRW\".>',0),(27033,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect! Now that I\'ve perfected the wing balance and have all the parts I need, all we need is a pilot.',0),(27034,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t care about my father and his silly inventions! It\'s all just nonsense!',0),(27035,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it? You did! You fought them and won!$B$BThere\'s hope after all...',0),(27036,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Er... what\'s this? A bear\'s head, by the looks at it.$B$B<He runs a finger along his scar unconsciously.>$B$BWell, that\'s quite an interesting kill you have yourself there. Couldn\'t be that bear from back then...$B$B<He trails off then starts to visibly shake.>$B$BOh, take that away take it away! Get that grisly thing out of here!',0),(27037,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks for helping me out with my little plan, $n. I\'ve been itching for months to get back at that snooty, stuck-up boy, and I\'d say we did a pretty good job! Here, have this, you\'ve earned it.',0),(27038,1,5,15,0,0,0,0,0,'<Silicon gate greedily goes through the patterns, throwing over the shoulder selected. >$B$BOh, yeah, that\'s it.$B$B< He puts his head in one of the drawers. >$B$BBut where\'s my gunpowder? It\'s got everything but gunpowder. I need the explosives, $gboy: girl!$B$BSo tell your king, no gunpowder, goodbye. If they won\'t let me blow something up here, I won\'t move.',19342),(27043,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An excellent display of $C prowess.$B$B$B$BI believe that a reward is in order. Something appropriate for a powerful man such as yourself.',0),(27044,16,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Seeing the prince, farmer Wallerton clumsily falls on one knee. >$B$BB-Your Highness!',19342),(27046,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You wage a war that we cannot. Thank you for your help.',0),(27047,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $R. These will do well.',0),(27048,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well played!$B$BI\'ve got this pretty sweet deal going. A bunch of shmucks go up there to Therazane\'s Throne and give all kinds of gold to D\'lom for who-knows-what kinda crap. He forks all that cash over to me for these crystals. I go home freakin\' rich for a couple chunks of rock.$B$BDon\'t tell no one though. I don\'t want no competition springin\' up.$B$BThink you can come back later to help me get another load of crystals out?',0),(27049,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Once the growth starts, it is near impossible to stomp back into submission. Through persistence our realm will one day be cleansed.',0),(27050,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are proficient at stepping on things. You would make an excellent giant.',0),(27051,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $R. We will weed the rest out of their possession in time.',0),(27053,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Cauldron Lord Soulwrath\'s key disintegrates as it touches the lock on the access panel at the base of the cauldron\'s platform. A slight clanking noise is heard within, and the access panel swings open to reveal more viscous toxins within the cauldron\'s framework.$B$BThere is a small spigot that the bottle fits well enough under, allowing you to draw a sample for Field Agent Kaartish back at the Menders\' Stead.',0),(27054,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The orders in Malicia\'s possession incriminate Darkmaster Gandling of the Scholomance, but they also conceal another important bit of information.',0),(27055,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have gone above and beyond, $n. Not only have we set back the Cult of the Damned in their crusade to re-plague the plaguelands, but you have uncovered another set of dire plans: they continue to re-animate the dead!$B$BYour name will definitely be mentioned when this information is presented to Highlord Fordring, $n. You have my thanks, and the blessing of the Argent Crusade.',0),(27057,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. One moment please...$B$B<The draenei takes a moment to compare your sample with a sample he presumably had distilled earlier.>$B$BYes, this appears to be the same corruption that is affecting the wildlife. With this knowledge, and with your combat expertise, we may have the power to stop this.',0),(27059,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! Excellent work, my boy. You found out what the Twilight\'s Hammer were up to and you stopped them dead in their tracks!$B$B<Examiner Rowe pats you on the back with his bony hand.>$B$BNow I\'m certain that I have something around here for you.$B$B<He begins rummaging around for your reward.>',0),(27060,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ух ты! Еще бы немного, и нам конец! До сих пор не могу поверить в то, что тебе удалось одолеть столько противников.$B$BПохоже, здесь проводился какой-то жуткий ритуал Сумеречного Молота. Очевидно, что его агенты действуют в Штормграде. О, что это?$B$B<Андуин подбирает с алтаря какой-то медальон.>$B$BНа медальоне изображены перекрещенные топор и молот. Похоже, это древняя вещь. Если мы продолжим расследование, то, возможно, нам удастся выяснить, что все это означает...',19342),(27062,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You seem an able warrior. Perhaps you can help me put an end to the terrible evil here.',0),(27063,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You seem an able warrior. Perhaps you can help me put an end to the terrible evil here.',0),(27064,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, this is VERY suspicious! Samuelson has no knowledge of the Shadowhunter, as if he wasn\'t investigating his supporters at all. But he does have a full catalogue of missing explosives. $B$B<Anduin is pulling some kind of locket out of the folder. It shows a crossed axe and a hammer. $B$B$BIt all means something. But what?',19342),(27066,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help in seeing to the wounded braves. I\'m sure that you will often find your healing skills in demand. Return to me when you need further instruction.',0),(27067,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have a knack for the healing arts, $n. Wherever you go, your skills as a healer will be in demand. Return to me when you are ready for more training.',0),(27072,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You pat Boden in the face until he regains consciousness.>$B$B|3-6($C)? What are you doing here?$$B$BSHRU. Agent Jack Boden. This is the longest day of my life.$B$B.',19342),(27074,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You hit the twilight camp at the center of the lake? Not bad, lad!$B$BIf you\'re ready to take the fight right to their doorstep, I\'ve got your chance.',0),(27075,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It may look grim, but we\'ll win with your help, $n. They won\'t keep the dwarves down.',0),(27077,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shame that these half-formed things are too brittle and warped to be used for some weapons of our own. But it\'s thanks to you that we had the chance to get them out before they set. I\'m not about to complain.',0),(27078,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it! We may not have stopped the cult dead, but we\'ve shown them we\'re not easy pickings and given them a welt to prove it.$B$BTake this with my gratitude, and try not to blush if anyone in Thelsamar calls you \"hero\"!',0),(27083,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thassarian and the humans made their move. I thought I had an agreement with Thassarian... but I suppose this will do.',0),(27084,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Merely a dent in their numbers... but the sight of their fellow men falling from the skies surely weakened their resolve.',0),(27085,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You fight well, $n. I wish I had your ability... and your bravery.',0),(27086,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. With them out of the way, I have no more excuses.$B$BSoon, I must battle Thassarian, for honor and for Andorhal.',0),(27087,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You won\'t be taking me anywhere, $n.$B$BWhile Koltira prances about with his playmate, Thassarian, I plan to win this battle. Then I\'ll make Koltira suffer for his weakness.$B$BDon\'t believe me? Fine, I\'ll let you in on a little secret...',0),(27089,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is the body of Lurid, Thassarian\'s trusted knight. With Thassarian nowhere to be found, it would seem that the Alliance forces have withdrawn.$B$BThe Forsaken have won the battle for Andorhal.',0),(27090,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'See? All it took was a little help from the val\'kyr. These creatures are turning to be much more helpful than I had first thought.$B$BNow, on to other matters.',0),(27091,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think you\'ve mastered the basics of the charge, $n. Don\'t forget to return when you need more training.',0),(27092,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<3... 2... 1...>$B$B<Вы смачиваете пальцы и тушите фитиль. Собор спасен!>$B$B<Под бочками с порохом лежит груда бумаг. Похоже, сектанты пытались уничтожить улики.>',19342),(27103,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты хорошо $gпотрудился:потрудилась;, |3-6($c), и за это я перед тобой в вечном долгу. Война далека от завершения, но мы выиграли важное сражение с теми, кто стремится приблизить конец мира.$B$BПожалуйста, прими это в знак моей безграничной благодарности. Если мы когда-нибудь сумеем полностью очистить Забытый Город, знай – тебя здесь будут чествовать как героя. Спасибо тебе.',23877),(27104,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, very, very good. Today you\'re $gHappy: Happy is the old spirit. You deserve all the thanks you can get for your feat.',23877),(27105,1,1,6,1,0,0,0,0,'Меня тревожит, что в этих краях появился элементаль воды, да еще и такой сильный. Вот награда за твои услуги. А я займусь исследованием его сущности.',23877),(27106,274,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Самуэльсон был поражен порчей Сумеречного Молота? Должно быть, это началось много лет назад. И прямо здесь, в моей крепости!$B$BСпасибо за то, что вы с моим сыном расследовали это дело и не позволили сектантам причинить вред моему городу. И, кажется, я недооценил Андуина – он уже совсем взрослый. И его способность управлять Светом Небес спасла мне жизнь, а может, и все королевство.$B$BЧто же касается тебя, то твой героизм невозможно описать словами. Спасибо, |3-6($c).',19342),(27107,1,1,2,0,500,1000,1500,0,'Книга вернуться! Теперь хозяин убивать глупые деревья и рогатых! ХА!',23877),(27114,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You da big boss now, so you get free sample of my better brews! These drinks boost you up AND give you good buzz! These are da good ones, chief... you try and tell Kreeg yourself!',0),(27115,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s working! My father brought it!',0),(27116,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What in blazes WAS that? A flying mechanostrider?$B$BYou know what, I don\'t want to know. I\'m just going to pretend that didn\'t happen, and we\'ll be all nice and businesslike.',0),(27117,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellently done, $n.',0),(27118,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Перед вами лежит большая сломанная ловушка. Судя по ее виду, огры пытались починить ее, но у них ничего не вышло. Рядом с ловушка лежит второпях нацарапанная записка, и, что удивительно, в ней говорится о том, как починить западню. Нужно произвести всего лишь несколько простых манипуляций. Если западню починить, то любой проходящий мимо огр может в нее попасть и тогда его можно будет благополучно миновать.$b$bОчевидно, мало кто из огров умеет читать.',19342),(27119,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah, this will do the trick. Just a slip here, and tuck here... heh - this is going to work out just fine! <A broad smile beams from the chained goblin\'s face.>$B$BHere you go, you\'re all set. Remember- this isn\'t the most securely fashioned item in the world. You\'ll have ten minutes of use before it falls apart, and then you\'re not going to fool anybody! Try using it just before you approach him to make sure it lasts as long as you\'re going to need it.',0),(27120,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here ya go $n - put this thing on, and you\'ll have ten minutes to do whatever. Good luck!$B$BOh, and if you happen to find a key to get me out of here, BY ALL MEANS LET ME KNOW!!!',0),(27122,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dark Iron dwarves and Ragnaros the Firelord, ye say? At the behest of the Cult o\' Twilight\'s Hammer?$B$BWell done! Ironforge is in yer debt.',0),(27124,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow... you ARE da true king! Old king never even ask about da gauntlet!$B$BLook - this mark on da gauntlet an old old OLD timey magic mark, older than da Gordok they say. Well, I learn one thing as little ogre - how to make mark come to life and give power back to gauntlet!$B$BI do it for you, king! Here, take da gauntlet and rule FOREVER!',0),(27125,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes! I can see that you were indeed successful. You have received your tribute, the Gordok advance will exist no longer, and the Gordok are blissfully ignorant! This is a true winner\'s scenario, $n.',0),(27127,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dark Iron dwarves and Ragnaros the Firelord, you say? At the behest of the Cult of Twilight\'s Hammer?$B$BWell done! Orgrimmar is in your debt.',0),(27128,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Little $R did it! Now Horde more powerful than ever! YAR!',0),(27129,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Have you been in contact with a druid of the talon recently, $C? I can feel the lingering presence of one.',0),(27130,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your face shows signs of desperate conflict. I honor your presence, brave $C.',0),(27131,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I sensed your coming all the way from Dreamer\'s Rest. Your assistance would be most welcome.',0),(27132,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I sensed your coming all the way from Camp Mojache. Your assistance would be most welcome.',0),(27133,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Speak softly, $n. The Gordok may not be intelligent, but they are still dangerous warriors.',0),(27134,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These ogres no pushovers. I need you help me finish Orhan\'s task, $R.',0),(27137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ol\' Theradras was behind all the movin\' amd shakin\', ye say?$B$BAnd the Cult o\' Twilight\'s Hammer put her up to it?$B$BWell done! Ironforge is in yer debt.<table class=\"iconlist\"><tr><th><ul><li><var></var></li></ul></th><td><a href=\"/npc=44822\">NPC #44822</a> slain</td></tr></table>',0),(27138,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Theradras wreaking havoc for the Cult of Twilight\'s Hammer, eh? And she\'s in pieces, now?$B$BWell done! Orgrimmar is in your debt.<table class=\"iconlist\"><tr><th><ul><li><var></var></li></ul></th><td><a href=\"/npc=44822\">NPC #44822</a> slain</td></tr></table>',0),(27141,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shake it off, kid. Happens to me all the time... ',0),(27144,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have nothing against the Knights of the Ebon Blade, but Koltira needs to be reminded who he works for now. His loyalty must lie with the Horde.$B$BOr, more specifically, the Forsaken.$B$BI wouldn\'t plan on seeing Koltira anytime soon. Now that I have him... you can rest assured that any bonds he may have had with that Alliance scum will be thoroughly broken.',0),(27151,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have to admit, $n... I\'ve been tracking your progress with an internal vision spell. And you know... I\'m just amazed at how many gnols you met on the way!',19342),(27152,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hnolls and necromancy... However! It seemed to me that dark times had passed here in the Western Plague lands. $B$B< You can feel Daria\'s gaze focusing on something lying on the ground. > $B$BWait a minute... WHAT\'S THAT?',19342),(27153,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gзаметил:заметила;, $n? Прозвучало много имен, но одно упоминают чаще других.$B$BБисп.',19342),(27154,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я полагаю, мы можем расценивать его агрессивное поведение как признание вины. Ты в порядке, $n?',19342),(27155,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мне уже все известно, $n. Я тебя радушно встречаю в нашем городе, даю свое благословение, а ты в ответ что вытворяешь?$B$BУбиваешь предателя, которого мы выслеживали неделями. Молодец! Твоя доблесть проявилась куда раньше, чем я ожидал.',19342),(27156,1,24,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Я вот тут бумаги просматриваю. Мы вроде как рассчитывали, что к нам прибудет |3-6($r) |3-6($c) $gженского:мужского; пола. А не... э-э...$B$B<Лейтенант Майнер смотрит на вас в смущении>$B$BЛадно, опустим. Получается, мы изначально наняли кого-то другого, но ты тоже неплохо $gсправился:справилась;. Так что я тебе все равно заплачу.',19342),(27157,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Славно сработано! Как удачно ты тут $gоказался:оказалась;... даже не знаю, что бы я без тебя делал.',19342),(27158,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты очень вовремя, |3-6($c).',19342),(27159,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты не особо $gпрыток:прытка;, но, по крайней мере, с делом $gсправился:справилась;.$B$BОчень хорошо. У меня для тебя, $n, потом будет еще одно задание, уже поважнее.',23877),(27160,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Чудовища... сильны.$B$B$n... сильнее.',23877),(27161,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эти гранаты просто взрывчатка, не более. Может, я и не гоблинский инженер... но понимаю, как важно уметь время от времени взрывать всякие вещи.',23877),(27162,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brilliant job, $n. And now that the Wicked Leader has been banished from Andoral, we will wait for the right moment.',23877),(27163,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасно, $n.',23877),(27164,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Arazh is dead... That\'s good news. This dwarf has contributed to our success in this war. Just like you, $n.',23877),(27165,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The news arrived just before you did, $n. Now that the Whip has been banished from Andoral, we\'re one step closer to the return of Lordereon.',23877),(27166,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я велю нашим мастерам приниматься за работу.$B$BМне очень приятно, что ты так быстро $gсогласился:согласилась; выполнить это задание, $n. Возможно, потом я найду тебе дело поинтереснее.',23877),(27167,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты охотишься, как $gистинный:настоящая:c; |3-6($c). Даже если мы тут и не поселимся... по крайней мере не умрем с голоду.',23877),(27168,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надеюсь, большинство из них ушло с миром. Thank you, $n.',23877),(27169,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Значит, вы с людьми из лагеря Промозглого Ветра хотите вернуть себе Андорал? Желаю вам удачи.',23877),(27170,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You see the broken crates of weapons and armor scattered there and down the bottom level. Looks like someone got here before you did.',23877),(27171,274,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Призраки напали? Странно. Вообще-то я предполагал, что этот склеп не до конца зачищен.$B$BТы едва не $gзастал:застала; Турмана Гранта... помнишь, того неуклюжего фермера, что и прежде сюда приходил. Он взял своих ребят и отправился на ближайшую ферму... вопреки моим приказам.',23877),(27172,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ладно, раз уж ты здесь, мы с радостью возьмем у тебя эти доспехи.$B$BА оружие можешь оставить себе. Эти люди не знают, за какой конец браться.',23877),(27173,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты отлично сражаешься, |3-6($r). Моим людям не помешало бы перенять пару приемов у такого опытного воина, как ты.',23877),(27174,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну ладно, теперь мы разберемся. Спасибо тебе за помощь, $n.$B$BДумаю, в следующий раз мы встретимся уже в бою. А пока береги себя. Нам понадобится любая помощь.',23877),(27175,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, |3-6($c). As you can see, our camp is a joint expedition of the Silver Avangard and the Druids of the Kenaria Circle, but we are glad to all who are ready to heal this land together with us.',23877),(27176,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,' Let\'s have a look at this. Shall we? ',0),(27177,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at all this! You were able to recover more than I thought. We can outfit a whole squad of marines with this stuff.$B$BWe have the gear. If we only had some way to bolster our numbers here in the Highlands...',0),(27178,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'ll send \'em packing, $n! Cho\'gall won\'t be able to count on the naga to back him up in this fight. From here on out, it\'s just us versus the Twilight\'s Hammer.$B$B$B$B...And the Horde.',0),(27179,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These tablets are covered with titan writings. There\'s never-before seen information here, $n! Missing pieces to an ancient puzzle... Good work! ',0),(27182,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Have you come here to spy on me? No?$B$BPerhaps you have an appreciation for fine cuisine, then? Good, you can help!',0),(27183,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, that\'s the spice! Now here\'s some swampy good stew.',0),(27184,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You got the eyes! You got the eyes! Tasty, tasty spider eyes!$B$BSome eyes... when you stare at them they stare back. Eat those last. They keep you company... out in the swamp.$B$BHello, little spider eyes. Hello! You taste like chicken. Gooey, salty chicken!$B$BMmmh.',0),(27185,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nicely done, lad! Without them new weapons, they\'re just as easy t\' kill as they were when they were alive!',0),(27186,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a good blade. It has a good swing. It\'s a good swing blade. Thank you. Thank you, thank you, thank you!!! Now I want to try it.... $B$BLater. I\'ll try it later. But like I was saying... thanks.',0),(27188,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Mordant produces a small sheet of paper and a pen, beginning to scribble down notes on your findings.>$B$BFrom your findings, the spirits in this place must amount to everyone who ever lived on this land, not just the previous occupants.$B$BSomething has been corrupting and killing them. Those who follow don\'t learn the truth until it\'s too late. We have to put an end to this, $n!',0),(27189,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Mordant accepts the bunch of herbs from you.>$B$BThese match the description exactly! I prepared the torch while you were out. All that remains is to fasten the herbs to the end here.',0),(27190,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It worked?$B$B<Mordant clears his throat.>$B$BI mean... it worked! Jarl and I are in your debt, $n. Now the only remaining problem is my friend\'s taste in furniture, and I\'m afraid that won\'t be solved as easily.',0),(27191,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonder what it\'s like to be an ogre. Big people have to eat more.$B$BOgres must be even hungrier than me. That doesn\'t sound very fun.',0),(27196,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Would you get a load of this place! ',0),(27197,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word has it that you helped those farmers arm themselves. Well, now they\'ve initiated the attack without my order! They\'ve forced my hand.$B$BThe battle has resumed. This time, we fight the Forsaken... and I fight Koltira, my old brother of the Ebon Blade.',0),(27198,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You fight well, $n. I wish I had your ability... and your bravery.',0),(27199,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. With them out of the way, I have no more excuses.$B$BSoon, I must battle Koltira, for honor and for Andorhal.',0),(27200,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'She had me under her spell, $n. I wouldn\'t have made it out of there alive if it weren\'t for you. Thank you!$B$BMaybe the rest of the Alliance fleet can finally anchor here in peace...',0),(27201,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Убивая валь\'киру, ты спасаешь десятки наших бойцов... И не даешь увеличиваться силам Отрекшихся.$B$BИ все же они теснят нас. Мы можем и не выиграть этой битвы.',19342),(27202,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты храбро $gсражался:сражалась;, но это нам не помогло. Каждый павший лишь пополняет их ряды.',19342),(27204,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я наблюдал снизу, как ты $gсражался:сражалась;. Хороший был бой, жаль только, в итоге не принесет нам никакой пользы.$B$BВаль\'киры и Отрекшиеся наступают, скоро они нас раздавят. Мы все-таки потеряли Андорал.',19342),(27205,5,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Val\'kira? Did Coltira call the Val\'kira to this fight? Is he crazy? No, that\'s not Coltira\'s handwriting. It\'s Silvana\'s handwriting.',19342),(27206,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lost? No... next, they\'ll be coming for Chillwind, I suppose. This was a major strategic blow to the Alliance\'s plans for Lordaeron.$B$BVery well. I will report the results of this battle to King Wrynn. I don\'t expect him to be happy.',0),(27207,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A massive prince of the wind, you say? The herald of Al\'Akir, the Windlord?$B$BMadness. All of it.$B$BStormwind is in your debt, hero.',0),(27208,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good we stopped Balnazzar now. Before long, his army would have overtaken all of Stratholme, giving him a powerful center for his new unholy empire.',0),(27209,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A massive prince of the wind, you say? The herald of Al\'Akir, the Windlord?$B$BMadness. All of it.$B$BAll of Thunder Bluff is in your debt, $C.',0),(27210,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. I think we managed to catch them off guard. Their agents probably thought themselves safe within the city walls.$B$BGiven time, the agitators will return and spread their lies again. We\'ll use the time you\'ve bought to shut out the deserters further.',19116),(27211,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The SI:7 agent nods in approval.>$B$BExcellent. All that remains is to discredit the deserters so that they\'ll never gain a foothold in Theramore again, and I have just the plan to do it.',19116),(27212,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Calia chuckles as you describe the guards\' reactions to the propaganda.>$B$BJust as I\'d hoped! I think it\'s safe to say any deserter agents who try to infiltrate Theramore will be laughed right out of town!',19116),(27213,2,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Gavis\' request isn\'t as outlandish as it might sound. With the proper handling, Lady Jaina can return the deserters to the fold, but that is her decision, of course.$B$BIt\'s been a pleasure working with you, $n. Without your help, I doubt the operation would\'ve gone so smoothly. When I make my report in Stormwind, it will name you as the $c who ended the deserter threat.',19116),(27214,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The captain makes no effort to hide that he\'s assessing your abilities.>$B$BSo you\'ve heard about the recent shipwreck off the coast? Good, I could use some help confirming my suspicions about the survivors. Welcome aboard, $n.',19116),(27215,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Get off my lawn... unless, that is, you want to help old \"Swamp Eye\" with a little bit of cooking. Whad\'ya say?',0),(27216,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. I can use all the help you can offer. My first priority is to get that lamp re-lit.',19116),(27217,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, I have my doubts, but this is the only solution available right now. Once we have it up and running, I\'m sure there will be time to look at other ways to fuel the lamp.',19116),(27218,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, now, that was thoughtful o\' Babs to send that over. I don\'t know if you\'ve leafed through it or not, but there\'s a lot of truth to the tales in that book. Sailors didn\'t just make it all up, you know.',19116),(27219,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you want to know about sea monsters? Hmm... well, I\'ll make you a deal, but it\'s going to involve a lot of alcohol and some embarrassment on your part.',19116),(27220,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not bad at all, but you know, I think I\'d get a bath in as soon as possible, if I was you.$B$BNow, about your sea monster...$B$BHelp yourself to a brew or two in the meantime.',19116),(27221,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You recount your experiences with Nat Pagle, carefully omitting the portion about the \'bait test.\'>$B$BWell, it sounds like we\'ve got our work cut out for us. I\'ll make the preparations.',19116),(27222,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n! I\'ll admit, when I caught my first glimpse of that beast, I had doubts about our ability to defend the docks, but you held together the defenders brilliantly!',19116),(27223,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You may have this as a suitable reward. I found it nestled in the armor of one of the scourge here.',0),(27225,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to see that you received my message. I have something important I wish to discuss with you.',0),(27227,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Стратхольм станет образцом всего самого лучшего в этом мире. Я благодарю тебя за все, что ты $gсовершил:совершила; ради общего дела.',19342),(27228,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я ценю силу, которую ты $gпродемонстрировал:продемонстрировала; в сражении с Рамштайном. Если твои деяния будут столь яростны, даже Плеть содрогнется от страха.',19342),(27229,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'By Grom, I\'m glad that\'s over with. If you read that sign you may have some idea how desperate I got after trying to communicate to these lumbering oafs.',0),(27230,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасно! Раз они лишены бесперебойных поставок оружия, мы без труда победим!',19342),(27233,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $C. As you can see, our camp is a joint expedition between Argent Crusade members and Cenarion Circle druids, but we welcome all who wish to help heal the land.',0),(27234,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Captain Wymor accepts the orders from you and reads over them.>$B$BWhat in the world could \'precious cargo\' refer to? The Defias have done some small time smuggling back in Stormwind, but this seems out of their league. The language of these orders suggests a wealthy or noble patron.',19116),(27235,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Renn looks over the orders.>$B$BSo there was valuable cargo on board! We have to locate it before the Defias recover it. These guys are no divers, but we\'re going to need some of their gear if you\'re to help me find the cargo.',0),(27236,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow, this is in worse shape than I\'d thought, and these tools...$B$BWell, I said I\'d get this back into working condition for you, so I\'d better get to work.',0),(27237,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Renn rifles through the contents of the strongboxes you recovered.>\r\n\r\nGood work. Now, let\'s see if our \'precious cargo\' is in here.... ',0),(27238,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You and Renn have done excellent work in bringing this information to light and reporting it immediately. Now, we must confirm your findings. The implications are too great if we are wrong.',0),(27239,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Lady Jaina listens intently as you report the results of your aerial survey.>$B$BA rune circle, dragonkin? The Defias have allied themselves with HER? The traitor?$B$B<Lady Jaina composes herself and prepares to explain.>',0),(27240,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So it was the Defias who served as the hands of Onyxia in this plot?$B$B<The king\'s face grow red with anger and his hands clench into fists.>$B$BYou and Lady Jaina have done Stormind a great service this day. The traitors will not live long enough to regret their crimes.',0),(27241,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have no doubt that the king meant every word when he told you he plans to destroy the Defias once and for all. He does not make promises lightly, and the enemies of Stormwind should know it.',0),(27242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You look a little scratched up, but nothing major. You\'re certainly in a lot better shape than the Grimtotems will be when our new raptor friends get done with them.',0),(27243,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The sergeant doesn\'t bother to hide his grin.>$B$BGood. That ought to forestall a raid or two.',0),(27244,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n. Our agent, Marg Nighteye, was stationed outside Theramore. He was charged to spy on the city. $B$BThis is his latest report, and it may be his last -- from your testimony, I fear that Marg met his end in the swamp...',0),(27245,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The freed captives have already begun returning from Blackhoof Village. The information the captain is receiving from the prisoners will give us an advantage in our next battle against the Grimtotems.$B$BYou have my thanks and that of the men.',0),(27246,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hm... I can\'t read orcish very well, but this looks like a report... written by an orc spy!',0),(27247,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A report from an orc spy! How did you find this? No matter -- let\'s see what it says...',0),(27248,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So Theramore is interested in doing business? Well, that\'s not an offer I\'d turn down. Supplies are pretty scarce here right now, so we need all the business contacts we can get!',19116),(27249,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to see that Captain Vimes is finally assigning others to this investigation.$B$BI\'ve used a reflective powder to dust the area. It will reveal suspicious objects and markings, helping you to focus your efforts. Look over anything the dust illuminates.',19116),(27251,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'James Hyal\'s his real name. He opened an inn at the edge of the Barrens. Wanted to make a nice place for travelers to stop over...$B$BMight be he was thinking too big, but the inn did do well for a while. Then we lost control of the roads in the marsh, and the ogres took over.$B$BJames was too stubborn to give up his dream for safety within our walls, and the Shady Rest Inn was burnt to the ground. We\'re investigating, but haven\'t had much luck. If you want to help out, see what you can find in the rubble.',0),(27252,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hm, I\'m no expert with the construction of arms and armor. Their use, yes, but not their making.$b$bThis shield seems as ordinary as any, excepting the damage from the fire that engulfed the inn.',19116),(27253,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The inspector regards you with what can only be disdain and distrust.>$B$BLeave this place be, errand boy, or I\'ll be sure to bring a contingent of guard with me next time to sink the lesson home.',0),(27254,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I grant that humans have strange decorating tastes, but would they use a plain iron shield to adorn their fireplace? Perhaps this shield was placed there by the ones who burned the inn.$B$BA warning? A threat?',0),(27255,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is good shield. Very strong, heavy, good. But Do\'gol don\'t need it. I make shields, not buy them, $n.$B$BYou should know that.',0),(27256,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t like spiders that are so big I can\'t sit on them and squish them.$B$BThanks for getting them, $n. Now I rip them open and pour them onto the shield...',0),(27257,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mosarn? Sounds familiar... I can\'t put my finger on it. Maybe it\'ll come to me later.$B$BIt probably isn\'t important. A shield can come from anywhere and not mean anything...',0),(27258,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, you are certainly correct. This is a shield that I made.$B$BI\'m afraid there\'s not much more I can tell you though, $n. I craft so many different shields and sets of armor, I can\'t keep track of them all.',0),(27259,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hoofprints... It could have been the quilboar, I suppose. Or maybe even the centaur. Their presence in the Barrens is not insignificant, and I would not think it a stretch to commit such an act.$B$BDid I tell you? It wasn\'t just that the inn was burned down... The owner\'s woman and pup were killed. Bad business, that.$B$BNonetheless, I will send Kagoro to find where the tracks lead.',0),(27260,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm... now this is interesting.',0),(27261,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmph. It is good that Reethe will no longer be lurking around the swamp, but it is a shame that humans are built so frail that he could not recover from a little arrow wound.$B$BIt seems that this thread of the mystery has led nowhere, and we must look elsewhere.',0),(27262,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hoofprints, eh? It is true that there is an extraordinary amount of centaur activity in the lands near the Dustwallow Marsh. In brief excursions into the Barrens, we found their camps and holdings dotting the area.$b$bI\'ll send out Falgran Hastil, one of our trackers, to see if he can find where the tracks lead.',19116),(27263,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s never good news when a guard\'s badge is brought to me.$b$bSometimes it\'s a man or woman who\'s fallen in battle, and I\'m left to bring the news to the grieving family. Other times we never find out what happened to them. And other times it\'s even worse than that.',19116),(27264,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello, $n. You\'d like information about a specific member of the Theramore guard? Reethe, was it?$b$bJust give me a moment to find the right book.',19116),(27265,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It heartens me to see that my message found you, $n. We have much to discuss. ',0),(27266,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve arrived. Make yourself at home, $n. We have much to discuss. ',0),(27267,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope my message didn\'t unnerve you, $n. I have called you here to recognize your accomplishments. ',0),(27268,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It heartens me to see that you received my message and responded so quickly. ',0),(27269,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the Temple of the Moon, $n. I am glad that you chose to answer my summons so quickly. ',0),(27270,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $n. I am glad that you decided to accept my invitation.',0),(27271,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the Wizard\'s Sanctum, $n. I have been watching your progress with interest. ',0),(27272,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see that my message managed to reach you. Good. We have much to discuss. ',0),(27273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad to see that you have arrived safely in Nighthaven, $n. I offer you the welcome and the hospitality of the Cenarion Circle.',0),(27274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see that you received my message. Excellent! ',0),(27275,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good to see you again, $n. Let us put the fear of the Goddess into the Grimtotem.',0),(27276,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am honored by your presence, $n. Let us put the fear of the Earth Mother into the Grimtotem.',0),(27277,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good. It seems my message did find you. ',0),(27278,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, you\'re here. Let\'s get started. ',0),(27279,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that you are here, we can begin. ',0),(27280,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you are both obedient and talented, $n. Stay that way, and you will go far in the Horde.',0),(27281,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you are both obedient and talented, $n. Stay that way, and you will go far in the Horde.',0),(27282,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'re here at last. ',0),(27283,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Moonglade, $n. I have been looking forward to meeting you.',0),(27284,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hm... interesting piece of iron you have here. Definitely not made by any of the blacksmiths I know over on this side of the sea, and it\'s certainly not my work.',19116),(27285,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s not much information to work on, but we\'ll have to keep it in mind. Hopefully some of the other pieces of this mystery will fall into place, and paint a more helpful picture of what happened.',19116),(27286,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Missing? That would be Tesoran\'s kind way of saying traitor.$b$bNo doubt he\'s one of those fools so blindly loyal to Admiral Daelin that he turned traitor.  Isn\'t that a delicious irony? The deserters accuse us of betraying the Alliance.',19116),(27287,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did Vimes send you? Couldn\'t do his dirty work himself, could he...',0),(27288,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will send Lieutenant Caldwell to deal with the deserters at Lost Point. In addition, I will instruct him to find Reethe. The marsh is not so big and trackless that he should be unable to find him.',0),(27291,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Captain Vimes smiles slightly as you relate the events you witnessed at the Hyal family grave.>$B$BIt\'s good to know that they understand. You didn\'t tell them about James, did you?$B$BI\'ll deliver his wife\'s message to him, but I doubt he\'ll understand.',0),(27292,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He actually said that the Grimtotems are his biggest customers? Mosarn gave us more help than he knows. With this much pointing toward the Grimtotems, I think we just found our first suspects.',0),(27293,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Krog reads over the battle plan.>$B$BThere\'s no doubt in my mind that the Grimtotems are moving against the humans. What I don\'t understand is what their intentions are toward us. We knew nothing of these plans and we lost a good man because of it. I don\'t trust that we\'re not next on their list.',0),(27294,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Krog inspects the weapons and armor you\'ve brought from Blackhoof Village.>$B$BThis is unmistakably the work of Mosarn. Questioning him further may draw too much attention, but we have a bit more freedom in dealing with the Grimtotems.',0),(27295,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Tabetha smiles slightly.>$B$BKrog wishes me to scry for the Grimtotems, eh? Well, I have no need of magic in this case.$B$BIt seems we have a mutual enemy. The Grimtotems have built an outpost nearby and are a constant thorn in the side of me and my students.',0),(27296,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Grimtotems should have no trouble understanding our latest message.$B$BAs for you, your contact at Brackenwall Village will want to know of your success. If I know him, he\'ll appreciate the taste of vengeance.',0),(27297,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Krog listens to your report.>$B$BI\'m impressed, $n. I would\'ve thought that the Grimtotem criminals would\'ve been more difficult to locate. The Alliance are truly incompetent.$B$BIn truth, I just sought to answer the death of one of my men, but this situation has been more fortunate than expected. If the Grimtotem choose to retaliate, it will likely be against the Alliance. Perhaps we will soon have the manpower to drive the scum from these shores once and for all.',0),(27298,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve heard much about you, $n. You have a bright future ahead of you in the Horde. ',0),(27299,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tank ya, $C. A bit of breathin\' room helps a lot.',0),(27300,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Revenge is bittersweet, but I\'m glad we be havin\' someone as powerful as you do see dis done.',0),(27301,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank the elements that you\'ve come. Did my brothers send you?',0),(27302,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that\'s what I\'m talkin\' about! Can you think of all the uses for this stuff? I definitely can\'t. But I can think of a lot, and I\'m liking the possibilities.',0),(27303,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. You are quite capable. I\'m extremely grateful that you\'ve chosen to aid us.',0),(27304,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve heard much of your contributions to the Horde, $n. ',0),(27305,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Master Fordring will be glad beyond measure to see this painting again.',0),(27306,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ogron? Yeah, that me.$B$BShh. Keep voice down. Crocs hear you.',0),(27307,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad you\'ve come, $C. These are troublesome times and we could use all the help we can get.',0),(27308,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad you\'ve come, $C. These are troublesome times and we could use all the help we can get.',0),(27310,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s see them wage their war now!',0),(27311,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let us see how well they fight without their weapons.',0),(27312,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That put a dent in their numbers! Can\'t say that they didn\'t deserve it.',0),(27313,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'While the Earth Mother does not condone such violence, we had no choice. The Grimtotem have ignored Her teachings for too long and are reaping what they have sown.',0),(27314,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'She was tougher than I thought. We worked well together, but we\'re going to have to make sure not to underestimate the other Grimtotem chiefs.',0),(27315,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'She was more formidable than her reputation suggested. Although we worked well together, we must make certain not to underestimate the other Grimtotem chiefs.',0),(27316,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s true then! What is it doing here, though? And if it\'s here, that must mean that the writ and the drums are also nearby!$B$BMaybe there\'s some link between it and the wind serpent that just appeared? I think that I\'ve an idea what that creature is as well.',0),(27317,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is true then! What is it doing here, though? And if it is here, that must mean that the writ and the drums are also nearby!$B$BPerhaps there is some link between it and the wind serpent that just appeared? I think that I have an idea what that creature is as well.',0),(27318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s two of them. Two more to go.$B$BI wonder what he meant about being \"chosen\"?',0),(27319,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was not pleasant. I wonder what he meant by calling you, \"the Chosen\"?',0),(27320,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m fairly certain that\'s it. This is very intriguing, $n. What are they doing here? Are they being used as a weapon?$B$BThe wind serpent flew northwest to that next bluff. Maybe that\'s where the drums are?',0),(27321,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is very exciting and also worrisome, $n. What are these artifacts doing here? Are they being used as a weapons against us by the Grimtotem?$B$BThe wind serpent flew northwest to that next bluff. Maybe that\'s where the drums are?',0),(27322,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That towering behemoth has killed hundreds of Forsaken soldiers. You\'ve done a great thing, $n.',0),(27323,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The sentinel gives you an appraising look.>$B$BWhat is it with you? Why do they all seem spooked by you being here?',0),(27324,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The brave gives you an appraising look.>$B$BThere is something special about you, $n. That much is certain.',0),(27325,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Surely that was the voice of the Elder Crone!$B$BWe must be very careful, $n. Great danger lies ahead if Magatha Grimtotem has taken notice of you.',0),(27326,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Surely that was the voice of the Elder Crone!$B$BWe must be very careful, $n. Great danger lies ahead if Magatha Grimtotem has taken notice of you.',0),(27327,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For some reason they all think that you\'ve been sent by Magatha Grimtotem. I know it must have something to do with that wind serpent that\'s been hanging around.$B$BDoesn\'t matter. Their leader is dead. It\'s only a matter of time before the tauren of Freewind Post regain their home.$B$BIf I were them, I\'d push back a little to teach the Grimtotem a lesson, but they probably won\'t. They\'re tauren.',0),(27328,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They all believed that you have been sent by Magatha Grimtotem. There is no arguing that her pet, Arikara, has been lurking about.$B$B<The brave gives you a long look.>$B$BIt does not matter. Arnak is dead. It is only a matter of time before we take back Freewind Post.$B$BPerhaps now we will be able to establish a lasting peace with the Grimtotem?',0),(27329,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, she\'s been taken prisoner by the Twilight\'s Hammer. I can\'t say that I feel sorry for her, but she might prove even more dangerous in their hands.',0),(27330,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, she\'s been taken prisoner by the Twilight\'s Hammer. I can\'t say that I feel sorry for her, but she might prove even more dangerous in their hands.',0),(27331,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming to see me, $n. ',0),(27332,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The spirits knew that you would answer my call, $n. ',0),(27334,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you are, $n. I was beginning to think my message hadn\'t found you. ',0),(27335,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $n. I\'m glad that you accepted my invitation. We have much to discuss. ',0),(27336,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The apprentice listens as you describe your experiment.>$B$BA haze and some lightning? That\'s it? There\'s got to be more to the totem than just that! The Grimtotems aren\'t likely to bring something like this to the battlefield unless it has some kind of utility.',0),(27337,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ander told me to expect you. It\'s quite an honor to be crafting a weapon for you, $n. With these materials, it will be a fine blade indeed.',0),(27338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Keep your head down \'fore you lose it, $C!$B$BThis is MY beach.$B$BThe Horde WANTS my beach.$B$BThey will NOT have my beach.$B$BIs the beach situation clear?',0),(27339,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Apprentice Garion inspects the venom.>$B$BThis is absolutely perfect! He\'ll never know the difference.',0),(27340,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Apprentice Morlann nods.>$B$BGood. Can\'t say I\'ll miss the company, if you can call it that. You\'d think at least in the middle of the swamp you\'d get some privacy, you know?',0),(27341,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s the lay of the land, soldier. If you\'re having trouble fighting here on the coast, you might consider pitching in and helping us take and hold that hill.',0),(27343,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord Grayson has told me much about you and your dedication to the Light and the Alliance. It will be a great honor to craft a hammer for you, $n. ',0),(27344,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who knew that cursed old keep hid such valuable items? I\'ll be honored to craft them into a fine weapon for you. ',0),(27346,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So those hermit mages sent you? How can I be sure that I can trust you?$B$BI suppose I can use the help. There\'s not much here a mage would be interested in, anyway.',0),(27347,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, it does look a little cleaner out there...$B$BI suppose it\'s time to get down to the business of salvaging this wreckage.',19116),(27348,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! You certainly found a lot more than I expected would be out there. I\'m not sure how much Drazzit thought we were going to find out here, but he\'s going to have to be happy with this for now.',19116),(27351,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It was quite an honor to receive the commission for your weapon, $n. When Tony mentioned using so many exotic materials, I had my doubts, but it seems you managed to find them all. This will be a fine reward for all you\'ve done for the Alliance. ',0),(27352,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Превосходно! Когда у нас будет много святой воды, мы зададим этой Плети!',19342),(27353,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have rarely had the chance to work with such exotic materials, but even I can sense the power residing within them. I will have the honor of crafting an incredible weapon for you, $n. The farseer did not underestimate your abilities when she told me about you.',0),(27354,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, I have been expecting you, $n. Maginor Dumas has spoken highly of you and the royal commission only confirms his words. It is an honor to be able to craft a staff for you. ',0),(27355,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I won\'t ask what you had to do to come by such rare and powerful materials, but I\'m glad to have the chance to work with them. Your weapon will be magnificent! ',0),(27356,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you must be the $C Loganaar was talking about. It is a pleasure to finally meet you. Loganaar and other members of the circle speak highly of you. It will be an honor to make a weapon for such a $C.',0),(27357,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is embarrassing to have been kidnapped by Arnak again. I heard the fighting outside. Did you kill him?$B$B<The shaman looks sad for just a moment.>$B$BI am happy to be free once more. Now, how can I help you, $R?',0),(27358,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is embarrassing to have been kidnapped by Arnak again. I heard the fighting outside. Did you kill him?$B$B<The shaman looks sad for just a moment.>$B$BI am happy to be free once more. Now, how can I help you, $C?',0),(27359,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Чудовищно... банши и впрямь терзаемые души. Даже когда просто держишь в руках их сущности, это причиняет неимоверную душевную боль...$B$BНу все, довольно. Я поработаю над противодействием их магии, а затем мы быстро наладим портал. Стратхольм скоро снова будет нашим.',19342),(27361,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t believe you managed to get all those materials. I wouldn\'t think of venturing into Shadowfang Keep! The stories about that place are horrific. Enough of that, though. This is a time to recognize your achievements, not prattle on about my silly fears. ',0),(27362,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t believe you managed to get all those materials. I wouldn\'t think of venturing into Shadowfang Keep! The stories about that place are horrific. Enough of that, though. This is a time to recognize your achievements, not prattle on about my silly fears. ',0),(27363,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t believe you managed to get all those materials. I wouldn\'t think of venturing into Shadowfang Keep! The stories about that place are horrific. Enough of that, though. This is a time to recognize your achievements, not prattle on about my silly fears. ',0),(27365,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Grezz Ragefist told me to expect you. Those materials will make a fine sword. Always use it for the glory of the Horde.',0),(27366,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dead? By the dozen?$B$BIt\'s a start, $C. It\'s a start.',0),(27367,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$GTrenar? Fiona! Is that you? $B$BWhoever it is, help me!',23877),(27368,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Уже $gвернулся:вернулась;? Прежде чем плеснуть на меня этой кислотой, ответь на один вопрос: ты случайно не из этих восьминогих мерзавцев? Надо же мне знать – благодарить тебя или бить, когда освобожусь.',23877),(27369,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я порву этого паладина-недоростка в клочья еще до того, как он... минутку! Это колокольчики банши? Мне?$B$BО, Гидвин попросил тебя передать? Он такой милый! Ладно, я его прощаю.',23877),(27370,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Они здесь, |3-6($r). Слуги Плети. Моя мечта сбылась.',23877),(27371,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пятерых достаточно.$B$BОй, времени-то сколько! Мне в лагерь пора.',23877),(27372,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это именно то, что нужно! Ладно, я прощаю Таренара.$B$B$n, можешь присоединиться к нам, если хочешь.',23877),(27373,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надеюсь, тебя не слишком укачало в дороге.$B$BПока лошади отдыхают, можешь осмотреть башню. Это, конечно, не часовня Последней Надежды, но, думаю, ты все же найдешь, чем заняться.',23877),(27374,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, brotha. You\'ve chosen a harsh time to be joinin\' us, but that is to our fortune. We could use ya help.',0),(27375,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, brotha. You\'ve chosen a harsh time to be joinin\' us, but that is to our fortune. We could use ya help.',0),(27376,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The tentacles swept us off of our gryphons as well! They were far more nimble than we anticipated.$B$BNo matter. We were prepared for this possibility. I can summon the elemental from here if you can keep me safe.',0),(27377,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve brought you back from the brink of death, hero!$B$BDeathwing is upon us! We need your help.',0),(27378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re awake! Thank the elements. I\'d almost lost all hope.',0),(27379,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'United with the Earthen Ring, we can survive the horrors of Iso\'rath. Now it is time to turn our vengeance upon him!',0),(27380,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You saved many of my closest allies today, $n. I can only imagine what horrors you witnessed within Iso\'rath, but you have the thanks of all of the Earthen Ring.',0),(27381,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Argus Guiding... That old man at the top of the tower? That\'s great!$B$BJudging by his age, he\'s long served the Silver Vanguard. Maybe he\'ll put in a good word for us at the Chapel.',23877),(27382,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Конечно, |3-6($r) вроде тебя с легкостью справится с парой диких зверей. Если ты расчистишь дорогу, то мое путешествие будет гораздо спокойнее.',23877),(27383,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Привет, я Памела. А как тебя зовут?',23877),(27384,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Нашлась! Нашлась моя куколка! О, спасибо тебе!',23877),(27385,18,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gвидел:видела; Памелу? Она жива?$B$BМертва? Нет!.. Ох... Памела... Почему твой дух обречен на страдания в этом мире? Почему ты погибла, а меня судьба оставила в живых? Я бы с радостью поменялся с тобой местами и бродил бы по мертвому Дарроуширу одиноким призраком!..$B$BОх, судьбу не изменишь. Спасибо тебе, $n. Теперь моя жажда мщения разгорелась с новой силой.$B$BНо скажи мне, что это у тебя за меч?',23877),(27386,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что это? Меч? Или кухонный нож? Я ничего не смыслю в оружии. Дай-ка посмотреть...$B$BКогда-то этим мечом владел великий воин, но в его прошлом была ужасная трагедия.$B$BТы здесь, чтобы ему помочь? Уже слишком поздно... Хотя, возможно, мы и сумеем исправить его прошлое!',23877),(27387,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found them! Well done, $n! These relics hold within them the memories of the Scourge forces at Darrowshire. We will need these if we are to save your Joseph Redpath.',0),(27388,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have the relics? Good. I will get to work on resolving any temporal discontinuities.$B$BDon\'t worry... that\'s not something you have to worry about. You just gather the reagents.',0),(27389,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. Are you certain you haven\'t done this before?',0),(27390,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The fighting is over! I heard my daddy whisper to me. He scared away all the ghosts and he says he\'s coming home! I\'m so happy!$B$BHe also said I should welcome you if came to our house, so I made some tea!$B$BI hope you like lots of sugar!',0),(27391,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The key fits the lock, and the chest opens...',0),(27392,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, it\'s him! Dad\'s sword! How you him $gfound:found ;? $GAnd he saw:And he saw; bad hunter?',23877),(27393,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Wavespeaker was right. There\'s something here.',0),(27394,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Wavespeaker was right. There\'s something here.',0),(27395,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m honored that the warchief chose me to craft a weapon for you, $n. With such exotic materials, it will be a very fine bow. ',0),(27396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gordul told me that you would be bringing a variety of unusual materials, but I didn\'t expect anything like this. Moonsteel is said to be very rare and there\'s only one place I know to get it. You have risked much for this weapon, $n, and I\'ll see to it that you receive a fitting reward. ',0),(27397,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you must be $n. Kardris said that you were venturing to Shadowfang Keep to find the materials needed for this weapon and I see that you have not disappointed. I will make you a mighty weapon worthy of what you have brought.',0),(27398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your aid is most timely, $n.',0),(27399,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты вовремя $gподоспел:подоспела;, $n.',19243),(27400,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you must be the $c that Uthel\'nay mentioned. I\'ve heard tales about the artifacts the Silverlaine family once kept, but I haven\'t ever seen one. This should make an excellent focus for your staff. Let\'s get started. ',0),(27402,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you are the $c who will receive this staff. It will be a fitting reward for one so dedicated to the pursuit of power and the ascendancy of the Horde. ',0),(27403,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I haven\'t worked with the Sunwalkers before, but from all I\'ve heard, the warchief holds you in high regard. It was a great honor to be asked to forge this weapon for you and I hope it will serve you well. ',0),(27404,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you must be the $C Loganaar was talking about. It is a pleasure to finally meet you, $n. I\'ve often heard members of the circle describe you as a talented and promising $C and I\'m heartened to see their estimations were correct.',0),(27407,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Brogg accepts the feathers.>$B$BBrogg pleased with these feathers. Very strong magic. Brogg not know what raptors do to give feathers power, but raptor feathers always best for ritual.',0),(27408,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have Brogg\'s thanks, $n. Brogg has big plans for clan banner.',0),(27409,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have Brogg\'s thanks, $n. Once Brogg adds their magic to the totem, it will be able to redeem the spirits of Brogg\'s fallen friends.',0),(27410,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brogg thanks you for your help, although he knows Overlord Mok\'Morokk never will. At least surviving Stonemaul can finally focus on problems with the living and leave dead where they belong. Only one thing remains for Brogg to do.',0),(27411,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Brogg listens as you recount your experience at the entrance to Onyxia\'s lair.>$B$BBrogg know Onyxia dead. Brogg know her brood still there. Brogg not let them forget the Stonemaul.$B$BBrogg is grateful for your help, $n, and he will never forget what you have done for him. Brogg will never give up his quest to bring Stonemaul back where they belong.',0),(27412,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank goodness someone\'s finally taken me up on that offer. I was just thinking that I might need to triple the reward to get that stupid raptor killed, and our budget couldn\'t afford that!',0),(27413,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you! This will help keep our guys going out in the field until Moxie returns with the rest of the supplies from the zeppelin crash.',0),(27414,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'\'Twas a perilous affair, no doubt, collecting all of these hearts and tongues. I shall delve into the depths of the arcane to trace the origin of the black menace which has descended upon our former home.',0),(27415,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Splendid! It will be sometime before Onyxia can produce more eggs.$B$BOn behalf of my people, I thank you, $n.$B$BI have asked much of you so far. Perhaps you can do the Stonemaul Clan one last service.$B$BMok\'Morokk is not fit to lead us. Tharg would make an excellent leader but is hindered by his injuries and age. Drive Mok\'Morokk from this place by force. Only then can we appoint a new leader to return us to our proper home in the south.',0),(27416,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Why you tell me \'bout dragons? Me no like dragons. Me like it here. No dragons here.',0),(27417,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That lazy coward!$B$BMok\'Morokk displayed strength when Rexxar was our leader. But soon after Rexxar\'s departure Mok\'Morokk fell prey to temptations of power. Rather than lead, he demanded. He does not serve his people but rather expects us to serve him.$B$BSomething must be done.',0),(27418,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That cowardly fat mass Mok\'Morokk fled like a scared child. You have done a great service, $n.$B$BNow my people can appoint a new leader, one who will help us reclaim our old home once and for all.',0),(27420,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The sooner those Scourge are pushed out of the Fungal Vale, the sooner we can heal it.$B$BThank you, $n.',0),(27421,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even if the flowers died out shortly after they bloomed, they proved our point to the Scourge: they are losing, and we are winning.$B$BThank you for your assistance.',0),(27422,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What a relief it is to see an able-bodied soldier that\'s on our side! There\'s plenty for ye to do around here, $R.',0),(27424,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You good $R. Me miss things very much. Me like you now.',0),(27425,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Vimes thinks the Grimtotems are behind the destruction of the Shady Rest Inn? They wouldn\'t have been first on my list of suspects, but if Captain Vimes sent you here to follow up on a lead, he must have his reasons. Regardless, the Grimtotems have been a thorn in our side for some time and we\'re always glad to have the extra help.',0),(27426,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Captain Darill glances at the battle plan.>$B$BI\'d say it doesn\'t get any clearer than this. They\'ve taken it upon themselves to fight back against human settlements in the area and I have little doubt Theramore is next on their list.',0),(27427,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Captain Darill inspects the armaments you\'ve brought from Blackhoof Village.>$B$BThere\'s no doubt about it. These match the description exactly, but there\'s just one problem -- these have never been used in battle. Blackhoof Village must not be the only Grimtotem post in the marsh.',0),(27428,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you want me to scry for Grimtotems, eh? And what will you say when I tell you there\'s no need?',0),(27429,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope the Grimtotems got the message. Any attempt to return will be met with far worse than a mere torch. My apprentices and I will see to that.',0),(27430,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The captain listens to your report intently.>$B$BWe have avenged James and his family, but not even that can restore what was destroyed.',0),(27431,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Talk about bringing the house down... ',0),(27432,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, ты с ним $gрасправился:расправилась;! Надеюсь, и банде его тоже хороший урок $gпреподнес:преподнесла;!',23877),(27433,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh aye, tha\'s the stuff! A good engineer can make anything outta just about anything.$B$BThis here doo-jicker could recouple a busted cylinder casing... Oh! And who doesn\'t want a dongle? ...And you can fashion this jobby into a ... thing.$B$B<Flintlocke sticks one of the grease-smeared engine parts into his mouth.>$B$BYep, perfect.',0),(27434,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t know how you came by such a large supply of moonsteel, $n, but I haven\'t worked with it in years. It will be both a challenge and a pleasure to create this weapon for you. ',0),(27435,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Seer Liwatha mentioned that you were visiting Shadowfang Keep to find the materials for your new staff. I see now why she sent you there. Even the twisted magics gripping the keep could not extinguish the power of these items. ',0),(27436,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shadow-Walker Zuru mentioned that you were visiting Shadowfang Keep to find the materials for your new staff. Artifacts from the keep are reputed to possess much hidden power and your efforts are proof that the tales are true. Your staff will be a masterwork. ',0),(27437,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dark Cleric Cecille mentioned that you were visiting Shadowfang Keep to find the materials for your new staff. I see now why she sent you there. Even the twisted magics gripping the keep could not extinguish the power of these items. ',0),(27439,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tyelis mentioned that you were visiting Shadowfang Keep to find the materials for your new staff. Few would venture into the keep, even to retrieve such valuable things. Your new staff will be a fitting reward for your bravery. ',0),(27440,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Извини меня за излишнюю откровенность, но то, что ты $gостался:осталась; в живых, выполнив задание, – огромное чудо. Эти твари повинны в гибели бесчисленных тысяч жертв, среди которых множество прославленных героев.$B$BТы $gзаслужил:заслужила; мое уважение и награду за отвагу.',19342),(27441,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You must be the $c that Brother Silverhallow mentioned. Welcome, $n. Let me see those materials you gathered from halfway around the world. They seem well worth the travel and you will not be disappointed with your staff. ',0),(27442,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your aid is most timely, $n.',0),(27443,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your aid is most timely, $n.',0),(27446,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings and salutations, friend. Welcome to Tanaris!',0),(27447,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well hello there, $C. Welcome to Tanaris!',0),(27448,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve enjoyed having you ride with us, $n. Hopefully, once Gidwin and Tarenar join the Argent Crusade, we can continue to travel together.',0),(27449,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, you are indeed strong... and I submit to you.$B$BI will join you and your friend, the worgen. My strength is yours.',0),(27450,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm... they didn\'t survive the trip out of the water as well as I had hoped.$B$BOh well! Seafood salad for Frederick tonight!',0),(27451,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello!  It\'s me.  Hope you don\'t mind a little home-brewed magic to allow me to communicate with you in the field.  It\'ll save us both some time.\r\n\r\nWe\'re going to incorporate that living rot into a mixture that\'ll ruin their next batch of plague.  That\'ll show them! ',0),(27452,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve got both pieces! Good. These will help when trying to sneak into their death camp.',0),(27453,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Uh oh... it looks like we may have gathered a little too much coagulated rot. Oh well, we\'ll just have to improvise, then!$B$BWhat could possibly go wrong?',0),(27454,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It should take them weeks to get their operation running again. Thank you, $n.',0),(27455,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t believe it. We\'re literally FEET away from becoming sworn members of the Argent Crusade.$B$BWe\'d be in there already if it weren\'t for Tarenar\'s dallying. If he doesn\'t quit chatting with the locals soon, I\'m going to head in there myself.',0),(27456,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the Earthmother watch over you! Bless you, young one.',0),(27457,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You brought us a shaman! From the Earthen Ring, no less!$B$BI have no idea how we\'ll fit him in the caravan, but we\'ll find a way. Welcome aboard, Rimblat Earthshatter!',0),(27458,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well well well! Someone who goes and gets things done! Here\'s your cut, chief. I\'ll be seein\' you around.',0),(27459,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A $C! Just what we needed. Your arrival couldn\'t have been more timely.',0),(27460,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The flare is fully assembled, and the matches lie unused next to the fuse.$B$BThe fallen Argent centurion got much closer to setting off this flare than you had guessed.',0),(27461,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $n. Can I trust you to assist me in taking this abbey away from these abominations?',0),(27462,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll be handling things from here, $C.$B$BFine, you want an assignment? I suppose I can afford to send you in on a mission or two.',0),(27463,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Light\'s Hope Chapel.$B$BYou wish to join the Crusade? Very well. We have plenty of tasks for new recruits.$B$BBut first, a test.',0),(27464,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Remember that your ancestors always watch over you. As a brother of the Argent Crusade, you will join a family that has a long line of such fallen ancestors. Their vigil and protection will be your strength as you press forward against the Scourge.$B$BCongratulations Tarenar, Gidwin, and $n. Welcome to the Argent Crusade.',0),(27465,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve returned sooner than I expected. Excellent.$B$BWe will continue our path into the north. Next, you will be completing a similar task - this time, in Northdale.',0),(27466,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello, $n! Glad to see you\'ve rejoined the caravan!$B$BTarenar and Gidwin arrived here before you. Tarenar\'s just right there, and Gidwin\'s... well... he\'s in a little bit of a mood right now. I think he\'s in the tower.',0),(27467,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our duty for the day is done.$B$BIt is only a matter of time before we defeat the Scourge. Today, we made progress.',0),(27468,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yep, one more tank limpin\' back home for repairs.$B$BAll these trees an\' stumps an\' mud an\' rock - you couldnae drive a golfball into this turf, much less a tank.$B$BWe\'re gonna need a new approach.',0),(27469,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello, what is your business in a place like this?$B$BI\'m sorry, who sent you? I\'m afraid I\'ve never heard of such a dwarf.',0),(27470,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello, what is your business in a place like this?$B$BSo Overseer Oilfist sent you? Listen carefully, we have much to discuss in little time.',0),(27471,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello, what is your business in a place like this?$B$BSo you come at the will of Miss Brightwing, do you? Very interesting indeed.',0),(27473,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good that you\'ve come, $n. We need all the help we can get with the situation here.',0),(27474,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Clever mages. The codex is sealed by a magical ward.$B$BPity that they weren\'t clever enough to realize that former archmages of Dalaran are now Forsaken.',0),(27475,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. The praise the Banshee Queen lavishes upon you is apparently not unfounded.',0),(27476,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Dark Lady requires my expertise? Well of course! Give it here, boy.',0),(27477,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Keep this up and I may have to keep you here at Eastwall, $R.',0),(27478,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect. I hope this wasn\'t too much trouble to come by, $n. Relios was a pupil of mine back when I was a mortal man thereby making him a competent and formidable adversary. I suppose I could have warned you ahead of time.$B$BNow, let us see the ring.$B$B$B$BThere we are...',0),(27479,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, hallelujah, and praise, praise be to the Light, my brother!',0),(27480,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Smart boy! I can most definitely use these arcane remnants in my studies. Indeed, Dalaran was built upon a massive ley line. It\'s no wonder, then, that such things exist at the crater.',0),(27481,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My duty is not over yet. In many ways, this was the easy step.',0),(27483,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thought for sure that with the death of a dozen of my most hated enemies I would feel a great burden lifted from my shoulders. Sadly, I do not feel a thing. Perhaps I am a psychopath.',0),(27484,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Only one may enter? I know just the person for this mission.$B$B<Sylvanas nods at you.>$B$BI will prepare our forces and have them at the ready.',0),(27485,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad Lira didn\'t scare you off. I won\'t say her concerns aren\'t warranted, but we have a common enemy. She is perhaps a bit overzealous.',0),(27486,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad Lira didn\'t scare you off. I won\'t say her concerns aren\'t warranted, but we have a common enemy. She is perhaps a bit overzealous.',0),(27487,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I couldn\'t stop him. While you and Tarenar were out, Giddy ran north all alone!$B$BTarenar, you should have known better! Gidwin gets so impatient sometimes, and you only egg him on. If Giddy gets into any trouble, I\'m blaming you for this.',0),(27488,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You didn\'t see him? Where could he have gone then?$B$BHis... his prayer book? Why would he leave that behind?$B$BOh...$B$BBy the Light, what have I done?',0),(27489,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Time is wasting, $n. Every minute we waste gives the Scourge another chance to kill Gidwin. If he isn\'t dead already.$B$BNot that I think he is. Giddy may be a stick-in-the-mud, but when it comes down to it, he can swing the Light like a champion.',0),(27490,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must have been deadly.$B$BWhile I don\'t approve of their methods, no one can question the effectiveness of Master Mathias Shaw and his SI:7. Not to mention that you\'re here. Our victory is all but assured.',0),(27491,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must have been exciting.$B$BDespite any losses that the Kor\'kron may have incurred along the way, no one will be able to doubt their effectiveness, nor that of Garona. And with you in the mix, it\'s only a matter of time before victory is ours.',0),(27492,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s the spirit, lad! Today\'s already shaping up to be a good one.',0),(27493,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And here I thought that today couldn\'t get any better.$B$BI enjoy being wrong, occasionally.',0),(27496,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks to you, our cannoneers hit their marks. Tell me about the situation within the Twilight Gate.',0),(27497,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I must say that I rather enjoyed the sight of their buildings being hit.',0),(27500,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The paladin frowns.>$B$BThat\'s quite a gruesome trophy collection you have there. I would have believed you if you had simply said they were dead. Regardless, thank you for having the foresight to take care of them.$B$BThe Twilight Gate will soon be ours. Time to move up to the Twilight Citadel.',0),(27501,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The noble lady grins wickedly.>$B$BThat\'s quite a gruesome trophy collection you have there. I would have believed you if you had simply said they were dead, though I do appreciate the extra effort. Thank you for having the foresight to take care of them.$B$BThe Twilight Gate will soon be ours. Time to move up to the Twilight Citadel.',0),(27504,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Calen has become very trusting. It is not often that strangers are permitted within the redoubt.',0),(27505,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We will take Grim Batol back from the Twilight\'s Hammer and thier allies. It may take time, but this is one charge that we cannot forsake.',0),(27506,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In this, we deny Deathwing the destruction that he so passionately seeks. In this, life continues.',0),(27507,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have a talent for killing I see. In times like these, that has its place.',0),(27508,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t know if you did this for me or the young inside these eggs, but it doesn\'t really matter, either way it\'s clear that you want to be an ally of our flight. I appreciate that.$B$BI cannot forgive the attacks by your allies against my brood, but for now, it seems you have chosen the right side.',0),(27509,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. Thank you, $R.$B$BI will not be so foolish as to let such an oversight happen again.',0),(27510,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I only hope that we don\'t end up getting beat down by inconspicuous birds, cats and trees next... or seals. Could you imagine it?',0),(27511,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your exploration of the Chamber of the Stars has yielded more questions than answers... ',0),(27512,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Banshee Queen\'s voice invades your thoughts.>$B$BYes, this is it. Now run the ring along the runes of the portal and you should become attuned for transdimensional travel.',0),(27513,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Banshee Queen\'s voice invades your thoughts.>$B$BExcellent work, $n. Now to eject them into our waiting hands!',0),(27514,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aw dang crap it all. You\'re just an Alliance $C. I was hoping for a rescue.',0),(27515,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, that\'s the stuff all right! Hope ya didn\'t eat any. Gives you the cramps something awful but it does wonders for birds.',0),(27516,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n! Aiding that downed gryphon-rider has given us our first contact with the old Wildhammer clans. We\'ll be able to find out who\'s still left, and in what numbers.$B$BOur campaign is looking up!',0),(27517,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, rope! Thanks, kid. Something tells me I\'m going to need this. ',0),(27518,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Had I not witnessed what you did with my own eyes I would not have believed it, $n. Now, with the Ambermill magi on our side, there is but one thing left to do before we retake Gilneas and send those Alliance dogs running for Stormwind.',0),(27519,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thank you, $n.  Orsis was punished for not joining the forces of Deathwing. Prince Nadun has offered my people refuge in his city.  I must go there and tend the survivors. ',0),(27520,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You continue to prove to be a valuable ally, $n. ',0),(27521,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do not feel sorry for me. Those were my friends that you saw at Quel\'lithien Lodge, but they were already as good as dead.',0),(27522,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It sounds like you were successful. Hopefully this is enough information to find Gidwin.',0),(27523,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work. I can now continue my work without the distractions of that great white beast.$B$BI shall fashion this fur into something you can use.',0),(27524,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I haven\'t found anything but brainless undead, and plenty of them. I was just about to kill my way into Stratholme when you arrived.$B$BDid you have any more success?',0),(27525,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve got to keep moving! We\'re getting so very close!',0),(27526,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have no idea how happy I am to see you two! You\'re a sight for sore eyes... sore eyes that have been starin\' through a banshee for far too long now.$B$BI\'m sorry for causing so much trouble. Will you take me back to the caravan?',0),(27527,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve been more help than anyone expected of you, $n. The doors of my caravan are always open to you.$B$BThe boys and I have even put together a little something special for you. Here, take your pick!',0),(27528,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A blessed fire cleanses even the most corrupt of flesh.$B$BThey stood no chance in the face of the Light.',0),(27529,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good to hear you found the tortured souls of my brethren and freed them. I find my strength renewed, knowing at least some of the defenders of Darrowshire no longer wallow in the vile subservience of the Scourge.',0),(27530,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are a true Champion of the Light, $n. I wish you luck in your future endeavors, wherever they might take you.$B$BIf you need anything in the future, you can always find me here - knee-deep in the corpses of the slain.',0),(27531,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I love the smell of fresh foot scrapings, don\'t you?$B$BIf we\'re going to find a cure to the plague, we need to get creative with our ingredients. Now, if you don\'t mind, I\'m going to get back to work.',0),(27532,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whew. Every time Argus comes plodding through that Plaguewood, I fear it to be his last. It\'s good to see that he\'s wise enough to send a youngblood like you in his stead.',0),(27533,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see them! Can you? The little pig spirits, on their way to the great sty in the sky...',0),(27534,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There it is! And oh my! I forgot how full it was!$B$BThis is a glorious day, $n! Stupendous! Insanely good, I say!',0),(27535,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve come to the right place, mister! No place better than Terrordale, yes siree, that\'s right! The jewel of Lordaeron!',0),(27536,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну, что я говорил? Совершенно безопасно!$B$BЯ прослежу, чтобы некоторые из них достались твоим друзьям. Со скидкой, разумеется.',19342),(27537,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My word, $n. These elemental energies are so powerful, so chaotic - no wonder the Twilight\'s Hammer has chosen to build their stronghold here!$B$BI should be able to channel these energies into something more benign and productive though. Let\'s give it a try...',0),(27538,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh... mud. You brought me mud?$B$BWow - this stuff oozes with power! I see what Thordun was saying, now. I\'ll distribute this to all of the healers. Our wounded will be on their feet in no time!',0),(27539,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May my pile never stop growing.',0),(27540,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $C. I am Gavan Grayfeather, emissary of the Wildhammer shaman.$B$BThere is much work to be done. The leaders fear for their citizens, as many have turned to cults. We shaman are concerned with the elemental unrest.$B$BOur advice to you, $C, is to be vigilant. Help where you can, be it calming the people or putting the elementals at rest. There is plenty to do.',0),(27541,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Odd... It looks as if someone used gemstones as lenses. I should be able to fix them without too much trouble. ',0),(27542,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The hour of victory approaches, $n. Godfrey has devised a plan to decimate our enemies. I am sending you into the field with him and his men to bring the rebel insurgents to their knees and seal the fate of the Alliance filth encroaching upon our lands.$B$BOur final march begins when you are ready.',0),(27544,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I suppose I had better work on my stealth, if you were able to find me.$B$BAre you interested in helping me heal the Plaguelands?',0),(27545,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ho! I knew you were a $C I could count on, $n. Use that portal anytime you need to get from Stormwind back to the Highlands.$B$BNow then, time to get to business. We need to locate and unite the lost Wildhammer clans scattered around the Highlands. Talking with Thordun here is a good start!',0),(27546,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'King\'s honor, $C. I am Captain Anton. I am leading the investigation into the cultists that have appeared in Stormwind.',0),(27547,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What happened here today is between us. Say a word to anyone and you will find yourself in a corpse pit next to these poor fools.',0),(27548,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I suspect we\'ll see fewer humans at the Battlefront. The risk for these cowards is too great.',0),(27549,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, kid, it looks like you\'ve done it again. This starlight is exactly what we were missing. Now we can get to work! ',0),(27550,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The part of me that was Gilnean died at Tempest\'s Reach. Only vengeance remains, $n. To that end, we have work to do. Spare me your pointless queries.',0),(27551,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is it! If this missive is to be believed, then he\'s literally right over this hill!$B$BWhat are we waiting for, $n?',0),(27555,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Фиона оставила в караване несколько амулетов.$B$BОна занимается торговлей и, похоже, хорошо разбирается в денежных вопросах. Быть может, один из ее амулетов улучшит состояние ваших финансов.',23877),(27556,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin left some bottles of gun lubricant in the caravan. He seems to be a good warrior.  Perhaps his gun lubricant will help you in battle.',23877),(27558,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You see a small doll sitting in the back corner of the caravan.$B$BTarenar tells you that it must belong to Gidwin, and Gidwin says that it\'s probably Tarenar\'s.',0),(27559,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vex\'tul has left some of his wrappings within the caravan. Surprisingly, he was courteous enough to keep them folded and separate from everyone else\'s belongings.$B$BVex\'tul values strength over everything else. Leaning in close, you can sense some of his residual strength emanating from within these armbands.',0),(27560,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You see a trail-worn journal inside the caravan. Judging by the Argent Crusade emblem on its spine, it must belong to Argus.$B$BWritten within the journal are several accounts of Argus\' experiences during his tenure in the Crusade. It should prove to be an interesting read while on the road.',0),(27561,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You notice a small heap of stones within the caravan.$B$BThey do not appear out-of-the-ordinary, yet one of them attracts your attention. You sense a warmth coming from within it.',0),(27562,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It looks like Beezil has already made himself comfortable, and has stuffed several peculiar gizmos into the caravan.$B$BMost of them seem too impractical or dangerous to take with you. One small cogwheel, however, looks to be fairly well-crafted.',0),(27564,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope you\'re as tough as your gear suggests. The Twilight\'s Hammer have made their way within the redoubt somehow and I need someone to hunt them down.',0),(27565,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не знаю, как мне удалось выжить. Патрули меня обходят так, словно меня тут и нет.$B$BЯ что… умер, |3-6($c)?',19342),(27566,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good to see you, $n. Here at the Throne of Elements we may be able to uncover what ails Azeroth.',0),(27567,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see...she did not cooperate. Hopefully we can still stop them before something else terrible happens.',0),(27570,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $C. The situation here is tense. The elements are restless and the people are scared and confused. The Warchief is trying to find a semblance of balance between leading the people and protecting Azeroth. Though it seems he will soon be leaving us to travel to Nagrand and gain insight about the elementals.$B$BRegardless of the Warchief\'s choice, we still must do what we can. Help calm the populace, scour the lands for rogue elementals. These tasks will surely help our cause.',0),(27572,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good to see you, $C. Here at the Throne of Elements we may be able to uncover what ails Azeroth.',0),(27574,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know that face, $n. This head belongs to a former Gilnean known as Sean Dempsey. He was imprisoned with Crowley before the great outbreak.$B$B$B$BI wonder if it would be possible to put him back together. The rest of him must be in the belly of these crocolisks.',0),(27575,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now let\'s see if I can do this.$B$B<Godfrey starts mumbling under his breath.>$B$B...leg bone connects to the thigh bone...$B$B...arm bone to torso...$B$B...sprinkle on a little Forsaken necromancy...$B$BTA-DA!',0),(27576,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You got the dragons in the game! Good on you.$B$BWe\'d already laid out plans for our ambush by the time the dragons contacted us. They\'re helping by cutting off their retreat.$B$BIt\'s not too late for you to join in on the fun though. We saved some for you.',0),(27577,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Walden flips through the battle plan.>$B$BIt looks like the reinforcements from the ships in Gilneas are marching soon. Crowley and Bloodfang have set up an encampment to the southeast for the Gilneas Liberation front.',0),(27578,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it! You\'ve actually done it! Morgan\'s years of planning and waiting have finally come to fruition.$B$BShe may have lost her land and family when Ragnaros tore this land asunder, but with the Dark Iron crippled we\'ll be able to safely build a new kingdom of our own in the Burning Steppes. Not even the Firelord himself will be able to breech the capital\'s walls!$B$BMake sure you come back someday when we\'ve finished, you\'ll be our guest of the highest honor. I thank you with all my heart, $n.',0),(27579,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Get over here. If you blow my cover, I swear to the Warchief I\'ll kill you where you stand.',0),(27580,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The rest of the Alliance fleet will arrive shortly, only to find their base camp decimated. Now for the second and most important part of our battle plan.',0),(27581,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Twilight\'s Hammer\'s presence only complicates our mission here further, but you\'ve done your part for now. You\'ve earned a reward for your efforts...and some rest. Let\'s get out of here.',0),(27582,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beyond this door lies the commander of the Dark Iron Army, surrounded by trained soldiers. Are you up for a little killing?',0),(27583,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Warlord Zaela sent you? Good.$B$BIf you Horde are as strong as your Warchief promised, I expect to see some bloodshed on these shores.',0),(27584,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Gralok sizes you up.>$B$BYou\'re a true fighter, $n. I liked watching you work. Perhaps the Dragonmaw really DO belong in your Horde.',0),(27585,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Up ahead is the Grim Guzzler. A disgusting bar full of all our enemies, intoxicated and therefore unfit for proper battle.$B$B<Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania grins.>$B$BRipe for the slaughter.',0),(27586,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh yeah. YEAH! These are DEFINITELY going to kill somebody.$B$BProbably naga.',0),(27587,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я прямо вижу: наш собственный веслотопский лобстер-корн! Свежепойманный! Реклама прямо сама сочиняется, да? $B$BТвоя помощь неоценима, дружок. Я уже начинаю подумывать, не сделать ли твоему народу хорошие скидки...',19342),(27589,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hear quite the commotion coming from the Grim Guzzler. I see you\'ve been hard at work.$B$BIf you\'ll direct your attention opposite me, you\'ll notice that we have bigger issues to worry about than toying with drunkards.',0),(27591,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I cannot proceed any further alone, regardless of my combat experience. The Lyceum has proven too difficult for me. If you are here, though...you might be the key to all of this.',0),(27592,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ура, наш прохладный освежающий \"Лед Сереблекса\"! Даже не знаю, как тебя благодарить, $gдружище:подруга;, за это спонтанное героическое деяние!$B$BВот тебе бутылочка в качестве искренней признательности! И не забудь сказать ВСЕМ СВОИМ ДРУЗЬЯМ, какой это отличный напиток.',19342),(27593,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A true $C if I\'ve ever seen one! You\'ve done the impossible! I knew we could count on you.$B$B$B$BAnd with that, I\'d like for you to be the first to know that the Kargath Expeditionary Force is now officially back in business!$B$BI extend to you my personal gratitude for your efforts here. Remember always our motto: \"First in, last out, always victorious. Remember always Kargath.\"$B$BYou are dismissed.',0),(27594,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done it! Finally, everything is in place. Should Crowley not accept our terms, his daughter will be turned.',0),(27595,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who... who are you?  Sent here... to rescue my people and fight our enemies. ',0),(27596,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have the heart! Amazing! It is even more beautiful than I imagined!$B$BPlease, $n, take this as payment!',0),(27597,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебя послал Сереблекс?! Мне КОНЕЦ!$B$BАх, он велел тебе мне помочь! Ха-ха, другое дело!',19342),(27598,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это проучит рыболицых уродцев! Отлично!',19342),(27599,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'УХ ТЫ!$B$BНе знаю, к чему это я. Я легковозбудимый! Но батюшки-светы, сколько у этих ребят было добра!$B$BСмотри, хочешь вот это?',19342),(27600,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мой первоклассный взрыватель! Мой импортный порох!$B$BИ моя... приветик! Это я просто заберу!$B$BЭто все стоит больше золота, чем на тебе надето, знаешь ли! Спасибо за помощь!',19342),(27601,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Lady Sylvanas Windrunner grimaces in pain.>$B$BThis... is not over. Godfrey and his traitorous allies will pay for what they have done as will the remaining Alliance forces occupying Lordaeron.$B$BOur work has only just begun.',0),(27602,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Though the chest is locked, there is a plaque bearing interesting hieroglyphs above it. ',0),(27603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Проклятье! Я просто обязана знать, что за ними скрывается! Это открытие может круто изменить мою карьеру!$B$BХм… может, стоит их подорвать…',19342),(27606,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Boom baby, boom!$B$BWhat? You killed the Fathom-Lord already?$B$BI suppose we should stop shelling his corpse, then.',0),(27607,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good timing, $C. We were just about to unleash a counter-attack.',0),(27608,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The paladin frowns.>$B$BThat\'s quite a gruesome trophy collection you have there. I would have believed you if you had simply said they were dead. Regardless, thank you for having the foresight to take care of them.$B$BThe Twilight Gate will soon be ours. Time to move up to the Twilight Citadel.',0),(27609,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The noble lady grins wickedly.>$B$BThat\'s quite a gruesome trophy collection you have there. I would have believed you if you had simply said they were dead, though I do appreciate the extra effort. Thank you for having the foresight to take care of them.$B$BThe Twilight Gate will soon be ours. Time to move up to the Twilight Citadel.',0),(27610,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. Now you know the lay of the land.$B$BIf you\'re ever having difficulty fighting here on the Twilight Shores, remember that capturing and holding the Beach Head will give all Horde forces here a combat advantage!',0),(27611,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, good. Let them reap what they sow!',0),(27612,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The abbey will fall shortly. We can soon move on, deeper into Tyr\'s Hand.',0),(27613,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The death of Rohan eases my spirits a bit.$B$BI once fought beside him, you know. He was an emissary of the Scarlet Crusade; one of the few that deigned to join us in our battle against Kel\'thuzad, so many years ago. How quickly things change.',0),(27614,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. I will deliver these to Tyrosus when we return.',0),(27615,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are well on your way to becoming a true champion of the Light, $n. Well done.',0),(27616,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One less thing to worry about. Nice work up there.',0),(27617,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, the abbey is ours. I never doubted Eligor\'s ability for a moment.',0),(27618,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It sounds like Korfax really cleaned house over at the barracks. It\'s very much like him to show off like that.',0),(27619,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, good. These barracks are as good as fallen.',0),(27620,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'While I can\'t agree with their methods, I can\'t argue with their results. In many ways, the Scarlet were well-intentioned, but their zeal grew too strong, and their hate blinded them to reason.$B$BI only hope that the same doesn\'t happen to our Brotherhood of Light.',0),(27621,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Come to join the patrol, lad? Glad to have ya.$B$BI need some bodies helpin\' to get our defenses under control here. Help me out and I\'ll see if I can\'t find some more prestigious work for ya.',0),(27623,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You place the two gems inside the sockets in the wall. ',0),(27624,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fine work, $n. It looks as though our work here is nearly complete. ',0),(27628,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is just the beginning, $n.  If Deathwing\'s minions can bury entire cities, we have little chance of defeating them through conventional means. ',0),(27629,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What manner of creature are you?  You will leave the king\'s lands before... Wait!  You are that $n I\'ve heard so much about. You must pardon my lack of hospitality.  We have seen all manner of hostile intruders since the barrier around Uldum failed. ',0),(27630,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'War, you say. Divinations for war are always difficult.  Some wars must never be fought, even if victory was assured.  Some wars have to be waged even if defeat is certain. ',0),(27631,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No need to fill me in on the events in Orsis, $n. I\'ve heard about them already.  And about you.  Any enemy of Al\'Akir is a friend of mine. ',0),(27632,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve obtained a map of the Vir\'Naal river delta. ',0),(27635,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There, now you\'re fit to head off to the surface and start your new life. The High Tinker will be delighted to hear of your arrival. ',0),(27636,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where are the rest of my people?',0),(27638,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where are the Kor\'kron?',0),(27640,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If it\'s Dunwalds you be lookin\' for, it\'s Dunwalds you\'ve found. A couple of\'m anyway. I can\'t find me other brothers for the life of me.',0),(27641,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that\'s what I\'m talkin\' about lad. My kinda $R.',0),(27642,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That many dead, eh? Not seemin\' likely that anyone outside of me brothers fought through it then. I guess I already expected as much.$B$BThanks for takin\' the time to look for me.',0),(27643,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hi friend! I don\'t think I know you... I\'m Donnelly Dunwald.$B$BWhat\'s your name? I don\'t think I know you... Do I know you?',0),(27644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Of all the buildings in all the towns to collapse, why\'d it have to be this one?!',0),(27645,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well look at ya, all geared and fancy. Keely send you to keep an eye on old Cayden, eh? Won\'t be needin\' it. I got these louts handled.$B$BHahah! They chose the wrong dwarf to be ambushin\' today! Ahahahahah!',0),(27646,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found\'m! You found Beak! I like you, new friend!$B$BI\'m gonna go show Keely. Keely like Beak too.',0),(27647,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Donnelly\'s belly! That\'s more like it. Good to not be dyin\' of the thirst again.$B$BHere, have some. Good ol\' Eoin\'s never so impolite as ta not share!',0),(27648,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A thing of beauty, isn\'t it? An\' they keep comin\' back for more. Love it!$B$BI\'ll go find Keely and settle her nerves in a bit. Just one more go through the row.',0),(27649,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Woooooh! That\'s exactly what my belly needs!$B$BYou get me all the nice things.',0),(27650,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for bandin\' my brothers back together. I know they\'re tough, but they\'re even tougher when they\'re side by side, and there\'s a lot of Twilight out there.$B$BYou\'re good to put a gal\'s heart at ease.',0),(27651,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks for your help. You\'ve got a warrior\'s spirit in ya - you coulda fooled me for a Wildhammer if it weren\'t for your... well.. you know.$B$BI know Firebeard sent you to unite us. My love for that dwarf runs shallow, but you know now we\'ve got plenty of reasons to make enemies of Twilight. If you see him, tell him that when the battle starts, the Dunwald family will be there.',0),(27652,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m not sure what I\'m going to do with all of these. I\'ll probably fence them and donate the proceeds to the Stormwind orphanage.$B$BNow to find someone sick enough to buy such a thing. It\'ll probably be a goblin. Or, a gnome warlock.',0),(27653,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What do you think I should do with all of these? Maybe I\'ll melt them down and have the metal imbued into a new dagger that I can thrust into Cho\'gall\'s chest.$B$BThink there\'s time for that?',0),(27654,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'None of us are too good to get our hands a little dirty. Or bloody, in this case.',0),(27655,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Feels good to get a little blood on your hands, doesn\'t it? Especially when that blood belongs to such self-deluded fools.',0),(27656,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is done? Excellent! Mountain from the shoulders. Now I can concentrate on normal business for the benefit of the people of the Swamp Waves and Kamenor, tired of the war ... and other nonsense.',19342),(27657,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! I\'m glad you\'re here.$B$BOf course, I\'m more than happy to lend you whatever assistance that I can.',0),(27658,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! I\'m glad you\'re here.$B$BOf course, I\'m more than willing to help you in any way that I can.',0),(27659,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The last portal is deep within the mine here, but we\'ll deal with that in a bit.',0),(27660,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know why you are here, $n. Your reasons sing within your fluids.$B$BI know about the dead dwarf forgesmith polluting my lake. If you want to find out what his corpse remembers, you must earn it.',0),(27661,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am pleased. Lord Cannon was always an unworthy adversary.$B$BVery well, $R, I will help you gain the information which you seek.',0),(27662,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'d I tell you? Elementals aren\'t so bad after all, eh?',0),(27663,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О, отлично, отлично! То, что нужно.',19342),(27664,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you have put together a deck of Embers.  Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten.  Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation.',0),(27665,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you have put together a deck of Hurricanes.  Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten.  Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation.',0),(27666,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you have put together a Tsunami deck.  Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten.  Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation.',0),(27667,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you have put together a deck of Earthquakes.  Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten.  Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation.',0),(27668,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sure enough...$B$BThis looks to be something that Nazgrim will take quite an interest in.',0),(27669,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, now. Would ya look at that! As amazing as this is, I am confident that there\'s more to our discovery than meets the eye... Much more. ',0),(27670,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. My men can take it from here. Let\'s focus on getting the other survivors out now. ',0),(27671,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know Nevin will be pleased with all the survivors you managed to help. I still can\'t believe you managed to stay so strong down here in the radiation. You\'ve seen the shape the other survivors are in. Let\'s get you to the loading room for decontamination. ',0),(27672,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'За чертог можешь не волноваться, мои ребята там все проверят! А у тебя есть дела поважнее!',23877),(27673,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это невероятно, $n. Потоки энергии не ослабели за столько лет... Как будто их только что зарядили... Две контрастные силы так близко друг к другу!$B$BОтдам их нашим спецам – они найдут им применение. Это действительно ценная находка!',23877),(27674,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to see you again, $n. Without your help, we wouldn\'t have been able to get so many survivors out of Gnomeregan this time. Everyone is going to be thrilled to meet you and hear your story. ',0),(27675,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You hand over the forged documents, exchanging only a few words; your masterful skill speaks for itself.>',0),(27676,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Замечательно! Ты молодец! Сейчас мы узнаем, какие тайны хранит третий раскоп!',23877),(27677,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты молодец! А теперь прочитай эти диски и собери максимум данных!',23877),(27683,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes?',23877),(27684,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes?',0),(27686,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You hand over the forged documents, exchanging only a few words; your masterful skill speaks for itself.>',0),(27687,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s not much, but it\'s all I\'ve got down here.$B$BYou\'re more than welcome to it, $C.',0),(27688,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That takes care of most of their leaders outside of the Bastion of Twilight.$B$BWe work well together, $n.',0),(27689,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That takes care of most of their leaders outside of the Bastion. Not bad work, $n. Not bad at all.',0),(27690,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Narkrall sizes you up.>$B$BAnother mewling Horde whelp? Zaela saps our strength by diluting our forces with the weak. Very well, $C. Prove yourself to me, and show me what your Horde is made of.',0),(27691,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Остается только догадываться, что там творится. Это же побережье Зловещего моря, за ним ничего нет... Но эти рыбоподобные твари просто взяли и вышли из него.$B$BБолее того, я видела, куда они направляются...',19342),(27694,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In these artifacts, the essence of the genus of green dragons are particles of the souls of my enslaved brothers. By purifying them, I will establish a bond between us. Come, $n, and take the Stone of the Isera Dragon Swear.',19342),(27695,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That thing looks sharp. Sharp enough to the do deed, at least.$B$BBut if I\'m a judge of weaponry, that\'s not what Cho\'gall\'s after.',0),(27696,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a very sharp axe. It\'ll do the job, but if I\'m any judge of weaponry, that\'s not what Cho\'gall\'s after.',0),(27698,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In the absence of her faithful servants, Princess Teradras became much more vulnerable. Find her lair, $n... It\'s time to strike a decisive blow. $B$B< You feel your bags have become heavier because of the gold that\'s added to them. Apparently, this is another reward for your exploits.>',19342),(27700,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Isn\'t she a beauty?$B$BLet\'s see what she does now that she\'s free.',0),(27701,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Isn\'t she beautiful? So graceful.$B$BI hope she gets her fill of revenge and then some.',0),(27702,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our efforts to improve relations with the red dragons has really paid off, $n.',0),(27703,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good thing that you and Warlord Krogg made friends with the red dragons.',0),(27704,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты на месте!$B$BТут повсюду кости моих братьев...',19342),(27705,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Поделом ей. Еще одному источнику порчи этого мира положен конец.$B$BБлагодарю тебя за храбрость, $n.',19342),(27706,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So... this is what Al\'Akir wanted all along. ',0),(27708,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good that this operation has been undone.$B$BSoon, I must move on...',0),(27711,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, glad you\'re back! Have I got something fun for us to do!',0),(27712,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, glad you\'re back! Have I got something fun for us to do!',0),(27713,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Some story, huh?  Now you know why Deathwing hasn\'t come back here since.',19116),(27714,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The end!  No moral.',19116),(27715,274,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t believe those guys would interrupt me like that.  My story was going so well, too...$b$bAnyhow, thanks for sticking around so long.  It\'s nice to have someone new to share tall tales with.  I\'m sure Lucien and Theldurin feel the same way.$b$bYou have any you\'d like to share with us?',19116),(27716,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brilliant! It will take me a while to translate, but this is precisely the kind of find I was hoping for.$B$BThere\'s no knowing if we will make it out of this place, but if it comes down to it, I will find a way to float this to the surface in hopes that it will one day be found.$B$BThank you again, $n. Here... perhaps I have something that may be of use to you.',0),(27717,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brilliant! I can\'t have expected much more with the tools I gave you.$B$BI should be able to fill in the blanks and get this all written out shortly. There\'s no knowing if we will make it out of this place, but if it comes down to it, I will find a way to float this to the surface in hopes that it will one day be found.$B$BThank you again, $n. You\'re not bad.',0),(27718,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lok\'tar, brother! You have arrived just in time.',0),(27719,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Hammer of Twilight? And you say you got this information out of a drowned Wildhammer dwarf?$B$BYou\'re kidding, right?',0),(27720,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh no! My weapons and totems!$B$BThey\'re destroyed!!!',0),(27721,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We knew the Horde would send help and not a moment too soon!',0),(27722,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our world is in danger, $n! We need the help of great heroes, like you, to save it!',0),(27724,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'All of our war ships are off fighting the Horde. You\'ll have to take the mercenary ship.',0),(27738,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thank you for what you\'ve done, $n.  You can count on my vote when High Council convenes. ',0),(27740,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, it\'s so good that help has arrived!$B$BModern technology... I\'m not rejoicing.',19342),(27741,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So there were more cultists waiting to be admitted to the city? It\'s a good thing that you caught them, $n. Reading over the note that you found, it seems they\'re planning something big.',0),(27742,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Goldmine slyly looks at the pile of Elementium shards.>$B$BHmm, I don\'t think that stuff\'s going to sell for much. I better give you your cut right now so you don\'t feel ripped off.',0),(27743,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They had it coming to them.',0),(27744,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'ll teach \'em to move in on our territory!$B$BWhat\'s that over across the way?',0),(27745,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We survived and all of the portals are now shutdown!$B$BYou don\'t think Magmatooth is going to hold a grudge, do you?',0),(27746,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News of your conquest in Silverpine emboldens us, $n. We are prepared to fight at your command and beat back the last remaining vestiges of humanity in Hillsbrad.',0),(27747,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, yes. Burn them out, as you would flush groundhogs from their holes...$B$BWell done, $n.',0),(27748,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good to see you\'re still in one piece, $n. ',0),(27749,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. The note you captured makes sense in light of this ritual the infiltrators mentioned. This city is infested with cultists and their sympathizers. We must act before their plans can come to fruition.',0),(27750,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Griff greedily snatches the heap of food, enough to feed dozens of men.>$B$BGreat! Did you get any for yourself?',0),(27751,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Narkrall clenches the insignias in his weathered hand.>$B$BSo, $C. There\'s more to you than meets the eye.$B$BMaybe your Horde can stand with the best of my warriors. Let\'s try you out...',0),(27752,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh aye ... we get a few of these kegs out to the boys on the front and we\'re gonna see some fireworks. Thank you, $n!',0),(27753,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good - hardly a worm or weevil to be found!$B$BThis is a lifesaver to the folk who fled here for survival.',0),(27754,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at that! That\'s quite a collection of trophies you have there.$B$BI\'ll spread the word. If a single Alliance $C can do this, imagine what the rest of your lot can accomplish!',0),(27755,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They couldn\'t be saved, $n.  The ancient curse that fell upon them is irrevocable. ',0),(27757,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, my God! Looks like you\'re $Gstumbled upon .:stumbled upon; a frightfully ominous creature. I wonder why it even got in here...',19342),(27760,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Scanning subject... Cerebral cortex diagnostics indicate the absence of \"tomb curse\" phenomenon. Diagnostics did reveal frequent head trauma.  The user would do well to exercise more caution around blunt objects in the future. ',0),(27761,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n.  The expedition has already doomed itself. There is no need for it to endanger the rest of the world as well. ',0),(27762,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice landing!',19116),(27763,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Fuselight!',19116),(27767,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You need to familiarize yourself with the portal ritual quickly. We need to send as many teams into Stormwind as we can. They\'re discovering and arresting more of our brothers each day.',0),(27768,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Он заслужил такую судьбу. Миролюбие рода красных драконов не свойственно мне и моим собратьям, $n; то, что сделали эти тролли, не останется безнаказанным.',19342),(27773,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He managed to get away! I should have known it wouldn\'t be that easy. $B$BThe path is clear, $n. Time to go back.',19342),(27777,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent job, user $n.  We must obtain access to the fusion core now. ',0),(27778,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am in control, user $n.  But I cannot keep the core temperature stable indefinitely. ',0),(27779,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is done, user $n.  I thank you for your assistance with this unfortunate task. ',0),(27780,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done an excellent job tracking down and combating the cultists, but I fear they are right about one thing. We will never know if we\'ve gotten them all.',0),(27782,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, you\'re back. We know where Cho\'gall\'s ultimate weapon is located!',0),(27783,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, you\'re back. It\'s about time. We know where Cho\'gall\'s ultimate weapon is located!',0),(27784,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Hammer of Twilight floats in the middle of the altar, unprotected....',0),(27786,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Hammer of Twilight floats in the middle of the altar, unprotected....',0),(27787,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it, lad! You beat that damned gronn and sent Cho\'gall packing into the Twilight Bastion.$B$BDon\'t you worry. With your help and that of your friends, we\'ll get in there and we\'ll kill Cho\'gall once and for all!',0),(27788,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it, $n! You beat that damned gronn and sent Cho\'gall packing into the Twilight Bastion.$B$BDon\'t you worry. With your help and that of your friends, we\'ll get in there and we\'ll kill Cho\'gall once and for all!',0),(27794,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just one tiny little device?$b$bI never did understand those titans.$b$bVery well!  Let\'s see what this peeper can do.',19116),(27795,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сражаться на равных с ограми... впечатляет, $n. Я рада, что на нашей стороне бойцы вроде тебя.',19342),(27798,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Hammer of Twilight? And you say you got this information out of a drowned Wildhammer dwarf?$B$BYou\'re kidding, right?',0),(27799,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve brought many of these traitors to justice, $n, and yet their numbers keep growing. I fear we won\'t be able to stomp out all these rituals in time...',0),(27800,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You need to familiarize yourself with the portal ritual quickly. We\'ve sent dozens of brothers into the city, but only so many can evade capture. We\'re relying on you, $n.',0),(27801,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So there were more cultists waiting to be admitted to the city? It\'s a good thing that you caught them, $n. Reading over the note that you found, it seems they\'re planning something big.',0),(27802,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So they\'re preparing some kind of ritual all over the city? Orgrimmar city is infested with cultists and their sympathizers and the warchief is at wit\'s end. We must do something!',0),(27803,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, boy. Good to have another capable set of hands about.',0),(27804,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks for your help. Every little bit makes a difference.$B$BWe\'ll keep the water going until we can push the Twilight back.',0),(27805,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are very generous. Thank you.\r\n\r\nThere\'s a lot of darkness in our world these days. We appreciate the light that you\'ve brought here. ',0),(27806,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $R. Sent by Keegan?',0),(27807,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Iain sent ya?$B$BYou don\'t look like a Firebeard to me. Why exactly should I be listenin\' to anything you say?',0),(27808,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It seems the Doyles suffered the worst of the attacking Twilight drakes.$B$BIt\'s clear that they fought to the end: not a single rider\'s footprint more than a few yards from his gryphon. It\'s doubtful there were any survivors.',0),(27809,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bout that time, eh? Help us wrap things up then.',0),(27810,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s the stuff! Not half bad. You\'ve got a bit of fight in ya after all.',0),(27811,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good on you. I always feel like a part of me is missing when my gryphon isn\'t nearby. I can\'t speak for Duglas or the rest of the clan, but I\'ll be ready to ride at Firebeard\'s call.',0),(27812,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ya got the Mullans. Good news! They\'re worth more than their weight in a fight, and they ain\'t exactly skinny.',0),(27813,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s more like it. Let\'s finish gatherin\' up supplies and get back to Keegan.',0),(27814,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yer a good lad. Have me thanks and a little gold for yer troubles.',0),(27815,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hah! Looks like their raid went mighty well then. I\'ll have to buy ol\' Forgehammer a round once we finish with this mess.',0),(27816,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It seems you had some luck bringin\' riders back. Well timed too - we just pushed the elementals back, so we should have the arm room to lead an attack right away.$B$BThank you, $n. You\'re a good $R.',0),(27817,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that\'s how it\'s done, lad!$B$BWith a real gryphon wing back together, we can take the fight to the rest of the Twilight. You\'re welcome to fly with us anytime.',0),(27818,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну-ка, поглядим...$B$BОх, батюшки... Да, это точно они. От них, конечно, будет прок, однако боязно, когда поблизости водятся такие твари.',19342),(27821,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'На тебе больше черных пятен, чем красных... Это зрелище мне по душе. Похоже, ты $gухватил:ухватила;, что к чему, $n.',19342),(27822,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пока ты $gбыл:была; на задании, на нашу лесопилку тоже покушались. По крайней мере, твоя работа уравняла нас в условиях по лесозаготовкам с противником.$B$BПрекрасно, $n.',19342),(27823,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Sigrun instantly downs a dusty mug of shadowstout.>$b$bWow, this stuff is strong!  I knew they had beer, but I never expected them to have shadowstout!  That\'s my favorite shadowbeer!',19116),(27824,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now here\'s some treasure!  I was beginning to worry that these weren\'t titan ruins at all!$b$bI\'ll show these to Durdin.  Thanks again, $n.',19116),(27825,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I imagine those ogres weren\'t too much trouble for you. Here - some coin for your troubles.',0),(27826,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll take that egg out of your hands now.  We need to get this egg incubated... and hidden, quickly.  There are lots of angry dragons looking for this.$b$bIt\'s good to see you again, by the way.',19116),(27827,1,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re the $r we\'ve been waiting for?  It\'s about time you got here.  My legs could use a stretch.$b$bCome on boys!  Let\'s go kill us some black dragons!',19116),(27828,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m not what you\'d call \"very strong\" or \"battle-hardened\", but I get the job done my own way.$B$BLookin\' forward to fightin\' with you. I never fought with a fancy-lookin\' $C before.',0),(27829,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One less dragon to worry about, one step closer to redemption. Onward, my soldiers!',0),(27830,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Two more dangerous black dragons have been removed from this egg hunt. Your greatest task, however, still awaits.',0),(27831,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just think... Nyxondra may end up being the mother of the new black dragonflight. In death, she has given a gift to the future generations of Azeroth.',0),(27832,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The egg must always be moving. We are not safe anywhere.$B$BDeathwing, even in his madness, knows all the hidden places in this world. The egg must not rest.',0),(27833,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $R. However, I\'m afraid I don\'t have much to give you, other than this passionate round of applause.$B$B$B$BOh, I do have these. Here, take your pick.',0),(27834,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think you\'re ready, $n. You\'re getting the hang of this.',0),(27835,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'See? No need to worry when Olaf is around. Just let me know, and I\'ll protect you from the monsters.',0),(27836,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thank you, $n.  This will make our prophetic visions that much clearer. ',0),(27837,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, $n.  I can feel the disruption in the river fading. Yet, I feel the source of this taint still lingers. ',0),(27838,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes.  The waters are clearing up. I am certain I will be visited by a vision before the High Council meets. Be warned, $r.  My vote will only be swayed by what I see. You might have helped us greatly here today, but if the vision sways me to make a case against war then that is the way my vote will be cast. ',0),(27839,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is quite timely.  I will distribute these armaments to my best men and to the laborers that you recruited. I\'ve a feeling they\'ll show as much courage as my best trained captains. ',0),(27840,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $n. Мы у тебя в долгу.',19342),(27841,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, more delicious Bread of the Dead, thank you!$B$BPlease, take this in return... a little something fun for the holiday.',0),(27843,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, как всегда. Еще немного – и мы победим.',19342),(27845,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. These fighters deserve more than lying in the mud.',19342),(27846,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, more delicious Bread of the Dead, thank you!$B$BPlease, take this in return... a little something fun for the holiday.',0),(27849,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты в точности $gследовал:следовала; приказу, $n. От имени Короны награждаю тебя за храбрость в бою.',19342),(27851,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n. Теперь капитуляция орков или их бегство через портал – лишь дело времени.',19342),(27852,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We will fight to the last orc, $n. I hope you\'ll keep yourself alive long enough to properly destroy these trespassers.',0),(27853,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No true member of the Horde should find pleasure in killing such terrified weaklings... without challenge, victory has no true thrill.$B$BBut your dirty work has helped stave off the Alliance and protect our homes here. Be proud of your work for the Horde.',0),(27854,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are a true champion, $n, to take the lives of so many on the battlefield. I hope it will be enough to save Stonard.',0),(27855,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With no link to the outside, the Alliance must rely on what they\'ve brought to the swamp. We shall see if they can handle our home environment.',0),(27856,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You honor both the dead and the living with your courage, $n.',0),(27857,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Alliance is driven out! Stonard will be safe, thanks to your ferocity. Lok\'tar Ogar!',0),(27859,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You were not the only mortal that Rheastrasza confided in. I too earned the dragon\'s trust.$B$BI have already moved the real purified egg on to a safer location, away from the Badlands. It will continue to grow, out of Deathwing\'s sight.$B$BThe red dragonflight is as benevolent as it is powerful. It was Rheastrasza\'s final wish that I give this to you.',0),(27860,1,1,0,0,0,1000,0,0,'У меня по-прежнему тяжело на сердце оттого, что я попросил тебя это сделать, хотя и знаю, что другого пути нет. Ты $gспас:спасла; тех из нас, кто еще противится жуткой угрозе.',19342),(27864,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No love in your heart for orcs I see. You really made a mess of that guy. ',0),(27869,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебя послала гоблинша? А у нее зоркий глаз...$B$BОна права. Я хочу прервать поток тлена, исходящий из храма. Если желаешь спасти свой народ от тяжкой участи, $n, мне понадобится твоя помощь.',19342),(27870,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Неприятности в храме... Жаль, что у нас нет дополнительных сил, чтобы отрядить их туда. Война с Каменором в самом разгаре, и нам нужен каждый человек.',19342),(27871,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have no time to send orcs to the temple, $n. The humans come, and they are many. Stonard must be defended!',0),(27875,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Prayerblossom has been used by the Broken as a remedy since they settled in this swamp. If it soothes the physical form, it might be used for more powerful healing...',0),(27876,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It will have to be purified, but this will be most helpful. Thank you.',0),(27877,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent! We\'ll bury these immediately. Those Explorers\' League dimwits will never suspect us!',0),(27878,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew it! The High Examiner will be pleased to see this.$B$BNice work, $R.',0),(27879,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I imagine those ogres weren\'t too much trouble for you. Here - some coin for your troubles.',0),(27880,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve got the hint of a hero in you, $R.$B$BNow get out of my battlefield.',0),(27881,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Titans? You come to me, asking about titans?$B$BYou\'ve come to the right place, as we\'re on the brink of discovering something big. You will, however, need to earn your keep first.',0),(27882,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Chalice... worthless.$B$BVase... counterfeit.$B$BHieroglyph... interesting, but rather common.$B$BWhat\'s this? I\'ve never seen trogg craftsmanship of this caliber! You\'ve stumbled upon something rare indeed, $n.$B$BWe must not be so hasty as to overlook the troggs. They may be simple, but they know things about the deep, hidden places of this world.$B$BYou\'ve performed well enough. Let\'s talk titans, shall we?',0),(27883,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The statue clicks into place on the large stone slab.>',0),(27884,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The statue slides into place on the cold marble slab.>',0),(27888,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just one tiny little device?$B$BI never did understand those titans.$B$BVery well! Let\'s see what this peeper can do.',0),(27889,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll take that egg out of your hands now. We need to get this egg incubated... and hidden, quickly. There are lots of angry dragons looking for this.$B$BIt\'s good to see you again, by the way.',0),(27890,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re the $R we\'ve been waiting for? It\'s about time you got here. My legs could use a stretch.$B$BCome on boys! Let\'s go kill us some black dragons!',0),(27891,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m looking forward to fighting with you.',0),(27892,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think you\'re ready, $n. You\'re getting the hang of this.',0),(27893,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'See? No need to worry when Gargal is around. Just let me know, and I\'ll protect you from the monsters.',0),(27894,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One less dragon to worry about, one step closer to redemption. Onward, my soldiers!',0),(27895,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Two more dangerous black dragons have been removed from this egg hunt. Your greatest task, however, still awaits.',0),(27896,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just think... Nyxondra may end up being the mother of the new black dragonflight. In death, she has given a gift to the future generations of Azeroth.',0),(27897,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The egg must always be moving. We are not safe anywhere.$B$BDeathwing, even in his madness, knows all the hidden places in this world. The egg must not rest.',0),(27899,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It would seem that I\'m not the only one interested in these obelisks... ',0),(27900,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a relief. Thanks, $n. Turns out I\'ve got my hands full here. ',0),(27901,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s it! Good work, $n! ',0),(27902,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Such clarity... let us hope this will aid poor Magtoor.',0),(27903,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'According to Harrison\'s notes, placing the lens upon this dais should re-activate this obelisk. Exactly what that means remains to be seen... ',0),(27904,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can only hope this will lead to a cure, $n. Thank you for bringing it to me.',0),(27905,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work back there, $n. Looks like we\'ve lost them, for now at least. ',0),(27906,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope the sight of my sniveling amuses you, $n. It will be the only joy here.',0),(27907,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will grind these and try to get him to eat. Thank you.',0),(27908,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'At least I can soothe him with my own hands while he still breathes. Thank you, $n.',0),(27909,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He can only drink so much. The rest might be used for washing his body, after...$B$B<Neeka glares in frustration and shudders, turning her head away.>',0),(27910,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With Duskfang to shroud his body, he will carry the animal\'s spirit with him into the afterlife.$B$BListen to me. An old superstitious fool. I\'m so sorry, Helgrum...',0),(27911,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He is gone.$B$BHe is right. I must be strong for him...',0),(27912,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You peer into the chest...',19116),(27913,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You peer into the chest...',0),(27914,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gсослужил:сослужила; мне и моим собратьям великую службу, $n. Прими это в знак благодарности за твою отвагу.',19342),(27915,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am pleased to see you once again, $n. You are truly noble to assist me further.',0),(27916,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ruag reads over the report.>$B$BI see. Thank you for this information, $n.',0),(27918,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, |3-6($c). I\'m afraid it\'s too late... ...but I will not give up even if Exodar itself does not take my pleas.',19342),(27919,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, has Avuun sent ye? Good, good...',19116),(27926,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I trust that you had no troubles fitting in with our guests, hmm? ',0),(27927,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They sent you to check up on us? Pshh... I\'ve been around this desert longer than any of those chumps. We\'re just soaking in some of the scenery and telling stories about old times.$B$BYou like telling stories?',0),(27928,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, these are exquisite! The commander will be able to make a winter uniform with these. ',0),(27929,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You look a little battered. Those dwarves didn\'t give you any challenge, did they?$B$BStill, that was an impressive show.',0),(27930,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Heroes:$B$BIf you are reading this, then my suspicions were correct. Deathwing has found us. The egg is destroyed, as am I.$B$BThis was, actually, the plan from the beginning. You see... the egg that Deathwing destroyed was not the egg he sought.$B$BIt was mine.',0),(27936,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done what few others could have. Defeating Avalanchion was no small feat.$B$BI\'m impressed, $n. Will you help us with our war against the stone troggs so that we can rescue the Stonefather?',0),(27939,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it! Perhaps I can trust you vizh more serious matters, hmm? ',0),(27941,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Most efficient work, $c. You should rise rapidly through the ranks. ',0),(27942,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zhese look to be of sufficient quality. Vizh zhese, ve are vone shtep closah to zhe cleansink ritual. ',0),(27943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very goot! You have earned yourself a place at zhe ritual. You shall be among zhe first to velcome Gobbles back to his... original form. ',0),(27944,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work on those spiders $n. At this rate, we will be taking that forest in no time.',0),(27945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Mallia removes her eyepatch and holds the black diamond before her empty eye socket.>$B$BWhat have we, what have we - breaches, the breaches number three. Two heads, one wholly given to its master. I see the future. A hammer united. A mountain shattered. Oh - OH!$B$B<Mallia drops the diamond to the floor, covering her face with her hands.>',0),(27947,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Eye sits before you, humming ominously with dark energies.>$B$B<Without warning, the orb rotates, as if to look at you. You sense a malevolent presence, as though the orb is alive.>',0),(27948,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These glands will do nicely. We are grateful for your help, $n.',0),(27949,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May their souls rest in peace.',0),(27951,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Eye glimmers darkly, colors swirling about its dusky surface.>$B$BAh, the succulent thrill of life extinguished. Do you feel it, $C? Do you relish it as I do?$B$BNo, I see not. You fight to protect the lives of others. Pity.',0),(27953,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наконец-то кто-то пришел поговорить с нами о важном.',19243),(27954,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found one? I\'ve been searching everywhere. Give it here!$B$BSome of these eyes are won over with riddles or verse. Others require magic. What did this one demand? Ah, it\'s no matter. What matters is that it\'s ours.',0),(27955,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve gone pale, $C. What did the Eye show you?$B$BYou saw Cho\'gall? Wait - Cho\'gall saw you? He\'s watching us? He\'s watching us right now!?$B$BDamn this stupid dark magic! I\'m going to have to infiltrate Cho\'gall\'s stronghold myself.',0),(27966,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I didn\'t think you would be able to do it, $n. You are just full of surprises aren\'t you?',0),(27967,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey, you made it back alive! Can\'t say you were the first one to try this task, but you are definitely the first one to make it back alive.',0),(27969,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vell done, $c. Zhere may be hope for you yet. ',0),(27970,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! Maybe we can finally get some ships into port now. Thank you $n.',0),(27971,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work on the undead up there $n. We really appreciate the help.',0),(27972,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This rum will really help us out, $n. They might not feel great in the morning but at least they will go to sleep happy.',0),(27973,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I didn\'t think you would be able to do it, $n. You are just full of surprises aren\'t you?',0),(27975,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work $n. I will report your efforts to our highest in command immediately.',0),(27978,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $n! We should not hear from the ghosts again anytime soon.',0),(27987,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good job on the recovery effort $n. These cannonballs should last us a while.',0),(27990,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Auch! If I vere an inch or two taller, I\'d be dead! ',0),(27991,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha, we finally got Largo! Nice one, $n.',0),(27992,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These parts will really help us out, $n! Who would have thought you can find stuff this useful in all that old junk?',0),(27993,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good to see ya, kid. Would\'ve been even better if you\'d have been here to help me take care of these little savages... ',0),(27999,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a right shame. Stubborn as they were to speak to, they were just as stubborn in a fight. Would have been good to have \'em.$B$BOnce this is done, we\'ll have to send some boys out to bring them back for a proper send off.',0),(28001,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here here, WOT!? He calls ME a COWARD!?$B$BJust like a Firebeard, all hot air and not a lick of sense. I\'ve been bearing the brunt of a Dragonmaw invasion from the south, much of Thundermar is in ruins, and do any of the other clans stick up to help? NO! Ol\' Thundermar is on his own he is, and you\'d better believe I\'m usin\' everything in my arsenal just to stem the tide.',0),(28002,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm, still a bit frazzled, are they? Well, you know what they say. Time heals all wounds. Except for those of the ambassador, of course... ',0),(28031,4,1,6,0,0,1000,0,0,'That must be the new I-Scream Cryocannon! Ain\'t she a beauty?!$B$B<Brivelthwerp eyes you shrewdly.>$B$BI\'m going to let you in on a secret, my good $g friend : lady;: the groundwork for a vast mercantile empire is being laid right here!$B$BTell me... how do you feel about ice cream?',19116),(28038,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey, you\'re one big strong heap of $C. Can you handle the crucible? We got bookies are standing by!',0),(28041,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You gather up the fresh carcass.>',0),(28042,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Brivelthwerp eyes you up and down, but becomes overjoyed at the site of the special delivery.>$B$BWelcome, friend, welcome! I\'m going to give you the chance to get involved at the ground level of a once-in-a-lifetime opportuntity.$B$BThe entrepreneurial spirit knows nothing of the differences between the Alliance and the Horde!$B$BTell me... how do you feel about ice cream?',0),(28043,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was an impressive aerial display, $n, but I wish it had come at a better time.$B$BNarkrall is a great warrior, but he\'s also an impatient fool. He\'s about to get himself killed ... and we\'re about to lose one of our most important weapons in the battle for the Highlands!',0),(28045,15,94,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh yeah! This is going to be the greatest flavor in the world!$B$BLook out, Tigule and Foror!!!',19116),(28046,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s about time someone took those guys out.',0),(28047,6,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do you hear that, $n? That\'s the sweet hum of the refrigeration kicking in.$B$BWe\'ll be able to store our inventory down there in no time. Thank you!',19116),(28048,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Outstanding! Nothing can stop us from being the greatest purveyors of ice cream in all of Azeroth!',19116),(28050,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No way, you actually killed him? We are having shark tacos tonight for sure!',0),(28051,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. They gave their lives for ice cream.',19116),(28058,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is better than even I could have thought possible! The Chambermaid\'s magical pillow is mine! You better believe you\'re going to get a nice reward for this accomplishment, $n!\n',19116),(28059,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You killed him? We have been trying to take that guy out for weeks! We thank you, $n.',0),(28063,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks for rounding these up for us, $n. Kind of hard to fight a battle without any guns.',0),(28065,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You saved our men! No words can express our gratitude $n.',0),(28068,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You look eager to kill a few hundred Dark Irons in justice\'s name.$B$BPerfect.',0),(28069,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve managed to take this small area, but to do anything more we\'ll need your help.',0),(28084,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You may now make use of the Krom\'gar stockpile, $n! For a small fee I will sell you armaments of battle, useful for crushing your enemies! The availability of what I sell depends upon your rank in the army. Visit my shop whenever you earn a new rank.$B$BLOK\'TAR OGAR!',0),(28085,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know nothing of the Elder Crone, Magatha. What I do know is that the Twilight\'s Hammer is destroying Highperch.$B$BWill you help me to stop them, $C?',0),(28086,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They\'re precious. One day they\'ll grow strong, but until then, they must be protected.',0),(28087,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There\'ll be no more trapping this day!',0),(28088,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The great Heartrazor is a majestic creature. He has told me of his gratitude and fondness for you, $n.',0),(28089,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was wondering when reinforcements would show up. Suit up, $n. It\'s time to dispense some justice!',0),(28090,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good going.$B$BDoesn\'t look like much, does it?',0),(28091,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. Now we can start pushing our ground forces up towards Grim Batol.',0),(28092,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Works like a charm, every time.',0),(28093,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The gate is clear. Once your people finish clearing the canyon, we will speak to your leaders about the next move.',0),(28094,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We make it look easy.',0),(28097,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The canyon is well fortified, but the distraction that the dragons are providing should be enough to allow us to break through.',0),(28098,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The pridelings did what? They must love you deeply for freeing them.$B$BThank you, $n. You\'ve saved Highperch!',0),(28101,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The red dragons have agreed to help! No small feat, I\'m sure. You have the thanks of the Alliance.$B$BWe\'d already laid out plans for our ambush on a Twilight caravan by the time the dragons contacted us. They\'re helping by cutting off their retreat.$B$BThe battle still rages. You can definitely be of aid.',0),(28102,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A few of the remaining satyr have fled into the deeper woods, but they have taken heavy losses. Good job, $n.',0),(28103,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. Now we can start pushing our ground forces up towards Grim Batol.',0),(28104,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good going.$B$BDoesn\'t look like much, does it?',0),(28107,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We make it look easy.',0),(28108,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Like a well-oiled machine.',0),(28109,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The gate is clear. Once your people finish clearing the canyon, we will speak to your leaders about the next move.',0),(28113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'See what can get done with a little cooperation?$B$BI\'ll make sure the claw is given to people responsible enough to contain such things... assuming it can\'t be destroyed.',0),(28117,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You made it back out alive? You are a stronger man than I, $n.',0),(28118,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Galus is dead? Fantastic work $n, now we can send down the cleanup crew and get that cellblock ready for new prisoners.',0),(28120,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These journals are in excellent condition $n. We will begin deciphering them immediately. Only time will tell what secrets they hold.',0),(28122,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You actually killed him?! I can\'t believe it!',0),(28123,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Zaela takes the gore-spattered length of chain and wraps it around her hand and wrist.>$B$BIf the stories are true, $n, it was on this length of chain that Deathwing had once fastened the Demon Soul, forged in his bid to control the other dragonflights. The Demon Stone has long been destroyed but perhaps this hunk of elementium holds some residual power...$B$BYou\'ve done a great thing today.',0),(28124,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad that you made it.$B$BDon\'t mind my new clothes. It seemed prudent to blend in.',0),(28125,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Lakota looks worried about the condition of the armor, especially the bloodstains.>$B$BYou sure don\'t fool around, do you, $n? Well, it\'ll have to do.',0),(28127,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You give so much of yourself without requiring anything in return.$B$BThe people of Thousand Needles are grateful, as am I.',0),(28130,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Told you that village was full of wackos. Nice job clearing it out $n.',0),(28132,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh look, it\'s one of little Schnottz\'s pamphlets. I\'ll just be taking that from you, if you don\'t mind. ',0),(28133,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Once free of the chain, Torth died rather than submit again. I admire the creature. I will have his hide fashioned into a set of armor.$B$BThis much is clear to me now: The Dragonmaw cannot stand alone if the Alliance backs the Wildhammer. Narkrall proved that. And you have proven the might of the Horde, again and again.$B$BI will rebuild our drake wings and take up position outside the Bastion of Twilight. You should continue to help out here in the Gullet and elsewhere in the Highlands.',0),(28134,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Orsis!  Of course! How could I not have seen this? ',0),(28135,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do you see what Deathwing\'s minions have done?  Great Orsis is now all but buried in the sand! ',0),(28136,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that those three are dealt with, the combined forces from Freewind Post should be able to handle the rest of the cultists here.',0),(28137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These fish will do nicely, $n. Keeping the troops fed and in good condition is our number one priority and you really came through for us here.',0),(28139,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. Now there\'s only one thing left to do.',0),(28141,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you.  The rumors I\'d heard about you are proving true after all. ',0),(28142,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It took you long enough. Do you think that we are playing games here?',0),(28145,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n.  We might yet save Iset. ',0),(28147,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What did you manage to get? I suppose we can piece something together from this.$B$BAfter all, you\'re not joining the cult. We just need to fool a few ogres.',0),(28149,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dat\'s de stuff, mon!$B$BNow can you hear dem? De spirits, dey be talkin\', but dey say nothing nice.$B$BLet us bring dem to de light.',0),(28151,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hah! I\'m sure Twilight\'s Hammer wanted to number those ogres among their ranks. Now they\'ll probably have to fight them off instead.$B$BThis is good, $n. With one well-placed $C we managed to do the work of a small army. I\'ll let Warlord Krogg know of your work here!',0),(28152,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, just what I was expecting. With these herbs, our preparations for Jaedenar are nearly ready.',0),(28154,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Muckgill you say? Never heard of him. What is this anyway? Some kind of fin or something?',0),(28157,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Magatha gazes at you with naked disdain.>$B$BI\'ll combine them into a suitable form. I\'ll keep it\'s use simple.',0),(28158,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A simple task for a simple boy. Let us see if you have what it takes to finish the job.',0),(28159,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Surprising... you lived.$B$BI thank you for doing my dirty work, $C. You kept my hands clean while ridding me of some incompetent Grimtotem leaders.$B$BNot only do I have the Rattle of Bones, the Writ of History, and the Drums of War, but I now have the ultimate artifact: the Doomstone!',0),(28160,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow, she\'s evil! But, what does it mean, $n? Is Magatha going to destroy us? Is she in charge of the Twilight\'s Hammer now?$B$BWhatever happens, you\'ve delivered us from our enemies. Please allow me to show you our gratitude.',0),(28161,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow, she\'s evil! But, what does it mean, $n? Is Magatha going to destroy us? Is she in charge of the Twilight\'s Hammer now?$B$BWhatever happens, you\'ve delivered us from our enemies. Please allow me to show you our gratitude.',0),(28162,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Looks like you were able to get the croc hides that we needed. Thanks $n, your contributions will not go unnoticed.',0),(28163,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Those filthy horde never stood a chance. Nice work, $n.',0),(28164,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad to see you received my message. ',0),(28165,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'D-Block is all clear? Good work, $n. We will send down a crew to start cleaning up right away.',0),(28166,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, dis be it, mon.$B$B<The lens glows brightly in Buunu\'s hands, casting unearthly rays of light across the shadowy cave mouth.>$B$BWe be ready to bring dem spirits out de shadows now.',0),(28167,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did Nevin send you ahead? That means he\'s getting ready to end the mission, but there are still survivors to be rescued. We have to help them! ',0),(28169,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to meet you, $c. We rarely come across survivors as strong and capable as you are. I can help get you decontaminated and on your way out of here. ',0),(28170,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You see! De dead be nothing to be scared of. You brought de light to de darkness, mon, and never flinched.$B$BWe can use dis cave now as a base of operations in de northern Highlands. You\'re de best, $n!',0),(28171,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It seems you are still with us. I\'m somewhat appreciative of that.$B$BThank you.',0),(28172,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я позабочусь, чтобы дракончикам обеспечили надлежащий уход.',19342),(28173,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You seem to have made use of the disturbing implements with ease.$B$BI take solace in knowing that some tools of evil can ultimately still lead to safeguarding life. Nothing is without purpose.',0),(28174,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Итак, ты в деле?$b$bЧудесно.',19342),(28175,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve started a wonderful thing this day, amidst all of this blood shed.$B$BIt may take many years, but this ravaged land will be restored. It will be beautiful again.',0),(28176,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lirastraza sent me ahead to the lair, suspecting the black dragon we are seeking may still be here. Judging by the hatchlings, it seems she was not mistaken.',0),(28177,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Скорпидов легко недооценить. Рад, что одно из этих жал не пронзило тебя насквозь. Может быть, ты просто $gпрофессионал:профессионалка;.$b$bЯ положу жала на склад. Пока еще не все готово, |3-6($r).',19342),(28178,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Поверь мне, $n… Я так же как и ты рвусь в бой, но нам нужно следовать плану. Наш час скоро настанет.$b$bПока что я сложу шкуры на склад.',19342),(28179,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, that’s just what you need. $B$bDon’t worry, $n ... soon the time will come for reprisals against the orcs.',19342),(28180,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эй! Ты кто?$b$bАх, так ты от Кишана? Не хочешь тут маленько задержаться? Ничего особенного… просто надо убить парочку чернокнижников для меня.',19342),(28181,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надеюсь, это то, что искал Кишан. Для меня это все равно хлам.',19342),(28182,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Зная уклад жизни орков, полагаю, что скоро его место займет кто-то еще. Надеюсь, я проникну в Алтарь Бурь до того, как это произойдет.$b$bСпасибо, $gприятель:милая;.',19342),(28183,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kishan examines the contents of the box.>$b$bWell, well, good. Now we go east and forget about the Black Mountain... for a while.',19342),(28184,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ll have to excuse me, but we\'re not taking visitors right now.  I\'ll ask you to leave Chiselgrip out the same door you came in.$b$bOh, Keeshan... is that you?',19116),(28185,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Svarnos is finally dead? Looks like we can finally get to work setting up that cellblock then. Thank you $n.',0),(28186,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The shackles! We will begin the process of destroying these shackles immediately $n. Thank you for your help.',0),(28187,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is times like zhese, zhat one learns who his friends really are... ',0),(28188,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You cleared that area out? Looks like you might be more useful to us that we thought, $R.',0),(28191,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve proven a great ally. I would have never expected such upon our first meeting.',0),(28193,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zhey know nozhink, you say? Very vell, zhen. Zhe search goes on... ',0),(28194,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are perfect, $c. Wish us luck! ',0),(28195,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good, $r... ',0),(28198,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is a great honor to meet you, $n!  I\'ve heard much about you. ',0),(28200,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent job, $n.  You might not think this adds up to much, but this might very well be the difference between life and death to one of our soldiers. ',0),(28201,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are a born leader, $n.  It\'ll be good to have you by our side when war comes to these lands. ',0),(28202,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s it? That\'s your disguise?$B$BI\'m feeling less confident about our chances. It was nice knowing you, kid.',0),(28203,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s it?  That\'s your disguise?$b$bI\'m feeling less confident about our chances.  It was nice knowing you, kid.',19116),(28204,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s it? That\'s your disguise?$B$BI\'m feeling less confident about our chances. It was nice knowing you, kid.',0),(28205,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s it? That\'s your disguise?$B$BI\'m feeling less confident about our chances. It was nice knowing you, kid.',0),(28210,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well... that wasn\'t all that great, was it? ',0),(28211,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at that - OW! Pointy! Hot!$B$BThese spears should cut through that dragonhide like an electric cheese-slicing apparatus through butter.',0),(28212,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Marvelous! I\'ll smelt this down into a delicious soup. An angry soup. Of molten metal.',0),(28215,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Terrific! These coils will decompress with the force of a thousand suns!$B$BThat\'s just a rough approximation of course, don\'t hold me accountable for those numbers.',0),(28216,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, that\'s him. Can you believe this thing was human once?$B$BThat\'s the Twilight\'s Hammer for you. What they don\'t destroy, they corrupt.$B$BThank you, $C.',0),(28223,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, the wardens key\'s. Another job well done, $n. These will come in very handy.',0),(28225,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that\'s what I like to see!  Yer alright, $r.',19116),(28226,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is exactly what we needed.  I\'ll get the boys workin\' on the next batch of golems right away.',19116),(28227,4,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Yer a lifesaver, $n.  With golems like these, we won\'t have to worry about Dark Irons, Blackrock orcs... maybe even dragons!$b$bIf ye ever need anything from the Thorium Brotherhood, don\'t hesitate to ask.  That goes for yer friends, too.',19116),(28232,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These rations will really help the troops out $n. Thank you for your help.',0),(28233,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t be looking! I\'m not wearin\' me pants!',0),(28234,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you! Now turn around so I can put\'em on.',0),(28238,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A ride to the Highlands, then? I\'ve just the thing!$B$BI\'ll make room for yeh in me seaplane. I\'ll have to ditch the cat-food I was packing, yeh know, in case we crash in the mountains and ain\'t rescued fer weeks.$B$BOn second thought, jes\' keep the cat food on yer lap, aye.',0),(28239,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where have you been, grunt?  You\'re late!  Give me one reason why I shouldn\'t kill you on the spot!',19116),(28241,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Eye sits before you, humming ominously with dark energies.>$B$B<Without warning, the orb rotates, as if to look at you. You sense a malevolent presence, as though the orb is alive.>',0),(28242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Eye glimmers darkly, colors swirling about its dusky surface.>$B$BAh, the succulent thrill of life extinguished. Do you feel it, $C? Do you relish it as I do?$B$BNo, I see not. You fight to protect the lives of others. Pity.',0),(28243,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found one? A gen-u-ine Eye of Twilight? Lemme see.$B$BOh Gods. It\'s lookin\' at me. It\'s lookin\' right back!$B$BI need a drink. Can you face that thing toward the wall or somethin\'?',0),(28244,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What did you see, $n? Cho\'gall? Wait - he saw YOU!?$B$BOh aye, that wee sneaky eye! It looks both ways. That cheeky looker! Where\'s me hammer!?',0),(28245,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmph.  Good work, grunt.',19116),(28246,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not only did you pull off the executions, you made them all look like accidents!$b$bYou were the right $r for this undercover work.  Good job, soldier.',19116),(28247,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You killed Obsidia within her own lair? Impressive, $R. I\'m sorry that I could not be there.$B$BYou\'re true to your word, and you most certainly have the bite to back your bellow. Thank you.',0),(28248,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done well, $n. We\'re in the process of preparing the attack now.',0),(28249,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done well, $n. We\'re in the process of preparing the attack now.',0),(28250,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You showed those thieving little scoundrels!  Great job. ',0),(28251,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The worgen situation hasn\'t gotten any better and Helcular is really creeping me out.',0),(28252,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your job is complete.  You take a look at the horn that they gave you, and decide to hang onto it for a while longer.',19116),(28253,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I didn\'t count on obtaining an item like this.  I will change our plans accordingly.',19116),(28254,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You need a disguise?  Well, you came to the right place, $g honey: sister;.$b$bLet me take a look... mm-hmm.  I know exactly what we\'ll do.',19116),(28258,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to see you again, $n. I wish I could say that I had happy news.',0),(28259,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you received my message. An opportunity has presented itself, $n, one which will allow us to demonstrate just how important we are to the success of Stormwind and the Alliance.',0),(28260,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll be brief, $n. Our enemies are gathering and Stormwind needs our help.',0),(28262,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $n. We have much to discuss.',0),(28263,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to see you again, $n. Stormwind has need of your skills.',0),(28265,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'More outsiders?  What do you want?',19116),(28266,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I had a feeling you\'d be the one returning to me.  I like your style, soldier.',19116),(28267,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, this Schnottz character is working with Deathwing!? This is even more distressing than you think... ',0),(28268,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I wish had good news to share with you, $n, but the truth is that I have asked you here because we have need of your talents.',0),(28269,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, glad you could make it. I could use a hand here. ',0),(28271,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good job with Schnottz\'s men. Sounds like you gave them something to think about. Hopefully it bought us the time we need. ',0),(28272,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,' Yes... yes... perfect! I\'ll need some time to make sense of these, but the information is there. Good work, $n! ',0),(28273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome $c! You and I are going to be good friends! I can tell already. ',0),(28274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here we are, $n! Great things will happen here... magical things! ',0),(28275,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work on those supply ships, $n! We knew you would be good for somethin\' around here.',0),(28276,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aren\'t they beautiful? ',0),(28277,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not bad, huh?  Maybe you can put a word in with the high commander. Maybe he\'ll put us in charge of our own squad! ',0),(28278,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have a feeling we\'ll be hearing about you and your exploits for a long time, soldier.  I look forward to fighting by your side in Redridge.$b$bYou are dismissed.',19116),(28279,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Without those sergeants, Thorg\'izog will be hard-pressed getting his troops ready for battle.$b$bAlready the dominoes are beginning to fall, $n.',19116),(28280,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it, $n! Alliance ingenuity to the rescue.$B$BOf course, I don\'t have anything to help you fight the dismounted riders now that they\'re on the ground. You\'re a $C; improvise!',0),(28281,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You sure know your way around a battlefield, $C. It looks like they\'re about to fall back.$B$BAll we need is one decisive blow...',0),(28282,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We did it, $n! Narkrall Rakeclaw lies dead at my feet, and Thundermar has weathered a storm of drakes!$B$BThis wouldn\'t have been possible if it weren\'t for the help of the Alliance. I owe you a debt that I don\'t think can ever be repaid.',0),(28283,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Interesting....',0),(28284,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Interesting....',0),(28285,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Light has answered my prayers. At last, you have arrived.',0),(28286,6,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You alright?$b$bGood.  You did a fine job out there, $n.  Now pack up your things.  We\'re moving out of here.',19116),(28287,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $n. We will need your skills in the continuing battle against Twilight\'s Hammer.',0),(28288,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... their eyes are open$B$B<Delaris smiles with bemusement.>$B$BMaybe I\'ll keep Impsy around after all. He\'s got a lot to teach me...',0),(28289,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to see you again, $n. I wish I could say that I had happy news.',0),(28290,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Horde has need of your skills, $n.',0),(28291,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Salhet?  A tactician, you say? Hah!  Very well, if you\'ll vouch for him, we might be able to arrange something. ',0),(28293,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Uldum? What about Uldum? Speak quickly!',0),(28294,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello, $C! Keegan Firebeard here has told me all about your heroics down south. Thank you for all of your efforts on behalf of the Wildhammer.$B$BI see Colin Thundermar is right behind you. The summit is ready to begin! Please stay and let\'s see how things unfold...',0),(28295,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Harrison sent you, hmm?$B$BHow fortunate!',0),(28296,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Belloc sent you, hmm?$B$BHow fortunate!',0),(28297,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Horde has need of your skills, $n.',0),(28298,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Shattered Hand needs your skills, $n.',0),(28299,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Horde will soon call upon your skills, $n.',0),(28300,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Horde needs your help in the battle against our enemies.',0),(28301,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are dangerous times, $n. The Horde is fortunate to have taurens like you in its ranks.',0),(28302,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Horde will soon have need of your skills, $n.',0),(28303,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are one of the most promising young paladins I have ever trained, $n. It is for that reason that I wish to offer you a dangerous mission.',0),(28304,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our enemies stir once more, $n, and you will be at the forefront of battle.',0),(28306,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kelnir? Hahaha...$B$BSometimes I wonder if her chatter drove all the other dryads away. But I\'m glad she is safe.$B$BWelcome to Whisperwind Grove, $C. Hold peace in your heart, and you will find a home here.',0),(28307,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Horde has need of your talents, $n.',0),(28308,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Horde has need of your talents, $n.',0),(28309,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Horde be needin\' you, $n.',0),(28310,5,482,22,5,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve arrived!  And just in time for the friendship ceremony!$b$b<Oralius looks wistfully over his shoulder at the ogre head, and quickly becomes panicked.>$b$bCaptain Winky!  Where\'d Captain Winky go?$b$bNo, don\'t tell me he got cold feet!',19116),(28311,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, these will do. I will get this packed up for you.',0),(28312,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'To the untrained eye, these will look exactly like imps.$B$BWe just need to get them to that untrained eye. I\'ll work on preparing them for delivery.',0),(28313,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This meat looks good... but I think it needs a little \"seasoning\". I\'ll make sure that gets taken care of.$B$BThank you, $n.',0),(28314,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Keeshan is covered in blood and sweat.>$B$BThat was exactly what I needed.',0),(28315,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your kill count is adding up, $n. We\'re chipping away at them.$B$BAnd we are going to win. Redridge will NOT fall to these cowards.',0),(28316,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, the whelplings. I will take care of them.$B$BAs for the agreement I made with your Colonel Troteman earlier, tell him that I will hold up my end of the bargain. You will have your dragon for the battle against the orcs.$B$BWe hold no particular love for the Redridge Mountains, but we do share your grudge against the Blackrock clan.',0),(28317,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well would you look at that! My favorite soldier comes through in the clutch!$B$BI\'ll make sure to get this distributed among the ogres.$B$BI\'ll see you in Redridge, soldier. For the glory of the Blackrock!',0),(28318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What are these? Oh, are these imps?$B$BI\'m pretty sure that imps don\'t just fall asleep in boxes!$B$BI\'ll take your word for it, though. I don\'t understand any of this warlock crap. Leave them in the corner.',0),(28319,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pff! You\'re late! Do you know how long I\'ve been waiting for Ner\'gosh to deliver this orb?$B$B<Xi\'lun looks down at the orb, then up at you.>$B$BThere\'s something strange about this orb... it\'s too...$B$B<Xi\'lun trails off.>$B$BNever mind, it must be my nerves talking. Thank you for the delivery. For blood and honor!',0),(28320,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did you see them run? They didn\'t know what was happening! Beautiful!$B$BOur job\'s almost done, $n. It\'s time to deliver the deathblow.',0),(28321,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Colonel Troteman is beaming.>$B$BWelcome home, boys.',0),(28322,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You peer inside, and find...',0),(28323,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you got my message. Good. I have an important task for you.',0),(28326,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, you\'re back.$B$BI hope you\'ve still got that disguise. You\'re going back undercover, $n.',0),(28328,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done your work well, $n. While this will not stop Twilight\'s Hammer, it will help sow suspicion between them and the Dark Irons.',0),(28329,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'All signs indicate to a breeding pool being inside the ruined town hall. You\'ll need to investigate!',0),(28330,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps with Chet vanquished, the lethality levels of this place will decrease a tad faster. A job well done, $n!',0),(28333,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Efficiency in the workforce! Wonderful.$B$BMaybe I should check on the goblins inside those shredders later.',0),(28334,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mangy curs think they can just waltz in here and ruin my finely-tuned operation. Hah!$B$BI told you not to look directly at the flares, right? Oops.',0),(28335,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You turn the largest handle you can find on the Master Control Pump, and the rattling noises in the nearby pipes stop.$B$BThis gives you a few moments to hear the sound of flames outside before a familiar voice cuts in through a tinny, craclikng speaker.',0),(28336,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s not working! We\'re going to have to shut it off at the source.$B$BGo talk to the Deputy outside, he\'ll walk you through it!',0),(28338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I sense that you have achieved victory. Victory... such a hollow word considering what had to be done. Regardless, you\'ve proven yourself to be worthy of our trust.$B$BIt may take some time before the Timbermaw welcome you without hostility within the Hold. Still, your perseverance will erode any suspicion my brethren may have about you. So long as you never betray us and raise weapons against us, we will find common ground.',0),(28339,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank goodness the oil is safe! Well done, $n.',0),(28340,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey, nice! I\'ll just take those... carefully...$B$BDon\'t go tellin\' the workers I didn\'t have the guts to go down there myself, you hear? Here\'s your pay... and a little somethin\' extra.',0),(28343,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m heartened to have the Breath of Cenarius back where it belongs and I know the rest of the circle will be impressed by your efforts. You may have also set back the plans of the Twilight\'s Hammer clan a bit, too. Excellent work.',0),(28344,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'*GASP*$B$BHELP!$B$BDROWNING!$B$B*GURGLE*',0),(28345,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Orkus\' face turns as red as his armor.>$B$BI... uh... the human must have cast some type of mind-altering spell on Orkus. Orkus will explain.',0),(28346,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What? Kurdran\'s talkin\' marriage!? Didn\'t he just see me an\' ol\' Thunderface tearing each other new ones?$B$BThe only eligible Thundermar is Fanny. Now, I\'ll give you this, she\'s got the looks allright. All lumpy in the right places, if you hear me. But she\'s not got that somethun\' somethun\' a Firebeard looks for in a woman, right?',0),(28348,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will have my vengeance, but first we must heal Kasha.',0),(28350,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fine work, my boy! You\'ll master this trapping skill in no time. ',0),(28351,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Splendid! This is shaping up to be better than I had dared to dream! ',0),(28352,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it! I now have camels to spare. Perhaps one day we shall take our show on the road! ',0),(28353,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright, kid. My research is complete. We\'re about ready to activate the final obelisk. ',0),(28354,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This mushroom is toxic to living things, but provides a restorative boost to the undead. Let us see how Kasha reacts.',0),(28357,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s hope we put down enough of them to get the message across.',0),(28360,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. They won\'t spread the corruption any further, and they won\'t be in pain either.',0),(28361,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aren\'t they just adorable?$B$BIt\'s those little victories that keep me going. We\'ll save this forest one squirrel at a time.',0),(28362,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Help! Please help!',0),(28363,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You know, I believe I have just the thing! ',0),(28364,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, thank you! I\'m getting out of here right away!$B$BAnd if Ferli sent you here... don\'t tell her I was crying!',0),(28366,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $R. An action like this will go a long way towards proving yourself as an ally of the Timbermaw.',0),(28367,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hah! I heard it from here! I wish I could\'ve been there to see it! ',0),(28368,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, my entire operation\'s nearly been ruined. But you came through in the clinch, $n.$B$BIt could\'ve been worse! I gotta hand it to you.',0),(28369,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Me brother sent you? Good! I could use a $C. Can ya hold yer own in a fight?',0),(28370,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pretty little things, aren\'t they? I wonder if we can figure out how to make more of them.',0),(28372,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fez sent you, hmm? At least he\'s good for something.',0),(28373,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We furbolg are not foolish, $n. We will not yield Timbermaw Hold to any askers.$B$BHowever, we are also in dire need of assistance. If you help us, we will grant you our favor and allow you passage.',0),(28374,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s hard work, but it\'s so rewarding when you see them growing up big and strong.$B$BWhen they\'re not covered with demonic thorns, that is!',0),(28375,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This place is dark... foreboding. It smells of piss and fur. There are definitely worgen here and very likely dwarves.',0),(28377,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good to have you fighting at my side again, $n!$B$BAnd I see the Firebeards have come as well. I suppose they\'ll provide a distraction while me and my boys do the heavy lifting.',0),(28378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fanny is safe! I hear Firebeard was in there with you? Nice to hear he\'s finally pulling his weight.$B$BWait, why are you looking at me like that, $n? Do you know something I don\'t?',0),(28379,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Har! My men could learn a lot by watching you work. Well done.',0),(28380,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s a disaster down here! The pump\'s thrown, all my men in there are gone...$B$BYou gotta help!',0),(28387,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at them run... the live ones, that is. Glorious.',0),(28388,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Serves every last one of them right. Let\'s hope those in charge send the rest of their greedy scavengers somewhere else.',0),(28389,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let the goblins and all the Horde know we will not have offers of peace and sanctuary abused... most of all not in our new home.$B$BI am grateful my people have found allies as bold as you, $n. This reward will represent your bond with our pack. You will always be welcome here.',0),(28391,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are quite skilled at bending the dragon\'s will, $R. I would be jealous of your agility, except that it comes with such a fragile frame.',0),(28392,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The druids of Talonbranch Glade have assisted us before. We are still unused to \"friendly\" worgen in these woods, but our people are also familiar with the sorrows of curses and corruption...$B$BSorrows that I hope you can aid us in, $C.',0),(28393,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll send these plans to the king and his strategists immediately. If the Dark Irons and their Twilight allies manage to recover and attack, our men will be ready for them. Well done, $n.',0),(28394,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know a couple of engineers who will want to take a look at those plans. They won\'t be using these golems anytime soon. Good work, $n.',0),(28395,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n! I will make sure that your deeds are known amongst my kind.$B$BRemember to bring any of the feathers you find to me. I will continue to accept them as long as necessary.',0),(28396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n! I will make sure that your deeds are known amongst my kind.$B$BRemember to bring any of the feathers you find to me. I will continue to accept them as long as necessary.',0),(28397,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look upon the carnage, $n. You and I make quite the team!$B$BNow to find those plans and deal with their leaders.',0),(28398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The $C trainer pages through the grimoire quickly.>$B$BI\'ve already seen a dozen spells I never knew existed. This will be most helpful, $n.',0),(28399,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The binding stones you brought back are exceedingly powerful. It will likely take me years to learn all their secrets, but I\'m certain they\'ll prove most useful. Thank you, $n.',0),(28400,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<High Warlord Cromush salutes.>$B$BHe will be honored as a hero of the Horde, just as he always hoped. What you and Orkus did will save hundreds of lives and ensure that our foothold in Hillsbrad is not lost.',0),(28401,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have truly served both the Alliance and your calling as a $C.',0),(28402,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright, $n. I think everything is in order. Let\'s do this! ',0),(28403,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Okay, $n. I think I can do this manually, but I\'ll need your help. ',0),(28404,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should do it. Stand back! ',0),(28405,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks to your efforts, those weapons will never shed Alliance blood. Excellent work, $n.',0),(28406,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With any luck, the poison will take out a fair number of their frontline troops before they know what\'s happening. That should stall them for the near future. SI:7 is most pleased with your work.',0),(28407,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Fanny throws her arms up, exasperated.>$B$BYou, Kurdran, Firebeard, and now my brother - everyone\'s got wedding fever!$B$BFine, fine, I\'ll marry Keegan Firebeard. But only \'cuz he\'s strong and handsome, with a jaw that can cut gravel and an arse like an anvil. Not for any political reasons.$B$BWe\'re going to need your help, though. We got a whole lotta wedding to put together, and not a lot of time to do it.',0),(28408,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you work fast. Bold feathers for a bold woman. Well done!',0),(28409,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, Russell the Bard is always raving about Thundermar Lager. I guess it doesn\'t have the kick of a good Wildhammer brew, but he goes on and on about the \"body\" or \"flavor.\" I guess we\'ll find out, eh?',0),(28410,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, aye! Kilts for the gents, gowns for the bridesmaids.$B$BJust don\'t tell the ladies they\'re wearing clothes fit for a blimp.',0),(28411,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lookat that! You\'re practically bent double under the weight of all that meat. I\'d better get my people cooking.',0),(28413,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, it\'s catchy, that\'s for sure.$B$BBut is it a classic?',0),(28414,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Uh... you did it, kid. You REALLY did it! We won the game and....$B$BDID YOU SEE THAT DRAGON?!!!',0),(28415,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ll never guess what happened! Winky came back! No flameflies needed.$B$BCan a dwarf get a celebratory belly rub? Come on now! RUBBA MAH BELLY!',0),(28416,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Glad to have you on my side, $n. Bravo Company reunited, right?$B$BOh, did I mention that Troteman\'s here, too?',0),(28417,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will see to it that these dragons are taken care of.',0),(28418,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you\'re in, then?$B$BGood.',0),(28419,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Those scorpids are easy to underestimate. You\'re lucky you didn\'t end up on the end of one of these barbs. Or maybe you\'re just good.$B$BI\'ll add these to the stockpile. We\'re not done yet, $R.',0),(28420,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Believe me, $n... I\'m just as anxious to get to the killing as you are. We\'ve got to keep to the plan. The armageddon will come soon enough.$B$BI\'ll keep these hides here.',0),(28421,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is exactly what we need.$B$BDon\'t worry, $n... the killing will come soon enough.',0),(28422,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gah! Who are you?$B$BOh, so Ariok sent you? Good. Would ya mind sticking around for a while? It\'s nothing big... I just need you to kill some warlocks for me.',0),(28423,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope that\'s what Ariok was looking for. It\'s not doing me much good right now, anyhow.',0),(28424,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Knowing the way those orcs operate, there\'ll be another one to take his place soon. I\'ll see if I can\'t sneak back into the altar before that happens.$B$BThanks, buddy.',0),(28425,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ariok looks through the crate.>$B$BGood, good, good. We can move on. Our war takes us east, away from Blackrock Mountain... for now.',0),(28426,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ll have to excuse me, but we\'re not taking visitors right now. I\'ll ask you to leave Chiselgrip out the same door you came in.$B$BOh, Ariok... is that you?',0),(28427,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You need a disguise? Well, you came to the right place, honey.$B$BLet me take a look... mm-hmm. I know exactly what we\'ll do.',0),(28428,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s it? That\'s your disguise? I\'m feeling less confident about our chances.$B$BBut still confident.',0),(28429,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s it? That\'s your disguise? I\'m feeling less confident about our chances.$B$BBut still confident.',0),(28430,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s it? That\'s your disguise? I\'m feeling less confident about our chances.$B$BBut still confident.',0),(28431,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s it? That\'s your disguise? I\'m feeling less confident about our chances.$B$BBut still confident.',0),(28432,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where have you been, grunt? You\'re late! Give me one reason why I shouldn\'t kill you on the spot!',0),(28433,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmph. Good work, grunt.',0),(28434,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not only did you pull off the executions, you managed to make them all look like accidents.$B$BYou were the right $R for this undercover work. Good job, soldier.',0),(28436,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'True, an attack on Redridge is an attack against the Alliance... but it is also an attack against innocents.$B$BI won\'t stand for that. Not as a Crusader. Not as an orc.$B$BIt\'s time we taught the Blackrock clan - my old clan - that their raiding days are over.',0),(28437,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'More outsiders? What do you want?',0),(28438,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I had a feeling you\'d be the one returning to me. I like your style, soldier.',0),(28439,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have a feeling we\'ll be hearing about you and your exploits for a long time, soldier. I look forward to fighting by your side in Redridge.$B$BYou are dismissed.',0),(28440,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Without those sergeants, Thorg\'izog will be hard-pressed getting his troops ready for battle.$B$BAlready the dominoes are beginning to fall, $n.',0),(28441,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Are you alright?$B$BGood. You were strong out there, $n. Strong, and wise.$B$BNow pack up your things. We\'re moving out of here.',0),(28442,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh. Visitors?',0),(28443,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, these will do. I will get this packed up for you.',0),(28444,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'To the untrained eye, these will look exactly like imps.$B$BWe just need to get them to that untrained eye. I\'ll work on preparing them for delivery.',0),(28445,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This meat looks good... but I think it needs a little \"seasoning\". I\'ll make sure that gets taken care of.$B$BThank you, $n.',0),(28446,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ariok is covered in blood and sweat.>$B$BThat was exactly what I needed.',0),(28447,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your kill count is adding up, $n. We\'re chipping away at them.$B$BAnd we are going to win.',0),(28448,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, the whelplings. I will take care of them.$B$BAs for the agreement I made with your father earlier, tell him that I will hold up my end of the bargain. You will have your dragon for the battle against the orcs.$B$BWe share your grudge against the Blackrock clan.',0),(28449,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, you\'re back.$B$BI hope you\'ve still got that disguise. You\'re going back undercover, $n.',0),(28450,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well would you look at that! My favorite soldier comes through in the clutch!$B$BI\'ll make sure to get this distributed among the ogres.$B$BI\'ll see you in Redridge, soldier. For the glory of the Blackrock!',0),(28451,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What are these? Oh, are these imps?$B$BI\'m pretty sure that imps don\'t just fall asleep in boxes!$B$BI\'ll take your word for it, though. I don\'t understand any of this warlock crap. Leave them in the corner.',0),(28452,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pff! You\'re late! Do you know how long I\'ve been waiting for Ner\'gosh to deliver this orb?$B$B<Xi\'lun looks down at the orb, then up at you.>$B$BThere\'s something strange about this orb... it\'s too...$B$B<Xi\'lun trails off.>$B$BNever mind, it must be my nerves talking. Thank you for the delivery. For blood and honor!',0),(28454,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Eitrigg looks over the devastation below.>$B$BOur job is almost done, $n. It\'s time to deliver the deathblow.',0),(28455,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Eitrigg bows.>$B$BWelcome home, boys.',0),(28456,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You peer inside, and find...',0),(28457,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The warchief will be most interested in seeing these plans. You are a most loyal member of the Horde.',0),(28458,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ureda looks through the grimoire with interest.>$B$BThere\'s a wealth of arcane knowledge in this book! We will learn much about our enemies and the arcane arts.',0),(28459,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The binding stones you brought back are exceedingly powerful. Not only have we dealt a blow to the Horde\'s enemies, but you have also discovered a fascinating source of power.',0),(28461,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Can you imagine what would happen if they got these models working and into the field? You\'ve done a great service for the Horde, $n.',0),(28463,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The poison should decimate their ranks if they\'re slow in discovering the tainted rations. Even if it does not kill most of the troops, we will have delayed them significantly. Well done.',0),(28465,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your actions honor the ancestors and the Horde, $n.',0),(28466,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Without those weapons, the Dark Irons will never be a match for the Horde. You have served your brothers and sisters well this day, $n.',0),(28473,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your actions honor your brethren and the Horde, $n.',0),(28474,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will not dissuade Twilight\'s Hammer, but perhaps it will increase the suspicion between them and the Dark Irons.',0),(28475,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We can only hope your efforts will keep the two forces apart long enough for us to exploit their weakness.',0),(28476,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We can only hope that the confusion and distrust you have created enables us to keep our enemies divided.',0),(28477,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I shoulda asked you to mind control the cultists and truly tear our enemies apart. But what you did will work, $n.',0),(28478,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s the way you do it when you don\'t have an army. And now, Twilight\'s Hammer won\'t, either.',0),(28480,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are a valuable ally, $n.  We are one step closer to defeating the enemy. ',0),(28482,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Glad you could make it, $n! ',0),(28483,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent job, $n.  Our troops will hear of your deeds. ',0),(28486,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it, $n!  Excellent! ',0),(28488,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is exactly what I was seeking. Thank you, $R.',0),(28491,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work! More pets for Kibler!',0),(28493,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you\'re the reinforcements? I suppose you\'ll do fine as long you can kill night elves.',0),(28496,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We could sure use some help out here.',0),(28497,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n. Now let\'s see if we can make our way up there before they\'re able to recover. ',0),(28498,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent.  Let\'s see if we can find anything of importance. ',0),(28499,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps you are as powerful as I\'ve heard afterall. You have our gratitude. ',0),(28500,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is true then?  It does exist! ',0),(28501,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We did it, $n!  We held Nahom. ',0),(28502,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thank you, $n.  These savages must be punished for what they\'ve done here. ',0),(28503,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve arrived just in time, $C. We need your help to hold off the Grimtotem.',0),(28504,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Horde forces in Thousand Needles desperately need your help.',0),(28505,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s about time you arrived, $C.',0),(28506,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The time to act is now. The Stormpike must be crushed!',0),(28507,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have to persuade the goblins of Gadgetzan to side with us, $C.',0),(28508,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s about time you arrived, $C.',0),(28509,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I could use your help, $C. That blasted gnome is trying to persuade the Steemwheedle Cartel to favor her side!',0),(28510,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There is much wrong in Feralas. I am glad to have your help.',0),(28511,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Elune has favored us with your arrival, $C. There is much to do.',0),(28512,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well whadda we have here? You here to help?',0),(28514,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебя прислал Скользорук? Ха!$b$bА он когда-нибудь рассказывал тебе, почему его так прозвали? Спроси его об этом как-нибудь.',19342),(28515,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, Oilfist sent you? Hah!$B$BDid he ever tell you how he got the name Oilfist? You\'ll have to ask him about that one sometime.',0),(28520,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is done.  We have defeated the Neferset inside their own city. I wish I could say that there is peace for my people at last, but I only foresee more bloodshed. ',0),(28521,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $C - I stand guard here as both a speaker for the Timbermaw here in Winterspring and as a defender of the tribe.$B$BOur Winterfall brethren here in this frigid land have fallen under the same corruptive sway as the furbolg of Felwood. If you\'ve come here offering the Timbermaw furbolgs aid, then we are ready to accept such an offer.',0),(28523,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Once again, you prove your honor to us! I will make sure that your deeds are known amongst my kind.$B$BRemember to bring any of the Winterfall\'s beads you find to me. For each set you continue to bring to me, I will speak on your behalf to the tribe.',0),(28524,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, how nice of those dear furbolg. I feel so bad for them, cooped up in that hold, afraid of the world.$B$BBut can you blame them? These Winterfall furbolg are turning just as vicious as any in Felwood. I\'d like to put a stop to it... if only for the sake of my own research, let alone the dear Timbermaw.',0),(28525,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My team of explorers, researchers, and scientists is the finest in Azeroth, but we need all the help we can get to discover the truth about the crater\'s history and its denizens.',0),(28526,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $C. My scientists and explorers will be glad to have your help.',0),(28527,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Cenarion Hold.',0),(28528,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Cenarion Hold.',0),(28529,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where did you find these?! You haven\'t shown them to anyone else, have you?$B$BI apologize. You took me off guard. Telarius was a very powerful Demon Hunter, but he was slain during a confrontation with the warden, Maeiv, many years ago. You are fortunate that his ghost was only a shade of his former power. I wonder how many have found their way to him in those ruins.$B$BI will see to it that these scrolls make their way to the high priestess immediately. Thank you, $n.',0),(28532,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you\'re to deploy to Stonetalon? Good, we\'ll need your abilities to defeat the Alliance there.',0),(28533,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very well, it looks like it\'s time.  Stay and watch if you so please. ',0),(28538,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Melisara\'s voice pervades your thoughts.>$B$BThe humans will serve us in life and in death. I will be in contact with you shortly.',0),(28542,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome. My brothers and I are dedicated to the redemption and rejuvenation of this once-sacred forest.',0),(28545,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps you can help me make sense of my discoveries about the source of the Winterfall Furbolgs\' strength.',0),(28551,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'re facing heavy resistance from the Horde, $C. Any reinforcements are welcome.',0),(28552,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Deserters from the city guards are spreading discontent in the ranks. We have to get to the bottom of this before it undermines our defenses.',0),(28553,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, well, well... look what the Ruag dragged in!',0),(28554,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If we can get things straightened out here, we have a chance to strike at the Alliance while most of their forces are busy in the Barrens.',0),(28556,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Once Melisara is through with you we will detonate the explosives!',0),(28558,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There are wonders just waiting to be discovered beyond this valley. And they will be ours!',0),(28560,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your arrival here is fortuitous, $C. We cannot fight the Scourge without help.',0),(28561,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n!  It\'s you!  My regiment was ambushed on our way here. Our captain was slain, leaving me in command... until you got here, that is... sir! ',0),(28562,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Murder, rookie. That\'s what you\'re looking at on the ground in front of us.',19116),(28563,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Heard Westfall was in some deep doody.$B$B<Parker doesn\'t even turn to face you.>$B$BWell, we got our own set of problems here. See them gnolls out there? Looks like they\'re actin\' up again. I don\'t like it. Don\'t like it one bit.',0),(28564,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are the help that we requested?$B$B<Althea sighs.>$B$BI suppose you will have to do.',0),(28565,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We haven\'t gotten much in the way of reinforcements lately. We can use every pair of hands we can get.',0),(28566,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Melisara\'s voice pervades your thoughts.>$B$BThey will see the bloodshed and they will hesitate. Hesitation will make them think twice about ever attacking us again.',0),(28567,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Have our leaders finally heard my pleas? We\'re down to just a handful of pilots and mountaineers to defend Loch Modan.',0),(28568,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Most excellent! A new recruit has arrived. There is much to do... much to do I say.',0),(28569,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Time is money, $C... and I\'ve got plenty of each.$B$BWhat can I do for you?',0),(28570,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Time is money, $C... and I\'ve got plenty of each.$B$BWhat can I do for you?',0),(28571,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was wondering when reinforcements would show up. Suit up, $n. It\'s time to dispense some justice!',0),(28572,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'At last, the Warchief\'s reinforcements have arrived. The Dark Lady has plans for you, as she does for us.',0),(28573,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Would that you were a company, but we\'ll have to make do with with what we have.',0),(28575,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is this all the warchief can spare? Don\'t worry, you\'ll be put to good use.',0),(28576,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There is much to be done here. Both of our enemies are relentless and would slaughter us without mercy the moment we sheathe our blades.',0),(28577,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps you can help, $C.',0),(28578,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps you can help, $C.',0),(28579,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You must be here to help Fuselight! Let\'s get you to the Badlands right away.',19116),(28580,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sure, I can get you to the Badlands, but when you get there, I want you to agree to help my comrades.',0),(28581,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We, too, are suspicious of the Dark Irons\' recent activities.',0),(28582,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We, too, are suspicious of the Dark Irons.',0),(28587,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You come from Tarren Mill? You reek of death...',0),(28596,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s more like it. We should be able to mop this up from here.',0),(28597,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, that\'ll do \'er.$B$B<Flintlocke stuffs some of the powder in his mouth.>$B$BOhhh, fresh. Heady. Redridge fine grain with a hint of Westfall sulphur and a mild aftertaste. Highbank gets the good stuff.',0),(28598,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Flintlocke wipes tears from his eyes.>$B$BOh, $n. $n!$B$BThat ... were beautiful.',0),(28599,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The King himself sent you? Good to hear that Stormwind is secure.$B$BI was expecting more in the way of troops, but word is that the Alliance fleet was ambushed by the Horde on the way here. They gave as good as they got, but the fleet is in shambles.$B$BIf we\'re to make any forward progress here in the Highlands, we\'re going to need the help of heroes like you.',0),(28600,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<High Warlord Cromush\'s face turns white.>$B$BTHEY HAVE FORSAKEN US? THEY HAVE FORSAKEN THE HORDE? This cannot be!$B$BI...$B$B<Cromush falls to one knee.>$B$BI... I WILL BE FINE. We will do this without their aid. To hell with the Frostwolf!',0),(28602,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Something tells me I\'m going to need this. ',0),(28603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Melisara\'s voice pervades your thoughts.>$B$BPerfectly handled. You could easily be a Deathstalker. And what could they have even done to you? You acted in self defense!$B$BNow to deal with the final finger.',0),(28604,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They won\'t die immediately, but they WILL die! When they finally piece together who was responsible for the deaths of their soldiers, you will be long gone - a phantom of death!',0),(28605,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With the Stormpike forces maimed, the time has come for detonation!',0),(28607,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You lost your Keys to the Hot Rod somewhere?$B$BNo problem, boss. I always like to keep a spare set handy just in case.',0),(28611,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The waters of the river are nearly cleansed.  Our prophetic visions will soon return. ',0),(28612,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lucky fer you, this ol\' dwarf\'s still got a few tricks up his sleeve!$B$BHeehee! ...shoulda seen tha look on yer faces!',0),(28613,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So far, so good...',0),(28614,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your actions prove yourself a mighty warrior to me and all the Timbermaw!$B$BLet us hope the Winterfall will be defeated for good now...',0),(28615,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the Winterfall never threaten the Timbermaw again. Thank you, $n.',0),(28616,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With the fingers destroyed and the hand shattered, the Stormpike will have no choice but to scurry back to their cave in Alterac Valley.$B$B<Cromush spits.>$B$BWarchief Hellscream will hear about your bravery, $n.$B$BAnd rest assured that he will know of the Frostwolf clan\'s treason!',0),(28617,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think that was just the start of it, bud! MORE INCOMING!',0),(28619,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'At last, the Warchief\'s reinforcements have arrived. The Dark Lady has plans for you, as she does for us.',0),(28621,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Of course I have a plan for moving the coffer. Someday, maybe the old coot will learn to trust me. ',0),(28622,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work, lad. Looks as tho everything made the trip in one piece. I\'m beginnin\' ta see why junior keeps ye around. ',0),(28623,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve arrived just in time, $n. ',0),(28633,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Of course! I had a hunch this is what we\'d find. Had no idea about the organic transformations, though, I must admit. There\'s more to this old relic than I\'d dared to hope. ',0),(28649,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Felt good, didn\'t it? You\'re not one of them anymore, $n. You\'re Scourge. You\'re one of us. Forever...',0),(28650,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Felt good, didn\'t it? You\'re not one of them anymore, $n. You\'re Scourge. You\'re one of us. Forever...',0),(28651,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the Dark Lady watch over you, $n. ',0),(28655,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We did it, $n! Fighting that ... thing side-by-side really brought all the Wildhammers together. The heads of the families are more united than I\'ve ever seen them. Drink up, $n, and celebrate!!$B$BOf course, our work is only beginning. I\'ll rally our new Wildhammer reinforcements with the rest of the Alliance and prepare to storm the Twilight Bastion.$B$BI\'m sure we\'ll meet again soon.',0),(28666,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s time for the Blackrock orcs to feel the full wrath of the Alliance. They will pay for what they\'ve done.',0),(28667,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We must stop the Blackrock orcs before they can expand their influence.',0),(28671,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our enemies are numerous, $C. It will take skill and bravery to overcome them all.',0),(28673,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For decades has the garrison at Nethergarde held firm against the threat of the Horde and we do not intend to surrender now.',0),(28675,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Bogpaddle, $C. I fully expect you will enjoy all our facility has to offer.',0),(28677,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to beautiful Bogpaddle!',0),(28688,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'At last, the Warchief\'s reinforcements have arrived.',0),(28699,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to our camp, $C, such as it is.',0),(28704,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Hardwrench Hideaway!',0),(28705,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Prepare yourself for battle. The Horde has need of you here.',0),(28709,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Экспедиции нужна твоя помощь, |3-6($c).',19342),(28711,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Warsong Offensive could use more like you, $C.',0),(28712,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello again, $R. I hear you were instrumental in our push toward Grim Batol - thank you!$B$BAlexstrasza has sanctified this ground in the hopes of luring Deathwing here. She\'ll perform a ceremony to lure him out... and then destroy him within this sacred circle.$B$BLet\'s hope her plan works.',0),(28716,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are pleased that you have answered our summons, $C.',0),(28721,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You saved our men! No words can express our gratitude $n.',0),(28733,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'PHEW! That was close! You\'re a real natural with these plants, $C. You know, I brought the seeds here with me from Lost Isles. I figure once I get them all figured out I\'ll make a fortune in the deadly flower business!$B$BWha... LOOK! MORE ARE COMING!',0),(28734,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ilthalaine sent you? He was wise to do so. I am indeed in need of help. ',0),(28736,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The enemy on Maker\'s Ascent remain a threat, but with your help we\'ve dealt a serious blow to their numbers and their morale.',0),(28744,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think that made Stillwater angry. He\'s sending the heavy-hitters after us now. No time to lose, friend, let\'s go!',0),(28747,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'D... Do you hear that rumblin\'? I think Stillwater is comin\'! HOLY MOLY LOOK OUT!',0),(28748,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t believe we defeated him, $n! That was the toughest fight yet, but there are still hundreds of crazed zombies roaming around Hillsbrad. We\'ll need to stay alert.',0),(28750,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s about time you arrived, $C.',0),(28751,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'ll keep \'em out for today, but I know they\'ll be back tomorrow. Hopefully you\'ll be around to help me.',0),(28755,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is indeed one of the lost volumes! Tyrosus will be most pleased when he learns of your find.',0),(28756,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your deeds do honor to those who fell in battle defending this hallowed ground.',0),(28758,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks to your quick action, the Dragon Queen still lives. She is being brought back to Wyrmrest to recover.$B$BBut the battle wasn\'t a complete failure. Deathwing was gravely wounded. I suspect he will go into hiding to recuperate. Alexstrasza has bought us time to strike!',0),(28762,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gвыиграл:выиграла; для нас еще немного времени, $n, но сейчас у нас есть еще большие проблемы. ',0),(28764,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gвыиграл:выиграла; для нас еще немного времени, $n, но сейчас у нас есть еще большие проблемы. ',0),(28765,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gвыиграл:выиграла; для нас еще немного времени, $n, но сейчас у нас есть еще большие проблемы. ',0),(28766,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gвыиграл:выиграла; для нас еще немного времени, $n, но сейчас у нас есть еще большие проблемы. ',0),(28768,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank goodness you\'re here. I\'ve discovered the secret of the fierce Winterfall furbolg.',0),(28770,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Молодчина, $n. Ты $gоказался:оказалась; ценным приобретением для нашего гарнизона. Настало время тренировки! ',0),(28772,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Молодчина, $n. Ты $gоказался:оказалась; ценным приобретением для нашего гарнизона. Настало время тренировки! ',0),(28773,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Молодчина, $n. Ты $gоказался:оказалась; ценным приобретением для нашего гарнизона. Настало время тренировки! ',0),(28774,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Молодчина, $n. Ты $gоказался:оказалась; ценным приобретением для нашего гарнизона. Настало время тренировки! ',0),(28785,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s true, we were ambushed. I don\'t dare send any more soldiers out there and risk losing them too. I need a volunteer. Someone willing to risk their life! ',0),(28787,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s true, we were ambushed. I don\'t dare send any more soldiers out there and risk losing them too. I need a volunteer. Someone willing to risk their life! ',0),(28788,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s true, we were ambushed. I don\'t dare send any more soldiers out there and risk losing them too. I need a volunteer. Someone willing to risk their life! ',0),(28789,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s true, we were ambushed. I don\'t dare send any more soldiers out there and risk losing them too. I need a volunteer. Someone willing to risk their life! ',0),(28790,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May your sense of honor and duty serve Azeroth well, $C.',0),(28793,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That will teach those monsters! They\'ll think twice before taking another mercenary job for orcs. ',0),(28794,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That will teach those monsters! They\'ll think twice before taking another mercenary job for orcs. ',0),(28795,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That will teach those monsters! They\'ll think twice before taking another mercenary job for orcs. ',0),(28796,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That will teach those monsters! They\'ll think twice before taking another mercenary job for orcs. ',0),(28797,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That will teach those monsters! They\'ll think twice before taking another mercenary job for orcs. ',0),(28798,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'After a few moments, you are able to use the keystone and reveal the secret of the water....',0),(28799,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah ha! You knew you\'d seen this level of craftsmanship before. Now, with the final piece...',0),(28800,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It appears as if this particular brazier has trapped a minor djinn, and freeing him would certainly bring a reward. Right?',0),(28801,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Using the keystone, you confirm the grave is from one of the original builders, and you learn important details of the mummification process.',0),(28802,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes... \'X\' marks the spot! This is a detailed map of the dungeon, a valuable find indeed.',0),(28803,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'After comparing the two very closely, you are sure these are the remains of the Wildhammer. The treachery committed against them fills your heart with anger.',0),(28804,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Interesting! It seems as if the Dark Iron dwarves had a strategic plan in the case of an elemental invasion. As the elemental forces are ageless and unchanging, it seems as if these ancient techniques are still viable even today.',0),(28805,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that your eyes have seen the truth, where will you choose to serve?',0),(28807,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is Anduin investigating the Twilight Hammer? Aren\'t you supposed to be keeping him out of trouble?$b$bHmm. Let me see those medallions.',19342),(28809,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think you now understand the power of the Light. The Light giveth hope, brother and the Light taketh from the darkness! BLESSED BE THE LIGHT! ',0),(28810,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think you now understand the power of the Light. The Light giveth hope, brother and the Light taketh from the darkness! BLESSED BE THE LIGHT! ',0),(28811,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think you now understand the power of the Light. The Light giveth hope, brother and the Light taketh from the darkness! BLESSED BE THE LIGHT! ',0),(28812,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think you now understand the power of the Light. The Light giveth hope, brother and the Light taketh from the darkness! BLESSED BE THE LIGHT! ',0),(28813,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think you now understand the power of the Light. The Light giveth hope, brother and the Light taketh from the darkness! BLESSED BE THE LIGHT! ',0),(28816,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lok\'tar, brother! You have arrived just in time.',0),(28819,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With your help we have managed to secure the northern and western sectors of Northshire. We still have a rather large contingency of Blackrock orcs to the east and they\'ve begun burning down the forest! ',0),(28820,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With your help we have managed to secure the northern and western sectors of Northshire. We still have a rather large contingency of Blackrock orcs to the east and they\'ve begun burning down the forest! ',0),(28821,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With your help we have managed to secure the northern and western sectors of Northshire. We still have a rather large contingency of Blackrock orcs to the east and they\'ve begun burning down the forest! ',0),(28822,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With your help we have managed to secure the northern and western sectors of Northshire. We still have a rather large contingency of Blackrock orcs to the east and they\'ve begun burning down the forest! ',0),(28823,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With your help we have managed to secure the northern and western sectors of Northshire. We still have a rather large contingency of Blackrock orcs to the east and they\'ve begun burning down the forest! ',0),(28824,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Therazane\'s eyes appear slightly more crystalline than you recall.>$B$BOzruk has been reclaimed by the earth.$B$BTake your reward and leave me be, $n. I wish to be left alone.',0),(28832,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You two are the last thing I expected to see fall from the sky. Highbank is under attack!',0),(28834,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What is this? You... rescuing me?$B$B<Erunak smiles at you.>$B$BThis will take some getting used to.',0),(28836,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n!$B$BKnow that without your aid, things would be far different here.$B$BNot only would I be long dead, but the naga and their allies would have free reign over the sea.$B$BThe king himself shall hear of your heroism in this realm.',0),(28845,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You actually came here looking for me?',0),(28852,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is great news, $n! I\'m glad our drakes were able to assist you. Thank you for rescuing them from the clutches of Twilight\'s Hammer.',0),(28857,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For decades has the garrison at Nethergarde held firm against the threat of the Horde and we do not intend to surrender now.',0),(28858,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our enemies are numerous, $C. It will take skill and bravery to overcome them all.',0),(28859,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Cenarion Hold, traveler.',0),(28860,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, that\'s how it\'s done! With heroes like you taking care of business, I\'m proud to be a part of the Alliance.',0),(28861,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh aye, quite a haul!$B$BThis\'ll last me until... oh say probably tomorrow.',0),(28862,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh hey, yer just in time! I was working up a huge appetite, workin\' so hard to feed these hungry refugees. Yessir.',0),(28863,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Grim business, but well done all the same. Thank you, $n.',0),(28864,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Go figure. Never thought I\'d develop a taste for imported draft. Thanks, $n!',0),(28865,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Silithus, such a worthless piece of land. It is a wonder that the great cataclysm did not sunder it fully!',0),(28867,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Silithus, not such a great place, eh? We get a lot of you from there...',0),(28870,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hail, $n. Nadun spoke highly of you.$B$BAre you here to aid us?',0),(28871,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look what we have here! A single Horde $C can demolish the Wildhammer by the dozen. What hope do they have now?',0),(28872,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, yes. Burn them out, as you would flush groundhogs from their holes...$B$BWell done, $n.',0),(28873,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Griff greedily snatches the heap of food, enough to feed dozens of men.>$B$BGreat! This\'ll tide me over for ... hours!',0),(28874,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You made that look easy, $n.$B$BGet the Wildhammer off of their mounts and they\'re nothing!',0),(28875,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The High Shaman has been brought down! Thundermar will no doubt try to send others, but on this day, the Dragonmaw are triumphant.',0),(28876,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re the reinforcements that Thork sent?$B$BYou\'ll do fine as long you can kill night elves. The forest is crawling with them.',0),(28877,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I suppose my reputation grows. Yes, yes I kill harpies. I don\'t enjoy it. But their raids on our supply caravans must cease, and someone\'s got to organize a resistance.',0),(28878,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A small tag on this present reads:$B$BHappy holidays, $n!',0),(28879,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It sounds like little Roo had a great time this week. I know he was getting awfully lonely in the orphanage and was eager to make some new friends. Thank you so much for agreeing to look after him.',0),(28880,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for agreeing to care for Kekek this week. I know he can be a handful, but I think that with more individual attention and a few more friends, he\'ll do a lot better. No doubt he\'s going to be telling stories of his adventures with you for weeks.',0),(28881,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What, you here to help?',0),(28885,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh no! My weapons and totems!$B$BThey\'re destroyed!!!',0),(28909,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Sauranok nods toward you.>$B$B$C.',0),(28912,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Desecrate the Alliance\'s Badlands bonfire!',0),(28915,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Desecrate the Alliance\'s Stonetalon Mountains bonfire!',0),(28921,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Desecrate the Alliance\'s Un\'Goro bonfire!',0),(28923,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Azshara flame.',0),(28931,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Western Plaguelands flame.',0),(28933,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Un\'Goro Crater flame.',0),(28934,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin\'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya.',0),(28935,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good job, kid. You deserve a little somethin\'. And hey, come back tomorrow if you get the time; I might have a job for ya.',0),(28951,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(28952,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(28953,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(28954,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(28955,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(28956,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(28957,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(28958,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(28959,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(28960,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(28961,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(28962,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(28963,0,0,0,0