,0),(29015,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at the size of that thing! We\'re going to be rich! Let\'s see, according to the rates I\'ve seen on gems going into Undermine, I should be able to figure out your cut - fifty percent, don\'t worry!$B$BNow let\'s see... I think this should do about right. Pleasure doing business with you, $n.',0),(29016,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(29017,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(29018,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(29019,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(29020,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(29021,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A variety of buttons, levers, and blinking lights are somewhat erratically arrayed on the face of the control console. A small gauge indicates that the apparatus is currently operating within optimal levels, and indicates that control valves one through three are currently open. There is a small keyhole set into the lower right side of the control panel.',0),(29022,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The lights indicating the three control valves dim as they are shut off. Green lights slowly fade into yellow, and the switch controlling the apparatus is now moveable, with the valves closed, it can be turned off.',0),(29023,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Turning the key in the lock, the control console unlocks. A red light at the top of the console turns off and all power drains from the terminal.',0),(29024,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is... er... interesting... yes. A device this complex is best analyzed by a team of skilled engineers in a clean room, painstakingly reverse engineering each component in a controlled environment.$B$BBut who has that kind of time?$B$BLet\'s just fire this thing up and see what it does...',0),(29026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, what\'s this? A samophlange, you say? What\'s a samophlange??$B$BAh... but look at the way it moves when you handle it. And there\'s the sound of intricate gears inside. Oh my! I want to fix it and see what it does, don\'t you??',0),(29027,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great, you got them! Now I can get to work...',0),(29032,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These cubs are just the right age to begin their training. A few of them even have the proper traits to be trained as mounts. As promised, I\'ll select one of these cubs for you to train. This fellow here seems to have an affinity for you.$B$BI\'ll train the more common, docile cubs for the market in Darnassus.',0),(29034,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It looks like you\'ve done an admirable job of raising your cub, $n. Your saber has grown up to be strong, healthy, and loyal. Both of you are well-matched.$B$BYour Winterspring frostsaber will respond to your call anytime you wish to ride together.',0),(29035,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your Winterspring cub looks happy, satisfied, and ready to curl up for a nap.',0),(29037,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your cub looks satisfied for now.',0),(29038,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your Winterspring cub looks tired, content, and perhaps a bit more experienced.',0),(29039,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your cub looks tired, content, and perhaps a bit more experienced.',0),(29040,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your Wintersrping cub seems thrilled with its new toy, but there\'s no telling how well it will survive the cub\'s enthusiasm.',0),(29051,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your Winterspring cub seems thrilled with its new toy, but there\'s no telling how well it will survive the cub\'s enthusiasm.',0),(29052,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your Winterspring cub looks happy, satisfied, and ready to curl up for a nap.',0),(29053,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your cub looks satisfied for now.',0),(29054,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That will show those foolish crones who the strongest is.$B$BTake these treats and treat yourself to something nice, $C.',0),(29067,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent!',0),(29073,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Veterans of Northrend, Warchief Garrosh commands you to return to Orgrimmar at once! You will be the blade the Horde wields against Deathwing and his Twilight\'s Hammer minions.$B$BUse the attached hearthstone to transport yourself to Orgrimmar. Our allies await your return, hero.',0),(29074,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Wickerman ceremony is a time honored tradition. It is good to see the Alliance celebrating it once again.',0),(29075,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do not let your burdens trouble you any longer. Any time you are feeling burdened, remember the Wickerman.',0),(29078,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gвыиграл:выиграла; для нас еще немного времени, $n, но сейчас у нас есть еще большие проблемы. ',0),(29079,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Молодчина, $n. Ты $gоказался:оказалась; ценным приобретением для нашего гарнизона. Настало время тренировки! ',0),(29080,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s true, we were ambushed. I don\'t dare send any more soldiers out there and risk losing them too. I need a volunteer. Someone willing to risk their life!',0),(29081,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That will teach those monsters! They\'ll think twice before taking another mercenary job for orcs.',0),(29082,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think you now understand the power of the Light. The Light giveth hope, brother and the Light taketh from the darkness! BLESSED BE THE LIGHT! ',0),(29083,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With your help we have managed to secure the northern and western sectors of Northshire. We still have a rather large contingency of Blackrock orcs to the east and they\'ve begun burning down the forest!',0),(29086,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks for recovering my blueprints. Now my work on the Silver Bullet X-831 can continue.',0),(29087,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You look around and notice the lake is covered in slick oil. This once beautiful oasis has been ravaged. You feel a deep sense of foreboding.',0),(29088,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good riddance! Those filthy pests are more trouble than they\'re worth.',0),(29089,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You saw sludge being dumped straight into the lake? I wouldn\'t be surprised if the Sludge Beast were a product of the Venture Co.\'s carelessness.',0),(29090,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. This old orc will sleep more safely at night.',0),(29093,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was the best! I want to come back and do this again next year. When I grow up, I\'m going to have a chopper, except I\'m gonna make it myself, and take all my friends for a ride!',0),(29094,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thought you were a goner. Glad to see you\'re still in one piece.',0),(29095,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello $n. I have heard of your deeds from Darsok. You are a valuable $C of the Horde, indeed.',0),(29100,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dere ya have it, $n. It look like we gonna lead an assault on da Gurubashi in Zul\'Gurub.$B$BDese be dire times for us Darkspear. But dey be even more dire for da Zandalar. Dey goin\' too far.$B$BYa been good to Bwemba, hopefully ya gonna continue to help out all of Stranglethorn.$B$BSpirits be wit\' ya, $n.',0),(29102,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Another Darkspear emissary passed through some time ago telling us to be on our guard.$B$BHe mentioned some other trolls may show up, but not in spirit form, and not escorted by a $R $C.',0),(29103,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks for the help, $n. These serpents, there doesn\'t appear to be an end to them.',0),(29104,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Venoxis... Dis can\'t be good, $n.',0),(29105,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We know all about the serpents, $n. But there is something else out there lurking... The jungle has come to life, $C!',0),(29106,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So King Magni didn\'t wanna become a diamond? That\'s really sad.$B$BHey, shamans work with rocks and the earth all the time, right? Maybe one day, they\'ll be able to help him become a dwarf again!',0),(29107,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was the best! Did you see when Malfurion cast those wings on me? The other orphans are going to be sorry they missed out on this trip!',0),(29109,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is terrible news! $n, at least you arrived safely.',0),(29110,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you came for me!',0),(29111,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Some days we gain quarter, other days we are beaten back behind our walls. Every day, we bury more of our brothers and sisters.$B$B<Kadrak pauses and takes a deep breath.>$B$BNot only have the supplies you brought strengthened our troops, but your heroic deeds have inspired them as well. Thank you, $C.',0),(29112,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'re back! Balgor made it down before you, and he\'s already eaten two bowls of raptor stew. Considering that his appetite hasn\'t suffered, I\'m sure he will be fit to travel in no time.$B$BI\'ll make sure that this artifact is taken care of. You\'ve done us a great service today.',0),(29114,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shhh....',0),(29116,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We be here... Da hunter, he be in da cave. Da beast... Sometin\' ain\'t right about her...',0),(29117,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks for the kite, $n. Every time I fly it, I\'ll remember the day you gave it to me!',0),(29118,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We be here... Da hunter, he be in da cave. Da beast... Sometin\' ain\'t right about her...',0),(29119,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do you think the apprentices mind freezing all that ice cream? I wish I got to make ice cream at school. That would make lessons a lot more fun, don\'t you think?',0),(29120,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Priestess Kilnara be behind dis abomination. Dis ain\'t looking good. We should see to da dwarf and then make our way to see what other trouble be going on.',0),(29121,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Th-thank ye, lad.$B$BPappy...?$B$B$BIs that...$B$B$B$Byou...$B$B$B$B$B...',0),(29124,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'First we had snakes, then we had panthers, now we have trolls.$B$BIt\'s good that you\'re here, we could use all the help we can get.',0),(29131,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks for giving us a bit of a breather, $n.$B$BLike I said before, your troll friend was here for a small amount of time. He warned us and then left.$B$BJames Stillair helped get him to his next destination, maybe he can help you out.$B$BGood luck out there, $n.',0),(29132,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is no whimsical dalliance that brings you here, mortal.$B$BMuster every fiber of your courage for what you are about to behold.',0),(29133,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dis don\'t look very good, $n.',0),(29135,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well, friend.$B$BBe still as I weave ancient magics to create the Timeless Eye.',0),(29144,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, much better, $n. Those crones in the Undercity have no idea how powerful we have become. Now I suppose you would like a reward.',0),(29145,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n. It is good to see you again. Our gate is nearly opened.',0),(29150,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We done enough, $n. We can\'t keep fighting dese zombies. We need to figure out da source of dis voodoo. An\' I tink I know where to start...',0),(29151,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zanzil... Dis is all startin\' to come together now. If I can find my contact den we can formulate a plan of attack. A way to end dis madness.',0),(29152,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I be tellin\' Baron Revilgaz about da Zandalar threat now...',0),(29153,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You killed them all? I wish that would ease my mind, but these guys seem to have a habit of coming back from the dead.$B$BAh, but what\'s that you have?$B$BYou say it might keep them out of Booty Bay?$B$BNow we are talking!$B$BOh right, I said I had a reward for you? Sure... Just give me a minute to find it.',0),(29154,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You killed them all? I wish that would ease my mind, but these guys seem to have a habit of coming back from the dead.$B$BAh, but what\'s that you have?$B$BYou say it might keep them out of Booty Bay?$B$BNow we are talking!$B$BOh right, I said I had a reward for you? Sure... Just give me a minute to find it.',0),(29155,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Loot at last!',0),(29157,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $r.  Dese be desperate times.  Da Zandalar trolls be ready to take back dere lands.',19116),(29172,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<T\'ara\'s tusks shift slightly. Is she smiling?>$B$BYou done well.$B$BWe gonna rest easy tonight knowin\' Jin\'do an\' Zanzil ain\'t gonna bind dem powerful beasts against us.',0),(29173,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jin\'do\'s empire crumbles around him like da ruins of dis forsaken city.',0),(29175,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Da great Gurubashi empire begin ta wither already.$B$BIt be only a matter of time, now.',0),(29186,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So dis is da fetish of da mighty Malacrass? It be a good addition to my collection, $n. And now, I believe, rewards be in order.',0),(29193,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are either a fool, or a lunatic. Regardless, you must return from whence you have come.$B$BWere you spotted by another of my brood, you would already have met your end.',0),(29194,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This cannot be, $C!$B$BIt must be some kind of trick!',0),(29195,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Leyara... she lives. I sense Fandral\'s hand at play here...',0),(29196,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What happened up there? I saw fire and... never mind, you can tell me later. We have other, more immediate matters to attend to.',0),(29197,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! You\'re back!$B$BThey\'ve pushed us back to the Sanctuary. We are vastly outnumbered. At this rate, the Guardians of Hyjal stand little chance of survival.$B$BI\'m glad you\'re here with us.',0),(29198,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Malorne\'s strength alone may have just saved Kalimdor. To imagine, Malorne has returned today, after so long an absence...$B$B<Malfurion surveys the area.>$B$BWe\'ve taken heavy losses. Though the immediate threat is no longer present, our forces will need time to heal, and to put out any remaining fires here in Hyjal.$B$BOur attack on the Firelands will have to wait.',0),(29199,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work. I will send for our reinforcements right away.',0),(29200,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Matoclaw listens intently as you explain what happened.>$B$B<She is visibly distressed.>$B$BYou deviated from our plan, $n. Our attack was supposed to happen today! All this preparation... how will we succeed without the aid of Hamuul?',0),(29201,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very well done, $C. We\'ve managed to take a foothold in our enemy\'s realm without their notice. Our armies are moving through to establish a front as we speak.$B$BWe have a long, brutal war ahead of us. It is my hope that you\'ll be around to help us see it through.',0),(29202,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, Hamuul lives. You can visit him in the tent behind me, but please, be careful. He is in a fragile condition, and we are doing everything in our power just to keep him alive and comfortable.$B$BWhoever did this to the Arch Druid showed no mercy. I hope that you are someday able to return the favor.',0),(29208,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Among all of the raptors in Mandokir\'s domain, one familiar face stands out. She\'s grown a little bigger, and she\'s earned a few scars, but the lashtail hatchling is still here.$B$BShe recognizes you. Her father has finally come back to save her.',0),(29213,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh... Me spine... Brother, is that you?',0),(29217,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hadn\'t expected to see dem again, $n. The information dey gathered will be da key to destroying Zandalari influence in Zul\'Aman. Ya have my thanks and da thanks of my scouts.',0),(29225,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kalecgos listens to your account of recent events.>$B$BIt was wise of Tarecgosa to send you to me, $C.$B$BThough your vision in the Nexus was almost certainly an elaborate illusion, it would be irresponsible of me not to investigate it.',0),(29229,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We be here... Da hunter, he be in da cave. Da beast... Sometin\' ain\'t right about her...',0),(29234,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nordrassil\'s Bough...$B$BYou have done well, mortal.',0),(29239,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nordrassil\'s Bough is now joined with the Timeless Eye.$B$BEven a battleworn hero such as yourself cannot help but be humbled by such a gift.',0),(29240,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'She is dying, $n.$B$BI have... failed her.',0),(29241,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Bloodslayer Zala clutches her hand to her chest.>$B$BIt be done, then. Spilling da blood of our brothers be a grim task. Da city of da Gurubashi has seen only death an\' hatred for years.$B$BMaybe it be time for da jungle ta retake Zul\'Gurub, an\' wash da scent of death from dis place.$B$BBlood and honor, champion, to da Siame-Quashi you will always be known as \"Bloodslayer\".',0),(29242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What have you got there?$B$BA crazy-looking snake idol? What am I supposed to do with this? Hit someone over the head with it and steal something that\'s actually valuable?$B$BThis thing is worthless!$B$B<Briney tosses the Bijou into the water.>$B$BThanks for the \"help,\" I guess. Here\'s your \"reward.\"$B$BIdiot.',0),(29251,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You killed them all? I wish that would ease my mind, but these guys seem to have a habit of coming back from the dead.$B$BAh, but what\'s that you have?$B$BYou say it might keep them out of Booty Bay?$B$BNow we are talking!$B$BOh right, I said I had a reward for you? Sure... Just give me a minute to find it.',0),(29261,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The tablet provides the final incantation to bind the voodoo pile\'s magic to you and your party!',0),(29262,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As you slip the tablet into the voodoo pile, a primal screech shatters the silence.',0),(29267,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The panther cub looks at you with a look in its eyes that says, \"Will you be my new dad?\"',0),(29269,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am grateful, $n.$B$BWere you not present, or had you refused, Tarecgosa would be lost to me.',0),(29270,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I sense that Tarecgosa is still with you.$B$BYou have done well, my friend.',0),(29285,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Arygos\'s machinations have been undone, thanks in great part to you, $C.$B$BAs my first act as aspect of the blue dragonflight, your bond with Tarecgosa is now made stable.$B$BThe power that once sustained that bond I now infuse into your staff.$B$BMay the Runestaff of Nordrassil serve you well!',0),(29307,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well, $n.$B$BNow prepare to receive a hero\'s reward.',0),(29308,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well, $n.$B$BNow prepare to receive a hero\'s reward.',0),(29309,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your heroic deeds will never be forgotten, $n.',0),(29312,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your heroic deeds will never be forgotten, $n.',0),(29313,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. There\'s no way I could\'ve found them all in time and it would be a shame to miss out on so much good kimchi!',0),(29318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Feeding all those sentinels is much easier with your help. Nobody had to wait in line for their meal this time.',0),(29323,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are beautiful! Thank you, $n. I\'ll set them out to dry.',0),(29324,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Astaia takes the pendant from you.>$B$BUnderneath all the slime and tarnish, I think this is it! Aquinne will be so happy to have this back... after a thorough cleaning, of course. I can\'t thank you enough, $n.',0),(29325,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are going to be delicious, I can already tell! Thanks, $n!',0),(29342,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are beautiful, $n! I think ye\'ve got the hang of it.',0),(29343,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n! Maybe seein\' yer catch will inspire more dwarves to take up fishin\'!',0),(29344,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ye\'ve done a good job. Squirky seems happy and I\'ve had some time to make some new lures. Thank ye fer the help!',0),(29347,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are beautiful, $n! Grimnur\'s goin\' tae be so proud when he hears about this!$B$BOh, he did say tae pass this along tae ye, if the scheme worked.',0),(29348,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your help is much appreciated, $n.$B$BHopefully these fish will go a long way towards restocking our fishing pond.',0),(29349,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, so many crayfish!$B$BDid you fish these up? Or simply swim after them?$B$BWell, no matter. Excellent work, $n.',0),(29350,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It doesn\'t look like anything I think a fish\'d be interested in, but ye never know. Fish\'re strange creatures. Thanks fer givin\' this a try, $n.',0),(29351,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A full guard is a happy guard, as I always say. Thanks fer yer help, $n.',0),(29352,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, that\'s exactly what I needed. Ye have me thanks, $n, and me apologies fer bein\' so brusque earlier. I just cannae stand the thought of not gettin\' a meal finished on time.',0),(29353,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ye got them all? Wonderful! I\'ll get started right away.',0),(29355,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That bread looks delicious. Thanks, $n.',0),(29356,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, well done! I tell ye, that Drugan\'s a true polymath -- explorer, historian, brewer -- is there anythin\' that man hasn\'t mastered?',0),(29357,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are well-made, $n. I hope you found baking as relaxing as I do.',0),(29359,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks! I wonder what I should do with this batch...',0),(29371,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, so it is done. A momentary setback, but if it is as annoying as their attacks have been, then it is worth it.$B$BI spoke to the children about your adventure and they were very excited. They were impressed with your bravery to venture into enemy territory. They also seemed to get a kick out of the mischief that you helped bring about... Oh those little rascals...$B$BThey did want you to have some of these treats as a reward. Enjoy, $n.',0),(29374,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That will show the fools in the Alliance who is the strongest.$B$BTake these treats and treat yourself to something nice, $C.',0),(29375,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I didn\'t notice a smell before, but I\'ve come to expect weak magic from those Alliance hags. However, the orc guards complained enough and will surely appreciate your efforts.',0),(29376,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'NOW is the time of the Forsaken! Power to the Forsaken - NOW AND FOREVER!!!',0),(29377,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, so it is done. A momentary set back, but if it is as annoying as their attacks have been, then it is worth it.$B$BThe children learned about your adventure and were very excited. They seemed to revel in the mayhem that you helped bring about... Oh those little rascals...$B$BThey did want you to have some of these treats as a reward. Enjoy, $n.',0),(29385,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A small tag on this present reads:$B$BHappy holidays, $n!',0),(29387,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for answering our call for aid, $n.',0),(29388,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for answering our call for aid, $n.',0),(29389,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for answering our call for aid, $n.',0),(29392,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This courier won\'t be meeting with his employer anytime soon and the crate he was hired to transport seems to have disappeared.',0),(29393,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That crash between here and Bladefist Bay really messed up the brew flow! It doesn\'t help that Dark Iron dwarves seem to be attacking every hour or so!$B$BSo if you want to help, here\'s the deal. I\'ll let you borrow one of my rams.$B$BEvery time you bring me a keg, I\'ll give you some tokens. I\'ll even let you use the ram for a bit longer for every keg you bring me!$B$BBUT, once you start this, you won\'t be able to do it again until tomorrow.$B$BAre you sure you\'re ready to do this?',0),(29396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что это? Купон на кружку? Любишь выпить? Отлично! Я дам тебе кружку, а ты пойди и выпей за мое здоровье! А потом еще немного выпей... А потом возвращайся сюда.$b$bВсе пути ведут ко мне, знаешь ли. Тебе придется отоваривать праздничные билеты, штампы защитника бочек и так далее.$b$bКороче, вот кружка. Приходи, еще поболтаем.',22624),(29397,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aww, it\'s just a stein voucher... Maybe you\'re just playing hard to get. So here\'s this year\'s stein for you.$B$BBut I suspect I\'ll be seeing a lot more of you. After all, if you want any Brewfest tokens redeemed, I\'m your girl...$B$BOr maybe I\'m his girl... $B$BOooohhh... or his...',0),(29398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Keep your voice down and don\'t let word of this get out or I\'m finished as an auctioneer!',0),(29399,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Finally, Cutler\'s given me something I can work with. Before I give up that information, I\'m going to want to know who you\'re working for.',0),(29400,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Wickerman ceremony is a time honored tradition. It is good to see the Horde joining us in celebration.',0),(29401,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is GREAT! You did it!$B$BThanks, mister!',0),(29402,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sometimes, I think I should\'ve followed my father into alchemy.$B$BThis concoction should protect us from the worst effects of carrying or handling the crate. Bottoms up!',0),(29403,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tendrils of dark power dance around the crate, but there\'s no trace of Sanath Lim-yo. You can now claim the crate and return it to your employer.',0),(29411,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you did manage to get the crate before Archmage Xylem\'s man could get it out of the city. Excellent!',0),(29413,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s been sought after, stolen, and sold. Anyone who tried to tap the magic held within has seen that power turn against him.$B$BYet, the crate itself appears unscathed and suffused with magical energy. From time to time, it shakes or bobs as if its contents were alive.$B$BIt seems to have an affinity for you and now, it\'s yours.',0),(29415,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This courier won\'t be meeting with his employer anytime soon and the crate he was hired to transport seems to have disappeared.',0),(29416,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Keep your voice down and don\'t let word of this get out or I\'m finished as an auctioneer!',0),(29425,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Leave it to Droffers to have a buyer lined up already. We should combine our efforts to track down this thief and keep the crate\'s contents from falling into the wrong hands.',0),(29426,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s see what I can remember from the alchemy lessons of my youth. If it explodes, I\'ve done something wrong.$B$BThis concoction should protect us from the worst effects of carrying or handling the crate.',0),(29427,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tendrils of dark power dance around the crate, but there\'s no trace of Sanath Lim-yo. You can now claim the crate and return it to your employer.',0),(29428,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I never thought you\'d be able to recover it. Well, let\'s see it.',0),(29429,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s been sought after, stolen, and sold. Anyone who tried to tap the magic held within has seen that power turn against him.$B$BYet, the crate itself appears unscathed and suffused with magical energy. From time to time, it shakes or bobs as if its contents were alive.$B$BIt seems to have an affinity for you and now, it\'s yours.',0),(29430,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What do you want?$B$BI\'m never going to finish my research, $R. It\'s my life\'s work, and now the courier with the experimental reagents I need is late!',0),(29431,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What do you want?$B$BCandace sent you? She knows me too well. I\'ve hit a rut in my research and I\'ve been waiting for a very important delivery, but the courier\'s late...',0),(29453,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let us begin, mortal.$B$BThere is little time to spare.',0),(29456,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What a splendid banner! I\'d love to have it for my collection.$B$BWould you be willing to trade it for some Darkmoon tickets?',0),(29458,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Потрясающая находка!$b$b<Профессор перелистывает страницы дневника.>$b$bНе все строки легко прочесть, но если хотя бы треть описанного в этом дневнике правда, то это настоящее сокровище. Я готов дать за него целую пачку купонов ярмарки Новолуния. Продашь?',19342),(29475,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It appears you are indeed ready for proper training. I dub you Goblin Engineer $n!$B$BYou\'ll be able to access any goblin engineer for some diabolical creations. Have fun and try not to blow your face off.',0),(29477,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today is the day you become a real engineer, $n. Don\'t worry about all those messy bombs and explosives, because it\'s time to shine!',0),(29481,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent!',0),(29482,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent!',0),(29506,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your creation looks promising. With any luck, we\'ll soon have a new favorite!$B$BThanks for your help!',0),(29507,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Они превосходны! Как раз такие, какие детям особенно понравится находить.',19342),(29508,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help, $n! Here\'s the payment I promised.',0),(29511,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты неплохо $gпотрудился:потрудилась;, ремонтируя эти танки. Вот, держи обещанную плату.',19702),(29512,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help, $n. It takes all of us to keep the faire up and running.',0),(29513,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are wonderful! Here are your tickets, as promised.',0),(29514,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Anytime the Darkmoon Faire is in town, I\'d be glad to have your help again.',0),(29515,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These look just like mine. You\'ve quite an eye for detail. Thank you for all your help, $n.',0),(29516,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very nice work, $n. You\'ve quite a talent for this.',0),(29517,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work! These look just like the others. Thank you for your help.$B$BIf you ever want to help again, look for me next time the Darkmoon Faire is in town.',0),(29518,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There\'s a good bit of scrap here. Thanks for your help. It\'ll be a big help when I refit the steam tonks.$B$BPlease take this as a reward for your help.',0),(29519,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks for the help, $n. I\'ll never forget your contribution to the Darkmoon Faire.$B$BAnd if you feel inclined, come back and help again next time we\'re in town.',0),(29527,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With their leadership dead their forces should be in disarray.$B$BBut there\'s far more to this than killing a few guards, $C.',0),(29530,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. We need the time you\'ve bought us to investigate this link between the fel orcs and the Burning Legion. You very well may have saved hundreds of lives through your actions.',0),(29535,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These vials could mean the end of the fel orcs. I hope you understand just how important that is to our campaign here.',0),(29536,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You tell Caza\'rez everything you saw in the Blood Furnace.>$B$BI see.$B$BIf they can do this to the Mag\'har brown orcs, they can do it to us! We must be careful lest they turn all of Thrallmar into those mindless beasts.',0),(29537,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The interference has gone down, but we still cannot access that area. We will continue to investigate the matter. Thank you for your help.',0),(29542,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shatterskull\'s not personable by anyone\'s standards, but he certainly gets the job done. Let\'s put you to work.',0),(29566,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'re you doing all the way down here? As you can see, it isn\'t exactly safe!',0),(29571,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Underbog lies precariously on the edge of becoming another part of the Coilfang naga system. You must help us!',0),(29582,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That meathead send you instead?$B$B<Artificer Morphalius looks you over.>$B$BI suppose you\'ll have to do.',0),(29593,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done! The long term effects of this attack will be far worse than slaying a few orcs could ever be.',0),(29595,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the Auchenai Crypts, $n, where our two worlds meet.',0),(29598,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебя прислала Тарета? То есть теперь у нее новый план? Ну, ладно...',19342),(29599,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gсделал:сделала; великое дело, $n. Однако память юного вождя об этих событиях должна оставаться такой же, как была прежде...',19342),(29609,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been expecting you! This inn is part of Sunreaver\'s Sanctuary, the Horde\'s enclave in Dalaran.$B$BDon\'t forget to bind your hearthstone here for easy travel to the city and access to the portal to Orgrimmar, out by the fountain.',0),(29611,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, good. You\'re here. And just in time...',20886),(29612,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, good. You\'re here. And not a moment too soon...',0),(29616,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank the stars you\'re here. We need your help!',0),(29640,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do you think you could help me get out of this cage? It\'s a bit cramped.',0),(29641,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, these are the soul devices that the Shadow Council were using to enhance their summoning power? Intriguing.',0),(29643,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Opening the magically-suspended tome, a sense of dread overwhelms you.$B$BSomething is most definitely wrong here!',0),(29644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I cringe to think what would have happened had Murmur escaped to the outside world.$B$BThank you, brave hero.',0),(29645,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It won\'t bring anyone back, but at least justice has been done.',0),(29646,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations, $n. While your traineeship was strictly honorary, your results were undeniably impressive. The young ones look up to you.$B$BGroundskeeper Wu had this prepared for you. Please, use it as you see fit.',0),(29647,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations, $n. While your traineeship was strictly honorary, your results were undeniably impressive. The young ones look up to you.$B$BGroundskeeper Wu had this prepared for you. Please, use it as you see fit.',0),(29649,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He was a good soldier.',0),(29650,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will sing many songs of his glories.',0),(29651,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Caza\'rez...is no more.',0),(29652,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If only we could have saved him.',0),(29653,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We should not forget the orc Kargath once was, nor the lessons to be learned from his downfall.',0),(29654,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have struck a major blow against the enemy with your help.$B$BHonor Hold is far safer than it\'s been in years.',0),(29655,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. This will show those blood crazed monsters what they\'re up against.',0),(29656,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My superiors will be very pleased to see this. Thank you.',0),(29657,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты отлично $Gпоработал:поработала;, $n, но предстоит сделать еще немало.',19342),(29658,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я очень благодарен тебе, $n.',19342),(29659,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well. Any advantage we can take away from Kael\'thas\' forces is to our benefit.',0),(29660,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кабы мы не вмешались, их бы скоро все равно убили содержавшиеся там существа. Это было сделано во имя большего блага.',25961),(29667,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well thus far, $n. However, there is still one more task I must ask that you complete.',0),(29674,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Существа Бездны по натуре своей всегда хаотичны. Они тоже являются необходимой частью Вселенной, но Свет должен все время приглядывать за ними.',25961),(29675,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Легион хочет забрать себе все. Они могут только потреблять; их не заботит баланс.',25961),(29681,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, $n. Своими действиями тебе сегодня удалось предотвратить множество трагедий.',25961),(29684,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'...Come closer, $R... Listen carefully to my words....',0),(29685,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Larethor listens intently as you explain your deeds in Magisters\' Terrace.>$B$BTyrith will be missed - good man, that one. Thanks to you though, his death wasn\'t in vain.',0),(29686,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent! I can\'t wait to present this project to my superiors!',0),(29687,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, soldier. One step at a time.',0),(29689,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Be quiet! We\'ll surely be overwhelmed if they notice us now.',0),(29690,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n!? $b$bI was told you were $gdead:dead... $b$bGlad you weren\'t. We have an Alliance to defeat!',20886),(29692,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, but we can always use more. Perhaps you will find yourself in the Underbog again soon?',0),(29694,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты нашел всего нескольких уцелевших?\r\n\r\nБыть посему. У нас нет выбора – будем играть теми картами, что нам раздала судьба.\r\n\r\n<Горрок вскидывает голову.>\r\n\r\nПлевать на размер отряда! Покажем, что мы герои!',26124),(29730,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, as you can see, none of this is Riko\'s fault.',0),(29731,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And that\'s how we found our Alliance captive.$B$BBut that\'s not all that happened. Not by a long shot...',0),(29749,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Allow me to introduce myself: I am Pei-Zhi, Master Spiritsage under the last pandaren emperor Shaohao.$B$BAt least... I was.',0),(29750,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $C.$B$BI can already sense the spirits within these bottles - they cry out with fear, confusion... rage.',0),(29751,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. With these, I can complete the ritual to send all of the spirits here--including myself--back where they belong.',0),(29752,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. I will take them with me into the nether.',0),(29753,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Their bodies had long since returned to the land - their spirits can now follow.',0),(29755,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This age must be one of great strife to breed heroes such as you. I can only imagine what adventures must lie ahead.$B$BIt has been my great honor to have met you, $n.$B$BI will remain here to usher out the last of the spirits before crossing the tan-chao myself.$B$BStill, I am disturbed by the spirit waker\'s dying curse...$B$B\"You will not stop the thunder.\"$B$BWhat could he have meant?',0),(29756,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. These mushrooms may not seem like much of an offering, but the sentiment alone will be enough to draw the spirits to us.$B$BAlso, they make a pretty fine stir-fry.',0),(29758,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My MY now look at THIS! What a beautiful shell!$B$BYou were wise to bring this to me, my friend. It will make a fantastic serving platter.$B$BPlease, take this for your troubles.',0),(29760,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $C.$B$BGaining but one trinket is not enough to make you a Master Pit Fighter.$B$BNow is the time to truly prove your steel.',0),(29761,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many foes have you bested and many crowds entertained.$B$BI am glad to name you Master Pit Fighter of the Darkmoon Deathmatch!',0),(29765,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Zin\'Jun sobs...you think.>$B$BDey done killed Snuff...$B$BWhat\'d \'ol Snuff ever do ta dem?',0),(29801,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve found one! You\'re a credit to your race, $N.$B$BRings like these are capable of decoding even the most complicated of ciphers. Unfortunately, the ring is inert until it is charged...',0),(29802,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s this about? \"Ravenholdt Manor?\" I thought that was just a motley band of thieves up in the Hillsbrad Foothills.$B$BWhat would they want with a dragon egg? More importantly, how did they find out about it?$B$BWe\'re going to need some answers, $N!',0),(29804,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zin\'jun is lost?$B$BThis is a dark day indeed, brother. These vermin will pay!',0),(29815,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, yes, $n. This will do nicely.',0),(29821,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Этот ящик должен быть полон припасов...',0),(29822,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, traveler.$B$BPlease, make yourself comfortable.',0),(29823,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah, I ran away. So blikkin\' what? If it weren\'t for me, Kiryn would be dead. Oh, wait... she\'s already dead... already...$B$BGo away! Riko\'s head hurts.',0),(29824,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The most important thing we learned was that... not only have the Alliance befriended the jinyu, but they\'re giving them weapons, and teaching them how to use them.$B$BThe Alliance now control a force that outnumbers us thirty-to-one. And we - the HORDE - have befriended monkeys.',0),(29827,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent! What a creative solution!$B$BThat should hold them off for a while.',0),(29835,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ya really did it?$B$BYou surpassed my expectations, mon. Take dis gift for bringin\' justice to da frozen wastes.',0),(29836,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'To\'kini be my cowardly father - too fearful to take up a position so near Gundrak... so he sent me!$B$BDis place be full of troll history. We can\'t let Gal\'darah and his crazed followers keep it hidden forever!',0),(29838,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, yeah mon! Dat be what I\'m lookin\' for.$B$BHere ya go - take somethin\' nice for your troubles.',0),(29840,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You be havin\' my thanks, mon.$B$BThese will be very useful to us, I\'m sure of it.',0),(29847,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, you will join with me?$B$BGood. Very good.',0),(29863,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our time to act is short. Loken prepares for war.',0),(29873,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This place... it... it so SAD!$B$BKen-Ken never seen a place so sad.',0),(29874,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m pretty sure this settlement wasn\'t here a few weeks ago. Where did these people come from?',0),(29875,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m pretty sure this settlement wasn\'t here a few weeks ago. Where did these people come from?',0),(29879,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wikket save hozen? And bring slickies?$B$BHmm, maybe wikket not so bad.$B$BTooki Tooki never liked Dook Ookem anyway...',0),(29890,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Как ты меня $gнашел:нашла;?$B$B<Вы рассказываете Андуину о своем видении.>$B$BПотрясающе! Именно так все и было несколько дней назад. С тех пор мы особо не высовываемся.',19342),(29891,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Какой удивительный образчик! И то, что ты преуспел, поражает до глубины души.',19342),(29892,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Там, откуда ты, есть кроколиски?',19342),(29893,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасный цвет, исключительная прозрачность, мерцание без излишнего блеска... результат вполне удовлетворительный.$B$BПохоже, у тебя талант, странное существо.',19342),(29895,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is Anduin\'s cloak, $n!$B$BThis must mean he passed through this forest.$B$BWe must heighten our efforts to find him.',0),(29898,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Целебные воды ненадолго снимут жар, но, боюсь, победить болезнь они не смогут.$B$BСпасибо, |3-6($c). По крайней мере мы выиграли немного времени.',19342),(29899,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо... Я... рад... духи... обрели покой.',19342),(29900,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ой, это же стихотворение! Ты... $Gпрочел:прочла; его? Где этот дол?',19342),(29901,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что-что он сделал?!$B$BЕму повезло, что я его еще не нашел, потому что я его задушу собственными руками, когда найду!$B$BО чем он только думает... ищет эту долину... Принцам не подобает так себя вести!$B$BЕсли бы у нас не было более срочных дел, за ним по моему приказу гнался бы уже весь флот!',19342),(29922,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Твои деяния напомнили мне о давно забытом древнем пророчестве. В этом следует разобраться.$b$bНо для того чтобы разобраться в этом, мне нужен нефрит. Я поручил Тое собрать столько, сколько он сможет, а затем отдать тебе. Принеси мне его, и мы попробуем расшифровать древнее \"Знамение Императора\".$b$bПока он собирает нефрит, можешь побродить здесь. Кому-то из горожан вполне может потребоваться помощь профессионала твоего уровня.',19342),(29933,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Woot! Woot! Wikket da Ook Dook!',0),(29934,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So far so good. Are you ready to do some spying?',0),(29935,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm.$B$BMean wikkets fighting with nice wikkets?$B$BHozen fight mean wikkets too!',0),(29936,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impressive work, $n.$B$BIt had not occurred to me that we might somehow befriend these creatures.$B$BWith their acceptance, we can now turn our attention to more important matters.',0),(29937,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah!$B$BNow that\'s the stuff. Just you wait and see...',0),(29939,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve just revolutionized how these cretins.. err, hozen, feed themselves.$B$BThey\'ll never be the same!',0),(29941,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work $n.$B$BThe away team you assembled has departed.$B$BI hope Gorrok had the sense to change out of that ragged red shirt. I admire his patriotism, but he\'s had it on since we left Orgrimmar.$B$BThey won\'t be surprising anyone if he\'s wearing it...',0),(29942,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now everybody got grub! Great hozen wisdom in Eekle Eekle.$B$BMaybe Eekle Eekle become Chieftain someday...',0),(29943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes!$B$BBy Thrall\'s bloodied fist, I\'ve missed hunting Alliance!',0),(29966,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Alliance must be purged from this land, $n!$B$BNo half-measures will do!',0),(29967,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'d say repelling the attack is an understatement!',0),(29968,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, the smell of progress, and methane.',0),(29971,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We may have a problem.',0),(30006,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Every sha slain is another turn in the tide.',0),(30015,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $n!$B$BWelcome to Dawn\'s Blossom, a home of my people.$B$BSadly I must depart. Alas, a Lorewalker\'s work is never done.$B$BMake yourself at home. Our people could surely make use of one with your talents.',0),(30039,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today is the day when your fate will be decided. Do you have the strength and cunning to be a $C? Or are you destined to a life working in the fields?$B$BEach has its place, but I can sense that you aspire to greatness.$B$BLet us begin our training, my newest pupil.',0),(30040,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today is the day when your fate will be decided. Do you have the intellect and force of will necessary to be a $C? Or are you destined to a life scribing in the dusty libraries?$B$BEach has its place, but I can sense that you aspire to greatness.$B$BLet us begin our training, my newest pupil.',0),(30041,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today is the day when your fate will be decided. Do you have the compassion and the keen eye of a $C? Or are you destined to a life tending to the livestock?$B$BEach has its place, but I can sense that you aspire to greatness.$B$BLet us begin our training, my newest pupil.',0),(30042,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today is the day when your fate will be decided. Do you have the awareness and wisdom necessary to be a $C? Or are you destined to a life scribing in the libraries?$B$BEach has its place, but I can sense that you aspire to greatness.$B$BLet us begin our training, my newest pupil.',0),(30043,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today is the day when your fate will be decided. Do you have the deftness and cunning necessary to be a $C? Or are you destined to live the life of a humble merchant?$B$BEach has its place, but I can sense that you aspire to greatness.$B$BLet us begin our training, my newest pupil.',0),(30044,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today is the day when your fate will be decided. Do you have the strength of will to be a $C? Or are you destined to a life of tending to the shrines?$B$BEach has its place, but I can sense that you aspire to greatness.$B$BLet us begin our training, my newest pupil.',0),(30045,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today is the day when your fate will be decided. Do you have the strength and hardiness to be a $C? Or are you destined to a life working the fields?$B$BEach has its place, but I can sense that you aspire to greatness.$B$BLet us begin our training, my newest pupil.',0),(30063,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I suspect these masks allow the sha to make a physical connection to our world.$B$BI must study them further if we are to banish these creatures forever.$B$BThank you, $n. Your aid is greatly appreciated.',0),(30064,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you! What a relief it is to see these texts are safe.',0),(30065,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These arrows are still in good shape. They will fly straight and true.$B$BGreat work, $n.',0),(30066,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The sha\'s numbers are unending, and our numbers few. But we are not daunted by difficult odds.$B$BThank you for doing your part to protect our home, $R.',0),(30067,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have saved us. From what fate, I dare not imagine.',0),(30068,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done much to help curb the fires. Thank you for your efforts.',0),(30075,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve had just about enough of this brewery. I\'m starting to think that you and I should just bust down the wall and clean house.',0),(30076,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Looks like plain ol\' water to me. It\'s hard to believe it\'s actually the corpse of a real, honest-to-goodness walkin\'-around living thing.$B$BCan\'t wait to turn it into beer and drink it.',0),(30077,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What is it with monkeys and barrels, anyway?',0),(30078,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Take a look around - it\'s a lot calmer outside. All the brewery needed was somebody strong to take care of it.$B$BIt\'s going to take some time to clean this place up, but I don\'t really mind that so much.$B$BThis is, after all... my home.',0),(30079,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Only one lady-panda who\'s not crazy? This worse than Ken-Ken thought...',0),(30080,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me guess: my aunt sent you?',0),(30081,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pandaren got a case of the spooky-dooks!$B$BDooks get scared sometimes, don\'t wanna come out. Poor, fluffy mopey-dopes must be ready to explode by now!$B$BThis just the thing to bring \'em out. That make pandaren happy for sure!$B$BJust like ol\' gramma used to say: can\'t THROW if can\'t GO!',0),(30082,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t believe he was actually going to do that... This despair is worse than I had even imagined.$B$BI cannot thank you enough for bringing him back.',0),(30083,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. That should teach those savages to know their boundaries.',0),(30084,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n.$B$BZhu Province serves as a corridor from the upper tier of the valley down to the sea.$B$BKeeping the province safe requires daily efforts to maintain a border against the savage Krasarang Wilds.',0),(30085,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You came! Great!$B$BI\'m looking forward to fighting by your side again, $n.',0),(30088,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just in time! All done... look!$B$B<Ken-Ken holds up a carved wooden mask with a ridiculous face.>$B$BNow we put on finishing touches and we gots a guaranteed FUN MACHINE!',0),(30089,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We saving pandaren, but the land still sad... Look, rain\'s not stopping at all!$B$B<Ken-Ken shakes his tiny fists at the sky.>$B$BHow many more butts we gotta punch before we fix this town?!$B$B<The sky darkens in response.>',0),(30090,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We did some good work here today, $n.$B$BMonastery always tell us to leave a place better than we find it.',0),(30091,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $C.$B$BIt\'s time we take back our land from this curse.',0),(30092,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ravenholdt sent you? I hope you\'re a better assassin than the others.',0),(30093,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Creed is finished. The Gilneans who followed his lead are on their own now - assuming his corrupted draconic blood works its way out of their system without killing them.$B$BEither way they\'re no longer a concern of ours.',0),(30094,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$N, you have arrived. This is good. I apologize for bringing you to this strange place, and under such suspicious circumstances.$B$BI have a good reason for doing so.$B$BWe are going to kill Deathwing. And I require your aid.',0),(30095,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$N, you have arrived. This is good. I apologize for bringing you to this strange place, and under such suspicious circumstances.$B$BI have a good reason for doing so.$B$BWe are going to kill Deathwing. And I require your aid.',0),(30096,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Murozond is no more. The timeways are open to me once again.',0),(30097,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Alurmi collects the vessel from you.>$B$BI will handle these from here. Of course, they must be properly labeled, documented, and stored.',0),(30098,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let us proceed.',0),(30099,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. We march on.',0),(30100,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are but moments away from the Dragon Soul.',0),(30101,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help, stranger.$B$BYou fight well. I hope to fight with you again in the future.',0),(30102,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve arrived.$B$BGood, let us begin.',0),(30103,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I owe my life to you, heroes.$B$BNow that we hold the Dragon Soul safely within Wyrmrest, it may be that all of Azeroth owes their lives to you.',0),(30104,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We rarely enjoy the opportunity to employ a brave $C like you. Our archive grows more thorough, thanks to your efforts.',0),(30105,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is truly as we foresaw: Benedictus was the Twilight Prophet. And now he is no more.$B$BWe dealt a mighty bow to the Twilight\'s Hammer today. Let us hope that it was a deathblow.',0),(30106,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s wonderful news, $N. Creed was not the most powerful of the remaining black dragons, but his manipulation of the Gilneans was truly diabolical.$B$BI\'ve prepared a reward for you. These blades may not look like much at present, but in the right hands they may yet awaken.$B$BPerhaps in YOUR hands...',0),(30107,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, do you see how they shimmer? Many fine gems sparkle in the light, but only these seem to sparkle with darkness.$B$BI\'ll perform an enchantment on these while you are on your next mission.$B$BAre you ready?',0),(30108,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Madness. Insanity!$B$BI don\'t know what Nalice is up to down there, but the entire basement radiates with diabolical arcane energy. She\'s got an entire cult worshipping her as a goddess.$B$BIf we\'re going to take her out, we have to do it soon. I hope you\'re ready for this!',0),(30109,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it? She\'s dead? Unbelievable! You\'re some kind of miracle-worker!$B$BHere, let me see that blood. I can preserve its energies in an arcane matrix for your trip back...',0),(30112,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Revenge feels good. To think that this is but a taste of what\'s to come.$B$BArthas will get what he deserves soon enough.',0),(30113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are, indeed, a master of your craft. Nalice is dead, and it is time you are rewarded for your efforts.$B$B<Wrathion takes the vial from you, his face a mask of equal parts reverence and revulsion. He drops the gems you collected one-by-one into the blood, muttering an incantation.>$B$B<Without warning he pours the blood over the blades of the daggers, and the steel seems to writhe and twist as though alive. When the smoke clears, the daggers have altered their shape.>',0),(30116,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done it! No doubt you placed yourself and your allies in great peril to acquire these. Your sacrifices will be rewarded in time. I will use these as the foundation of a powerful enchantment for you.$B$BBut we will need one additional catalyst. Are you ready for your final and most dangerous mission, $C?',0),(30117,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Finally! Emmi\'s come through.$B$BI hope all is well at the Stormstout Brewery. My men don\'t do well without beer.',0),(30118,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can feel it - like a dark shadow lifted from the land. Dead. My father is dead!$B$B<Wrathion takes the jaw fragment from you. His hands and face blur as he recites a dark enchantment, the gem clusters you collected earlier orbiting around his head. The jawpiece suddenly shatters, and with a terrible hissing sound your twin daggers awaken.>$B$BYour reward is ready. Take them, quickly. You will need them momentarily...',0),(30121,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'P... poison. Need... warn... Dezco...',0),(30123,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent! Nothing clears a sickness like Skitterer Stew.$B$BHere, take this. It\'s a little memento of Mama Bramblestaff.',0),(30124,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. You have performed admirably and bought us some time to fortify our defenses. Now if I can just get Dezco to go on the offensive.',0),(30127,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are more than just a bandit threat. They are an ancient people beginning to rally under a single banner. Mark my words, soon these lands will know war.',0),(30128,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'At this point I am willing to try anything. This land is claiming my wife and unborn child. I need all the help I can get.',0),(30129,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wait. This document talks about the Pools of Youth!$B$BThe pools exist?!',0),(30130,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you hero. Kor is a brave warrior but he lacks compassion at times. Life must come before death, or there will be none of us left when the fighting is done.',0),(30131,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'She... she died. For all the powers the Light has given me, I was unable to save her.$B$BThanks to your help, however... we saved my sons.',0),(30132,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! Well timed!$B$BWe were laying an ambush for the Alliance in the ruins west of here when the mogu ambushed us. They are using mage portals to call in reinforcements.',0),(30133,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... And the sha have seeped out as far as the province already, have they?$B$BWell, I hate to break it to you, but the temple is also overrun with sha. Those of us who haven\'t been killed or... possessed, or whatever, are fleeing for our very lives.$B$BIf you defeated the sha at Zhu\'s Watch, I have to implore you to help us deal with them here.',0),(30134,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank goodness, they finally sent someone!$B$BThings have gotten out of control!',0),(30135,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $R.$B$BI tried to stop the Slitherscale where I could, but I was no match for their numbers.$B$BYour work today will help preserve an entire generation of cloud serpents.',0),(30136,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t worry. The hatchlings will be safe inside their nests.$B$BI can\'t thank you enough for arriving when you did.',0),(30137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, wonderful!$B$BThese eggs look...well...they look a little on the small side. Are you sure you couldn\'t find any better ones?$B$BOh well, I suppose with the current situation, we can\'t be so picky.',0),(30138,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You may choose only one egg to take with you.$B$BChoose carefully. There is no going back.',0),(30139,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, Elder Anli mentioned that a new student had joined our ranks. I see you have already chosen your cloud serpent egg.$B$BI will instruct you on its care. Let me see it for a moment.',0),(30140,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, Elder Anli mentioned that a new student had joined our ranks. I see you have already chosen your cloud serpent egg.$B$BI will instruct you on its care. Let me see it for a moment.',0),(30141,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, Elder Anli mentioned that a new student had joined our ranks. I see you have already chosen your cloud serpent egg.$B$BI will instruct you on its care. Let me see it for a moment.',0),(30142,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Поздравляю! Теперь у тебя есть собственный детеныш змея.\r\n\r\nПожалуйста, позаботься о нем, $n',0),(30143,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations, $n.$B$BThere is great joy in seeing the fruits of your own labor.',0),(30144,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What have you learned from this lesson?$B$BSpeed. It\'s all about speed.',0),(30145,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did better than I expected. Not bad for a new trainee.',0),(30146,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh wonderful! These fish will do nicely.',0),(30147,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Amazing, $n. These relics are invaluable to our studies. We will learn much from these fragments.',0),(30148,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful! It is a good thing you are trained in the arts of first aid.',0),(30149,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh these do look quite delicious. You are quite the cook!',0),(30150,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The hatchling leaps for your hand. It winds its long, serpentine tail around you and begins to lick the honey from your fingers.$B$BThat tickles!',0),(30151,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my, I see you and your serpent are having a great time! Well done, $n. Playtime will greatly increase your serpent\'s mental and physical acuities.',0),(30152,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful! How does it feel to finish the Sky Race?$B$BYou must be eager to collect your prize!',0),(30154,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you have been hard at work, gathering food for your hungry little serpent. Well done. It may not seem worth it now, but your serpent will know of your efforts, and it will love you for it.',0),(30155,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If the poachers will not listen to diplomacy, then they will surely listen to our blades. Thank you, $n.',0),(30156,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are learning well, young trainer. Saltback meat is tough, but loaded with the nutrients that a young hatchling needs to grow.',0),(30157,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you have been taking good care of the young hatchlings out there. Well done.',0),(30158,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have weakened them, but we cannot celebrate completely. A toothless tiger still has claws.',0),(30159,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. As soon as Suchi told me she sent you to recover the stolen eggs, I knew you would accomplish the task.$B$BOur instructors will make sure to return these eggs to a safer place.',0),(30160,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, is this for me? I-I don\'t know what to say.$B$BIt\'s very pretty, thank you!',0),(30163,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve already lost so many. I refuse to lose any more.',0),(30164,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The civilians are trickling in thanks to you. These \"mantid\" creatures are a serious threat. We will need to rally our forces soon to help.$B$BOne of the envoys asked me to give this to you as a token of thanks.',0),(30168,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not many would stop to help a village in need... especially so deep in the wilds.$B$BYou are a champion to our people, $n.',0),(30169,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done us a great service today. On behalf of my people I thank you.$B$BPlease, accept this token of our gratitude.',0),(30174,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thank you for avenging my friend, $n. We did not always see eye to eye, but I will mourn him.$B$BI know he would have wanted you to carry one of his items with you as a token of his memory and gratitude.',0),(30175,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help, $C! I\'ve never seen anybody stand up to the mantid like that before.$B$BWell, other than the Shado-Pan, of course...',0),(30178,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... And the sha have seeped out as far as the province already, have they?$B$BWell, I hate to break it to you, but the temple is also overrun with sha. Those of us who haven\'t been killed or... possessed, or whatever, are fleeing for our very lives.$B$BIf you defeated the sha at Zhu\'s Watch, I have to implore you to help us deal with them here.',0),(30179,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Chezin is dead? This is very bad news indeed. Kor, Chezin and I have fought dragons, undead, and Alliance on nearly every shore that has a name.$B$BTo lose him like this...$B$BThank you for recovering these weapons. It should teach us much about our new enemy.',0),(30187,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. If you hadn\'t been capable of finding the checkpoints, I fear you would never have done well in the Sky Race.',0),(30188,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сегодня ты становишься одним из нас. Поздравляю тебя со вступлением в Орден Облачного Змея. Будем летать вместе!',0),(30189,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Really? For me?$B$BSuch a lovely apple shouldn\'t be eaten alone.$B$BHere, please have half.',0),(30190,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We need to figure out where these things are coming from. We\'re dealing with this near daily and it\'s getting out of hand.$B$BThank you for your help.',0),(30191,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The workers will love you for this!',0),(30192,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I really wish you guys would stop throwing the buckets at the fire too� just the water would have been fine.$B$BReally though, it\'s a relief that you\'re here to help. Thank you.',0),(30193,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Doesn\'t get much fresher! Thank you, $C.',0),(30194,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your act is one of a responsible hunter. I respect you for it.',0),(30195,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aha! You are quite the kind patron.$B$BThank you... thank you.',0),(30196,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good timing! The stew\'s almost ready.$B$BYou have my thanks.',0),(30200,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re quicker than the trainees, but I would have been disappointed if you weren\'t. Thanks.',0),(30204,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. I\'d say I have about a week of Anji making fun of me for the screaming, and then I should be in the clear.',0),(30205,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is marvelous... very well perserved. Thank you very much, friend! I owe you for this.',0),(30206,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are lovely! Thank you, kind $C.',0),(30225,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve got a follow-through I can respect, $C. Thanks.',0),(30226,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As it should be. Thank you.',0),(30227,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks. I owe you one, $C.',0),(30228,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Some peace and quiet. Thank you.',0),(30229,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With their reinforcements severed we can begin to mount an offensive against their Lord Reclaimer.',0),(30230,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done $n. You have removed the sword from the child\'s hands.',0),(30231,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Delicious! I am indebted to you, my friend.',0),(30232,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my most gracious thanks, young one.',0),(30233,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes! Only one Cracklefang remains to terrorize the goats and yaks of the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. As it should be! Thank you for that!$B$BI sure hope no more big nasty wolves turn up. I really don\'t think I\'m going to be able to come up with another name that can live up to that one.',0),(30234,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My staff! My gorgeous staff! We shall never part again. I shall lean on you, and you will always be there. And I promise not to poke crocodiles with you anymore.$B$BThank you, friend. Your staff retrieval skills have proved invaluable today!',0),(30235,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For the sake of the villagers, I hope he remains at bay for some time.$B$BThank you, my friend.',0),(30236,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The spirits may be childlike, but they possess generous mounts of strength for their size. Your victory is no small thing, and is very appreciated.',0),(30237,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The spirits of the pandaren monks seem invigorated by the deaths of their mogu oppressors. It is a small victory, but it shows respect to great heroes of the past.',0),(30238,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, my friend. You respect for our ancestors means a great deal.',0),(30239,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lao-Fe the Slavebinder was one of the most spiteful and vicious mogu of his time. May defeating his spirit act as a reminder to all the mogu in the vale of the fate that awaits them if they seek to defile the sacred pools again.$B$BYour strength is unquestionable. You have my respect, $C.',0),(30240,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not bad, $C. Not bad at all.',0),(30241,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mantid from the south? This is not a good day.',0),(30242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not bad, $C. Not bad at all.',0),(30243,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done devastating damage to the mantid forces. The wall defenders should be able to get things under control.',0),(30244,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The mantid forces on the wall have been thinned.',0),(30245,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The scout reports have pinpointed the mogu leader\'s position.',0),(30246,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The mantid forces on the wall have been thinned.',0),(30248,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at you! All proactive and assertive. Looks good on you.',0),(30249,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I heard you performed some heroics in the courtyard! Your name will be remembered on the wall for some time. Well done, $n.',0),(30251,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I like your initiative. Good work.',0),(30258,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes?',0),(30259,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What do you mean, no virmen chewed them up? Teeth marks too small? WHAT? Then who else do this?',0),(30260,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh yeah, Farmer Yoon. I\'ve seen him around town.$B$BSeems like a nice enough fella.',0),(30263,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We must seize our advantage when an opportunity presents itself. We must make the Shao-Tien pay for every moment they remain in the Vale.$B$BYou\'ve done well this day, $C.',0),(30264,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kun tells me you were amazing out there. You impress my man, you impress me.$B$BGood work.',0),(30265,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rubies! Valuable, yes! Suggestive of an interesting backstory involving a dozen broken-hearted brides? Likely not. Still, quite the find!$B$BThank you my marvelously benevolent friend! You have saved me some awkwardly wet robes with your generous aquatic ways.',0),(30266,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve got good aim, $C. I\'ll remember that the next time the fliers come.',0),(30268,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $C. I knew you\'d be hardy enough to handle it.$B$BJudging by the sounds coming out of these refugees, I would not wish the murksweats on my worst enemy.',0),(30269,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. We would not have made it without your help.',0),(30270,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. I only wish I could have accompanied you...$B$BThe blood on these hand-wraps is not my own, you know.',0),(30271,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honestly, I\'m a little surprised that worked.$B$BPandaria is proving to be a land where the lines between metaphor and reality are blurred.',0),(30272,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You know something, $n? We make a pretty good team!',0),(30273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have vanquished the Sha of Despair. My order can handle the remaining cleanup from here.$B$BIt seems the time has finally come to face the consequences of Shaohao\'s actions.$B$BThis conflict has been a long time coming - the arrival of your people was merely a catalyst. Now, your help will be necessary if Pandaria is to survive.',0),(30274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fabulous! Your timing was impeccable. Another day in there and I think we would have wasted away to nothing.$B$BNow we can continue our search for the Pools of Youth!',0),(30275,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This tail came from a crocolisk? Funny, we don\'t get many crocs this far upstream.$B$BHave you seen some of the enormous fruits and vegetables that our farmers can grow? Your crocolisk grew so large for the same reason - there\'s something in the water.$B$BWhat it is, we\'re not quite sure... but we count it among our blessings. Humongous vegetables are great. The odd giant crocolisk every now and again is really just a side effect.',0),(30277,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When everyone else lets me down, you follow through. That\'s why I like you.$B$BThank you, $n.',0),(30280,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You accomplish what I doubt I could even overcome myself. I am humbled by your valor.',0),(30281,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The mogu numbers seem to be sufficiently thinned.',0),(30282,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll take the smoke on the horizon to mean that they\'ve received our message. Good.',0),(30283,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If they come asking who rudely crushed all their little statuettes, I\'ll tell them it was you.$B$BNot that I don\'t appreciate your help. You\'re lovely.',0),(30284,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aren\'t you just the sweetest thing?! I do rather like you.$B$BI\'m going to take that afore-mentioned dip now. I\'ll be modest and delay my disrobing until you depart, as a repayment for your kindness.$B$B...you\'re missing quite the sight though, I must say.',0),(30285,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are very kind, $n. Thank you for putting my mind at ease.',0),(30286,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve holed up everyone we can in the bar. We should be able to protect them for now.$B$BThank you again for your help, $n. You always seem to be there right when we need you.',0),(30287,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rook can handle rest of mogu. Thanks for help. Good man.',0),(30288,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We owe you so much... thank you, $C.',0),(30289,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lots of villagers inside and safe now. You do good work.',0),(30290,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes! You faster than rook. Do good!$B$BThank you, friend.',0),(30291,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Marvelous! You\'re quite the efficient fetcher.$B$BI\'m grateful that you don\'t mind getting that fancy armor of yours wet.',0),(30292,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You smell of saurok and mogu. Not a terribly pleasant mix, my friend. But it suggests to me that your task is done, and for that I thank you.$B$BMay we meet again soon under better-smelling terms.',0),(30293,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'More than one pandaren is thankful for your help today, that\'s for sure.',0),(30296,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Leader gone. People safe. Rook save village. And friend save village too. Thank you, friend!',0),(30297,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Leader gone. People safe. Rook save village. And friend save village too. Thank you, friend!',0),(30298,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Their foothold in these ruins shall not last the night.',0),(30299,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your efforts here make all the difference. Thank you so much for your help, friend.',0),(30300,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many of those you saved are back here in camp recovering. You surely have their gratitude, and mine.',0),(30301,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Smoke in the distance tells me that you were successful. Good work, $C.',0),(30302,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You haven\'t let me down. I won\'t forget that.',0),(30304,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your ruins vandalizing efforts are appreciated, friend.',0),(30305,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You really good friend. Rook like you. Thank you, good friend!',0),(30306,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very impressive. It seems they have much learning to do. I\'ll see to that.',0),(30307,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We hold this line. It does not matter how long they come, we hold this line.',0),(30308,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Less of those beasts on the field always cheers my day up a bit. Thanks.',0),(30309,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There\'s a satisfying amount of ruble strewn across the field today. A sign of your good work.',0),(30310,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Quite the battle! I think your feat has boosted morale among the troops a bit.',0),(30312,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The men you healed made it back safely.$B$BThank you, kind friend. Truly.',0),(30313,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<He pats you on the shoulder and nods his thanks.>',0),(30314,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<He smiles at you and nods his thanks.>',0),(30317,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmph! I knew you were a good waterer when I first saw you. You\'ve got good watering arms.',0),(30318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found her! You\'ve got an eye for fowl, kid.$B$BI\'ll hold onto her for now. Don\'t worry, I\'ll make sure she\'s punished later.',0),(30319,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, good. That that\'s taken care of. Neatly done, $R.',0),(30320,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good! I\'ll hold onto this dagger. Perhaps we will get the chance to make more use of it later.$B$BThank you so much, my friend. You have a good heart.',0),(30321,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks, mishter *hic* $n.',0),(30322,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad that nasty business is over with. Nobody gave you any trouble, did they?',0),(30323,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, $n! I\'d kiss you right here and now if you weren\'t... well, if you weren\'t covered in virmen dust.$B$BThanks, though!',0),(30324,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great! Chee-Chee knew you could do it!',0),(30325,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hah! They\'ll be cleaning that mess up for days.',0),(30326,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! Look at this! It\'s...$B$B<Fish flips through the pages, and her face sours.>$B$BOh, I think that\'s a dirty picture. But the rest of this is very interesting! I just love learning how other creatures think. Thanks, $n!',0),(30327,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ella\'s face lights up.>$B$BYou did it? For me? Oh, thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you!',0),(30328,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now, my student, lean in closely. Let me show you the secret of the Thousand-Year Dumpling...',0),(30329,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t know how the hozen manage to carry these things on their bodies... let alone eat the things.',0),(30330,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely.$B$BNow, $n... stand closer. Let me show you a thing or two about baking...',0),(30331,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is fantastic! You are quite the aspiring cook, $R.',0),(30332,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good choice of steaks, $n. You\'ve got a future as a butcher. You probably make a better $C, though.',0),(30333,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There, that\'s done with. Now we shift our focus back to farming, for a change.',0),(30334,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks! I\'ll make sure these are distributed out to my fellow farmers.',0),(30335,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They\'ll be attacking, but my farm - and the farms of my friends - should not be in any danger.$B$BNot if we can help it, anyways. Right, $n?',0),(30336,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No doubt the hozen will have a big ritual tonight, promoting a new Hunter-Chief.$B$BI\'m just happy that my fellow farmers can rest easy in the meantime.',0),(30337,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hopefully they\'re put off from stealing any more of our supplies. I know I personally wouldn\'t want to drink any explosive beer, or use an explosive rake.',0),(30338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well look at you! Not only can you swim in all that very ornate and heavy-looking gear, you can carry half-a-dozen awkwardly large gilded weapons while you do it! Of all your feats, this is surely one of the most impressive, no?$B$BThank you, you marvelously adept swimmer you.',0),(30339,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I like a $R who isn\'t too lofty to help a humble merchant out. Thank you.',0),(30340,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I like a $R who isn\'t too lofty to help a humble merchant out. Thank you.',0),(30341,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<He bows thankfully.>',0),(30342,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do you hear that, my beautiful feet? You can rest easy now, your water-kicking days have returned!$B$BYou\'ve been oh so lovely, friend. Do share the fruits of your labors and spend a second or two by the water with me someday. We can exchange tales of that one time when you so generously slaughtered a ravaging band of vicious limb-snatching reptiles for the sake of my frightened and innocent feet. What a grand day that was.',0),(30344,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh! Fabulous! Fabulous!$B$BYour one trip has advanced my research more than ten years of reading dusty tomes and decaying scrolls...$B$BAnd those \"mogu\" you saw. I have been doing some research as well as speaking to Kang on the subject.$B$BI suspect now that they were the race of the lost dynasties that my research is derived from.$B$BOf course, that also means that they are the ones who used to control the Pools of Youth.',0),(30346,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. Hmm, it looks like the mogu are here to collect ancient relics and weapons from their forgotten dynasty. That is a problem we can face later though.$B$BAh! Here is a reference to the Pools of Youth.',0),(30347,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You... you found the pools! The waters do exist!$B$BSomething is wrong though. I feel equal parts shadow and light swirling in this vial.',0),(30348,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wha... what happened? The water... it... it only transfers life. It will not make new life.',0),(30349,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. Another few missions like that and we might have to make you an honorary sentinel.',0),(30350,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha! With this I can make a stew potent enough to knock these waifish elves on their feet.',0),(30351,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s it! You pick, I punch!',0),(30352,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fantastic. Only thing that would make this hunting trip more entertaining is a chair. Here is the reward I promised you.',0),(30353,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great! This stuff is gonna make me a mint back in Kalimdor. Here\'s your cut.',0),(30354,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There are so few of us, it is a great relief to see such help.',0),(30355,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done $n. You have removed the sword from the child\'s hands.',0),(30356,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have bought us some much needed breathing room to lick our wounds and prepare a counter-attack.',0),(30357,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It has been a long time since I rolled up my sleeves and helped the needy. In my lust for immortality I forgot why I became a priest.$B$BThank you for reminding me there is good in this world worth fighting for, $n.',0),(30359,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for avenging my daughter. I am not willing to let her stay dead however.$B$BI still have the waters of youth.',0),(30360,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mantid from the south? This is not a good day.',0),(30361,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help, $C! I\'ve never seen anybody stand up to the mantid like that before.$B$BWell, other than the Shado-Pan, of course...',0),(30363,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, well timed as usual. It turns out the mogu know how to use portals as well.',0),(30376,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Finally, some good news. I will send a falcon to Winter\'s Blossom right away and let them know the Temple of the Red Crane is safe.$B$BBetween the sha outbreak and the increasing aggression of the mantid, our forces are being stretched thin.',0),(30379,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my, this is a flawless jewel!$B$BIf you keep giving me gifts like these, I may have to retire early!',0),(30380,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, what a lovely apple! These sweet fruits are quite the treat around here.',0),(30381,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, a jade cat!$B$BMy father and I used to hunt for these in the fields. He always said they were lucky.',0),(30382,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, thank you. This beautiful feather is just lovely.',0),(30383,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my, these are quite rare. Thank you for giving it to me.',0),(30384,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sunwalkers are not to be trusted. They are the most militant branch of the tauren armies within the horde.$B$BThank you for your help in this, $n. Please accept this token as a reward.',0),(30385,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome. Che send you?',0),(30386,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my, Shrimp Dumplings? My favorite!$B$BThank you.',0),(30387,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What an interesting little figurine. It\'s quite lovely. Thank you, dear.',0),(30388,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Such a pretty feather would fetch a nice price at market, but I\'m not selling this one. Thank you for the gift.',0),(30389,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh wonderful! You\'ve brought me a Marsh Lily.$B$BHow did you know that these are my favorite?',0),(30390,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bringing food to me on the busiest market day? What a sweetheart you are!',0),(30391,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, for me? Well, I guess that\'s mighty nice of you.',0),(30392,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well ain\'t that sweet of ya. Hmph.',0),(30393,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmph, well that is mighty fine of you to think of me like that.$B$BThank ye.',0),(30394,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'...$B$BMy son, Tai...he used to collect these as a little boy.$B$BWhen his mother died, I told him they were messages from her, fallen from the heavens.$B$B<Old Hillpaw falls into a quiet silence.>',0),(30395,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, these flowers are quite rare.$B$BYou know that these are considered lucky? Maybe my harvest will go well after all. Thank you.',0),(30396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I haven\'t had this dish since my wife died. Somehow, she must have sent you to me.$B$BThank you, $R.',0),(30397,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pretty stone! You silly for giving away. Oh well, mine now!$B$BThanks, $R!',0),(30398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For me? Red apple? So shiny! So juicy! Thanks, boss!',0),(30399,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ooh, very old, very valuable. Me like kitties. Got one from girl Ella.',0),(30400,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my. You know what this is? A frikfrak! Frikfrak for chief only!$B$BWhich mean...you must think me is chief? We boss buddy now, $n.',0),(30401,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh! Pretty flower! No takebacks boss, okay? Thank you, bye!',0),(30402,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, Valley Stir Fry. Thanks!',0),(30403,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For me? Why thank you.',0),(30404,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you.',0),(30405,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I appreciate the sentiment, $R.',0),(30406,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I appreciate your gesture, $R. Thank you for thinking of me.',0),(30407,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have never been one to dwell on pretty, useless things, but I know you give me this gift out of friendship. For that, I thank you. Whenever I look at this flower, I will think of you.',0),(30408,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, this is the best gift you could have given me! A warrior needs her strength.',0),(30409,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh yes, this ruby will go nicely with the rest of my collection.',0),(30410,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mmm, I do like a lovely apple.',0),(30411,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, this is exquisite craftsmanship. Where did you find such a thing?',0),(30412,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm, this is a very lustrous feather. I\'ll add it to my collection of rare things.',0),(30413,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm, I guess these flowers are supposed to be pretty lucky. I\'m honored that yer giving it to me.',0),(30414,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Charbroiled Tiger Steak for me? How did you know this was my favorite dish?',0),(30416,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, that\'s a very nice stone.',0),(30417,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Such a nice red apple for me?',0),(30418,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmmm, a very interesting little statue.',0),(30419,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a very rare blue feather. Thank you.',0),(30420,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Why this is a rare flower, indeed.',0),(30421,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How did you know that this is my favorite dish? Thanks.',0),(30422,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ooh, now I never seen such a purty red stone. Thank ya, $n!',0),(30423,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My stomach\'s been rumbling all mornin\'! This is a perfect gift.',0),(30424,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, a pretty jade cat! This makes me real happy, $n!',0),(30425,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whoa, I never seen such a purty color before. Thanks, $n!',0),(30426,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My pappy always said these flowers bring lotsa luck. Thanks, $n!',0),(30427,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh boy, this is my favorite! Thanks, $n!',0),(30428,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oooh, a shiny sparkly gem! I love it!',0),(30429,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh why thank you, $n.',0),(30430,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Why this is just lovely! Thank you so much, $n.',0),(30431,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, this blue feather will really bring out my eyes. Thank you, $n.',0),(30432,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, this will bring me much luck! Thank you, $n.',0),(30433,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh this is my favorite dish! Yum!',0),(30434,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, a pretty stone! I will look at this while I\'m drinking.',0),(30435,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey, this is my favorite food! Thanks, $n.',0),(30436,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks.',0),(30437,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A nice blue feather for me? Thanks, $R.',0),(30438,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The watersh were right! Thish flower will bring me luck.',0),(30439,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nothing like a delicious cold brew, and some Sauteed Carrots to wash it down.',0),(30444,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should keep them off balance for a while. Thanks.',0),(30445,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He... he shouldn\'t have done that! He shouldn\'t have paid for my mistake!',0),(30449,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you have put together a Crane deck.  Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten.  Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation.',0),(30450,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you have put together a Ox deck.  Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten.  Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation.',0),(30451,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you have put together a Serpent deck.  Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten.  Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation.',0),(30452,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you have put together a Tiger deck.  Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten.  Allow me to present you with one of the greater Darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation.',0),(30457,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are delivered! I was right about you, $c.',19116),(30459,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. You\'ve saved our defensive line here.$B$BThis next attack wouldn\'t have been possible without you.',19116),(30460,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my thanks, $n. You have shown great honor through your actions.$B$BI hope that my family\'s dit da jow was of some use to you.',19116),(30461,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... So the sha have seeped out as far as the province already, have they?$B$BWell, I hate to break it to you, but the temple is also overrun with sha. Those of us who haven\'t been killed or... possessed, or whatever, are fleeing for our very lives.$B$BIf you defeated the sha at Zhu\'s Bastion, I have to implore you to help us deal with them here.',0),(30462,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... So the sha have seeped out as far as the province already, have they?$B$BWell, I hate to break it to you, but the temple is also overrun with sha. Those of us who haven\'t been killed or... possessed, or whatever, are fleeing for our very lives.$B$BIf you defeated the sha at Zhu\'s Bastion, I have to implore you to help us deal with them here.',0),(30464,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! Well timed!$B$BWe were laying an ambush for the Alliance in the ruins west of here when the mogu ambushed us. They are using mage portals to call in reinforcements.',0),(30465,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, well timed as usual. It turns out the mogu know how to use portals as well.',0),(30466,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hrmm, I\'ll be surprised if we can keep these creatures focused enough to employ any tactics at all, $n.$B$BThey\'d better not get in my way when blades begin to fly!',0),(30467,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So horrible... When I saw the killing, I just ran. My father, Mei... are they alive?',0),(30468,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is satisfying to hear that our enemies are dead. Perhaps you can use one of my bodyguard\'s weapons.',0),(30469,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you... we will eat now, at least.',0),(30470,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Tina holds the gem in her hands, and watches it change from a pale blue to a bright red.>$B$BA chrysoberyl? That\'s so sweet! Was this Andi\'s idea?$B$BOf course I already have several... but this one is beautiful, too. I\'ll add it to the collection.',0),(30471,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For me? Me, Chee Chee?$B$BThis brings Chee Chee back to when Chee Chee was little wikkin\' baby. Chee Chee\'s mama used to make it just like this.',0),(30472,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was famished! How\'d you know? Who told you?$B$BAndi, huh? That kid\'s gonna grow up to be a real heartbreaker someday...',0),(30473,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aww, look at him! He\'s ADORABLE! With his fuzzy little tail, and his...$B$B<She composes herself.>$B$BI mean, ah... thanks, dude. It\'s pretty cool.',0),(30474,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You didn\'t have to do this! I didn\'t need any... any...$B$B<Ella eyes the dumplings, and her mouth begins to water.>$B$BWell, maybe I was a little hungry. Thanks, $n. And give my thanks to Andi, as well.',0),(30475,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эй! Откуда у тебя это? Ну надо же – а мне сказали, что равнинные ястребы у них закончились!\r\n\r\nАнди попросил тебя отнести это мне? Гм... Похоже, я его недооцениваю.',0),(30476,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well would you look at that! I\'ll have to keep this somewhere that the chickens can\'t get to.$B$BDid Andi tell you to get this for me? Funny kid, that one.',0),(30477,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, would you look at that! You don\'t see a tooth like THAT everyday.$B$BYou been hunting sharks, $C?$B$BThank you, $n. And send my thanks to Andi, as well.',0),(30478,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Jogu takes a long swig from the hooch.>$B$BThat\'sh it! I\'ve got a new favorite drink. An\' it\'sh this one!$B$BYou know what, $n? You\'re alright. I mean it, man!',0),(30479,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are beautiful! Did you get these for me?$B$BAhh... so they\'re from Andi, are they? I think I know somebody who\'s getting a kiss on the forehead later this afternoon...',0),(30480,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see now that this ritual rips whatever was controlling the minds of these creatures from them. I now know what we must do.',0),(30481,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So many! And so shiny! You did real good!$B$BThank you, little friend. Rook like you a lot.',0),(30482,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<As you hand the beads to He, his smile suggests that he understands perfectly what they symbolize. He nods approvingly.>',0),(30484,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'At least they\'re confident.$B$BThat might count for something.',0),(30485,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Lorewalker Cho shudders, in spite of himself.>$B$BThe legends... they\'re true!',0),(30487,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve arrived just in time, $C! I was starting to think I would die up here!',0),(30488,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for the save, stranger!',19116),(30489,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You just earned me a handsome bonus. Getting those needles is a pain in the paw but worth it when we take our yaks to market. Here, for your troubles.',19116),(30491,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, stranger! Hopefully we\'ll be able to cash these in and recoup some of the damages the yaungol inflicted.',19116),(30492,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! I can smell the luck from here. The Muskpaws always have good yaks for sale.',19116),(30496,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. Now we have some hope of redeeming this situation.',0),(30499,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тром-ка, $n!\r\n\r\nНадеюсь, на лесной дороге ты смог разузнать что-нибудь полезное.\r\n\r\nНаши приготовления практически закончены, но нам нужна твоя помощь.',26124),(30504,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My thoughts will be with your fallen companions, traveler.$B$BMay their wounds mend well.',0),(30506,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, is that you? I can\'t believe we survived the events that destroyed the Jade Snake statue.',0),(30507,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, is that you? I can\'t believe we survived the events that destroyed the Jade Snake statue.',0),(30508,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, is that you? I can\'t believe we survived the events that destroyed the Jade Snake statue.',0),(30509,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where have you been, $n? Nevermind. As you can see, we survived the battle at the Jade Serpent.$B$BUnfortunately, so did... they.',19116),(30510,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where have you been, $n? Nevermind. As you can see, we survived the battle at the Jade Serpent.$B$BUnfortunately, so did... they.',19116),(30511,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where have you been, $n? Nevermind. As you can see, we survived the battle at the Jade Serpent.$B$BUnfortunately, so did... they.',19116),(30512,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну что ж... мы живы, а ведь без твоей помощи наша участь была бы совсем незавидна.\r\n\r\nНо если хочешь, чтобы это место стало твоим основным лагерем и чтобы мы присоединились к Альянсу, есть еще одна вещь, которую тебе нужно сделать, чтобы обеспечить нашу безопасность.',0),(30513,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well... we are alive, and that is better than we could have hoped for without your help.\n\nBut, if this is truly to become a base of operations for you, and if we are to join your Horde, there is one more thing you must do to guarantee our security.',19116),(30514,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Победа! Наконец-то справедливость восторжествовала, и на какое-то время мы в безопасности, хотя и лишились многого.\r\n\r\nТем не менее, все решено. Мы присоединимся к Альянсу и восстановим деревню с твоей помощью.',0),(30515,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! At the very least, we have justice, and safety, though in the process we have lost so much.\n\nRegardless, it has been decided. We will join the Horde, and with your help, rebuild this village.',19116),(30516,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well what do we have here? You harvested enough to last me a while.$B$BMany thanks!',0),(30517,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh? You\'re with that new farmer in town, aren\'t you?',0),(30518,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Farmer Fung stares at you with his jaw on the floor.>$B$BI... I can\'t believe... YOU recovered all of my prized shagskins!$B$BDo you... do you know what this means to me?$B$BMy family\'s only been good at two things - raising enormous vegetables and raising yaks.$B$BThe shagskins you see are the result of generations of work.$B$BYou have saved my family\'s legacy, $n.',0),(30519,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, Nana Mudclaw... that is me. I may be old, dear, but I haven\'t lost my memory. Old Man Whitewhiskers, on the other hand, is another story.',0),(30521,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What do you want?',0),(30522,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It’s sad to hear that Khaohan has so many problems. Thank you for telling me about this. We will try to help him.',26124),(30523,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You need my help fer somethin\'? You came to the right gal!',0),(30524,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aww yeah, this wood\'ll do jus\' fine. You did good, $n.',0),(30525,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You got the ingredients? Good work!$B$BNow I just need to make the concoction.',0),(30527,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow, $n! Those are some big melons. Those are hard to grow, and I should know because I\'ve tried! $B$BI don\'t know how I would run this place without you, $n.',0),(30528,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The hozen chief is dead? Our plan worked, $n!',0),(30529,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yoon needs a neighbor to lend a hand, eh? Well I\'ll be plenty happy to oblige.',0),(30534,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The talismans on the shrine tinkle softly in the wind.',0),(30567,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'None too shabby, my $C friend! We\'ve saved the monastery and still have half a keg left.$B$BThank you for your help!',0),(30569,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a sight for sore eyes, $C.$B$BI\'ll be glad to help you Alliance fellas out. First though, you need to help me get my farm back.',0),(30570,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a sight for sore eyes, $c.$B$BI\'ll be glad to help you Horde fellas out. First though, you need to help me get my farm back.',19116),(30571,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now ain\'t you just the thing?$B$BThough, I guess it\'s not fair to force these here workers to stay with us, now that we don\'t have much work for \'em...',19116),(30575,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These yaks will do the trick nicely. Good work, $n. I\'m feeling better about this whole situation already.',0),(30581,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well there you go. We should be plenty good, now.',19116),(30582,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ya never know how much you can lose until you\'ve lost it. My wife passed a few seasons ago, but I can tell you this is a day when I could use her smile the most.$b$bAt least she doesn\'t have to see what these yaungol did to her beloved ranch.',19116),(30583,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work! I\'m telliin\' ye, these Kun-Lai meaty bits are grade A goodness!',0),(30584,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These look like some tasty eels $n! I\'m sure you will love them!',0),(30585,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My son\'s ring? What does this mean?$B$B<Rassan appears thoughtful.>$B$BThe situation is grim, but not without hope. My son is careless with his belongings, so perhaps he simply threw it into the pool? Thank you for your help $n, I will not soon forget this great favor you have done for me.',0),(30586,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh! Looks like you found plenty of abalone out there. Great job $n!',0),(30587,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well then, I am mighty grateful for you culling some of those yaungols for us.$b$bHopefully your little display of authority will be enough to discourage them from coming over here.',19116),(30588,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The expedition is safe. Thank you $n.',0),(30592,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many thanks and fortune to you, friend of grummles. But the journey to the Serpent\'s Spine is not safe yet.',0),(30593,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright! Looks like we won\'t have a bunch of statues to worry about any more. Good work, $n!',0),(30594,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, you dealt with the statues? Good work. Here\'s something for your trouble.',19116),(30595,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! I mean, wow! Thank you, $n!$B$B<Bao Jian\'s eyes widen with anticipation of the proceeds from the relics.>$B$BNow that you\'ve softened them up, I\'m thinking that I might head in. Just a few more relics from around the outskirts. Nothing dangerous.',19116),(30598,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The elusive silver goby! You truly are becoming an angler $n!',0),(30599,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A confident hozen is a dangerous hozen.$B$BThank you for your help, friend of grummles.',0),(30600,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are good fortune for grummles.$B$BWhen we are back at a proper camp I must buy you the smelliest, luckiest incense I can find.',0),(30601,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Incense works like a charm! Effects will not last long, so you must hurry!',19116),(30602,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look what Broketooths and Knucklethumps did to grummle waystation. Hardly a luckydo to be found.$B$BGrummles had a deal with the hozen. We give them food, and they don\'t ravage. Whenever they think to ravage, Shado-Pan remind them not to ravage.$B$BBut all of Shado-Pan are away defending the wall now. And the hozen want more food than the grummles have.',0),(30603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My luckydo! Oh happy day of good fortune! Many thanks!',0),(30604,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n! Hopefully that will slow the Broketooth ravage.',0),(30605,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good fortune for me to be saved by a luckydo like you.$B$BAnd Brother Rabbitsfoot always say I not have good fortune. Bah!',0),(30606,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are a true luckydo.',0),(30607,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh wow that looked like one wild ride!',0),(30608,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today is a day of many good and bad fortunes. Bad fortune that hozen stole my grummles. Good fortune that my $R saves my grummles. Bad fortune that so many hozen must die to learn lesson. Good fortune that humans are luckydos and know how to fight.$B$BGrummles are not fighters. We carry, we explore, and we are content.',0),(30610,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that hozen king is going to learn why it is bad fortune to cheat grummles.',0),(30611,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ready for the yeti?',0),(30612,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Ook of Dook is dead! Hurray!',0),(30613,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Careful with that carp, $n. They have been known to bite fingers off!',0),(30614,15,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Happy day! Your reward. May these coins bring you good fortune.',19116),(30616,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good fortune that a $r comes to help grummles. Good fortune to friend of grummles.',19116),(30617,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to One Keg! Gateway to Burlap Trail and Mount Neverest.',19116),(30618,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh thank you, $n! If I just cut off the nibbled pieces and repair the minor damage, I may still be able to sell these.$b$bOnce your cart is ready to go I\'ll have the supplies I promised loaded up!',19116),(30619,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, thank goodness! You\'ve saved all of our skins, believe me.$B$BYou have no idea how much trouble those guys can stir up.$B$BErr, or, I guess you do, now. Kind of. Almost.$B$BImagine that, but a lot worse, and for a couple thousand years.',0),(30620,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, thank goodness! You\'ve saved all of our skins, believe me.\n\nYou have no idea how much trouble those guys can stir up.\n\nErr, or, I guess you do, now. Kind of. Almost.\n\nImagine that, but a lot worse, and for a couple thousand years.',19116),(30621,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you! It appears my trinkets were lucky for you too, $c. While you were gone I did not gamble and lose my cart.$b$bI would be happy to lend it to you for your journey. Besides, I have some goods to win back from this shady grummle!',19116),(30622,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My wall... I spent my life atop that wall...',0),(30625,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They can\'t keep fighting like this forever. Those kids are downright heroic, but I don\'t want them to die as heroes.$B$BIt\'s time to throw in the towel.',0),(30626,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see.$B$BWell, we gave it our all. It\'s time to evacuate, save lives, and reassess our strategy, before these mantid take over the entire valley.',0),(30627,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t believe it! You - a foreign-born $R - have succeeded where the Shado-Pan have failed. You\'ve succeeded where the WALL has failed.$B$BWe may hold this farming village after all.',0),(30628,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Peering inside, you find...',0),(30631,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n. It sounds as though they are getting on quite well at the city.$B$BHowever, in order to ensure their safety, we must be even more vigilant than before.',0),(30632,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Leven sent you? I hope you\'re ready for a fight.',0),(30633,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $R. That should send a clear message to the mogu - we are not to be trifled with.',0),(30634,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful, $n!$B$BYou and He have single-handedly crippled the mogu advance.$B$BThat is called working smarter, not harder.',0),(30635,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. Those dogs know no mercy, so it\'s good that you showed them none.',0),(30636,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mmmhmm. These will do nicely.$B$BI\'ll have them sent back to camp immediately.',0),(30637,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your instincts were correct, $n.$B$BIn ancient times, the Guo-Lai Halls were home to powerful treasures.$B$BWe must do everything we can to stop this mogu warlord from accessing those sealed crypts.',0),(30638,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'To arms, $n! I thought we would have more time to set up our defenses, but the mogu are proving to be a deadly and intelligent enemy.$B$BWe\'ve moved the refugees and our supplies into the city behind us.$B$BIt\'s up to us to protect the front. We must not let the mogu gain a single foothold here in the Vale.',0),(30639,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Shao-Tien were spotted marching out of the halls with a hundred jade statues. The mogu now have an immense jade army to turn against us, and we\'ve yet to uncover their other goals in the Vale. We are all in danger.$B$BI had thought you and He dead. It\'s good that I was mistaken on the last part at least. Rest. Recover. There will be much fighting ahead.',0),(30640,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n, although it pains me to lay my eyes upon that wretched spear.$B$BThis foul weapon murdered thousands of innocents.$B$BAs long as I live, the mogu shall never have possession of it again.',0),(30641,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n.$B$BWhile our soldiers fight the mogu on the battlefield, I work to strip away the power of their legends.$B$BIn time, Lei Shen shall be no more than the shadow of a memory.',0),(30642,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Such modesty, $n. I witnessed what you did to retrieve the axe. Well done.',0),(30643,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Zhi the Harmonious and the defenders were slaughtered mercilessly.$B$BYour senses tingle. You realize that the Thunder King\'s treasures are gone!',0),(30644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What? Zhi the Harmonious... is dead? Oh...$B$BYou did very well, given the circumstances. I\'m sure a lesser $C would have succumbed to those assassins.$B$BThings are happening... so quickly. We must all keep ourselves together.',0),(30645,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What? You have slain how many mogu?$B$BRemarkable! If we survive this, you must tell me everything that happened.',0),(30646,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What you have accomplished today will live on in stories for ages to come.$B$BWith your help, we have saved the Vale from a terrible enemy.$B$BToday, we dealt a painful blow to the mogu. They will never stop their attempts to seize the Vale, but it will be a long time before they try a full scale attack again.',0),(30649,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n. The city should be safe for now.',0),(30650,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, if it isn\'t our hero, $n.$B$BI really wasn\'t sure we stood a fighting chance out here, you know?$B$BThese guys may be a little rough around the edges, but we\'ll be able to whip \'em into shape. And when we do, we\'ll have a real fighting chance at holding our own here in Kun-Lai.$B$BGood work.',0),(30651,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ho ho, that were a fine sight to see. I knew I should have gone up there with ya, $n!',0),(30654,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It looks like you may have averted a great disaster, $n.$B$BIf this mogu warlord seeks the treasures of the Guo-Lai Halls, we must do all that we can to stop him.',0),(30655,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, it looks like we\'ve got ourselves a little army, here, thanks to you.\n\nThey may not look like much yet, but a little Horde discipline and we\'ll have them in fighting shape in no time.\n\nBy the way, $n... good work.',19116),(30656,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You can\'t tell me that wasn\'t fun, $n! I knew I should have gone over there with you!',19116),(30657,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Ordo lieutenants are dead. The shield is down.>$B$B<Time to take out the Ordo leader!>',19116),(30658,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, I see you recovered some spines $n. These will certainly work well on my spear tips!',0),(30660,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it, $n! I\'m in your debt!$B$BAgain!',0),(30661,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Once again you\'ve accomplished what no one else could.$B$BWas there any doubt?',19116),(30662,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it, $n! I\'m in your debt!$B$BAgain!',0),(30663,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Once again you\'ve accomplished what no one else could.$B$BWas there any doubt?',0),(30665,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have bought us some time to breathe. We must not despair - instead, we must act.',0),(30666,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yesterday, we were fishing happily. Today, the crocs just started... tryin\' to eat us.$B$BStrange.',0),(30667,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks, $n. You\'ve made my day. I always hate to see such a prime feather-gathering opportunity go to waste.',0),(30668,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Jay deftly weaves the planks together into a surprisingly seaworthy-looking vessel, then tosses them down into water below.>',0),(30669,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You appear troubled, child.$B$BHow can this Lorewalker serve you? What is it that you seek?',0),(30670,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. Now you will see how to defeat unbridled rage.$B$BI will craft these into a trap for Kobai, the leader of the yaungol. Though he will be snared, and we will defeat him, he is not our ultimate target...',0),(30671,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve brought me more meat than I could ever hope to eat.$B$BNow, I suppose I owe you a story...',0),(30672,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Jay listens to your account of the day\'s events.>$B$BI see. We\'ll keep an eye on the Ungas from here. And we\'ll do our best not to fish these waters too heavily, either. No doubt we\'re part of the problem, too.$B$BUntil next time, $n.',0),(30678,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Looks like you\'re pretty handy with those bombs!',0),(30682,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We didn\'t know that there were any survivors out there.$B$BThank you for bringing them to safety, $n.',0),(30683,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You were attacked by a mogu? That sounds terrible!$B$BI hate to ask, but did you manage to pick up any supplies while you were fighting for your life?$B$BNo?! This is very bad luck.',0),(30684,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you made it, and you honored the shrines.$B$BI knew you could handle it.',0),(30690,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I should feel shame at the loss of the village. I should feel great pride in your success. $B$BI should feel many things, but must not allow myself to. Until our struggle with the sha is complete, we must maintain total control of our emotions.',0),(30691,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nahassa\'s fevered suffering has come to an end.',0),(30692,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha ha! Hero of grummles! Welcome to Kota Basecamp. Enjoy good fortune for most happy grummle delivery.',0),(30694,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every trap you sprang is a life saved, be it pandaren, beast, or otherwise. Nobody deserves an honorless death like that.',0),(30695,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Koro\'s metaphors can get a little tiring, but there\'s always true wisdom behind them.',0),(30698,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Looks like you found plenty of parts, another set of fishing bombs coming right up! Thanks $n!',0),(30699,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shado-Master Chong sent you, hmm?$B$BYes, we received his request for reinforcements.$B$BWe are in no position to grant it, however. We\'ve just concluded a battle of our own, and the monastery\'s been locked up tight. $B$BWe can\'t even get reinforcements here, and we\'re just down the hill!',0),(30700,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That is quite the claw, Snapclaw must be bigger than I thought! No matter, job well done $n!',0),(30701,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks $C, this might be my best batch of soup yet!',0),(30715,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. I will see to it that the armor is returned to their pupils.',0),(30716,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Chi-Ji smiles on you.',0),(30717,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n.$B$BReturn to us again soon.',0),(30718,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With every battle - a win or a loss - you improve. You become faster, hardier, cleverer... better.',0),(30723,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. After what they have done, I would not show the Yaungol kindness in life. But neither will I allow their bodies to be eaten by the birds.',0),(30724,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow, that was quite a bit of kite-flying there. Good job getting up here and not dying.$B$BIt\'s good you\'re here, too. Lao-chen\'s got an idea he\'s working on, but in the meantime we\'ve got yaungol to deal with.',0),(30725,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good!$B$BThe next time you return, you will face a new challenger. Continue winning, and your favor in the eyes of Chi-Ji will increase.',0),(30726,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. You are beginning to make a name for yourself.',0),(30727,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twice fought, twice defeated. It stands to reason that Ellia will not be requesting more rematches anytime soon.',0),(30728,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Of course you won. Fat Long-Fat does not fight to win. He fights for... other reasons.$B$BI fear I\'ve spoken too much about this subject already. From now on... no more questions about Fat Long-Fat.',0),(30729,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Another fight handily won. I anxiously await your next match, $n.',0),(30730,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n! You continue to gain favor in the eyes of Chi-Ji.$B$BYour next battle will be one to remember. You will not be fighting a trainee. Instead, you will face one of your trainers.',0),(30731,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You continue to impress, $n.$B$BCome again soon. Your training is not over yet.',0),(30732,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will consult directly with Chi-Ji about Ellia\'s behavior. She treads on thin ice.',0),(30733,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, as usual.$B$BI trust I will see you again soon.',0),(30734,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There remains only one trainee ranked higher than you.$B$BI have a feeling that you will be facing him when you return.',0),(30735,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are now our highest-ranked trainee. You are no longer obligated to participate in trainee duels. Congratulations!$B$BOf course, there are still other ways to prove yourself. I have the feeling I will be seeing you again...',0),(30736,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And with that victory, I suppose we\'ve run out of challengers for you to fight! Other than me, of course.$B$BBut... I don\'t fight. I mean, you wouldn\'t want to fight me. It would... not go well for you.',0),(30737,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I believe I understand why he wanted to fight you a second time, though I need to speak with Chi-Ji before I can be sure.$B$BCome back soon, $n. I think it is time you learned the true nature of Fat Long-Fat.',0),(30738,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are truly worthy of the secret of Fat Long-Fat. Here it is:$B$BFat Long-Fat and Chi-Ji are one and the same. Fat Long-Fat is the Red Crane.$B$BHe believes that the Cradle is in great danger.$B$BHe believes there is one person that can save it.$B$BHe believes that you are that person, $n.$B$BStay in touch.',0),(30739,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Cradle of Chi-Ji has long been a bastion of hope; a place free of despair. Ellia Ravenmane tried to plant the seeds of despair on our island... and you stopped her.$B$BWe owe you a debt of gratitude, $n. You are welcome to return whenever you like.',0),(30740,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Done masterfully, as always.$B$BWe hope to see you again soon, $n.',0),(30742,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, friend. Let this be a lesson to you: never feed the goots.',0),(30743,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great, I\'ll get up there and... harvest them soon.$B$B<Cousin Gootfur begins wrapping long strips of linen around his hands.>$B$BCan\'t believe I thought this was a good idea.',0),(30745,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You made it!$B$BYeti\'s are tough enough on their own - can\'t imagine what a cranky kafa-addict yeti must be like. You brave. Or lucky. Or dumb.$B$BMaybe all three.',0),(30746,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You brought kafa?!$B$BYou...$B$BMagnificent...$B$BLuckydo...$B$BHurry, let\'s give it to her! Maybe she won\'t have us both for snack...',0),(30747,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! That was VIOLENT.$B$BNot sure what I was expecting...$B$BThanks to you, I think we may have just formed a mutually beneficial relationship with the Terror of Kota Peak.',0),(30750,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha! I could see them flying. Good work.',0),(30751,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright. I am off to prepare our next move. Good luck, friend.',0),(30752,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No... this is worse than I could have possibly imagined. The monastery itself has been compromised...',0),(30753,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was a huge shark you took out $n! Color me impressed!',0),(30754,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These should do nicely $n. Thanks for the help!',0),(30757,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, |3-6($c). Ненависть оставила меня.$B$BТы $gнаш герой:наша героиня;!',19342),(30763,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you still have all your fingers, nice work.',0),(30768,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. Looks like the rest of the Shado-Pan decided it was a good time to catch up.',0),(30769,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. I hope you showed those cretins no mercy.',0),(30770,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ohohoho! I saw those animals trailing dust from up here.$B$BThose yaungol are probably still wondering what happened.',0),(30771,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It still smells fresh.$B$BGood job, $n.',0),(30772,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should put a serious dent in their numbers.$B$BI doubt they will be able to recover from such losses.',0),(30773,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, $C.$B$BNow that they cannot hide behind their siege weapons, they have no choice but to face us.',0),(30774,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am truly sorry to hear that Lin did not make it.$B$BSuna is taking the news quite hard. She will forgive me in time.$B$BAs for the rest of the Shado-Pan that you saved, well, I am very grateful to see them returned safe and sound.',0),(30775,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It pleases me to know those cowards died at your hands.$B$BPerhaps now, this burning tide in my heart will ebb.',0),(30776,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jung Duk is dead at last.$B$BHundreds, perhaps thousands, lost their lives due to his violent aggression.$B$BThough they are not here to witness his demise, they owe deep gratitude to your bravery today.',0),(30777,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, we made it.',0),(30778,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n.$B$BHopefully, their spirits are in a better place.',0),(30779,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. It was an unpleasant task, but it had to be done.',0),(30780,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was right! These totems were once used to store and conduct immense magical energies.$B$BI do believe I can use them once again to do the same.',0),(30781,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help, $n.$B$BWe cannot know exactly what happened here, but it\'s clear that something caused the yaungol to turn on one another.$B$BWhat kind of power could do this?',0),(30782,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. We cannot bring them retribution, but at least we can end their rage.',0),(30783,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you.$B$BThe sha preys upon the weak and the vulnerable.$B$BIf we are not vigilant, even the strongest of us can succumb to the sha\'s dark influence.',0),(30784,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What? She was possessed by the Sha of Hatred?$B$BNo. NO!$B$BDespite our differences, she was one of us. Today, the Shado-Pan has lost a dear sister.$B$BHer death will not be in vain. I will not rest until I have defeated the Sha of Hatred!$B$BSuna, I swear this to you!',0),(30785,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did the northern expedition go well, then? What news do you have to report?',0),(30786,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am freed.$B$BThe yaungol must be stopped.',0),(30787,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This torch... the yaungol once used these to communicate with me, with my people.$B$BNow, they use them to undo us.',0),(30788,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Golgoss does not speak your language, other than a few words. I suppose I am unique in this regard.$B$BHe thanks you for summoning him.',0),(30789,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It will be difficult to lose with Arconiss by my side.',0),(30790,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are one step closer to my goal.',0),(30791,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yet another step closer to completing my mission.',0),(30792,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I told you earlier, this wound would be my death. While you have bought me a bit more time, it is not long now.',0),(30793,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My name will be forgotten, but my actions will not.$B$BNor will yours, $n.',0),(30794,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. I suppose... I\'ll need to ask you to do a bit more before I can return to the village. I cannot leave the bodies of my friends and family here.',0),(30795,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good! The relic works!$B$BIt appears there is more going on in the Valley of Emperors than I had anticipated. It is crucial we figure out why the Mogu are opening the tombs.',0),(30796,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done them a great service, $n.$B$BIt is a cruel fate to be stuck between the living world and the afterlife.',0),(30797,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This text is curious indeed, $n...$B$BIt appears to have been written in the Meng dynasty, but some of the symbols are wrong. I don\'t think the Mogu wrote this, although it is oddly close.$B$BIt will take me some time to translate. Keep moving and see if you can find anything else.',0),(30798,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Mogu and the Zandalari intend to resurrect the Thunder King?!$B$BWe cannot let this happen, $n! The Thunder King will rain destruction on this land with his return.',0),(30799,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These tablets recount the history of the Mogu and Zandalari alliance dating back to the time of the first Mogu emperor.$B$BBy the looks of things they have rekindled their alliance. But why now?',0),(30800,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are fortunate they haven\'t gotten to Lei Shen\'s remains... yet.$B$BThe Zandalari will not give up until they have what they want.',0),(30801,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They will need to move the remains to a secure location. We must go after them!',0),(30802,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is dark Zandalari blood magic. Once we\'re done with the map it should be burned.$B$BThe map indicates they have headed for the coast just outside of a tiny fishing village called Zouchin. The villagers there may be able to help us find the Zandalari. We just have to hope the village is still standing...',0),(30804,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yee haw! I knew you $rs might be good for somethin\'. He must of made a very satisfying \"thump\" when he hit the ground.',19116),(30805,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh.. they are dead. Already, I can feel my spirits lifting. Soon I will have the strength to return to the village.',0),(30806,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beautiful, beautiful. Better to not need to bury our friends, but if we must, it is good they will have a fitting ceremony.',0),(30807,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. Thank you. After this, I cannot imagine leaving my fellows to less than a proper burial.',0),(30808,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hurray! Our Luckydos. Many thanks and fortune to friend of grummles!',19116),(30814,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. I can see that you are capable.$B$BI hope to rely on your talents for what is to come.',0),(30815,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'By removing this spear, I have truly guaranteed my own death.$B$BThis does not frighten me.$B$BI would sooner die than live carrying the weapon of my enemy.',0),(30816,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ох... Брат беспокоится не зря... Плохо мне...',0),(30819,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... it is tragic what has happened there. We will meet you at the graveyard to honor them.',0),(30820,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. Let us begin the funeral.',0),(30821,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hah hah! We could hear those monkeys screamin\' from over here!$B$B<Burrberry turns to Kota Kon.>$B$BWho\'s a pretty girl? You are!!',0),(30823,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for helping to correct my mistake, friend. Let this be a lesson to you: never feed the goots.',0),(30824,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'d heard an adventurer was up there marking the deposits. Mussy work for someone with your skills, but I appreciate it.$B$BI\'ll get up there and... harvest them soon.$B$B<Cousin Gootfur begins wrapping long strips of linen around his hands.>$B$BCan\'t believe I thought this was a good idea.',0),(30826,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, hello there! Tallmug sent a messenger yak over explaining that you would be helping us with our yeti problems.$B$BAnd you weren\'t torn to shreds! Yeti\'s are tough enough on their own - can\'t imagine what a cranky kafa-addict yeti must be like. You\'re brave. Or lucky. Or dumb.$B$BMaybe all three.',0),(30827,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We look upon the true face of hatred!$B$BNow it all makes sense. This is the work of the sha.',0),(30828,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Mere... I can feel the corruption clearing. At least now, this corruption will not spread.$B$BBut, there is one more thing we must do.',0),(30829,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This must be a very powerful relic for Zuan to want it back so badly.$B$BIt frightens me to think of what else they may find in the tombs...',0),(30834,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found him! This is all I have to give, but in finding my son, you have more than earned it.',0),(30855,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. You have assured that this corruption will not spread, and that my people - those who have not been corrupted - will be able to live on and found a new village. $B$BOur history will live on. You have done more for us than we could have ever hoped.$B$BThank you, friend.',0),(30879,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, претендент.',19342),(30880,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, challenger.',0),(30881,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прискорбно, что эти двое еще не усвоили урок. Впрочем, неважно. Со временем к ним придет мудрость, я уверен.$b$bПоздравляю с победой!',19342),(30882,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah. The Bramblestaff family have long held the championship generation after generation. I am sure this one will take the title sooner or later as well.',0),(30883,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dignified, fighter. You had a strong opponent.',19342),(30884,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You look capable. Taran knows to send me the best. I like that.',0),(30885,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well fought, challenger. That was a fierce opponent.',0),(30887,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is where they\'re getting through, the eastern pass.',0),(30888,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There are more getting through than I thought. I may need to stay here and clean up a while.$B$BYou\'ve done more than your part though, $C. Thank you.',0),(30889,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We could use a few more capable men like you around the camp. Thank you for your help, $C.',0),(30890,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. I\'ll have the new scouts at their posts shortly.',0),(30891,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Marvelous. And in good condition too!$B$BThank you, kind $C.',0),(30892,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There are several warriors that owe their lives to you. You have my deepest appreciation, $C.',0),(30893,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The men of the battlefront are growing to respect you. You clearly know how to fight.',0),(30894,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are in great condition! Thank you, $n!$B$BYou know, I\'ve managed to distil some of their poison into a form that we can apply readily. I\'ve even come up with some methods for weaving it into spell-casting, if you believe it. Would you like to give some a try?',0),(30895,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to have a $C that I can count on.',0),(30896,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I guess you\'re a bit faster than me. Well, thanks.$B$BI\'ll try to finish collecting some orbs and get them back to camp while there\'s still some face to save.',0),(30897,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You... you are a lifesaver! Seriously.$B$BThank you so much!',0),(30898,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'re not done yet...',0),(30899,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There\'s a lot of movement on the other side of the chasm... something big is coming.',0),(30900,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You. You\'re coming with me.$B$BI\'ve never seen someone handle themselves on the battlefield like that. I need a strong $C like you with me when we face the Sha of Hatred.',0),(30901,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s get this taken care of so we can get down to the bridge.',0),(30902,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations, champion! The day is yours.',0),(30907,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beautiful! That\'s the fight! You\'re rightfully winning the championship in today\'s competition. Be sure to come back to us and show your strength again.',19342),(30921,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The abundance of yak hair on that mantid\'s body suggests one thing... it came from Niuzao Temple. Our journey continues westward, $C.',0),(30922,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your messy work may have saved a few lives today, $R.',0),(30923,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are in your debt, $R.',0),(30924,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your Shado-Pan associate has spoken with me. Yes, Niuzao knows why the mantid are attacking. But he is not ready to tell you.$B$BNot yet.',0),(30925,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Niuzao will be pleased.$B$BDespite his size, our patron is a beast of grace and compassion. He treasured this icon... just as he treasures each of his followers.',0),(30926,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me make this clear... that creature was NOT the Sha of Fear. Simply a shadow... a fraction of the sha\'s true power.$B$BNo, the Sha of Fear is with the mantid now. The elders of my order need to be informed of this immediately.$B$BI will handle the rest from here. Thank you for your assistance, $R. Once again, your kind proves to be an asset to Pandaria.',0),(30927,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $C.$B$B$B$BI should have been among them.',0),(30928,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We already have mantid, mogu, and yaungol to worry about. This sha problem needs to be nipped in the bud before even we are overrun.',0),(30929,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think we made a pretty convincing argument. They\'ll HAVE to replace my yak now.',0),(30930,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, well! A good yak!$B$BTell you what, $n. I take this GOOD yak, and you can do whatever you want with this bad, bad one.',0),(30931,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah, this is dad\'s.$B$BLet\'s head on over to the temple. They\'ll know what...$B$B<Ku-Mo\'s voice catches.>$B$B...what happened to him.',0),(30932,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No shield, no crossbow, no yak... something bad has happened to dad.',0),(30933,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ku-Mo doesn\'t seem to notice you.>',0),(30935,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The elders have agreed to help us figure out where the Zandalari have hidden the Thunder King\'s remains.$B$BThey have a few conditions though...',0),(30942,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I told you I was a fast learner! I will head back to the village to start training others. Thank you, $n.',0),(30943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are perfect! Now, I would go wash your hands a few times $C.$B$BI would also continue to avoid open flames for a few days...',0),(30944,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good, $C! With the villagers rested we may yet stand a chance against the Zandalari.',0),(30945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, these are better than I had anticipated! I can make four spears for every one of their blades.$B$BDon\'t you worry, I\'ll make sure the villagers are armed when the time comes.',0),(30946,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We cannot dwell on this setback, $n. Prophet Khar\'zul must be dealt with.$B$BEvery member of the Thunder King\'s forces we are able to destroy brings us one step closer to victory.',0),(30952,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You fight like you are one of us.',0),(30953,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In times like these, we must trust in the power and protection of Niuzao. Should things get any worse, he will protect us.$B$BHe always does.',0),(30954,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will see to it that these are properly distributed. What\'s more - I\'ll make sure our blacksmiths get a rest. Niuzao knows they deserve it.',0),(30955,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He will get up. Soon. Maybe not today, but soon.$B$BAnd when he does...$B$B<A smile grows on Paosha\'s face.>',0),(30956,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at him, $C.$B$BNothing can stop Niuzao. Only Niuzao can stop Niuzao.',0),(30957,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Put on our armor, and you\'d be indistinguishable from any of the other sentinels out there.$B$BGood fighting, $R.',0),(30958,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It looks like the walls are beginning to take shape again. In time, the Temple will be whole again.',0),(30959,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, you\'re back in one piece.$B$BWe hope to be seeing more of you in the future, $R.',0),(30960,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back. I heard about the breaches in the eastern pass. It sounds like I put the right people on the job.',0),(30963,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. I\'ll get to repairing the armor tonight, once most everyone\'s returned.',0),(30964,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do.$B$BThe Shado-Pan appreciates your work, $n.',0),(30967,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Though we may not seem like much, from these inauspicious beginnings I know we will rebuild. Thank you, friend.',0),(30968,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Defeating a Sha... is not an easy thing. It is a miracle that we came out of this unscathed.$B$BTaran still blames himself for letting his hatred get the best of him and setting this beast loose upon the land. It may take some time for him to come to terms with this, but it is important that he does, lest he be vulnerable again.$B$BWe accomplished a great thing this day, a thing that will not soon be forgotten.$B$BAnd neither shall you for your hand in this. Thank you.',0),(30969,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n. This will make it very clear how Garrosh is going to deal with failures...',0),(30970,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. What\'s left of the camp will be a bit safer.',0),(30971,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I... you... er, thank you. You didn\'t have to help, but you did. Thank you.',0),(30972,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Taran Zhu told me what became of my camp. I would have stopped it if I could, but the attacks from the bridge have not let up.$B$BThank you for bringing these arrows - my archers will make good use of them.',0),(30973,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have the added benefit that the mantid will leave with broken morale after watching their brethren burn to death. Grim, but many lives will be spared if they simply stop pressing our lines.',0),(30975,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The mantid aren\'t likely to return soon after a beating like that... and now Lao-Chin is free to join us in the hunt.',0),(30976,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are close. I can feel the unnatural hatred surging.$B$BIt\'s a testament to the training of the Shado-Pan that the forces here have not been consumed by its influence.',0),(30977,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your efforts are appreciated, $C. Even a few more moment\'s breath between attacks are a relief these days.',0),(30978,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent shooting!$B$BI\'m pretty sure that big bug survived the fall though...',0),(30979,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where have you been all my life?! That was amazing!$B$BI\'d be proud to fight beside you any day.',0),(30980,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I like that I can always depend on you. You have the spirit of a true Shado-Pan.',0),(30981,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The first crystal is ours...',0),(30982,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n. Who knows what kind of destruction those beasts would have caused.',0),(30983,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It would seem that the dark shaman experiments drove Gordoth insane.$B$BHopefully we\'ve seen the last of this, $n.',0),(30984,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s all that survived?$B$BI don\'t know who these Dark Shaman are working for, but they are going to pay for this.',0),(30987,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пандарен... ты здесь.$b$bОтлично.',19342),(30988,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, wait-- I want to discuss something else with you.',19342),(30989,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты убедительно $gдоказал:доказала;, чего стоишь в бою. Немногие готовы покинуть родной дом и присоединиться к Альянсу, и еще меньше тех, кто рискнет сразиться c королем Штормграда.$b$bТы и все твои товарищи найдут здесь теплый прием. Добро пожаловать в Альянс, $n.',19342),(30991,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whoo, that was an explosion! Several, in fact.$B$BSad my beer had to go, but at least we\'re safe, for now.',0),(30992,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, their lieutenant is dead. I think we have finally pushed them out of Kun-Lai. $B$BBut at what cost? So many dead, Lin captured... I will not allow Taran Zhu to continue to ignore his charge.',0),(30993,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here we are, and now you know why we cannot let our brothers sit idly by.',0),(30994,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good to see you made it back in one piece. Thanks to your help with the barrels, I\'ve managed to brew up a good surprise for our yaungol friends at the front.',0),(30995,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No one else survived? $B$bThe horde will pay for it in blood.',19342),(30996,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Похоже, эксперименты с черной магией свели Гордота с ума.$b$bНадеюсь, $n, что на этом все закончится.',19342),(30997,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n. Кто знает, каких бед натворили бы эти чудовища.',19342),(30998,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n. Теперь мы узнаем, что им здесь было нужно.',19342),(30999,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Travel to Seeker\'s Point will require much good fortune, $c. Hopefully you have many lucky trinkets!',19116),(31000,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A volunteer for Dread Wastes duty? I think you might be the first.$B$BPleased to meet you.',0),(31001,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The fall wasn\'t that bad, actually. I\'ve always had a knack for soft landings.$B$BThat I landed on a pile of spider corpses probably helped, too.',0),(31002,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work with that dragon gun. I did what I could down here, but arrows are only so useful against these things.',0),(31003,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<This mantid is severely wounded. He barely manages to choke forth his words between wheezing gasps for breath.>$B$BHold, $R...$B$BWe are... not your enemy.',0),(31004,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Klaxxi... call to me.',0),(31005,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will do.',0),(31006,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a sacred meeting place for the Klaxxi.$B$BIt would be wise of you to let me do the talking.',0),(31007,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A few less traitors for us to feed to the kunchong when the dust settles.',0),(31008,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If all goes as planned, the Klaxxi will stop the Empress without your help. Still, it is my role to be prepared.',0),(31010,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My slumber was interrupted by sudden dreams. Unspeakable nightmares.$B$BThen I awoke.$B$BThe Klaxxi have spoken to me. I have my orders. There is much to be done.',0),(31011,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Zandalari have started to retreat, $n. This victory will mean a great deal to the villagers.$B$BIn the chaos I was able to capture one of the fighters. Perhaps we can get information from him.',0),(31014,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve more than proven your worth, in battle and in heart. Few would be willing to leave their homeland to join the Horde. Fewer still would be willing to face a charging magnataur in combat.$B$BYou, and the rest of your people, are welcome among our ranks. Welcome to the Horde, $n.',0),(31015,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Now that that is done we can start to place your collected research here. I look forward to seeing what you find.',0),(31018,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done your duty well, Wakener.',0),(31019,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The whispers seem to be emanating from within this amber.$B$BCould there be another paragon sleeping within?',0),(31020,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I feel the strength returning to my body.',0),(31021,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, Wakener. That is enough for now.',0),(31022,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Once, great rivers of amber coursed through this tree\'s veins. Now, it is but a dried husk.',0),(31023,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These relics describe the history of Kypari Vos and the nearby amber trees.$B$BI would like to study these.$B$BThank you, $C.',0),(31024,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, a worthy feast.$B$BWell done.',0),(31026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, Wakener. Kypari Zar can now dream in peace.$B$BHowever, the beast was merely a vessel for the corruption.$B$BNo... the true corruption lies much deeper.',0),(31030,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have come. Good. This is a calamitous situation.',0),(31031,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have come. Good. This is a calamitous situation.',0),(31032,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your help is appreciated, stranger.',0),(31034,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been expecting your arrival, $n.',0),(31036,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been expecting your arrival, $n.',0),(31037,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been expecting your arrival, $n.',0),(31038,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahhhh, so you bested Snow Blossom in battle, did you?$B$BShe will be stinging from that loss for a while, I\'d wager.$B$BHowever, you have done well to win her to your side.$B$BShe does not warm to strangers quickly, but through time, she will prove to be a loyal and dependable companion.',0),(31039,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Shan\'ze are up to something. Well done, $n, but we must continue to monitor their actions.',0),(31040,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. Left unchecked, the sprites would soon outnumber our entire army.',0),(31041,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gently, gently!$B$BThank you for recovering these eggs safely, $n.$B$BI know a few Serpent Riders in the Jade Forest who will take good care of these.',0),(31042,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do well, $n. Thank you.',0),(31043,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n.$B$BWe\'ll begin deciphering the writing on these tablets at once.',0),(31044,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These claws will come in handy.$B$BGood work, $C.',0),(31045,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew you could do this, $n!$B$BWith fewer Shan\'ze Illusionists to stand against us, our task here will be much easier.',0),(31046,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Those creatures will remember you as their savior.$B$BYou have done well, $n.',0),(31047,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $R. It gladdens me to see that the wild serpents are free once again.',0),(31048,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good riddance, I say! Those mogu ghosts were long past their expiration.',0),(31049,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n.$B$BThe wood sprites may look harmless, but that\'s what makes them so dangerous.',0),(31055,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Before your research, I don\'t think pandarens ever really knew why the saurok were so vicious. We will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),(31058,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A fine punch! A fine punch indeed! The sort of punch that punches back. Well done, $C!',0),(31061,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We do not fully understand what the Shan\'ze are doing, or the nature of their domination over the wild serpents.$B$BBan\'s theory is that the only thing that can cut through the mind control is physical pain.$B$BOnce the Shan\'ze Cloudrunners feel enough pain, it looses the corruption\'s hold, and they finally remember who they are.',0),(31062,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n.$B$BI expected nothing less.',0),(31063,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have the second crystal then. Good.',0),(31064,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The final crystal is ours. We are on the doorstep of our final confrontation.',0),(31065,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our tasks lay before us.',0),(31066,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What?! How did you...$B$BThe Deathcaller was a legendary hero. He must not have been fully wakened.$B$BYou are fortunate.',0),(31067,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'re not here to hurt anybody. We just want to make a little bit of brew out of this tree sap. Is that too much to ask?',0),(31068,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Lya reads the entirety of the message.>$B$BThis scroll, this... this prophecy...$B$BIt\'s terrifying!',0),(31069,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beautiful. This will make a fine addition to our brew.$B$BThe most dangerous ingredients are quite often the most delicious.',0),(31070,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I never thought of putting mushan teeth in a brew before.$B$BThat scroll\'s got some wacky ideas.',0),(31071,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have brought me joy, traveler.',0),(31072,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These daggers, look!$B$B<Lya holds the blades hilt-to-hilt.>$B$BThey were built to fit together! But how to join them...?',0),(31073,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll get these pieces prepared.$B$BWe\'ve already gathered quite a few of these ingredients! I\'ll have to get a pot boiling soon.',0),(31074,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, look! The daggers - they\'ve bound together, into a forked blade.$B$BWe are on the right track. I knew this wasn\'t a beer recipe.',0),(31075,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s been a while since I brewed on the road.',0),(31076,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Chen listens intently.>$B$BBig Dan, Han, Evie, and Mama. I understand.$B$BIt seems like Dan will be safe here. I will go look for Evie, Han, and Mama Stormstout.$B$BTravel well, $n, and follow the Wanderer\'s Way.',0),(31077,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Chen is, for the moment, silent.>',0),(31078,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'First Evie, now Han.$B$BI was too late again.',0),(31079,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good to have someone of your colossal size in our village.$B$BYou have many uses.',0),(31080,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'YEAH!!! FLITTERLING DUST!!!$B$B<Olon throws the powder into the pot.>$B$BThis brew is turning out... strange, and pretty smelly. I\'m starting to think maybe Lya was right.',0),(31081,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work. I\'ve heard the sprites talking about us.$B$BWe\'re getting their attention.',0),(31082,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, good. The motherseeds are taken care of.$B$BNow, we may speak of your enchantment.',0),(31083,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This shinyseed... it was your doing? I already had one shinyseed... but two is better.$B$BWe need only the seed, not the casing. If you like, you can keep.',0),(31084,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The blade is prepared.$B$BNow, only one task remains: you must use it.',0),(31085,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There was a... a mantid inside that amber? I never would have thought that the solution to our war on the mantid would be... another mantid.$B$BThere are still many things that I have left to learn, but I do know this: that CERTAINLY wasn\'t a beer recipe.',0),(31086,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should do it! Recipe... complete.$B$BNow let\'s see how this beer tastes.',0),(31087,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good you showed up when you did.$B$BPerhaps you are not as useless as I thought...$B$BThe Klaxxi\'va sing to the paragon now. Soon they will know where to send you. For now there are other tasks.',0),(31088,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Klaxxi are pleased with our work, outsider. You have proven to be more resourceful than we thought.',0),(31089,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What... what sort of creature are you?$B$BHow have you awoken me?',0),(31090,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even this raw amber will be of use. We can\'t afford to be picky in times like these.$B$BThe Klaxxi\'va will be glad I thought of this. I will tell them you helped!',0),(31091,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kovok is just as impressive as the last time I saw him. He will ensure great victories for the Klaxxi.',0),(31092,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good! I had half expected Kovok to just eat you. What a pleasant surprise to see you both in one piece,$B$BPerhaps Kunchong raising is in your blood.',0),(31093,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hozen are, by their very nature, a rambunctious lot.$B$BWe will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),(31094,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a real treat. I always did enjoy the jinyu. Such a peaceful people with a real appreciation for wisdom.$B$BWe will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),(31095,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mogu. Even the word makes my fur stand on end. We will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),(31096,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who would have thought the freedom of the pandaren people would begin with a single punch.$B$B Wonderful. We will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),(31097,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When we began this research project I never thought I would learn so much about such a terrifying people.$B$BWe will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),(31100,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The yaungol are a warring people strengthened by their exile beyond the wall. We will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),(31102,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a story I have long sought to uncover. Ever since the Sha was released I have felt in my belly that this tale was at the heart of it all.$B$BWe will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),(31103,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The long lost story of Lou Lang and his Wandering Isle. This is a superb addition to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),(31104,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! You bested Yalia!$B$BYou have most definitely earned her favor, $R.',0),(31105,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Shan\'ze are up to something. Well done, $n, but we must continue to monitor their actions.',0),(31106,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Shan\'ze are up to something. Well done, $n, but we must continue to monitor their actions.',0),(31107,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They are large. They will hatch soon.$B$BGood. We may need them.',0),(31108,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What would happen, I wonder, if you ate one? What would it do to your soft, pink insides?',0),(31109,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will do, for now.',0),(31110,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent! Excellent!$B$BThis is just the stuff, $n.$B$BWe\'ll get to work right away. I have no doubt we\'ll be done very soon.',0),(31111,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will admit, Wakener, I am impressed.',0),(31112,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Только взгляните!\r\n\r\nЭти вещицы помогут нам продержаться еще несколько дней.\r\n\r\nИ мои ботинки! Они целы! Отличная работа, Тобру!',0),(31113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well - that should certainly deter any attack for a while. Good work, $n.',0),(31114,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'By conspiring to use these dark magics, the Deadtalkers have given up their rights to protection. Your actions should deter them from their current course, I hope.',0),(31116,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, you have helped right this terrible wrong.',0),(31117,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Uruk is dead! This threat has subsided, at least for today. Thank you, $n.',0),(31118,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aha! Show me that.$B$BHmm... we will send this to the monastery for analysis. As we find which of these symbols are most common in their writing, we can begin to understand the meaning of these writings.',0),(31119,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha! Good work. Teaches both of them to make enemies of the Shado-Pan.',0),(31120,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With Cheng Bo subdued, we can refocus our efforts on our other enemies. Your efforts earn you much respect, $n.',0),(31121,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will help you, traveler, but first I would like to learn a little about this Horde of yours...',0),(31127,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m sure there\'s no hard feelings. She just loves a good fight.$B$BYou should talk to her next time I have some missions for you. She\'s quite an able fighter, as I\'m sure you saw.',0),(31128,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow, you must have impressed Lao-Chin. He can\'t stop talking about how excited he is to go out and fight with you. Good work.',0),(31129,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Chen listens intently.>$B$BBig Dan, Han, Evie, and Mama. I understand.$B$BIt seems like Dan will be safe here. I will go look for Evie, Han, and Mama Stormstout.$B$BTake care, $n.',0),(31131,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<He Softfoot smiles at you as you approach.>',0),(31132,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I suppose the best way to explain what a Lorewalker is all about is to show you...',0),(31133,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve got the makings of a fine brewgarden guard, $R. Let me know if you ever get tired of the whole \"$C\" thing.',0),(31134,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That is enough translating for one day, I think.$B$BThis experience has been an enlightening one, I hope.',0),(31135,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Why, you look great! I\'ve heard bad things about what happens down there.$B$BWell, are you ready to start your training in the ways of the $C?',0),(31136,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well fought. I hope to see more of you soon.',0),(31137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to meet you, $n. You\'ve probably heard others speaking of Operation: Gnomeregan. Let me tell you a bit about what happened and why we left the dwarven city of Ironforge.',0),(31138,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You picked that one up quickly. I can\'t wait to show you some of my other favorite tricks.',0),(31139,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve bought us a little time, $n, but we\'ve got even bigger problems to deal with now.',0),(31140,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. You\'ve turned out to be quite an asset to this garrison. It\'s time for you to train!',0),(31141,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have come from very far to train you in the ways of our people. Do not hesitate to come to me for training whenever you like.',0),(31142,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a quick learner, $n.',0),(31143,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s true, we were ambushed. I don\'t dare send any more soldiers out there and risk losing them too. I need a volunteer. Someone willing to risk their life!',0),(31144,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That will teach those monsters! They\'ll think twice before taking another mercenary job for orcs.',0),(31145,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With your help we have managed to secure the northern and western sectors of Northshire. We still have a rather large contingency of Blackrock orcs to the east and they\'ve begun burning down the forest!',0),(31146,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, you can come to me to learn more about our people and our ways, especially when it comes to the arts of the $C.',0),(31147,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, it\'s my favorite pupil! I\'m going to go ahead to Undercity and try to teach the way of the $C to some of the Deathguards. You should meet up with me there.',0),(31150,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, it is good to see you. I must say, as much as you learn from me, I think I will learn from your people. Your brews are quite different than mine!',0),(31151,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, good work. You may return any time you need another lesson from teacher.',0),(31152,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am most grateful for the knowledge my forebears have passed on to me.$B$BI stand upon their shoulders.',0),(31156,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We will honor our respective peoples by learning from each other. You will become a great $C, if I have anything to say about it. And I will learn the ways of your people.',0),(31157,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, good. Your first challenge surpassed. We will learn much from each other, I can see.',0),(31158,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nicht schlecht, Mann. Es liegt eine natürliche Grazie in Euren Schwüngen... Ihr habt womöglich Talent.$B$BEin paar Ecken und Kanten sind natürlich noch zu glätten, aber ich werde Euch noch einiges beibringen in nächster Zeit.',19116),(31159,6,5,0,0,0,60,0,0,'Noch so ein Jungblut, wie?$B$BObwohl, Ihr seht aus, als wärt Ihr gut in Form. Ruhige Hände. Scharfe Augen. Vielleicht wird aus Euch noch $gein echter:eine echte:c; $C.$B$BLasst uns keine Zeit mehr verschwenden.',19116),(31160,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Das sind nette Pelzchen, $GJunge:Mädel;. Die geben sicher \'n paar mächtige Mäntel ab.',19116),(31161,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ihr seid sehr gut in Form. Eines Tages werdet Ihr sehr mächtig sein.',19116),(31162,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gute Arbeit, Mann! Das schien Euch ja wirklich leicht zu fallen.',19116),(31163,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ihr seid der neue Rekrut, von dem alle reden, hm? Willkommen bei den Dunkelspeeren.',19116),(31165,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am honored that Chief Hawkwind would allow me to train you and grant you your rite of passage. While I am a master in the ways of the $C, I am but a child in the ways of your people.',0),(31166,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well, $n.',0),(31167,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not so different, you and I.$B$BI believe we can become good friends.',0),(31168,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was warned that not all of your people would be welcoming, but I have found quite the opposite - not only have I been welcomed, but I have learned so much from you.$B$BYou seem quite promising as a young $C, and I hope I can teach you much of our ways, as your people have taught me of yours.',0),(31169,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve proven a capable student. When it is time to resume your training, return to me and I will show you other techniques.',0),(31170,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, welcome. I have been teaching your people the ways of the $C, and they seem to be well suited for it. Perhaps you too will take to it as quickly as they.',0),(31171,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think you\'ve mastered the basics of the Tiger Palm technique, $n. Perhaps you will impress me, after all.',0),(31173,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Keep that technique handy, $n. You can use it to finish off strong opponents, or just to feel awesome, like a tiger.',0),(31175,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The hunger... they said it would be fierce, but I did not expect anything like this.$B$BIt is strange to feel so... weak.',0),(31176,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, give it here! Well done, Wakener.',0),(31177,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. This shall give me the strength to vanquish my foes.',0),(31178,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, this will do.',0),(31179,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have succeeded once again. Well done, Wakener.',0),(31181,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not bad, green, not bad.',0),(31182,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should keep their little whiskers out of our traps for awhile.',0),(31183,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'New deckhand, eh? We\'ll see about that.$B$BI run a tight ship - even if she IS at the bottom of the sea.',0),(31184,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s the charter tube, alright. I guess you\'d like to know what all the fuss is about, eh?$B$B<Soggy lets out a long sigh as he un-caps the tube.>$B$BMight as well get it over with.',0),(31185,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How did it go? I hope he didn\'t cause too much trouble!',0),(31186,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Dog licks his chops happily, looking satisfied.>',0),(31187,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work out there!',0),(31188,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Those are perfect, just put them down over there. I\'d rather not touch them myself. Creeps me out.',0),(31189,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What happened out there?! I heard a scream and next thing I know these nasty things come rolling in on the next wave!',0),(31190,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice shooting out there!$B$BI knew we could do it. Never met anything that can\'t be killed with enough harpoons.',0),(31194,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful! I knew you could triumph against the Slitherscale lord.',0),(31196,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. I think it\'s always best to strike while they\'re unprepared.',0),(31197,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, well done. That should keep us safe for a few days, at least.',0),(31198,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m sure they\'ll be upset without those statues. Right?',0),(31199,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Those siege weapons won\'t be a problem. They may rebuild, but we\'ve bought ourselves some time.',0),(31200,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice, I can see the smoke from here. That should definitely cause some confusion!',0),(31201,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, thank goodness. I was worried about them!',0),(31203,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I heard you did a little... extra credit while you were out there. Good work, friend.$B$BCome back another day - I\'m sure we\'ll have some more work for you.',0),(31204,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n! Because you took on that extra work, you\'ve bought us some respite from the mantid.$B$BI\'m sure I\'ll have more work for you in the future, though. Come back later.',0),(31207,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gargtok said it was a glorious fight. Take your pick!',19831),(31208,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, Wakener. I hope you handled these stingers carefully.$B$BThe natural poison from these scorpions is deadly, but slow.',0),(31209,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, excellent, Wakener! These are perfect.$B$BHave you ever considered learning the poisoner\'s craft?',0),(31210,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many would not know the value of what you hold.$B$BYou have done well, Wakener.',0),(31211,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for returning me home, Wakener, but I fear the war has just truly begun.',0),(31216,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, Wakener. You have a destroyer\'s aim.',0),(31220,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, well, well. Looks like I was wrong.$B$BGood work. Nurong\'s looking forward to accompanying you on your missions.',0),(31221,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! Well done. Glad to see you fought so well.$B$BMaybe if he\'s trying to keep up with your fighting it\'ll help keep his mouth shut.',0),(31228,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These events should be learned from, $n.$B$BIt is important that we learn from our history. Had we paid attention to the histories, we may have been able to head this off before it got this far.$B$BEverything that has happened was already foretold, we just didn\'t know how to read it.',0),(31231,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I never liked spiders. Filthy, mindless insects.',0),(31232,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, Wakener. It will take me time to decipher these tablets, but all knowledge is worthy.',0),(31233,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, this is exactly what I needed.$B$BI will examine these samples. We must continue to monitor the health of these young kypari.',0),(31234,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, yes! Wonderful! Oh, so delicious!',0),(31235,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A crude weapon, but it has its uses.',0),(31237,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Information is power, $n. We cannot allow the Empess to monitor our movements.',0),(31238,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kovok was whining the whole time you were away. It was really quite pathetic.',0),(31239,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha ha! Wikket Grooked ookin\' Jinyu!',0),(31240,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, you\'re here.$B$BFor a while there, I was wondering if Ren would even deliver the message.',0),(31241,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wikket grookin\' makin\' hozen rich with shinies!$B$B$n makin\' a good second impression. And for hozen, number two is most important!',0),(31242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Leven sent me a good one today! I must thank him later.',0),(31243,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, thank the celestials you\'re here! This is worse than we thought!',0),(31244,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Glad you\'re here. Let\'s get to work.',0),(31245,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ren send you my way? He puts on playful air, but he follows through when it matters. Can\'t hold it against him much.',0),(31246,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You come to help Rook?',0),(31247,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well timed. I was just about to go put some recruits through their paces, but I\'d be much more eager to see what you have to offer.',0),(31248,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If it isn\'t one of my favorite paladins. Glad to have you with us.',0),(31249,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is strange to be dispatched away from the combat, but Leven is right in that the villagers need our protection. We cannot afford any risks.',0),(31250,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s whip these recruits into shape.',0),(31251,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You know what they say about cooking - GTL. Garnish, taste... and... laundry?',19116),(31252,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did good, bringing these guys back. We\'ll have \'em farming you up some food in no time!',0),(31253,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did good, bringing these guys back. We\'ll have \'em farming you up some food in no time!',19116),(31254,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, you are a friend of Cho\'s? Welcome! Welcome!$B$BI would serve you a banquet but as you can see we are in dire straights at the moment.$B$BSay, would you be willing to lend us a hand?',0),(31255,2,1,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Oh, you are a friend of Cho\'s? Welcome! Welcome!$b$bI would serve you a banquet, but as you can see, we are in dire straights at the moment.$b$bSay, would you be willing to lend us a hand?',19116),(31256,1,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done! Well, they\'re plenty stubborn, I\'ll say that much. But they should do nicely.',19116),(31260,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impressive! Can you smell the money? Here\'s your end.',0),(31261,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ookin\' grookin, wikket!',0),(31262,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now THAT is a trophy. Looks intimidating. Wait... is this your blood on it?',0),(31265,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ll thank me later.',0),(31266,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It was just a decoy! They\'ve moved to attack Niuzao Temple!',0),(31267,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. With access to this amber, we shall be able to craft weapons to our cause.',0),(31268,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My my, this is interesting indeed. They are unlike any other brains I have seen.$B$BI will study these carefully.',0),(31269,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. I am glad to hear that he is dead.',0),(31270,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have purged the hills of the infected creatures? Good.$B$BThe sha is a merciless enemy. Thus must we be merciless in return.',0),(31271,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, yes! They are dead!$B$BThank you, Wakener. Well done.',0),(31272,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So the infection was spreading. You halted the spread just in time, it seems.$B$BI doubt that the genemancers will stop their outrageous experimentation, but we must continue to thwart their efforts.',0),(31277,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Niuzao has been saved. The Mogu pushed back. And you, friend, have been found worthy of a great honor. $B$BWe shall induct you into the Shado-Pan.',0),(31279,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My, that\'s so thoughtful. I love hearing from my old students.',0),(31281,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very well. You are capable of learning. There is much I can teach you, and I have most of the ingredients you need to learn. Train with me.',0),(31285,1,1,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Wheh, we made it. Welcome to Binan Village.',19116),(31286,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, our merchandise. Madam Goya will be pleased. You have the gratitude of her ladyship.',0),(31287,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The deed is done and a debt must be paid. Here is your reward. You have our gratitude.',0),(31288,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Some fine pieces here. Very fine pieces indeed. My thanks, adventurer.',0),(31289,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Some fine pieces here. Very fine pieces indeed. My thanks, adventurer.',0),(31293,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rook can handle rest of mogu. Thanks for help. Good man.',0),(31294,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Che sent you my way, did he? Good to have you.$B$BThe ruins are crawling with things to be squashed.',0),(31295,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good to see you.$B$BI don\'t know where the mogu mustered all these forces, but we need to hit them hard before they can push their advantage.',0),(31296,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sun is smart to send me the strong ones. I\'d accept nothing else.',0),(31297,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You I can work with. Let\'s show these trainees a thing or two about how a real $C fights.',0),(31302,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are ready. You are now a zen master cook.',0),(31306,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you made it, and you honored the shrines.$B$BI knew you could handle it.',0),(31308,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work, $n! You\'re better with those pets than I thought!',0),(31309,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now those look like some healthy pets, $n. Remember, you can heal and revive your entire collection of pets at any time by visiting a stable master.',0),(31311,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good cuts.',0),(31312,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whoa! I think you found it, $n! You found the map to Old Man Thistle treasure!',0),(31313,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Of course! It makes perfect sense. So the location of the treasure must be where the lake meets the mountains!',0),(31314,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The chest\'s lid slides off with the lightest touch. You peer inside...',0),(31315,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, I know the story of Old Man Thistle quite well, $R.$B$BThere are all sorts of crazy tales about his quest for treasure.$B$BBut the truth of the matter is that he was a bit of a recluse, a bit eccentric, and an excellent farmer.$B$BAs he grew near the end of his life, he retreated up into the mountains and was never seen again.$B$BHe was just a man, and it seems that you have found his legacy.$B$BBut don\'t tell Fish the truth. Some stories are best left tall in the telling.',0),(31316,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re better with those pets than I thought!',0),(31320,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanksh, buddy.',0),(31321,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oooh, this is the shtuff.',0),(31322,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oooh, that\'sh got quite the kick! I\'m growing shleepy...',0),(31323,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n! I will be shaving these for a rainy day... hic!',0),(31324,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хо-хо, а это еще что?$B$B<Пивное брюшко дядюшки Гао колышется, когда он видит фамильные рецепты.>$B$BЯ так и знал, что добавляю слишком много кукурузы.',19342),(31325,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my, this is my favorite necklace! I didn\'t even know it was missing! Thank you, $n.',0),(31326,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, my tiara! It was missing, but wherever did you find it?',0),(31327,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Огромное существо из хмеля?! Как такое может прийти в голову?$B$BСпасибо, что спас Гао от его собственных экспериментов с хмелем.',19342),(31328,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my earring! Why, it matches the one I\'m wearing today!$B$B<Tina hooks the earring onto her ear.>$B$BThank you, $n!',0),(31329,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My grandmother\'s brooch! Oh, thank you for finding this! It\'s a family treasure.',0),(31332,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here it is! How did I do?',0),(31333,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here it is! How did I do?',0),(31334,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here it is! How did I do?',0),(31335,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here it is! How did I do?',0),(31336,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here it is! How did I do?',0),(31337,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re my favorite teacher ever.',0),(31338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, you found him! Thank you!',0),(31339,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sheepie, you make me so worried! Bad sheep! Chee Chee was so worried about you!',0),(31340,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What? Sheepie is... gone?$B$B<Chee Chee\'s lip begins to quiver.>',0),(31341,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. It will not bring my Sheepie back, but at least this way, no more sheep will be lost.',0),(31342,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gпобедил:победила; Ша Жестокости и $gспас:спасла; монастырь. Прими же мою благодарность.$B$BБыть может, мы неправильно судили о твоем народе, $n.',19342),(31354,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey there!$B$BOh, I\'m fine. I\'ve had worse spills than that after a night at the Chum Bucket.$B$BBut would you look at this thing? I spotted it peeking out of the sea floor when I went under - Jiao must have dredged it up while he was thrashing around.$B$BNot really sure what to do with it, but it looks valuable. Seeing as how you pretty much saved all our hides, I think we owe you this catch.',0),(31355,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'То, что случилось с Мудрым Марисом и жрицей Пламенное Сердце, очень печально. Но все равно – благодарю тебя от всей души.',19342),(31356,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я никогда в тебе не сомневался. Но почему-то мудрости в тебе не прибавилось.$B$B<мастер подмигивает>',19342),(31357,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я найду, где спрятать эти реликвии.$B$BПандария перед тобой в неоплатном долгу, $n.',19342),(31359,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am most impressed with your progress, Wakener. Kovok\'s training is coming along nicely and he seems to be fond of you.$B$BI have no doubt that you are the best choice to assist me in training him.',0),(31360,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это была поистине великая битва.$B$BХорошо, что ты на нашей стороне, $n.',19342),(31363,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Потрясающе, $n. Очень вовремя!',19342),(31364,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t believe it! Thank you, $n!',19342),(31365,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thirteen thanks I give to you; twelve for those you rescued and my own as well.$B$BHere\'s something else I give to you in gratitude.',0),(31366,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The wing leader lies dead and the siege is broken.$B$BYou\'ve saved the temple, $n.',0),(31367,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, I can see by your face that you are an eager seeker of stories. You have come to the right place.',0),(31368,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, I can see by your face that you are an eager seeker of stories. You have come to the right place.',0),(31369,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You ready to catch some FISH?',0),(31370,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You ready to catch some FISH?',0),(31372,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You arrived just in time!',0),(31373,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, have you come to join the Order?',0),(31374,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You arrived just in time!',0),(31375,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, have you come to join the Order?',0),(31376,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve arrived just in time, $C.',0),(31377,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve arrived just in time, $C.',0),(31378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $C.',0),(31379,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $C.',0),(31380,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Итак, ты хочешь испытать свои силы? Отлично, |3-6($R).',19342),(31381,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you wish to test your skills? Very good, $R.',0),(31382,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $C! We need your help.',0),(31383,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $C! We need your help.',0),(31384,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $R. You look capable. Glad to know we have a decent $C on our side.',0),(31385,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $R. You look capable. Glad to know we have a decent $C on our side.',0),(31386,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $R.',0),(31387,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes. $n. Your name has traveled to us from the east.$B$BWe have seen your efforts in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Already you have earned the esteem of the Golden Lotus.$B$BYes, we are interested to learn more about you.',0),(31388,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $R.',0),(31389,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes. $n. Your name has traveled to us from the east.$B$BWe have seen your efforts in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Already you have earned the esteem of the Golden Lotus.$B$BYes, we are interested to learn more about you.',0),(31390,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Dread Wastes is a very dangerous place.',0),(31391,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Dread Wastes is a very dangerous place.',0),(31392,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$c, it\'s good to have you here! The Pandarens speak of a legendary place, the Eternal Blossom. According to the locals, it has great healing power.\r\n\r\nBut the Chief of the Horde has done something terrible to the bone.\r\n\r\nWe need to get there now!',0),(31393,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Приветствую, $c! Мы добились аудиенции у Белого Тигра. Недавно наш вождь вторгся в Вечноцветущий дол, и мы просим, чтобы для оказания помощи в восстановлении туда впустили и Альянс и Орду.\r\n\r\nЭто священное место. Скорее всего, именно оно привиделось моей жене Лезе, и поэтому мой народ оказался в Пандарии. Мы обязаны спасти Вечноцветущий дол!\r\n\r\nКак думаешь, нас пропустят?',0),(31394,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Молодец, $n!\r\n\r\nБелый Тигр разрешил нам сопроводить пандаренов в Вечноцветущий дол. Там уже появился аванпост Альянса. Можно начинать работу над восстановлением!',0),(31395,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Молодец, $n!\r\n\r\nБелый Тигр разрешил нам сопроводить пандаренов в Вечноцветущий дол.\r\n\r\nТам, где потерпел неудачу принц Альянса, удача улыбнулась посланнику Орды.\r\n\r\nТам уже появился аванпост Орды. Можно начинать работу над восстановлением.',0),(31398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You were wise to bring this to us. This is a piece of another paragon\'s encasing amber.$B$BThe damage suggests the paragon may be in trouble.$B$BI will speak with the council to decide what should be done next.',0),(31439,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It seems my work will begin immediately. You have come to a dangerous place, Wakener.',0),(31440,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n.$B$BWith the destruction of the tomes I\'ll go to my final rest knowing that those books will never again haunt a living soul.',0),(31441,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You will see more of this. War is never pretty.$B$BThe empresses\' corruption is far reaching and hard to detect.$B$BThere is much work to be done. We need to start repairing the damage Kor\'ik did.',0),(31442,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n.$B$BWith the destruction of the tomes I\'ll go to my final rest knowing that those books will never again haunt a living soul.',0),(31447,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Behold my true form.$B$BI owe you a debt, one which I can never repay. But, I thank you for lifting the curse off of my family.$B$BKel\'Thuzad, the Lich King, and now Darkmaster Gandling -- all are dead.$B$BPerhaps now I too can find some semblance of peace.',0),(31448,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Behold my true form.$B$BI owe you a debt, one which I can never repay. But, I thank you for lifting the curse off of my family.$B$BKel\'Thuzad, the Lich King, and now Darkmaster Gandling -- all are dead.$B$BPerhaps now I too can find some semblance of peace.',0),(31450,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So be it ... Here it is, our new home.',19342),(31451,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My son! They took my son... Can you help me?',0),(31452,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My son! They took my son... Can you help me?',0),(31453,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who are you? Can you fight? If so, we can use your help.',0),(31454,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Of course, I must ask your discretion regarding what we just talked about.$B$BWe wouldn\'t want to alarm anyone who is, shall we say, less capable than yourself.',0),(31455,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who are you? Can you fight? If so, we can use your help.',0),(31456,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wha? Who the heck are you? What are you doin\' here?$B$BOh, you wanna help?',0),(31457,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wha? Who the heck are you? What are you doin\' here?\n\nOh, you wanna help?',19116),(31458,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work! This should allow us the time to repair the damage Kor\'ik caused.$B$BYou may have just shifted the tide of war in our favor.',0),(31459,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, hello. Nice to see you again.',19116),(31460,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, hello. Nice to see you again.',0),(31465,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This venom is in its advanced stages, but doesn\'t seem to be losing it\'s potency...$B$BThis is very curious. The Klaxxi will want to know immediately. Thank you, Wakener.',0),(31467,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Strength and good health! This is the Way of the Grill.',0),(31468,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Marvelous. That did not take long at all.$B$BWord of your many achievements has been the talk of the Vale!$B$BVery well, I will take you under my wing.',0),(31470,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done.',0),(31471,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work.',0),(31472,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good stuff. Now, let\'s get to your lesson.',0),(31473,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My friend - you do not disappoint!$B$BWe will put these to good use. ',0),(31474,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Intellect is a gift you must hone with time.',0),(31475,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fine ingredients.',0),(31476,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Spirits are lifted by good food.',0),(31477,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stamina and endurance are needed for mastering anything. To slave over a hot oven takes patience, but the results are very much worth the effort.',0),(31478,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We can work with these.',0),(31479,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a fine example of good ginseng. Would you like to learn how to make tea with it?',0),(31480,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. This is delicious.',0),(31481,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done it!$B$BSome put their faith in magic or steel. But in my experience, fear is the most powerful weapon one can wield. Use it properly, and your enemies cannot bring themselves to fight you. ',0),(31482,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have earned this, $n! Use it well.$B$BPlease understand, I mean to pay off my father\'s debts. I will stop at NOTHING to defend this world. In the future, if you are ever uncertain, you are welcome to question my means. But never question my motives. The safety of this world is my primary concern.$B$BNow then, let\'s talk about current events.',0),(31483,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They\'re here!$B$B<Wrathion claps his hands and rubs them together, excitedly.>$B$BOh $n. Things are about to get exciting.',0),(31487,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let this be a reminder - the kunchong should be feared and respected.',0),(31488,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My people have done their job and brought you to me. Wonderful. ',0),(31489,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My people have done their job and brought you to me. Wonderful. ',0),(31490,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличное начало, $n!$b$bСкоро от Алого ордена останется лишь безобразная строчка в анналах истории.',19342),(31492,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! You made it. Usually I get stopped by one of those gusts of wind.',0),(31493,273,274,0,0,0,3000,0,0,'О да!$B$B<Рыцарь в капюшоне радостно потирает руки при виде кодекса.>$B$BТеперь у меня есть перечень всех имен крестоносцев Алого ордена!$B$BА то, знаешь... мало ли, вдруг с кем-то из них еще не рассчитались. Не люблю быть должной.',19342),(31494,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, I could see them rising up from the clutches. Beautiful!',0),(31496,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, yes, hand it over! Quickly now! My forelegs are trembling with anticipation.',0),(31502,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent, these are in fine shape.',0),(31503,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My enhancements are tools for experienced warriors. Not toys for these fool children!',0),(31504,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You weren\'t exposed to the pheromones were you? That could lead to... well, perhaps I shouldn\'t worry you with the details.',0),(31505,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One by one, her champions fall.',0),(31506,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ingenious devices, really. I have a feeling they will prove useful.',0),(31507,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The kyparite ignited, did it? Fascinating!$B$BNot exactly what I was hoping for, but it\'s something.',0),(31508,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well look at that, you actually got it done. I half expected to be scooping your remains out of the muck with a jar.',0),(31509,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This species is interesting, but the risks associated with keeping it around for study are too high.',0),(31510,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It must drive her further into paranoia and madness, losing contact with Zan\'vess.$B$BGood. Let her suffer.',0),(31511,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming so quickly.$B$BFor thousands of years, the Golden Lotus has kept the Vale safe from those who would seek its power.$B$BUnfortunately, that time is past, and we need your help.',0),(31512,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming so quickly.$B$BFor thousands of years, the Golden Lotus has kept the Vale safe from those who would seek its power.$B$BUnfortunately, that time is past, and we need your help.',0),(31513,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< The second sword of the anointed soars in the air just before the wet statue. Steam rises from the sword.$B$B< You somehow feel that the Will of Providence is waiting for you. >',19342),(31514,396,396,2,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда Вайтмейн больше нет, Алому ордену настанет конец. Теперь осталось убрать мусор.$B$BСпасибо тебе, $n. Не только от меня, но от всех, кто противостоял их злобе и ненависти.$B$BИ позволь поблагодарить за новые мечи. Они послужат мне верой и правдой в Некроситете, когда я буду сражаться с темным магистром Гандлингом.$B$BДо скорой встречи.',19342),(31515,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The second anointed blade floats just in front of the wet statue. Steam rises from the sword.>$B$B<You get the uncanny feeling that the Hand of Providence has been waiting for you.>',0),(31516,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With Whitemane gone for good, the Scarlet Crusade is finished. It\'s just a matter of sweeping up the refuse.$B$BThank you, $n. Not just for myself, but for everyone opposed to mindless hatred and bigotry.$B$BAnd, thank you for these two new blades. Anointed anew in her blood, they should serve me well as I take the fight to Scholomance and deal with Darkmaster Gandling.$B$BI bid you adieu for now.',0),(31517,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I commend your victory and thank you for dealing with that ruffian.',0),(31519,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my sincerest thanks, $n. Without fine Stormstout brews to lighten the drudgery of the day, the world would be a dull place indeed.',0),(31520,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my gratitude, $n. You\'ve displayed great valor today, and the speed at which you completed the challenge surely will impress your friends and intimidate your foes.',0),(31521,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have been a great student. Now you should share your knowledge with others. I hope you will speak with the Stock Master and take on an apprentice as soon as you can.',0),(31522,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many blessings upon you, $n. Driving hatred from this world so quickly deserves rich reward.',0),(31523,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many thanks, $n. Your martial prowess is second to none, and your alacrity is sure to strike fear in the hearts of your enemies.',0),(31524,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was a blow well struck, $n. I\'ve never seen a $C fell a giant with such speed.',0),(31525,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, that was amazing. Ner\'onok is a master tactician, and you schooled him handily.',0),(31526,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'re a stalwart $C. Your friends and guild mates will surely notice the speed and ferocity with which you conquered the Scarlet Monastery.',0),(31527,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. Just the thought of him burning up that beautiful library makes me shudder. Your friends will appreciate the speed with which you dispatched him.',0),(31528,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. May the skeletons of the dead remain peaceful now that Gandling no longer seeks to disturb their slumber.',0),(31529,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The targets are eliminated? Well done, $C.',0),(31531,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew you would carry out the mission without any problems. Well done, $n.',0),(31532,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it, $n! I feel at ease knowing the Valley safer now, because of you.',0),(31534,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You got them! This is wonderful, $n!$B$BI\'ll get started on the brew as soon as I can.',0),(31535,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your help is very much appreciated. This will make a great difference for some of our students.',0),(31536,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good. Now these ingredients will stay fresh until we\'re ready to cook.',0),(31537,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Правда? Они прямо так и сказали? Ну надо же!',26124),(31538,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You aren\'t pulling my leg are ya, $n? If he really said that, well... I guess... I guess it means I can do it, after all!$B$BThank you, $n. You\'ve really helped me gain confidence in myself.',0),(31539,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This... This is beyond my wildest expectations. This will be treasured and preserved for generations to come.',0),(31540,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fine craftsmanship. The monks will appreciate these.',0),(31541,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beautiful. This will be cherished.',0),(31542,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where did you... How did you... This is perfect!',0),(31543,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A fine painting.',0),(31544,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A fine work to honor a fine man.',0),(31548,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work, $n! You\'re better with those pets than I thought!',0),(31549,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now those look like some healthy pets, $n. Remember, you can heal and revive your entire collection of pets at any time by visiting a stable master.',0),(31550,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что ж, прекрасный выбор. Рано или поздно ты соберешь отличную коллекцию!$b$bПомни, любого питомца, с которым можно драться, можно и поймать, так что не упускай такую возможность, если она вдруг появится.',19342),(31551,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... an excellent choice. You\'re on your way to building up a great team!$B$BRemember, any pet you can fight, you can catch, so go ahead and try to get as many as you can during your adventures.',0),(31552,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work, $n! You\'re better with those pets than I thought!',0),(31553,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now those look like some healthy pets, $n. Remember, you can heal and revive your entire collection of pets at any time by visiting a stable master.',0),(31555,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... an excellent choice. You\'re on your way to building up a great team!$B$BRemember, any pet you can fight, you can catch, so go ahead and try to get as many as you can during your adventures.',0),(31556,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work, $n! You\'re better with those pets than I thought!',0),(31568,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now those look like some healthy pets, $n. Remember, you can heal and revive your entire collection of pets at any time by visiting a stable master.',0)