nue your training.',0),(31843,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hear from Master Yoon that your training went well. Come back again in the future to continue your training.',0),(31844,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hear from Master Cheng that your training went well. Come back again in the future to continue your training.',0),(31845,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hear from Master Tsang that your training went well. Come back again in the future to continue your training.',0),(31846,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hear from Master Hsu that your training went well. Come back again in the future to continue your training.',0),(31847,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A volunteer for Dread Wastes duty? I think you might be the first.$B$BPleased to meet you.',0),(31850,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your risk has paid its reward.',0),(31852,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A thrilling match! Splendid! Well done indeed!',0),(31853,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome aboard the Fist of Hell Creek, $n! $b$bThis is his first flight. Isn\'t he handsome?',20886),(31854,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your pets are ecstatic about their victory. I hope you are as well.',0),(31855,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, $n. It is time to continue your training.',0),(31856,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $n. It is time to begin your training.',0),(31857,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, $n. It is time to continue your training.',0),(31858,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, $n. It is time to continue your training.',0),(31859,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, $n. It is time to continue your training.',0),(31860,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, $n. It is time to continue your training.',0),(31861,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, $n. It is time to continue your training.',0),(31862,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You think yourself victorious, but I be growin\' stronger with each defeat.',0),(31870,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26124),(31871,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No! Gluk no lose! Rematch!',0),(31872,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your victory is well-deserved. Your skills are superior to my own.',0),(31876,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, a scribe of great skill. Some of us here could really use your help.',0),(31886,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A volunteer for Dread Wastes duty? I think you might be the first.$B$BPleased to meet you.',0),(31891,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ротители боевых питомцев: КалимдорТы всем в Калимдоре $gдал:дала; понять, что с тобой нужно считаться. Но твоя дорога только начинае�',26124),(31894,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Orbiss groans at you in agony.>$B$BSo, the shado-pan have sent you to see what the yaungol are doing? Well, do you see?',0),(31895,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A volunteer for Dread Wastes duty? I think you might be the first.$B$BPleased to meet you.',0),(31897,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26124),(31903,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ротители боевых питомцев: Восточные королевстваЗа Орду! Твои предки могли бы гордиться тобой!Я никогда не сомневался в тебе.Варзок',26365),(31904,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I must\'ve converted a line wrong somewhere...',0),(31905,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s like my pretties have lost their will to fight.',0),(31906,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mark my words, I will defeat you one day soon.',0),(31907,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This world is doomed. Why do you continue to try so fervently?',0),(31908,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My flight has come to an end. Victory is yours this day.',0),(31909,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26124),(31910,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps my research is not as complete as I thought.',0),(31911,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps undeath is not the answer...',0),(31912,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re no better than Durin. In it for the glory. Pah!',0),(31913,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you have secrets of your own.',0),(31914,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll defeat ye if it\'s the last thing I ever do. I haven\'t come this far fer nothin\'!',0),(31915,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),(31916,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),(31917,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m so proud of you, $n. You\'re ready for the big time!',19116),(31918,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26124),(31920,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),(31921,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ЗапредельеТвои силы растут. Давай посмотрим, сумеешь ли ты справиться с великим укротителем питомцев Запределья!Пусть битвы принесут тебе славу.ВарзокВот и еще один этап твоего пути завершен.Варзок',26365),(31922,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I forgot to carry the 1!',0),(31923,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work!',0),(31924,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It would seem that these younglings still have a lot of work to do before they are at full strength. Thank you.',0),(31925,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even I continue to learn from each passing day.',0),(31926,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),(31928,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),(31929,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'НордсколМало кому удавалось зайти так далеко. И еще меньше тех, кто встречался с великим укротителем боевых питомцев Нордскола! Так что приготовься.Я не проиграю!ВарзокТебя ждет самое сложное испытание.Варзок',26365),(31931,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One day, when we\'re flying high above you, you\'ll be the loser!',0),(31932,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your risk has paid its due reward. Now begone!',0),(31933,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I dare you to continue to fight the inevitable. Dragons will once again serve our purposes, and you will fall to my hand in a pet battle. I swear on the Warchief\'s mantle that it will be so!',0),(31934,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Me like fighting you, even if me lose.',0),(31935,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I applaud your tactics, but despise your victory. Well done, $n.',0),(31936,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A sprinkler system? For the farm? Thank you, $n! We can use this instead of that old watering can.$B$BThe \"Jinyu Princess\" eh? What\'s up with that?$B$B$B$BAlright, I don\'t even want to know. I\'ll get this installed right away!',0),(31937,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pest repellers! You\'re a genius, $n! We can finally stop using that ancient bug sprayer.$B$B$B$BAw yeah, Thunder King! That\'s what I\'m talking about!$B$BI\'ll get this installed right away - those bugs won\'t know what hit \'em!',0),(31938,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An Earth-Slasher master plow! I... I never thought I\'d get to use one of these. Do you have any idea how much time this will save us?!$B$BI heard if you push the Earth-Slasher through twenty yards of solid rock, you end up with a sandbox and a citation from the Shado-Pan for causing an earthquake scare!$B$BThis is going to be AWESOME.',0),(31941,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well planted, $n.$B$BNow we play the waiting game...',0),(31942,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was close. We almost missed melon time.',0),(31943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright, witchberries! I can\'t wait!$B$BBut I\'m gonna have to.',0),(31944,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. Your training is now complete. Feel free to return in the future to spar with the masters here to practice what you have learned.',0),(31945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, I\'ll be! I\'ve certainly seen larger scallions, but this will do quite nicely. You\'ve just saved our hides, $n!',0),(31946,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whoa, these carrots look crunchy and juicy, $n! Mung-Mung did not know you had such a green thumb.',0),(31947,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was expecting cabbages, but not cabbages of this quality! Oh my!$B$BA perfectly round head, large waxy leaves, a perfect gradient of emerald color...$B$B<Farmer Fung takes a bite out of the cabbage.>$B$BMmm, and sweet, crisp flavor! These is a beautiful cabbage, $n. My yaks will certainly be spoiled by this tasty treat.',0),(31948,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Found the falls, did you? Oh yes, I see you found the water. Wonderful!',0),(31949,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Nana Mudclaw scrutinizes a dark witchberry, then pops it into her mouth. Her face lights up.>$B$BLands alive! I haven\'t tasted such a sweet, juicy witchberry in years! Why, the only person who could grow berries like these was... Old Yoon, yer friend\'s grandpa.$B$B<Nana Mudclaw blushes.>$B$BOh that man was such a scamp! I still remember the summer days when we were young, eating these berries by the bushel without a care in the world.$B$BThank you for reminding me of an old friend, $n.',0),(31951,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have emerged victorious. Continue your training and find challenges in other trainers like yourself. The journey is never truly complete.',0),(31953,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are very strong. Will you lend your skills to my efforts?',0),(31954,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Next time you lose. I\'m gonna beatcha!',0),(31955,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! I\'m not the only one that\'s been training!',0),(31956,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fine. Victory is yours once more. Begone, I have much preparation to do before we meet again.',0),(31957,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In all my time as a grand master I\'ve never faced one as determined as you. The others were right about you. You are a force to be reckoned with.',0),(31958,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are stronger and your skills more refined. Your journey continues.',0),(31967,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'CataclysmКлянусь клинком Вождя, ты сражаешься как орк! Думаю, ты $gготов:готова; отправляться дальше.Теперь ты не можешь проиграть.ВарзокДумаешь, пришло время для следующего поединка?Варзок',26365),(31970,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),(31971,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'By defeating me, I grow stronger. I urge you to be wary during our next encounter.',0),(31972,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even in defeat I feel closer to my pets. Thank you for a worthy skirmish.',0),(31973,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No, no, I just messed up. How about another go?',0),(31974,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You fight with the wrath of my masters. Perhaps you and I aren\'t so different.',0),(31975,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s see...where to send you next...',0),(31976,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s see...where to send you next...',0),(31977,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),(31978,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, it\'s not as much as I would have hoped, but it will have to do. I guess there is no sense in cryin\' over spilled brew.',0),(31980,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),(31981,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You really beat Grand Master Antari? Wow! I\'m going to have to find you some really tough tamers to fight!',0),(31982,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),(31983,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),(31984,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Payne asked you to court me for him, didn\'t he? When is he ever going to learn?',0),(31985,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I take it you met Obalis? He\'s a wonderful fellow, once you get past his rough exterior.',0),(31986,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),(31989,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, $n. It is time for the final step of your training.',0),(31991,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are indeed superior. If you would pardon me, I must consult the lake for guidance in my defeat.',0),(31998,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my gratitude, $n. You\'ve displayed great valor today, and the speed at which you completed the challenge surely will impress your friends and intimidate your foes.',0),(31999,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы победили в схватке с Альянсом, но мы не продвинемся дальше, пока не разберемся с этими бормочущими обезьянами в окрестностях.\r\n\r\nСледующая наша цель – хозены.',0),(32000,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my sincerest thanks, $n. Without fine Stormstout brews to lighten the drudgery of the day, the world would be a dull place indeed.',0),(32001,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many blessings upon you, $n. Driving hatred from this world so quickly deserves rich reward.',0),(32002,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many thanks, $n. Your martial prowess is second to none, and your alacrity is sure to strike fear in the hearts of your enemies.',0),(32003,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was a blow well struck, $n. I\'ve never seen a $C fell a giant with such speed.',0),(32004,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, that was amazing. Ner\'onok is a master tactician, and you schooled him handily.',0),(32005,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'re a stalwart $C. Your friends and guild mates will surely notice the speed and ferocity with which you conquered the Scarlet Monastery.',0),(32006,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. Just the thought of him burning up that beautiful library makes me shudder. Your friends will appreciate the speed with which you dispatched him.',0),(32007,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. May the skeletons of the dead remain peaceful now that Gandling no longer seeks to disturb their slumber.',0),(32008,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'re $n. Splendid! Let\'s get to work then, shall we?',0),(32009,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, you must be $n. Nice to meet you. I\'m Varzok.$b$bFrom now on, come to me.',24015),(32010,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Vale is safer now, thanks to you. Now, you must help the Celestials.',0),(32011,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Vale is safer now, thanks to you. Now, you must help the Celestials.',0),(32016,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the stars smile upon you, $n.',0),(32017,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the stars smile upon you, $n.',0),(32019,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You come from the Temple of the Jade Serpent? Rain-Zhu sends his thanks?$B$BAi yah... really, that was nothing. I could have defeated that saurok without spilling my beer.$B$BIn fact, I believe I did.',0),(32020,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(32021,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(32022,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(32023,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(32024,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(32026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(32027,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(32028,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(32029,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(32030,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your arrival is timely, wakener.$B$BOur ritual is underway.',0),(32031,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(32032,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the re