the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),(32106,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A small tag on this present reads:$B$BHappy holidays, $n!',0),(32108,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<This fire will signal the full might of the Horde invasion fleet to land on this beach, beginning Garrosh\'s campaign in Pandaria.>',0),(32109,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Blue sails are barely visible on the horizon - the full might of the Alliance fleet, awaiting one final signal.>',0),(32115,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ye\' did good work out there. It\'s not right seein\' the dead unable to rest like that.',0),(32116,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oi! We got a right nasty problem here. Kicked the hornet\'s nest. Except these are mogu ghost hornets with a mean streak a bloody mile wide!',0),(32118,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, yes. Good. Help from Belloc. He never does like to get his hands dirty.',0),(32119,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work! Now maybe the workers can get through a day without fillin\' their britches!',0),(32120,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, good. We\'ll begin our research post-haste.',0),(32121,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Those things are nasty! Thanks for takin\' care of \'em for us.',0),(32122,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! Good work! Really saved our bacon!$B$BHere\'s to hoping those things don\'t come back...',0),(32123,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. I see your time in this land has hardened your resolve and sharpened your skills.',0),(32126,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just remember, the weapon of choice is not always the weapon with the longest range or heaviest amount of damage. In the end, the best weapon is the weapon that works every time.',0),(32127,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is not enough to rob the Alliance of their leaders. We must warn those who would aspire to leadership the cost of such ambition.',0),(32128,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Look at them burn. These new Alliance craft require more to destroy them permanently however. I am sure they will have those fires out in a day or two.',0),(32130,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good and waxy, just like they asked for. Here\'s your share.',0),(32131,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha! YES! You got me some! I\'m gonna make the best bomb EVER!$B$BMan I love bombs! Love making them, love blowin\' em up...$B$B... and yeah, that IS how I got this eyepatch. What\'s it to ya?',0),(32132,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. That should slow them down by a few days, at least.$B$BYou don\'t win the war by playing the short game, friend. Trust me, this is the right strategy.',0),(32133,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n. I\'ve already been getting some useful information that should help make our next offensive even more devastating.',0),(32134,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh heck yeah! That\'ll show \'em that NOBODY blows stuff up like goblins blow stuff up!$B$BOh, and you did good work too.',0),(32135,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Cut off the head, and the body will fall.$B$B... Unless you\'re forsaken, I guess. I realize I should probably stop using that saying now that I am.',0),(32136,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'More fuel huh? Is her \"loveliness\" afraid she might have to do a little more than sit around lookin\' pretty?',0),(32137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, yuck! Why are these barrels wet?! Oh nevermind! At least you got here before they made me work. I can\'t think of anything more horrible!',0),(32138,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good for nothin\' huh?! I\'m busting my rump down here!$B$BMaybe her \"uselessness\" would like to come down here and haul this lumber herself!',0),(32139,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s about time you showed up with this lumber order! I was just about to come down there and get it myself.',0),(32140,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is she still complaining about diamonds and rubies? We found something better than diamonds down here!$B$BThis ore is special. It has power!',0),(32141,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did they manage to find anything useful down there? Maybe an emerald or an opal? Is it too much to ask for a little bit of effort?!$B$BNevermind! I\'ll make sure this shipment gets where it\'s goin\'.',0),(32142,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, soldier. That should help keep the horde in check.',0),(32144,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks to your actions, the Horde knows it cannot feed its troops.$B$BThe timeframe they can withstand a siege is greatly reduced and their morale is going to start suffering soon.$B$BWe just need to keep applying pressure.',0),(32145,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work! Sorry to put good soldiers in harms way but my Auto-Demolish-o-Tronic Mk 2 isn\'t functional yet.',0),(32146,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you soldier. That should teach the Horde that it will take more than a couple of mooks to scare us away.',0),(32148,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, soldier. Without those shamans, I don\'t think they\'ll have much luck breaking down our defenses.',0),(32149,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work! With this, we\'ll be able to finish reinforcing the structure of the keep, which will help keep people safe. You\'ve saved lives today!',0),(32150,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Without those supplies, they won\'t be able to support bringing more warriors in the fight. If they can\'t bring in more warriors, we have a great shot at holding out.$B$BFor today, at least.',0),(32151,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright! We\'ll get that stone mortared into the cracks in our walls faster than a Dwarf downs a pint.',0),(32152,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You really showed them who owns this beach, $n. Good work!',0),(32153,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know it wasn\'t easy, but you did it. Good work. You\'ve got my respect, soldier.',0),(32154,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wish I could\'ve been there to watch their fuel burn! Probably put on quite the show.$B$BYou\'ve done well, $n!',0),(32156,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done these soldiers a great service, $n. The only thing left to do is make sure they did not die in vain.',0),(32157,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $C! Eventually we will wipe the Horde from this continent.',0),(32158,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n! Now the forest can begin its regrowth process. From all death comes new life, and a new opportunity to protect it.',0),(32161,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You place the feathers in the dirt, then look off in the direction of the temple...',0),(32162,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You lay the meat out atop the trap, then turn your eyes toward the jungle...',0),(32163,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You spread out the decaying fish, prepare the crate, then turn your eyes toward the beach...',0),(32164,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You place the feathers in the dirt, then look off in the direction of the temple...',0),(32165,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You lay the meat out atop the trap, then turn your eyes toward the jungle...',0),(32166,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You spread out the decaying fish, prepare the crate, then turn your eyes toward the beach...',0),(32169,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well fought, $n.',0),(32172,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well fought, $n.',0),(32175,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I must say, good show!',0),(32181,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It only took one to capture the beast, but it will take many more to truly defeat it.$B$BSpeak to me again when you have gathered enough allies. We shall test the grace of the crane against the might of the Horde.',0),(32182,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It only took one to capture the beast, but it will take many more to truly defeat it.$B$BSpeak to me again when you have gathered enough allies. We shall test the ferocity of the tiger against the might of the Horde.',0),(32183,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It only took one to capture the beast, but it will take many more to truly defeat it.$B$BSpeak to me again when you have gathered enough allies. We shall test the resilience of the crab against the might of the Horde.',0),(32184,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It might have taken just one $R to capture this beast, but it will take many more to put it down.$B$BGather up some friends, then come and speak with me again. We\'ll pit the grace of the crane against the glory of the Alliance!',0),(32185,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It might have taken just one $R to capture this beast, but it will take many more to put it down.$B$BGather up some friends, then come and speak with me again. We\'ll pit the power of the tiger against the glory of the Alliance!',0),(32186,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It might have taken just one $R to capture this beast, but it will take many more to put it down.$B$BGather up some friends, then come and speak with me again. We\'ll pit the stamina of the crab against the glory of the Alliance!',0),(32189,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'AUGHM... nomf... -slurp- mmmf...$B$B<Barnaby looks up from the table, revealing a tangled beard dotted with melon seeds. Juices rush down his chin as he greets you.>$B$BMmf... -cough- A customer! Hello! Name\'s Fletcher. Barnaby Fletcher - nice to meet you!$B$B<He wipes a hand on his robe before extending it, still visibly sticky and flecked with pulp.>',0),(32190,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $C. We are an archaeological expedition, sent to excavate these ruins. We had no idea that this area was crawling with dangerous mogu.',0),(32191,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Well done! With the guardians gone, we should be able to excavate these ruins safely.',0),(32192,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We blood elves have served the Horde faithfully. Lately, I wonder what we have to gain from Garrosh\'s leadership.',0),(32193,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These artifacts must be several thousand years old. Have ye ever seen the like?',0),(32194,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $C. I knew that you could get the job done.',0),(32197,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have standards ya know! I\'m a chef, not a magician!$B$BThe only mystery here is how Duke thinks he\'ll pull this over on everyone else!',0),(32198,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew you would be!$B$BHere\'s the catch - the shards, in their current state, are unstable. But the soil in this valley is renowned for its magical properties! I am sure if you were to \"plant\" the shard, a very interesting reaction would take place.$B$BIt could stabilize, leaving you with a functioning portal! Or... it might tear open a magical rift that spits out transdimensional horrors!$B$BMy gut tells me it will be a little of both, but there\'s only one way to know for sure.$B$BHere, take a sample!',0),(32199,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This meat is disgusting! It\'s going to take every spice I have to cover that smell up.$B$BOnly the best for the Boss-Lady!$B$B<Sezik grins and winks at you.>',0),(32200,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Much blood was spilled this day. It is on my hands, $n, not yours.',0),(32201,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. You have dealt the mogu a blow that they shall not easily forget.',0),(32204,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One day, this island will belong to the Horde. I can only hope that it will be free of saurok before then.$B$B<Aethas sneers.>$B$BAt least they attack the Alliance, too.',0),(32206,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s impressive how easily you were able to cut them down.$B$BPerhaps, it\'s you they should not underestimate. Thank you for your assistance, $C.',0),(32207,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A trained Zandalari beastcaller with a mount unleashed on the battlefield can kill twenty times their number. Your preemptive attack has saved many lives. Thank you!',0),(32212,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes! You have done it, champion!$B$BWe will be as a tide that sweeps over this island, bringing with it a new destiny for our people. And you, hero, are at its forefront.',0),(32213,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, Violet Rise runs red with the blood of our enemies? Well done, $n.$B$BThis will be an ongoing battle I fear. We must continue to show our strength here.',0),(32214,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very nice, $n! I knew it! I knew there were Alliance sneaking around down there!$B$BNo one messes with a Bilgewater rig and gets away with it!',0),(32215,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I could feel the magic of their altars dissipating even here, $C.',0),(32216,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It what?! It killed its master? Wonderful. These skyscreamers have more fight in them than I realized. Thank you for helping free the beast, $R - it is one less threat to the Horde, and one more for the Zandalari.',0),(32217,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The tide of blood is slowed, at least for a time. Thank you for your efforts in stalling the sacrifices, $C.',0),(32218,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Their dead shall rise no more, thanks to you, $n. Excellent work.',0),(32219,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to hear that you left the quilen in a thousand tiny pieces. You have contributed much to our war effort.',0),(32220,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. You have lightened my heart of a heavy burden through your heroic actions.$B$BI will remember your efforts on this day.',0),(32221,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work down there, $n! That should keep \'em outta our hair for awhile!',0),(32222,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $C! This brings us one step closer to pushing them out of Pandaria!',0),(32223,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s a good day when another Lion\'s Landing leader falls, $C! Good work!',0),(32224,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful work, $C. This will help our offensive a great deal.',0),(32225,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You continue to exceed my expectations, $C. Well done.',0),(32226,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, you\'ve just confirmed my theory! Thank you, $C.',0),(32227,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have returned, $R. It is my hope that these young skyscreamers have the lives they deserve without dealing with the harsh treatment of the trolls.',0),(32228,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are not one to be trifled with. I am sure to have further use of your services.$B$BCome back to me in a day\'s time, $C.',0),(32230,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When I give you a task, it gets handled.$B$BWell done, $C.',0),(32232,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So I was correct to be concerned. It\'s a good thing you were there to stop them before that guardian was fully infused.$B$BGood work, $C.',0),(32233,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $C!$B$BThese weapons are terrifying on their own, nevermind the magic they are infused with.',0),(32234,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $C. Excellent work.',0),(32235,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha! Simple mechanical toys are no match for a well aimed bottle of grog.',0),(32236,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that\'s what I like to hear! I bet those spiders will think twice before messing with a Bilgewater operation again!',0),(32237,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So I was being followed! Those dirty rotten sneaks!$B$BI\'m going to have to start planting some real nice surprises for those cowards. Surprises that will really knock \'em out!',0),(32238,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n! I saw the fireworks from here!$B$BWho knew being a genius was this easy? I don\'t even have to try anymore.',0),(32242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Warchief sent you? What does he say?',0),(32243,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my, look at this thing!',0),(32244,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, this is remarkable! This is just the kind of artifact that we came here to find!',0),(32246,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have impeccable timing, $C. King Wrynn is just about to land, and the full might of our fleet will follow soon after.',0),(32247,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m satisfied with this site, it\'s time to bring in our fleet.',0),(32248,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good to see you again, $n.$B$BWe have a delicate situation on our hands here. We need to plan our next moves carefully.',0),(32249,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are just in time. The Warchief is about to land. Once this site passes his inspection, the fleet will follow.',0),(32250,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. Our presence here will not be denied!',0),(32251,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good ta see ya, mon. I be needin\' true allies at my side for dis mission.',0),(32252,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can only imagine what horrors you witnessed, $n. Your bravery was put to the test this day, and you did not fail the Horde in your task.',0),(32254,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The archmage listens carefully to your report.>$B$BI understand. Thank you for your aid, $C.',0),(32255,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s more like it.$B$BThank you, $C.',0),(32256,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What do you have to report?',0),(32257,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm... very interesting. This tablet will yield many secrets, indeed.',0),(32262,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Those you have rescued today would no doubt thank you, if they had the strength.$B$BOur task here will be ongoing. I refuse to leave anyone behind!',0),(32264,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have desired this book for many years, $R. It\'s power is too immense to describe. You have done me a great service.',0),(32265,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, champion. This artifact will be put to better use in our hands than in the hands of the Kirin Tor.',0),(32266,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This task will be ongoing, but you have done as a great service, $R.',0),(32268,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am sure the use of even these smaller mana bombs has Jaina squirming with rage. Serves her right.$B$BDalaran was my home before her grandparents were born. What right did she have to expel me from my home?',0),(32269,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. With your help we were able to successfully sneak several spies behind enemy lines.',0),(32274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know the true price of bloodshed. I know the cost of war.$B$BIt would be simpler to blindly massacre our attackers until they yield. But is it right?',0),(32275,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I shall continue my unrest until the threat is subdued, but your aid brings us closer to that goal. I thank you, $n.',0),(32276,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With your help, we\'re one giant step closer to our goal.',0),(32277,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Incredible work. This presents us with a monumental opportunity.',0),(32278,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work! With that blasted warship out of commission, the bombardments on our forces along the coast will cease.$B$BTaran Zhu has informed me that the Shado-Pan will keep vigil over Stormsea Landing, freeing up Sunreaver resources to press the siege elsewhere. Taoshi will be there. I am sure she will be glad to work with you again.$B$BWe are all grateful for your contributions, $n. Thank you.',0),(32279,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. Shan Bu\'s fall will weaken the Mogu and your heroism will surely be remembered.',0),(32282,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We lost three good soldiers when we first arrived on this island. Killed in their sleep by compies that had snuck into their tent. Some nights I still hear the screams.',0),(32283,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, champion. These beasts are strong enough. We don\'t need them infused with an angry spirit now do we?',0),(32284,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! You received my note. Very good. Vol\'jin is near death, and I will need your help healing his wounds.',0),(32285,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your efforts are appreciated.',0),(32287,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $C. Thank you for the help.',0),(32288,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that the wards have been fully armed, we can focus our attention elsewhere. Nothing will be slipping past us now!',0),(32292,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. What you did today brings us one step closer to our ultimate goal.',0),(32293,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to have a man I can trust close at hand.',0),(32294,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a good $C to have around, that\'s for certain. Thank you.',0),(32295,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Этот кодекс – книга невероятной силы, написанная на древнем, прадемоническом языке. У вас возникла мысль показать ее одному из наставников чернокнижников в ближайшей столице.',19342),(32296,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not entirely unsuccessful. Still, we\'ll do better next time.$B$BThanks for providing us with that key. The raid would not have gone off without you.',0),(32297,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Few things in this world and beyond are more entertaining than watching a rampaging ancient beast tearing through an enemy\'s settlement.$B$BIf times were not so dire I would consider selling tickets to such an event.',0),(32298,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very interesting results. I am sure there is a mage somewhere that cares about the specifics. I, on the other hand, am just glad to hear the sound of trolls being assaulted by their own beasts.',0),(32299,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jobs like this make me glad that I left most of my nose in the tomb.',0),(32300,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. The real irony is had these been normal bombs we would have had a much harder time detecting them. Some gnomish devilry could have spelled the end of our operation here.',0),(32301,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have put a good dent in the Sunreaver forces here. Like vermin, there will always be more. We must be at the ready at all times.',0),(32302,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So the constructs have fallen? Good!$B$BWe will remind Jaina and the Kirin Tor at every turn that the Sunreavers are not to be taken lightly.',0),(32303,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I wish I could be there to see the look on Proudmoore\'s face as she mourns the loss of her death machine!$B$BWe can be certain she will build another, but we have at least set her back.',0),(32304,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your presence on the battlefield cannot be ignored. I would like to give you something extra for your efforts, $C.',0),(32305,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $C! It will take them days to rebuild those foci.',0),(32307,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Garon is still in shock, but she\'s with us now. She wants revenge on her former lord. I\'m going to forgive her for hitting me.',19342),(32309,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are ready to learn more...',0),(32310,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь тебе пора узнать кое-что еще...',19342),(32315,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $C. We have much work to do here.',0),(32316,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see that you and my son have been hard at work. Thank you for taking the initiative to aid our cause here in the Vale.',0),(32317,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебе удалось найти все четыре фрагмента камня души… Теперь осталось лишь соединить их…',19342),(32318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good. These should work nicely.',0),(32319,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Thrall stares at the stone you have handed him.>$B$BVol\'jin\'s hearthstone? My friend, has it come to this?',0),(32320,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vol\'jin has saved my life many times in the past. To see my own Kor\'kron used against his people cuts deeper than I can put into words.',0),(32321,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You come asking for the Monkey King?$B$BLet us see how well you ookin\' sing.$B$BWho are you, so tiny and boring?$B$BYour cause is silly! You leave me snoring.$B$BThree riddles I will ask,$B$BThese riddles are a task,$B$BFinish each without pause,$B$BAnd we shall see if I help your cause.',0),(32324,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Камень души Джубеки привел вас к Черному храму. Осталось только найти путь внутрь...',19342),(32325,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gсделал:сделала; для этого мира больше, чем можешь себе представить, $gчернокнижник:чернокнижница;. Даже немного жаль, что Канретад закончил таким образом. С другой стороны, это было неизбежно.',19342),(32326,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! So glad Nazgrim selected you.$B$BIt\'s taken a great deal of the Horde\'s effort to get you here through Jaina\'s traps. Maintaining our illusion this close to Darnassus is considerably expensive.$B$BFurthermore, the Sunreavers of Dalaran are risking their neutrality by assisting the Horde with this operation.$B$BIn other words, we expect only the best from you.',0),(32327,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well executed, $R! I knew we could count on you.$B$BNow to get off this wretched tree.',0),(32328,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found the bell! And Fanlyr teleported it to Silvermoon for study, as instructed? The Horde will put this to good use.$B$BYou have done the Horde a great service today. Lok\'tar, friend!',0),(32329,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Warchief \"demands\" progress? His impatience is growing more destructive with each command.$B$BAs it stands, we could use your expertise.',0),(32330,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This reckless use of my people by Garrosh is becoming intolerable. If you had not been here to assist I dread to think what might have happened.',0),(32331,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to see you friend. While I have learned much about diplomacy I think Jaina is too familiar with my tactics.$B$BI could use a friendly hand in resolving this conflict.',0),(32332,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Amber! Fresh and untamed. Did you kill to get it? But of course.$B$BThough free, the untamed amber is a dangerous thing, and many might die because of it.$B$BMercy comes in many forms, like spikes and mantid and really ookin\' spooky storms.',0),(32333,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Metal Brew is strong and lasting, a brew to be shared with friends after a battle.$B$BEmperor Shaohao and his Monkey King had many a round in our day. Many battles, and many good friends.',0),(32334,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Why engage in duelery? Why engage in foolery?$B$BYou ask the Monkey King for an artifact of power, I have to make sure when the time comes you will not cower. One tough dooker you think you might ookin be, but against mogu, many will turn and flee.',0),(32335,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It looks like it is going to take us a few days to track all of these \"minions\" down.$B$BThank you for your help, $n. Meet me in Lion\'s Landing in a few days and we will embark to track down these objects.',0),(32336,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Artifacts not make people great. Artifacts allow people to be more of themselves. Good becomes gooder. Bad becomes badder. And Chief Ingoo Ingoo became worser.',0),(32337,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What virmen do not understand, they worship, fight or flee.$B$BI should send them a few statues of me.',0),(32338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Woot woot!',0),(32340,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You collected everything you could carry. It\'s time to pull the fishing rods before Akama comes back.',19342),(32342,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, yes. Hmm. Hand that over. Carefully.',0),(32343,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What treasures! With any luck, the spirits will return and we will be able to sample their essence further.',0),(32344,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, yes. I received word from one of our researchers that they are no longer troubled by that anomaly. Well done.',0),(32345,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good work. As much as it may seem trivial in comparison to our larger research goals, it is important that we maintain appearances, $n.',0),(32346,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright! We\'ll be back up and runnin\' in no time!',0),(32347,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha! That should send \'em runnin\' back to Silvermoon with their tail \'tween their legs!',0),(32348,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, what a fine day. Alliance fools defeated, and our research is moving ahead quite nicely.',0),(32351,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $C. You were sent from Domination Point? Very well. We have much to discuss.',0),(32352,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You bested my defenders? Finally, one who can control his hatred and violence!$B$BI need more men like you.',0),(32355,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad you made it, my friend. I could really use your help with what is to come. My father would prefer I remain in the safe custody of his legion.$B$BBut if there is one thing Pandaria has taught me, it is a few people in the right place at the right time can make a bigger difference than the greatest of armies.',0),(32362,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help, hero. I hear the wisdom in Jaina\'s words.$B$BLet\'s hope her faith in the Sunreavers is justified.',0),(32363,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming, $n.',0),(32368,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What did you see, $C?',0),(32370,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You do a doubletake when the Pandaren suddenly speaks with Connelly\'s voice.>$B$B\'Bout time, laddie! I\'ve been waitin\' fer ya to show up.$B$BThese Pandaren are good people but can\'t mix a martini fer nothin\'.',0),(32371,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Back so fast, rookie? So what did ye learn?',0),(32372,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The orcs have changed. My Horde has changed. Do I kill my fellow orcs until it is once again \"my\" Horde? Do I have any right to try force the Horde to be what it once was?$B$BThese are troubling times. But for now, I must see to Vol\'jin\'s people.',0),(32373,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am curious to see how King Wrynn rises to the occasion.$B$BI am even more curious to see what YOU are capable of. Let\'s find out...',0),(32374,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Marvelous! Even in the midst of the chaos of battle you\'ve proven that an individual can have an impact. The Horde has learned that their actions in Pandaria will not be unopposed.$B$BI believe it is time for a more substantial challenge...',0),(32376,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good. You have come. $B$BAgain, I apologize for the cryptic note - but Garrosh is increasingly distrustful of us. I do not want this operation disturbed by hasty action on his part.',0),(32377,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Agent Connelly\'s voice comes over the radio.>$B$BEy, you\'re good! I knew those Kor\'kron wouldn\'t be a problem fer ya. Couldn\'t\'ve done much better meself.',0),(32378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. We should be ready to make our move.',0),(32379,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. There\'s quite a bit to pore through here... $B$BI will have the Reliquary investigate these. Surely we can use them to discern more of the secrets of these Korune mogu.',0),(32380,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Following Connelly has been interesting to say the least. The man is a master of disguise!$B$BTalking him into joining you won\'t be the hard part, $C. Figuring out which of these lively individuals is him will be next to impossble.',0),(32381,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have a keen eye, $C! I think you are ready to meet Connelly.',0),(32382,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve arrived just in time. From the intel I\'ve gathered, Garrosh is hot on the trail of some sort of ancient mogu artifact of power.$B$BIf we can figure out what he\'s after, we can stop him from getting it!$B$BWe have to act fast to gather as much information as possible.',0),(32383,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done! Everyone always underestimates the little guys and it is always a grave mistake!',0),(32384,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We managed to capture our quarry. $B$BIn truth, though, I am not sure what our next move should be. I will contact the leaders of our allies and see if they have ideas - I don\'t know that our arcane talents are going to pry the secrets of our mogu captive.',0),(32388,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion grins.>$B$BYou were being tested, $C. I knew you were capable of great things by yourself.$B$BBut you have proven to me that you have the makings of a leader, cobbling together support among a group of strangers in the midst of a battlefield.$B$BThe Alliance is fortunate to have you.',0),(32389,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion hungrily listens to tales of your exploits on the battlefield, his eyes gleaming bright red.>$B$BOhh... oh! Incredible! In the very eye of battle, one\'s true heart is revealed.$B$BYou do not disappoint, $n.$B$BNeither does your Alliance.',0),(32390,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<A strange device sits within an ornate silk-lined chest. It appears as though it can be fastened to your sha-touched weapon as an additional upgrade. The empty socket is disconcerting; you feel as though it is staring back at you. A single, hollow, judgmental eye...>',0),(32391,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Alliance beat us here. How could this happen?',0),(32392,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Darnassus, is it?$B$BThe Alliance believes they have won the day. Now, when their arrogance is at its greatest, is our opportunity to pluck the prize from their fingers.',0),(32393,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We blasted the doors open moments ago, $C. You arrived just in time to join us for the excavation.',0),(32394,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fantastic work, $n. I could not even imagine the atrocity that Garrosh would commit if this bell were to fall into his hands.$B$BToday, we have secured a safe future for the Alliance. I will see to it that the bell makes it safely to Darnassus.$B$BI will extoll your deeds to the King.',0),(32397,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Phew! That was a close one! I never doubted you for a minute though.$B$BNow let me take a look at that journal...',0),(32398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was wondering when you would arrive, $n.',0),(32399,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They may have destroyed the Divine Bell, but I have taken the life of the Alliance\'s prodigal son!$B$BIt is nothing less than my own father would have expected of me.$B$BThis victory may have come at a high cost, but it is of little consequence.$B$BI will find other ways to destroy my enemies, and bring glory to the Horde!',0),(32400,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! Just the $C I was hoping to see. You couldn\'t have arrived at a better time.',0),(32401,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Anduin looks like a crumpled doll. He lays as still as a stone, and the only movement comes from the frigid air ruffling his fair, golden hair.>$B$B<You sit quietly for a while, until the cold settles into your bones. The bell is destroyed, but the silence is deafening.>$B$B<Out of the corner of your eye, you see the slightest flicker from the boy\'s hand. You lean in close. He breathes - but just barely! Anduin is alive!>',0),(32402,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good... you\'ve arrived. It\'s not a good day to be Horde in Dalaran.$B$BJaina\'s called for the exile of all the Sunreavers. You and I are going to save as many as we can - including Archmage Aethas Sunreaver himself - and then get out of here as fast as possible.',0),(32403,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s press on.',0),(32404,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So much bloodshed! In a place of peace!$B$BJaina has gone too far this time.',0),(32405,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The first stage of our mission is complete. That was the easy part.$B$B<Rommath takes a deep, measured breath, then continues...>',0),(32406,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now, let\'s move quickly.',0),(32408,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We will continue saving Sunreavers for a while longer. Aethas\' location may become clearer as we press on.',0),(32409,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for that, $n.$B$BIt unsettles me to have to fight directly with the high elves of the Silver Covenant... but I never tire of slaying Alliance.',0),(32410,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. Well done.',0),(32411,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. They should be waiting for us in Silvermoon when we return.',0),(32412,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is this... $n? What\'s going on here?',0),(32413,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Nazgrim listens as you recount the day\'s events.>$B$BWe take the bell... and the Alliance takes Dalaran. That escalated quickly.$B$BWar is coming, $n. Be on your toes.',0),(32414,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Bell is gone...$B$BAt the scene of the crime, we found traces of arcane magic... I may be able to use my skills to track the thieves.',0),(32416,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will instruct you from here on out.$B$BJaina will be going down into the city to enforce our new rules.',0),(32417,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s nice to have those rats out of here for good. Well done, hero.',0),(32418,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'While I can\'t say I agree completely with Jaina\'s methods, I do understand her motives.$B$BSometimes, you have to fight back.',0),(32419,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a bloody day, $n, and this is bloody work.$B$BBut do not forget what the Sunreavers did to bring this on: They used neutral Kirin Tor resources to aid the Horde in their fight against the Alliance.$B$BDo not hesitate to believe that they would do the same to us, given the chance.',0),(32420,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I suppose it wasn\'t enough for him to be a coward and a backstabber... he had to be a greedy thief as well.$B$BHmph. The Horde and the Sunreavers aren\'t all that different. They deserve one another.',0),(32421,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now, the Sunreavers have to answer to us. Jail or death - their fate is in their own hands.',0),(32423,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t fault you for following orders. In fact, I can\'t really fault Jaina for acting on her own behalf, for once.$B$BBut still... we aren\'t playing a game here. We are dealing with war, with people\'s lives, with the future of the Alliance itself.$B$BAt the very least, we now have the Kirin Tor on our side. Today will be remembered by all as a victory for the Alliance.',0),(32426,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So the SI: 7 needs a reminder in what the word retirement means?$B$BI suppose they wouldn\'t be comin\' to me if the situation weren\'t dire.$B$BI\'ll help, but I\'ll need a few days to gather some intel.',0),(32427,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Like all great leaders, Garrosh has greatly extended himself. Just what is he ultimately capable of?$B$BMore importantly, what YOU are capable of? Fresh bloodshed along the coast gives us an opportunity to find out...',0),(32428,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t belive you took out those spirits!',0),(32429,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Marvelous! Even in the midst of the chaos of battle you\'ve proven that an individual can have an impact. The Alliance buckles under Horde might, although their King refuses to break.$B$BI believe it is time for a more substantial challenge...',0),(32430,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion grins.>$B$BYou were being tested, $C. I knew you were capable of great things by yourself.$B$BBut you have proven to me that you have the makings of a leader, cobbling together support among a group of strangers in the midst of a battlefield.$B$BThe Horde is fortunate to have you.',0),(32431,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion hungrily listens to tales of your exploits on the battlefield, his eyes gleaming bright red.>$B$BOhh... oh! Incredible! In the very eye of battle, one\'s true heart is revealed.$B$BYou do not disappoint, $n.$B$BNeither does this Horde of yours.',0),(32432,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<A strange device sits within an ornate silk-lined chest. It appears as though it can be fastened to your sha-touched weapon as an additional upgrade. The empty socket is disconcerting; you feel as though it is staring back at you. A single, hollow, judgmental eye...>',0),(32434,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will get you next time!',0),(32435,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hurry up and turn those in if you want to get second place! I have been standing around here for HOURS with nothing to eat!  Hand those suckers over!',0),(32436,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hurry up and turn those in if you want to be awarded the third and final prize! I have been standing around here for HOURS with nothing to eat!  Hand those suckers over!',0),(32439,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will get you next time!',0),(32440,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will get you next time!',0),(32441,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will get you next time!',0),(32442,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наши защитники справились с первой волной атакующих, но флагман будет здесь с минуты на минуту!',23420),(32446,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Goblin construction leaves somethin\' to be desired, but it\'ll have to do. Good work, $n!',0),(32448,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, very good. This is the last thing we needed.',0),(32449,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have a lot of work to do, $C. Who knows what has already been uncovered in Ogudei!',0),(32450,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now things can get interesting! I have a few plans for Lion\'s Landing...',0),(32451,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The battle is already underway, $C. Let\'s get you out there!',0),(32452,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s about time we dealt with this nuisance. Those Bilgewater runts need to be taught a lesson!',0),(32455,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hesitate to guess what would have happened if you had not been there with the young Prince, $n.$B$BToday, you put an end to Garrosh\'s plans.$B$BYou have undoubtedly saved thousands of lives, and most importantly, you brought Anduin back to us.$B$BWe are doing everything we can for the boy, but we can only wait and see.$B$BI believe he has the fight in him. I must believe it...',0),(32457,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Sunreavers and the Kirin-Tor are mounting an assault on the Thunder King\'s base of operations! My new friend here and I were just discussing the ramifications of their attack.$B$BYou and I can stand to benefit from the situation, $n. I have a few ideas...',0),(32460,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve decided.$B$BCertain members of the Kirin-Tor have put their allegiance to the Horde above the order, and I will NOT tolerate it. This is nothing short of a betrayal.$B$B<Jaina\'s eyes flare with rage.>$B$BCome with me, $n. We\'re going to clean up Dalaran.',0),(32461,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, have you come to join the Order?',0),(32468,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Count me surprised to hear from you again, you must be tougher than I thought. You\'ve earned my respect, kid, here\'s your lens upgrade kit. Now get out there and take some S.E.L.F.I.E.S!',0),(32469,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew from the moment we met that you were an adventurer, just like me! Here\'s your lens upgrade kit, now get out there and take some S.E.L.F.I.E.S!',0),(32470,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great! I\'ve just gotta put this box here, and jam this part in here... and done!$B$BHere\'s your new S.E.L.F.I.E. cam, enjoy!',0),(32471,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re all set, kid. You\'ve got a face the camera will love, now get out there and get shooting!',0),(32474,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion nods slowly.>$B$BYes, $n. I saw your deeds, and I was most impressed.$B$BYou are truly an instrument of change.',0),(32476,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion nods slowly.>$B$BYes, $n. I saw your deeds, and I was most impressed.$B$BYou are truly an instrument of change.',0),(32485,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. Those perimeter wards should keep out all manner of filth.$B$BWith Violet Rise protected we can focus on more pressing matters.',0),(32489,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),(32491,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Left standing, those piles of discarded food are the perfect breeding ground for disease.$B$BWere I still in the disease-spreading business, I\'d consider using them myself.',0),(32493,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $C! This will aid my studies greatly, as well as advance our cause here.',0),(32494,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Getting these masks was no easy task, $C. I am grateful for your service.',0),(32495,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to hear that this piece of filth is slain. You have done us all a great favor, $n.',0),(32496,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Desecrate the Horde\'s Vale of Eternal Blossoms bonfire!',0),(32497,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Dread Wastes flame.',0),(32498,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Jade Forest flame.',0),(32499,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Krasarang Wilds flame.',0),(32500,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Kun-Lai Summit flame.',0),(32501,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Townlong Steppes flame.',0),(32502,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Valley of the Four Winds flame.',0),(32503,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Desecrate the Alliance\'s Vale of Eternal Blossoms bonfire!',0),(32505,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! To feel whole again! You have my gratitude, servant. Take this stone and use it wisely. Should you encounter his majesty the Thunder King in your travels, do not tell him where you received it, or you will be standing in a statue next to me for the remainder of eternity.',0),(32506,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful! I\'ll pass him off to our caretaker. Thank you.',0),(32509,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Vale of Eternal Blossoms flame.',0),(32510,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Vale of Eternal Blossoms flame.',0),(32517,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A good defense is just as effective as a strong offense. One less enemy to worry about.$B$BWell done.',0),(32520,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your skills are impressive indeed. Thank you for doing this for me, $n.',0),(32521,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have our gratitude, $n.',0),(32522,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One less threat at our doorstep. Thank you, $n.',0),(32523,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad you were the one Lor\'themar sent. These beasts are more than we can handle on our own. Time to spook the livestock.',0),(32524,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These Zandalari are even more dangerous than we anticipated.$B$BDo not make the mistake of underestimating them, for that may be the last mistake you make.',0),(32525,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Their dead shall rise no more, thanks to you, $n. Excellent work.',0),(32526,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. You have lightened my heart of a heavy burden through your heroic actions.$B$BI will remember your efforts on this day.',0),(32527,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. You have dealt the mogu a blow that they shall not easily forget.',0),(32528,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, you\'ve just confirmed my theory! Thank you, $C.',0),(32529,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You continue to exceed my expectations, $C. Well done.',0),(32530,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to hear that this piece of filth is slain. You have done us all a great favor, $n.',0),(32531,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A good defense is just as effective as a strong offense. One less enemy to worry about.$B$BWell done.',0),(32532,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful work, $C. This will help our offensive a great deal.',0),(32533,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to hear that you left the quilen in a thousand tiny pieces. They are little more than a nuisance to my work here on the island.',0),(32535,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One day, this island will belong to the Alliance. I can only hope that it will be free of saurok before then.$B$B<Modera sneers.>$B$BAt least they attack the Horde, too.',0),(32536,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The archmage listens carefully to your report.>$B$BI understand. Thank you for your aid, $C.',0),(32537,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s more like it.$B$BThank you, $C.',0),(32538,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$C, the destruction of those altars will force the trolls to halt their most heinous of sacrifices. You have the thanks of everyone here.',0),(32539,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Without the offerings, they will need to collect more before their sacrifices can proceed. Thank you, $C.',0),(32540,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Most who witness such rituals never return, and those that do tend to be shaken. You, $n, seem little moved by your incredible deeds. I am impressed.',0),(32541,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, $R. The hatchlings you frightened will live a better life without their captors.',0),(32542,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With a few of their more threatening kin slain, perhaps the Zandalari will show reluctance next time they decide to trifle with us.',0),(32543,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, your help against the Zandalari is appreciated. I realize it seems we cannot stem the tide, but your efforts make a difference.',0),(32544,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope that creature has the intelligence necessary to know who saved it. It seems to me that it would be a dangerous foe if provoked.',0),(32545,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know the true price of bloodshed. I know the cost of war.$B$BIt would be simpler to blindly massacre our attackers until they yield. But is it right?',0),(32546,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. Looking at you, I\'m suddenly quite proud of Dalaran\'s state-of-the-art plumbing system.',0),(32547,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),(32548,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Left standing, those piles of discarded food are the perfect breeding ground for disease.$B$BWere I still in the disease-spreading business, I\'d consider using them myself.',0),(32550,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These trolls have been using dark magics to achieve their goals. No patience, no honor. You have done the world a good service in reducing their numbers today.',0),(32551,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We lost three good soldiers when we first arrived on this island. Killed in their sleep by compies that had snuck into their tent. Some nights I still hear the screams.',0),(32552,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, champion. These beasts are strong enough. We don\'t need them infused with an angry spirit now do we?',0),(32553,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Few things in this world and beyond are more entertaining than watching a rampaging ancient beast tearing through an enemy\'s settlement.$B$BIf times were not so dire I would consider selling tickets to such an event.',0),(32554,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very interesting results. I am sure there is a mage somewhere that cares about the specifics. I, on the other hand, am just glad to hear the sound of trolls being assaulted by their own beasts.',0),(32555,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is very interesting, $C. The crystal hums with the rage of its captive inhabitants. Even after the passage of time their devotion has not decreased.$B$BI will need to study this further.',0),(32556,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are excellent finds! Studying them will take time, but there is much to be gained in understanding the Zandalari.',0),(32557,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $C! These weapons are impressive. Now we have a few less things to worry about in the field of battle.',0),(32558,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s a shame really that these masks must be destroyed. I would have liked to study this ancient magic, but it is better that they be destroyed than become the tools of the Horde.$B$BGood work, $C.',0),(32559,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s fortunate that you were able to intervene, $C. Who knows what damage that golem would have caused had he not been stopped.',0),(32560,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $C. The more Zandalari we destroy, the less chance their magic will fall into Horde hands.',0),(32561,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re dependable, $n. I like that.',0),(32562,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I appreciate what you\'ve done for us this day, $n.',0),(32563,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. That\'s a worry off my mind.',0),(32564,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yet again you prove yourself. We would be fortunate if all amongst us could aspire to your talents.',0),(32565,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your skills are impressive. You have our gratitude.',0),(32567,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today, we hunt the hunters!',0),(32568,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Zandalari here are not to be under-estimated, $C. Powerful magic overwhelms this space.$B$BWe must be diligent in our efforts.',0),(32571,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful! I\'ll pass him off to our caretaker. Thank you.',0),(32572,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your efforts are appreciated, $C.',0),(32573,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $C. Thank you for the help.',0),(32574,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are not one to be trifled with. I am sure to have further use of your services.$B$BCome back to me in a day\'s time, $C.',0),(32575,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When I give you a task, it gets handled.$B$BWell done, $C.',0),(32576,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re dependable, $n. I like that.',0),(32577,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I appreciate what you\'ve done for us this day, $n.',0),(32578,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to have a man I can trust close at hand.',0),(32579,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your skills are impressive indeed. Thank you for doing this for me, $n.',0),(32580,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have our gratitude, $n.',0),(32581,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One less threat at our doorstep. Thank you, $n.',0),(32582,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a good $C to have around, that\'s for certain. Thank you.',0),(32583,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yet again you prove yourself. We would be fortunate if all amongst us could aspire to your talents.',0),(32584,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. That\'s a worry off my mind.',0),(32585,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your skills are impressive. You have our gratitude.',0),(32587,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. What you did today brings us one step closer to our ultimate goal.',0),(32589,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $C. This is a dark magic indeed. We have much to learn here if we are to succeed.$B$BNow, we have only to hope that we can reanimate this creature.',0),(32590,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion introduces you both.>$B$BPrince Anduin, this is $n, possibly the most powerful $C in Pandaria.$B$BOh - do you already know of each other? Interesting.',0),(32591,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion inspects the treasures you brought him.>$B$BWell done. The trillium will need additional refinement, of course, but these samples are pure.$B$BI will need to study these artifacts for a time but I believe I can use the knowledge contained here to craft something of great value to us both.',0),(32592,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My Shado-Pan associates have spoken highly of your deeds. You have earned quite the name for yourself here in Pandaria!$B$BIt is settled. When the materials are ready, you will be my champion. You will be my instrument, my standard-bearer, my voice of change across this world.$B$BWe will do marvelous things together.',0),(32593,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Behold! The Lightning Lance! A conduit that can channel and control the very same power that the Thunder King used to found an empire.$B$BIt is dormant... but you\'re about to change that. If you\'re worthy.',0),(32594,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it! The lance seethes with power and potential!$B$BOh my friend, you have earned a great reward...',0),(32595,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Crown of Heaven! Use this to augment any piece of headgear.$B$BIt will also act as a third eye - I will be able to follow your progress as we embark on the next stage of our journey.',0),(32596,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks to your work, $n, we\'ve reconstructed an ancient narrative. The mogu were once creatures of stone, enacting the will of the Titans. But then their master fell silent, and they succumbed to the curse of the flesh. Eventually Lei Shen came along, imprisoned the keeper Ra, and took his power. Ah, what an empire he built!$B$BArmed with this knowledge, it\'s time to act...',0),(32597,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion squeezes the black heart in his hand, his eyes burning brightly.>$B$BYou did it... you did it! The black heart of the Thunder King!',0),(32599,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have just secured our advantage, $n. Your work here will be remembered.$B$BGarrosh will be made to pay for his actions!',0),(32600,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No wonder the Zandalari have come. They are in need of a new home, and I am sure their mogu allies have promised them much.$B$BWe will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),(32601,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What we know of Lei Shen are dark legends that have been remembered over the vast span of time. I often wondered if these legends had exaggerated the power of Lei Shen. But your research would suggest they may have greatly underestimated the Thunder King. These are dark days indeed.$B$BWe will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),(32602,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your research is most distressing. But it sheds light on a truth we have long sought: \"Where did the mogu come from? And why were they such tyrants?\"$B$BWe will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),(32603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found them all? Amazing! So the stories ARE true! Perhaps you will write the next great Pandaren fable based on your own incredible journey!',0),(32604,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I bow to you who continues to walk in the footfalls of the great Pandaren fables.',0),(32605,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Masterfully done, $C.',0),(32606,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Masterfully done, $C.',0),(32607,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Casualties are down significantly with that warship out of commission, and we continue to press the siege on Lei Shen.$B$BFantastic work out there today, hero.$B$BPlease, take this - you have earned it.',0),(32608,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s this? A necklace? What are you trying to- ahh, I see... A relic from the Thunder King\'s vault! Fascinating... Powerful, too.$B$BThe Kirin Tor will keep it safe. In return, please accept this.',0),(32613,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что у тебя есть для Ку\'мы?',0),(32614,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Give! Give them to me!',0),(32615,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кто ты? Зачем ты здесь снова? Хе-хе-хе...',0),(32616,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Qu\'ma giggles madly and points at you. >',0),(32617,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Qu\'ma starts dancing on her hut. >',0),(32618,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! Katie Hunter can be found here in camp.',0),(32621,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'While the language is incomprehensible, the diagrams in this book yield their knowledge to your skilled blacksmith\'s eye. It is clear that, by manipulating the properties of ghost iron, you can create a material of great power, perhaps powerful enough to recreate and increase the power of weapons long lost to the mists of time.',0),(32627,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, champion. This artifact will be put to better use in our hands than in the hands of the Sunreavers.',0),(32628,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It pains me to resort to such weaponry, but the Sunreavers must be taught the price of their actions.',0),(32631,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your presence on the battlefield cannot be ignored. I would like to give you something extra for your efforts, $C.',0),(32632,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $R. The problem with constructs is they can always be rebuilt.$B$BI imagine it will not take the Sunreavers long to build a new death machine.',0),(32633,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes! This is it. You\'ve done well, $R.',0),(32634,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $R! I was able to get a few of my scouts behind their lines before the perimeter wards were repaired.',0),(32635,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе за проявленные усилия, $n. Если бы ты не обезвредил эти мана-бомбы, случилась бы катастрофа.',24015),(32636,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have saved many today, $n. I cannot imagine the horror of being frozen and helpless among so many enemies.',0),(32637,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So they\'ve constructed objects that infuse their forces with additional power? This will have to be watched closely.$B$BThank you for your efforts today.',0),(32638,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve made excellent progress today, $C. Rest assured however, our work here is nowhere close to done.',0),(32639,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. As long as we keep the construct numbers in check, we will ensure our success here.',0),(32640,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yours skills as a $C are unquestionable. You\'ve aided the cause greatly this day. You have my thanks.$B$BAnd now for that reward I promised you...',0),(32641,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yours skills as a $C are unquestionable. You\'ve aided the cause greatly this day. You have my thanks.$B$BAnd now for that reward I promised you...',0),(32643,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the Red Blossom Leeks into the crate! A Dominance Offensive representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),(32644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes! You have done it, champion!$B$BNow, the Thunder King will taste the full force of the Kirin Tor!',0),(32646,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the Witchberries into the crate! An Operation: Shieldwall representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),(32648,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the White Turnips into the crate! A Golden Lotus representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),(32650,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gently place the Green Cabbages into the crate! A Shado-Pan representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),(32652,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Incredible work. This presents us with a monumental opportunity.',0),(32654,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With your help, we\'re one giant step closer to our goal.',0),(32655,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. That warship won\'t be raining fire on us again any time soon.$B$BTaran Zhu has informed me that the Shado-Pan will keep vigil over Stormsea Landing, freeing up Kirin Tor resources to press the siege elsewhere. Taoshi will be there. I am sure she will be glad to work with you again.$B$BWe are all grateful for your contributions, $n. Thank you.',0),(32656,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it, $C! Shan Bu is dead once and for all, and we\'ve learned that Lor\'themar may not be all that he seems.',0),(32657,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the Striped Melons into the crate! Now the August Celestials\' order is ready to go!',0),(32659,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the Mogu Pumpkins into the crate! A Klaxxi representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),(32661,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! Torallius is right over there.',0),(32662,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! Veron Amberstill is standing just outside the gates to the Ranch.',0),(32663,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! Milli\'s right over there!',0),(32664,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Lelanai right here.',0),(32665,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Old Whitenose here.',0),(32667,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Turtlemaster Odai here.',0),(32668,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Winaestra just outside.',0),(32669,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Ogunaro over there.',0),(32670,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Harb Clawhoof over there.',0),(32671,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Zjolnir over there.',0),(32672,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Zachariah Post here.',0),(32673,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Kall Worthaton over there.',0),(32674,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good to see you. You look like you are ready to take to the skies!$B$BRemember, you can buy a flying mount from Drakma, just behind me.',0),(32675,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good to see you. You look like you are ready to take to the skies!\n\nRemember, you can buy a flying mount from Tannec Stonebeak over there.',19116),(32676,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This so-called \"Thunder King\" is surrounded and cut off from his allies. No tyrant is strong enough to stand alone.$B$BYour efforts have not gone unnoticed. Take this, with my thanks.',0),(32677,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, I know a powerful artifact when I see one. You were wise to bring this here. I will see that Aethas examines it right away - perhaps we can put it to work in our favor.$B$BIn the meantime, take this in trade.',0),(32678,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We must move quickly, $n! The others have gone ahead of us, but I will brief you in the flight over.',0),(32679,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We must move quickly, $n! The others have gone ahead of us, but I will brief you in the flight over.',0),(32680,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have arrived just in time, $R. It is crucial we gain control of these shores before the Kirin Tor.$B$BThere is much to explain.',0),(32681,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have arrived just in time, $n. This land needs to be controlled by the Kirin Tor for everyone\'s safety. This will not be an easy task.',0),(32682,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Why I just knew you could convince him, $n. You\'ve set my heart at ease, knowing the Tillers will be in good hands.',0),(32683,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. You are ready to become a zen master blacksmith.',0),(32684,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Have you come to learn how to fish? You\'re talking to the right person. First, here - have some fish!',0),(32685,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me see... Yes, these are nice. Good job! Here, have some more.',0),(32686,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will aid lorewalkers and archaeologists in understanding the history of Pandaria.',0),(32687,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will aid lorewalkers and archaeologists in understanding the history of Pandaria.',0),(32688,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will aid lorewalkers and archaeologists in understanding the history of Pandaria.',0),(32689,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will aid lorewalkers and archaeologists in understanding the history of Pandaria.',0),(32690,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will aid lorewalkers and archaeologists in understanding the history of Pandaria.',0),(32691,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will aid lorewalkers and archaeologists in understanding the history of Pandaria.',0),(32692,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will aid lorewalkers and archaeologists in understanding the history of Pandaria.',0),(32693,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will aid lorewalkers and archaeologists in understanding the history of Pandaria.',0),(32706,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $n.',0),(32707,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect. I will show you how to use these stones, and then you can spring the ambush.',0),(32708,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very impressive.$B$BShould you find more stones, you should continue this ruse. It is sure to be quite some time before they catch on to our ploy.',0),(32709,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $n.',0),(32710,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Слизь, бывшая плотью Мясо\'рока, утекает в сточные воды. Судя по всему, он либо мертв, либо получил серьезные повреждения, от которых никогда не оправится.',20338),(32713,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Скальный ужас крошил все на куски, но вам удалось увернуться от осколков и не задохнуться в облаке пыли.',19865),(32718,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the stars smile upon you, $n.',0),(32719,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the stars smile upon you, $n.',0),(32722,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. What you did today brings us one step closer to our ultimate goal.',0),(32724,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. What you did today brings us one step closer to our ultimate goal.',0),(32726,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. You are ready to become a zen master blacksmith.',0),(32728,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, good, come... there is work to be done.',0),(32729,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One more to join the Zandalari hunt? Good. Very good.',0),(32730,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have good timing. I am quite in need of your assistance.',0),(32731,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, good, come... there is work to be done.',0),(32732,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have good timing. I am quite in need of your assistance.',0),(32733,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One more to join the Zandalari hunt? Good. Very good.',0),(32805,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have the four blessings of the celestials, and you have proven yourself by completing one of their challenges! I knew I saw great potential in you.',0),(32806,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, King Wrynn and the Dark Iron dwarves saved the city, and the bitterly divided Council of Three Hammers gained a new unity under the Alliance banner. How interesting!$B$BBut what is happening within the Horde?',0),(32807,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whaaaat? The remains of an Old God are buried beneath Pandaria? No wonder the land is so haunted!$B$BThe warchief\'s pursuit of those dormant powers are fraying apart the very Horde he leads. His vision is narrow, but very, very dangerous. I must inform the Shado-Pan immediately.',0),(32808,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! I cannot tell you how relieved I am to have some backup!$B$BKing Wrynn himself sent us to gather intel on Garrosh\'s activities and Orgrimmar\'s defenses, but... things are looking grim.$B$BWe need your help.',0),(32809,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s see... the warchief is moving tons of supplies through the Barrens... And what\'s this about the Darkspear? The trolls are in open rebellion?! Garrosh certainly has his hands full.$B$BI think I know how we can use this intel. It\'s a crazy idea, but it just might work...',0),(32810,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Zen\'tabra narrows her eyes at you.>$B$BWhy de Alliance seek de Darkspear? We fightin\' de \"Warchief,\" sure, but dat don\'t mean we friends. I never trust de Alliance, an\' I ain\'t \'bout ta start now.$B$BStill, dat funny mechanical cat ya have saved me life... so I give you dis. I let ya speak wit\' Vol\'jin.$B$BLet him decide if ya words be venom or honey.$B$BDon\'t be tryin\' nothin\', $C. Ya lift a finger against Vol\'jin, ya life be forfeit.',0),(32811,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Vol\'jin motions to his guards to allow you to come forward and speak.>$B$BDe Barrens be splattered wit\' blood, $R. Ya done right by me.$B$BTell de Alliance ta rally its fleet. When de time comes, de Darkspear an\' de other rebels will try ta hold de harbor for ya. Hellscream made too many enemies ta fight \'em all off at once, hah!$B$B$B$BYa have me thanks, $R. Dis rebellion only gonna get so far wit\'out ya.',0),(32812,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ki\'ta Arrowtusk beckons you over.>$B$BI been waiting for ya, hero. Dis be a time of reckoning.',0),(32813,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'De \"Warchief\" thought we\'d scatter once he sent in de Kor\'kron. Hah. He shoulda sent ev\'ryting he got.$B$BTime ta make \'im pay!',0),(32814,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Razor Hill. We did it, $n! Look to de north - you can almost see Orgrimmar from here.$B$BHellscream gonna figure out who did dis. Hah hah. He gonna be one angry orc.$B$BNext stop is de capital. We gonna need a lot more help. An\' more supplies...',0),(32815,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Huff> Oh, hello- <puff> hello there, young man.$B$BQuite the squall we\'re having up here today, isn\'t it?',0),(32816,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We made it, $C! Thank you so much. Please, help yourself to some of my old knick-knacks.$B$BBut... I am afraid I have not been completely honest with you...',0),(32819,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Sen\'jin is buzzing with activity. Vol\'jin motions for you to approach, a dark sadistic grin spreading across his tired face.>$B$BYa done good, $n. Blood in de Barrens. Hellscream got to be feelin\' that.$B$BNo doubt he gonna come for us, but we gonna be ready...',0),(32836,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),(32837,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great fighting out there! Even if he was just a little guy.$B$BYou\'ve earned every bit of this.',0),(32838,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),(32839,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты так... так величественно $gпарил:парила; по воздуху! Превосходно!',20490),(32840,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),(32841,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m not sure how to feel. I wanted you to win, but then again... I also kinda wanted to see you explode.$B$BNo hard feelings! I just like seeing explosions.',0),(32842,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),(32843,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations!$B$BAlso, how embarrassing would it have been if you got eaten by a beached shark?',0),(32844,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),(32845,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You left quite a mess behind you, but you did it. Well done, $R!',0),(32846,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),(32847,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aww... poor Mecha-Bruce.$B$BI\'ll give you your reward. But I don\'t have to be happy about it.',0),(32848,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),(32849,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I never thought I\'d say this, but successfully beating up a couple penguins is the sign of a true, tried-and-tested brawler. You\'ve earned your reward.',0),(32850,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, so you\'re $gfound: found it; my treasure. It\'s perfect.$b$bAs a reward, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare call cards.',19342),(32851,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У тебя, $n, настоящий талант к уничтожению роботов.',20490),(32852,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),(32853,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You ran around that arena so quickly, I got dizzy for a moment.$B$BWell done!',0),(32854,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),(32855,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I would normally shame someone for fighting a blind person, but in this case, I have to commend you.$B$BBrilliant brawling, $n!',0),(32856,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),(32857,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did well! Even if you did get a little lucky...',0),(32858,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),(32859,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at you! You went into that arena and beat Ty\'thar at his own game.$B$BHere. You deserve this.',0),(32861,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can custom-tailor the cloak to your preferred abilities. Choose wisely!$B$BThe cloak contains only a fraction of its potential power. I\'m already hatching a plan to augment it...',0),(32862,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ki\'ta Arrowtusk chuckles to himself.> I see you made a whole lotta Kor\'kron heads roll for dese supplies.$B$BWell mon, Vol\'jin was right to commend you. Dese supplies will be lastin\' us an entire week.',0),(32863,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve heard stories about some of your matches circulating around, apparently they were quite a sight to behold! I think you\'ve earned this reward. Congratulations, trainer, and keep up the good work.',0),(32867,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Vol\'jin nods at you.>$B$B$C. Looks like ya just chose a side.$B$BI hope ya ready ta fight.',0),(32868,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I bow to you who continues to walk in the footfalls of the great Pandaren fables.',0),(32869,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I bow to you who continues to walk in the footfalls of the great Pandaren fables.',0),(32870,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Are you ready for your next adventure, $C?$B$BOur campaign is nearing its conclusion...',0),(32871,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The troll does not have a strong grasp of the common tongue, and his throat is still bandaged from a knife wound. But the meaning of his words is clear.>$B$BWhat de Alliance want wit\' ol\' Vol\'jin, hmm? Zen\'tabra says we got a common enemy. That don\'t make us friends.$B$BBut... Maybe we can work together dis once. You want to strangle de Warchief, hm? Shut \'im out?$B$B<Vol\'jin smiles disarmingly, his grin slow and savage.>',0),(32872,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ki\'ta Arrowtusk chuckles to himself.> I see you made a whole lotta Kor\'kron heads roll for dese supplies.$B$BWell mon, Vol\'jin was right to commend you. Dese supplies will be lastin\' us an entire week.',0),(32892,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Welcome my friend. I am very glad that I was able to get your attention. Great deeds are at work that require a hero such as yourself.',0),(32895,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It be good to see dat some Alliance have a sense of loyalty.',0),(32896,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, it be good to see your face again, $n.',0),(32900,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations, $n, you did it! Before I forget, here\'s the special surprise I promised -- I hope you like it.$B$BNow tell me all about the adventure. Did you face certain death? Meet any friends? I wish I had more friends like you.',0),(32901,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations, $n, you did it! Before I forget, here\'s the special surprise I promised -- I hope you like it.$B$BNow tell me all about the adventure. Did you face certain death? Meet any friends? I wish I had more friends like you.',0),(32943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the scallions into the crate! A Sunreaver Onslaught representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),(32945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the juicycrunch carrots into the crate! A Kirin Tor Offensive representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),(32974,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The dirt here looks overturned. Perhaps something is buried beneath.>',0),(32975,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Another pile of dirt! Could there be something buried here?>',0),(32976,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The ancient chest has not been disturbed for a long time.>',0),(32979,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Опять ты? Ну надо же, и все-то тебе нипочем – и Громоборцы, и огры. Ха!',19342),(32980,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы пришли, чтобы просить помощи у стихий. Теперь я понимаю, что это мы должны помочь им.$b$bИдем, $p. Хочу, чтобы ты $gувидел:увидела; то же, что и я.',19342),(32983,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, |3-6($c).$b$bКогда придет время спасать Экзурота, помощь детей нам пригодится.',19342),(32984,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это древняя магия, она была здесь еще до пришествия орков. С ней нелегко будет справиться.',19342),(32985,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Крон повержен, и я наконец-то могу пробиться сквозь магию, которая сдерживает Экзурота. Но, возможно, что уже слишком поздно. Магнароны и горены вытянули из него слишком много силы.$b$BБоюсь, сейчас мы можем лишь дать этому духу спокойно умереть.',19342),(33018,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, hello there. I am Lin Chao-Wei.$B$BHave you come here to try my family\'s famous noodle soup?',0),(33020,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You recognize the name, Lin, on the scroll. A few characters down you see the character for \"Recipe.\"$B$BThis must be it!$B$BYour only worry is that the sha energies that manifested themselves in the tales of the pandaren may have corrupted the scroll as well.$B$BThere is only one way to find out....',0),(33021,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello, $n. What is it you have there?',0),(33022,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n! With all this grain I think we\'re ready to start.$B$BFor now I think you should try making noodle soup. Try using this recipe I\'ve written down for you. It\'ll make for excellent practice.',0),(33024,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. With this we can make a truly unique soup broth.$B$BI\'ve managed to get some updated schematics for your noodle cart. With this broth, you\'re definitely going to want to upgrade your operation.$B$BNext up: finding the secret ingredient of the Lin secret ingredient noodle soup!',0),(33026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ooh, these will do nicely, $n.$B$BNow for the final step: the Lin secret ingredient soup\'s secret ingredient.$B$BThat\'s a mouthful!',0),(33027,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. All those people came by to taste your noodle soup and YOU made them so happy!$B$BDon\'t you see? The secret ingredient is in you!$B$BNow go out there and make the world happy with this latest noodle cart!',0),(33087,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Are you ready for your next adventure?',0),(33088,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re here! How long have I been waiting for you?$B$B<Wrathion appears momentarily confused.>$B$BI feel like I just arrived... but maybe I\'ve been here for weeks... This island plays with one\'s head.$B$BKairoz has been trying to explain it to me, but sometimes I think bronze dragons speak in riddles.',0),(33098,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful, these are exactly what I need.$B$B<Wrathion holds one of the coins up, admiring it in the glow of the unmoving sun.>$B$BI will deconstruct their mysterious power, and use their timelessness to enhance your cloak. You will be most pleased with the result.',0),(33100,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An impressive display of martial skill, $C! You have truly walked the path of the emperor, and demonstrated the very traits pandaren value most.',0),(33104,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Step forward, my champion.$B$BThis is your hour.',0),(33105,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion is FURIOUS. News of Hellscream\'s defeat and King Wrynn\'s gesture of peace must\'ve already reached the black dragon\'s ears.>',0),(33125,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Устроив погребение должным образом, ты $gвосстановил:восстановила; честь клана, $n.',20574),(33132,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The wolf is dead? *(coughing): Fine.',20574),(33133,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пусть звезды улыбаются тебе, $n.',19342),(33135,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every world is better off without those demon-loving scum.',0),(33136,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, I can see the look in your eyes. I have heard of your deeds in the tournament. You are ready to choose a companion!$B$BThis one time I will gift you these two additional coins. Use them wisely, as you will only be able to earn one coin each week from this point forward.',0),(33137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A true leader stands before me. It is my honor to grant you this coin, $n.',0),(33138,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наш прекрасный Вечноцветущий дол. Так много разрушений и жестокости. Но... я чувствую, что есть надежда.',19865),(33146,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work $n! Everyone always loves it when they hear that you\'ll be making noodle soup. People come from all over Pandaria just to try a taste.',0),(33147,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You see that? Even now, he keeps fluttering.',19865),(33156,3,1,273,0,0,2,2,0,'',22624),(33160,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Well met, $n!$B$BI was told you would be coming, but had not expected you so soon.$B$B...or has it been a long while? It is difficult to tell, here.$B$BSo! Shall we begin?',0),(33161,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',22624),(33222,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You cheated! I know it!',0),(33228,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',24461),(33229,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< The eyes of the gnome woman reflect light with a copper glow. She\'s not who she seems.$b$b$n! I\'ve been waiting for you for a long time. The bronze dragons need your help again.',19116),(33230,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< The eyes of the gnome woman reflect light with a copper glow. She\'s not who she seems.$b$b$n! I\'ve been waiting for you for a long time. The bronze dragons need your help again.',19243),(33231,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see Chronormu has made good on her promise! You are right on time.',0),(33232,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see Chronormu has made good on her promise! You are right on time.',0),(33234,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ого, да она правда мясистая! Представляю, какой суп я из нее приготовлю! Вот, держи за нее несколько вневременных монет.',0),(33235,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Оно такое… мягкое! Немного соевого соуса и масла… Вот, держи свою плату!',0),(33236,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Таких друзей – за бока и в музей! Ха-ха, это я так шучу. Дам тебе несколько монет, раз уж ты не ворчливый!',0),(33238,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'На этом окороке такие интересные полоски. Интересно, как они повлияют на вкус блюда. Все же я сначала немного отобью это мясо. Да, это ему не повредит. Вот, возьми небольшую плату за твои труды!',0),(33239,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Никогда раньше не видел таких яиц. Где ты его достал? Оно такое прекрасное! Даже и не знаю, смогу ли я решиться его разбить. Шучу, шучу. Из него получится замечательный омлет. Держи свои монеты!',0),(33248,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the Proving Grounds, $C. I am Trial Master Rotun.$B$BHere, you may test your skill at performing several different combat roles: dealing damage, absorbing damage, and healing. I shall administer and judge these trials.$B$B$B$BAre you ready to begin?',0),(33249,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the Proving Grounds, $C. I am Trial Master Rotun.$B$BHere, you may test your skill at performing several different combat roles: dealing damage, absorbing damage, and healing. I shall administer and judge these trials.$B$B$B$BAre you ready to begin?',0),(33250,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is astounding, an egg like this hasn\'t been seen on Pandaria for thousands of years. I believe some of our more ancient scrolls will detail how best to handle it, though many are written in Mogu. I had best get to translating, then!',0),(33252,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A small tag on this present reads:$B$BHappy holidays, $n!',0),(33332,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you have it! Excellent!$B$BA cursory glance indicates that my presumptions were not far-fetched. Though the pages are worn and waterlogged, most of the entries are still legible. It appears that our friend, explorer Harrington, was quite verbose in cataloguing the creatures and treasures he found on his journey through the island.$B$BWell, are you simply going to stand there? This tome is a veritable trove of mysteries, and we have barely scratched the surface! Adventure awaits!',0),(33333,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am happy that you have discovered some riches for your efforts, though we are no closer to unraveling this mystery than before. Take solace in the knowledge that many such bounties are surely scattered throughout the island, eagerly awaiting your exploration skills and combat prowess.$B$BOh, one last thing, my young adventurer - do not forget to look to the skies now and again.',0),(33334,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An interesting story of combat and bravery, though I fear that we learned little from your endeavors save that you are quite the adventurer. It seems that we find ourselves at an impasse with each twist and turn of this tale. Time is a fickle mistress.$B$BYou may wish to spend some time honing your skills here, before the sun sets.',0),(33335,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In my pride, I sought to keep Pandaria a secret, and once again I have found myself learning great lessons from this land. I am glad to be able to share my stories with my people, once again, in that they may learn as I have, and learn from my mistakes. Perhaps you, too, can still learn a thing or two from the lessons of Pandaria.',0),(33336,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',22624),(33337,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How very intriguing. I will have to make some additional modifications, and perhaps locate a more proper catalyst. Thank you for performing this experiment, I trust that you did not experience any adverse effects? Should you feel up to the task, I may have use of your services again shortly.',0),(33338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Give me a moment to grind the stones and add them to the hourglass, and we shall see what new events unfold.$B$BIt\'s really quite convenient, I\'ve a particular affinity for specific moments, rather than lengthy chains of events.$B$BThe timeways tell me that we will have need of its power many times in the near future.',0),(33340,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The island gives in abundance, in nutriment and in answers. You only need look around to find what you seek.',0),(33341,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have experienced the power and wisdom of the Celestials. Let it flow through you now, and remain in your heart for all time.',0),(33342,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your accomplishments are many, and your bravery cannot be questioned. The Ordon have been driven back for the moment, but do not underestimate them. To restore harmony to the isle, we must continue to be vigilant.',0),(33343,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The emissaries of Ordos have been silenced, for a time.$B$BKnow that anger, violence, and hatred will never cease. Wherever there is the darkness within one\'s spirit, you will find these Sha awaiting you. They may become manifest in many forms: a warlord hungering for power, a dagger in your back in the night, a young prince following a dark path, and even your own battle against forces not aligned with your own.$B$BLearn from the lessons of these emotions, lest you lose yourself to the darkness.',0),(33354,1,4,0,0,0,4,0,0,'Наконец-то этот монстр убит! Спасибо тебе.',19702),(33358,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work $n! Everyone always loves it when they hear that you\'ll be making noodle soup. People come from all over Pandaria just to try a taste.',0),(33374,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let this be your daily lesson, and let it hone your strength, wisdom, and fortitude.',0),(33375,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A tale of true heroism, and a powerful moment in history. But not quite what we are after, I am afraid.$B$BNot much time remains - I shall double my efforts.',0),(33376,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Was that... me? How very interesting.$B$BNow we are beginning to see the shadows between worlds. Was this the future of our world, or simply one possibility? Regardless, our newfound ability to see more deeply into the timeways will allow us to push forward towards the answers we seek.$B$BAllow me some time to continue my research. And be vigilant, hero, for the timeways are as infinite as our enemies.',0),(33377,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stormwind... destroyed?$B$BI realize that this vision may come as a shock to you. I know little more than you at this time. I will do my best to search for answers, you have my word.',0),(33378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, it seems that our little prince has a role to play yet. We should not speak further of this, lest we alter the future ourselves.$B$BThe woods have ears, hero. Keep silent, we will find our answers in time.',0),(33379,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Soridormi, the prime consort of Nozdormu, dead? And I was there as well?$B$BWe cannot know what this means, or what will come to pass, or even if this vision takes place in our timeway. You must speak of this vision to no one, lest we alter the course of time and cause great danger to us all. All we can do now is complete the Vision of Time - it will show us what the future truly holds.',0),(33427,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Превосходно, командир. Я посмотрю, какие силы мы можем направить туда для дальнейшей зачистки.',19342),(33444,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorens are just monsters. They were created to eat this world. You\'ve done a good job...',19342),(33513,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа – но это только полдела. Теперь, когда вестник смерти Черношип лишился поддержки, пришло время покончить с ним.',23877),(33514,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы молодцы, $n! Теперь, когда филактерия Амненнара находится под защитой рода красных драконов, мы наконец можем вздохнуть спокойно.',19342),(33533,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Gorgrond, commander. We just arrived too.',20574),(33662,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Надо спешить, пока растения не поняли, что путь свободен.',19342),(33756,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good job, and nice time!',0),(33871,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я – провидица Малунэ, великая хранительница воспоминаний. Наконец-то мне выпала честь встретиться с тобой.',19116),(33882,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе! Теперь мы сможем отправиться в безопасное место.',19342),(33884,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Невероятно! В одиночку одолеть Шер\'хаана... Твоей храбрости нет предела!$b$bТеперь можно никого не бояться! Разве что жутких орков, гигантских птиц, бегемотов, птицелюдей, пауков, пожара...$b$bЗнаешь, пожалуй, не стоит мне тут жить одному...',19342),(33915,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, $n. Уверен, что теперь-то Орак дважды подумает, прежде чем куда-то уходить в одиночку.',20574),(33931,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Haha!',0),(33944,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $gдобрый путник:добрая странница;! Поверить не могу, что Шер\'хаан утащил моего Рики.$b$bТы $gтакой храбрый:такая храбрая;!',19342),(33955,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You scared the baby.',20574),(34012,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< Marauder Sasha nods and weaves two necklaces>',20574),(34066,66,0,0,0,500,0,0,0,'Отличная работа, |3-6($c).$b$bПеред тем, как продолжить наступление, надо найти припасы, которые помогли бы нам в бою.',20574),(34067,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The rope? What am I supposed to do with it? Tie a noose and tell Thunderbirds to hang themselves? Wait... and I have an idea. Yeah, I think I can find a way to use that rope. Great.',19342),(34069,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хм, да, эти копья очень хороши.$b$bНеплохо! Я знаю, что можно с ними сделать!',20574),(34070,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошая работа, $n! Наездники больше не угрожают нам. Но не спеши убирать оружие, для тебя еще найдется дело.',20574),(34072,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Фу, ну и вонища! Нет-нет, не нужно мне их показывать – я охотно поверю тебе на слово.$b$bТеперь давай сматываться отсюда, пока меня не засек очередной патруль Громоборцев.',20574),(34073,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошая работа, $n, мне удалось во время неразберихи пробраться в лагерь.$b$bОсталась лишь одна задача.',20574),(34075,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $n.$b$bКонечно, жаль, что нельзя воскресить его, чтобы убить снова, ну да ладно.$b$bНадеюсь, дух моей малышки теперь спокоен.',20574),(34093,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hrm, yes these spears look pretty good. Outstanding $n! I know just what to use these for!',0),(34102,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n! $b$bЗнамена клана Северного Волка, реющие над трупами наших врагов, наполняют мое сердце гордостью!$b$bПусть навеки запомнят гнев Северных Волков!',20574),(34227,1,1,0,0,0,3000,0,0,'Так грустно, что есть те, кто способен поразить Скверной столь благородных созданий.$B$BТы снова $gпомог:помогла; им, $n. Они не забудут этого.$B$BТеперь пора заняться Советом Теней.',20574),(34228,274,273,0,0,0,3000,0,0,'Этих тварей не было видно давным-давно.$B$BДумаю, их внезапное появление и землетрясения связаны между собой.',20574),(34229,273,274,25,0,0,3000,3000,0,'Мы слышали о странных бледнокожих орках, которых ты $gвидел:видела;. Они похожи на воителей из Награнда. Хотя нет, этого не может быть...$B$BЧто до огра, его зовут Чо\'Галл. Убей его, если сможешь. Он разрушает все на своем пути.',20574),(34230,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, that’s what you need. We use the magic of the Council of Shadows against themselves.',20574),(34264,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The rope? What am I supposed to do with it? Tie a noose and tell Thunderbirds to hang themselves? Wait... and I have an idea. Yeah, I think I can find a way to use that rope. Great.',20574),(34277,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надо было убить их еще у Темного портала, и пес с ними, с последствиями.',20574),(34278,274,25,0,0,0,3000,0,0,'Чтобы отомстить за их злодеяния, этого недостаточно.$B$B$n, когда найдешь их лагерь, посыпь землю солью.',20574),(34279,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Blouse never wins before. $b$bBlouse follow the little one, Blouse wants to learn to fight.',20574),(34280,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gul\'dan is there! To catch him, you must act very quickly!',20574),(34281,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With that ball o\' stone gone I be feelin\' better already!',0),(34284,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well I be a son of a gnome! Am I glad to see you! I was hoping fer a rescue but didn\'t expect da boss tae be here himself!',0),(34285,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank ye, looks like everything\'s still in good shape. Just give me a moment to put this on.',0),(34286,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Secluded cave across the lava, check.$B$BCreepy piles o\' bones, check.$B$BOkay, this looks like the place. We\'re gonna have to watch ourselves, I\'ll bet Borgal isn\'t here alone.',0),(34287,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, I am glad that the spirits have been released from their torment.',0),(34288,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good, I can feel that the magic in these is strong.',0),(34289,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was one hell of a battle! Bloody fine job there la... um commander. $B$BOrlana really helped us out there. I\'ll ask around, maybe a priest can think of something we can do for her. $B$BAt any rate, we still have this artifact to deal with. I think you better hold onto it for safe keeping before any power crazed lunatics comes looking for it.',0),(34291,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сердце? Как мило.$B$BПоспешим. С его помощью мы должны уничтожить кристаллы Скверны и добраться до Гул\'дана.',20574),(34292,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы должны покончить с ними сейчас. Нельзя рисковать, ведь они могут стать еще сильнее.',20574),(34293,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Necessary business. We don\'t dare risk letting them grow more powerful.',0),(34294,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The barrier\'s been destroyed. Time to capture Gul\'dan.',20574),(34295,2,1,0,0,0,3000,0,0,'Неприятно, но ничего удивительного. По крайней мере, нам удалось победить одного из членов Совета.$b$bНо не все потеряно, $n. Нам известны планы Совета Теней и то, куда они направляются.$b$bВ Таладоре мы соберем силы. Вместе мы сможем уничтожить Терон\'крова и не позволим ему захватить Аукиндон.$b$bТы это $gслышал:слышала;?..',20574),(34309,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oi dere mon! Glad to see a friendly face but I not expect da commander ta come out here for me himself!',0),(34314,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah now, dat be feeling much better!',0),(34315,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah dat be me stuff! Give me a moment ta put me stuff on mon. Then, I gonna take me an ogre ear for every bone I had ta pop back in place.',0),(34316,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This be da place. We gonna need ta be careful, Borgal an\' da artifact be in there.',0),(34318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good, I can feel that the magic in these is strong.',0),(34319,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dat was a battle for da ages mon! Bwu\'ja be glad ye are here commanda, else I\'d likely be back in da spirit world permanently.$B$BDat Soulgrinda be a nasty piece o\' mojo. Ye be the best one to hold onto it.$B$BDat spirit, she helped us out a lot mon. I hope she find da peace she be seeking now.',0),(34325,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The lava already burns bright with the return of my people\'s freedom!$B$BWe will have our revenge upon the ogres for everything they have done to us, this I assure you. But for now, we shall rest.',0),(34335,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Привет, |3-6($c). Это про тебя говорила Чолуна?$B$B<Тизали оглядывает вас с головы до ног и одобрительно кивает.>$B$BХорошо.',19342),(34336,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я и не сомневалась, что ты отлично справишься с этой работой, $n. Результаты меня очень порадовали.',19342),(34337,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Так вот он какой! Ну давай посмотрим, что скрывается в этих глубинах.',19342),(34338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты чудом $Gспасся:спаслась;, $n. Отличная работа.',19342),(34339,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ух ты, как интересно! Получается, что горены едят... вообще все подряд!',19342),(34340,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну ничего себе! Потрясающе! Эта кальдера не просто горячая – там все кипит! Спасибо тебе, $n.',19342),(34341,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо. Мы будем хранить артефакт здесь, в твоем гарнизоне.',19342),(34347,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Приказы напрямую от вождя клана Пылающего Клинка!$B$BО ней такое рассказывают... жестокая натура, беспощадный клинок...$B$BОчень хорошо, что ты сразу $gпринес:принесла; приказы мне, $n.',19342),(34352,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You have markedly reduced the number of goblins in the Dark Tide Nest. >',20886),(34353,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And you\'re $gexcellent hunter:excellent hunter;, $n. But our work on this island is not yet complete.',20886),(34354,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done a good thing here today. Don\'t let the blood on your axe blind you.$B$BYou have given these rylaks the peace they deserve.',0),(34355,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Потеряв машины, эти слабаки быстрее сдадут свои позиции на острове.$b$bТы хорошо $gпотрудился:потрудилась;, $n.',20886),(34362,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Blast it, he\'s given us the slip!$B$BTa make things worse the portal looks like it\'s closed from this side. We\'re gonna have to find a way to track Borgal down or we might be stuck in wherever this is.',0),(34365,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Чудесно, $n. Ты $gбесценный союзник:бесценная союзница;.',19342),(34381,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dat ogre, he done give us de slip!$B$B<Bwu\'ja looks around.>$B$BDis place, it be da spirit world! First time I ever walk here in da flesh.$B$BLooks like our path back be blocked and our prey be gone. We gonna have ta go find dat ogre ta get outta dis place.',0),(34397,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Со смертью их лидеров эта операция обречена на провал.',19342),(34403,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа, $n. Собранные тобой чародейские сущности как раз подойдут. Теперь нам нужен лишь подходящий для настройки кристалл...',22810),(34406,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, что $gпомог:помогла; шахтерам выбраться в безопасное место, $n.',22810),(34409,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $C. You\'re the commander from the garrison?$B$B$B$BGood.',0),(34410,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Never in my years have I seen anything like this, $n. You have done well today.',0),(34415,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Печально, что столь могучее существо пришлось уничтожить, но Ан\'дур был угрозой для всех в Иорунской шахте. Сердце кристаллического гиганта поможет нам восстановить мир.',22810),(34447,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Один мудрый старейшина моего ордена как-то сказал: \"Истинное могущество складывается из силы, позволяющей действовать, и мудрости, позволяющей не действовать попусту\". Пусть эти слова и память о Келинаре навсегда останутся с тобой, $n.',20574),(34448,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Один мудрый старейшина моего ордена как-то сказал: \"Истинное могущество складывается из силы, позволяющей действовать, и мудрости, позволяющей не действовать попусту\". Пусть эти слова и память о Келинаре навсегда останутся с тобой, $n.',22810),(34450,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сегодня мы с тобой многого добились, $n. Жду не дождусь того дня, когда мы сможем поохотиться снова.',19342),(34455,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Устройство рассыпается у вас в руках.$b$bУдар по больному обязательно заставит Железную Орду задуматься о своей тактике управления рилаками.',19342),(34464,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These boots are fantastic! You did the right thing bringing these to me.$B$BThey are actually trying to replace the space they occupy with a different timeline.$B$BThis will definitely require more study.',0),(34465,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a hat. Look how it moves in time back and forth! It\'s like it\'s being juggled by someone who\'s in the past, present, and future at the same time! I\'d love to try it on, but I\'m afraid to leave this reality by accident forever.',19342),(34466,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хм... Кажется, этот посох мне знаком. Может быть...$b$bТы молодчина, что $gпринес:принесла; его мне. Я изучу его более тщательно!',19342),(34469,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, I am glad that the spirits have been released from their torment.',0),(34472,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n? Is that you? Fantastic! And they said it couldn\'t be done.$B$BThey said traversing the worlds in this way was the domain of the bronze dragonflight. Well, guess who\'s temporally laughing now!',0),(34569,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re the one in charge around here, right? I\'ve heard the guards talk about your exploits and if I wasn\'t looking at you now I\'d swear they were lying.$b$bI\'ve only ever wanted to make the finest blades and put them in the hands of the strongest of fighters. I can tell already that you\'re exactly the type I want to carry my weapons.$b$bIf you can give me a chance I swear you will not be disappointed.',19116),(34572,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Теперь они вынуждены будут сосредоточить все усилия на обороне базы. Надеюсь, со временем здесь все нормализуется.',20574),(34576,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In the forges of the Black Mountain clan, we had better materials, but that will do too.',24742),(34577,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Здоровые куски, и в них почти нет пустой породы.$b$bТо, что нужно.',24742),(34579,66,1,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Спасибо, босс, это именно то, что нужно.$b$bКстати... Газ горенов довольно трудно добывать. Возможно, не стоит вырезать этих тварей подчистую до тех пор, пока мы не сможем хранить его в достаточных количествах.$b$bЭто просто так, мысли вслух.',24742),(34609,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это не совсем то, чему нас учили в Даларане, но все равно должно сработать!',22810),(34612,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, this is just what you need! An excellent parchment comes out of this bark.',22810),(34619,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасно! Теперь у нас достаточно энергии!',22810),(34631,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, so you built a magical sanctuary! That\'s great! $B$BI take it you\'ve had trouble connecting it to the power line network?',22810),(34672,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, that was something! The ancient gods will now think twice whether it\'s worth trying to get out of their holes again.',23877),(34673,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dat was amazin\', $n! De Old Gods be thinkin\' twice before tryin\' to take anudder bite outta you, mon.',0),(34674,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They came at us... from... nowhere.$B$B<The lieutenant nearly passes out.>',0),(34685,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебя прислал Калаам? Хвала Свету! Я знал, что могу на него рассчитывать!',20574),(34697,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебя прислал орк из Веселого Черепа? Это было бы смешно, если бы на его месте был орк из любого другого клана.$b$bЯ – Кас\'дракор, герой клана Северного Волка и лучший воин арены Каменного Молота.$b$bИ все же мне приходится просить тебя о помощи.',19342),(34698,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Один твой поступок по чести своей превосходит все, что я видел за много лет.$b$bКогда мы закончим это дело, я принесу клятву верности твоим войскам и обучу их всему, что знаю сам.',20574),(34699,153,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, $Gстранный воин:странная воительница;. Теперь-то мы можем разрубить вождя Кор\'галла пополам!',20574),(34700,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пока я или мой сын живы, твое доброе дело не будет забыто. Я очень благодарен тебе, $gгерой:героиня;. У тебя теперь есть новый преданный друг.',20574),(34702,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я смотреть за тобой издали. Ты хорошо драться. Из тебя выходить славный боец.',20574),(34703,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Этот топор за все время своего существования причинил достаточно боли и страданий. От него нужно избавиться.',20574),(34704,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты не $gпохож на охотника:похожа на охотницу; за головами из клана Каменного Молота.$b$bНам удалось вырваться из тисков их гнусной арены, но дорогой ценой. Позади осталось немало наших павших друзей – и слишком много живых огров.$b$bНам сейчас очень не помешает помощь новичка, чье лицо незнакомо ограм.',20574),(34711,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С помощью этого кристалла мы наконец подключим твою башню к сети силовых линий.$B$BЯ также немного подкорректировала чертеж, чтобы его легче было прочитать. Теперь строить следующее здание будет намного легче.',22810),(34720,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That bit of justice is sure to have lifted the spirits of my rangari.$B$BLosing Telaar and many of our friends has taken a heavy toll.$B$BThank you, commander.',0),(34721,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я – провидица Малунэ, великая хранительница воспоминаний. Наконец-то мне выпала честь встретиться с тобой.',20574),(34722,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did well against a coordinated Thunderlord attack, $n.',0),(34730,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander $n, Your mastery over the battlefield is astounding. If my people are to survive the coming conflict we will need more of our own people skilled in such warfare.$B$BIf you will have me, I would like to join your forces for a time. I wish to learn from you so that I might teach others in my clan.$B$BWill you accept my axe?',0),(34733,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пусть-ка лучше себя спросят: это они поймали Дагга или Дагг их поймал?$b$bА $gгерой:героиня; берет и раскрывает всем, где Дагг прячется! Но Дагг думает, ты $gособенный:особенная;. Дагг командует этими ребятами и хочет к тебе присоединиться.$b$bДагг в этом уверен.',19342),(34747,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У меня больше нет клана. Пылающий Клинок для меня больше не существует. Возможно, когда-нибудь я создам собственный клан.$B$BА пока что ты окажешь мне честь, если позволишь сражаться под твоим командованием. Ты $gосвободил:освободила; меня и храбро $Gсражался:сражалась;.$B$BМы могли бы многому друг у друга научиться. Что скажешь?',20574),(34751,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes! That\'s what it takes. It\'s a pleasure doing business with you, even though you\'re |3-6($c).$B$B$When we put this in here...',20574),(34794,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Они напали... словно из ниоткуда.$B$B<Каменный страж вот-вот потеряет сознание.>',19342),(34802,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе! У меня слов нет, чтобы выразить мою благодарность.',22810),(34815,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Рада встрече.$B$BЯ – магистр Серена. Ледяной маг высочайшего уровня!',22810),(34837,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I crafted a few things before we left that we may need: some bombs, a grappling hook, even was able to get one of the goblins to get a spare rocket pack.$B$BI\'m sure we\'ll find a use for everything.',0),(34840,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that we\'re inside we have much to do.',0),(34855,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now with the viziers gone the whole Gordunni enchantment trade with the Iron Horde will come crashing down!$B$BWe can now turn our attention to dealing with Morkurk.',0),(34858,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, commander. With this another stain on my honor has been removed.',0),(34860,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright, that should be the last one we need. $B$BNothing feels as good as knowing you are stronger than your enemy!',0),(34867,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorgrond is no place for armies, commander. We step into the lands of ancient legends.',20574),(34870,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fine work commander! Your combat skills are clearly second to none. I am honored to be your armorer!$B$BLet\'s get back to the outpost so we can take stock of our new inventory. I saved a few flares to call us in a ride back.',0),(34875,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь пора подумать об искусственном нексусе для твоей башни.',22810),(34897,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо за отчет, $n. За этими южными пустошами нужно постоянно приглядывать.',20779),(34908,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не будем тратить время впустую. Крепость Гордал стоит на вершине этого холма – осталось совсем немного.',22810),(34909,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не лучшие экземпляры, но, по-моему, польза от них будет.',22810),(34910,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда мы с ними разобрались, Моркурк остался без защиты.',22810),(34911,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Уничтожив стражей, мы обеспечили себе победу. Прекрасно!',22810),(34912,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Похоже, Моркурк ничего не смог нам противопоставить, а?',22810),(34913,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Свиток массовой телепортации готов, но прямо сейчас он не сработает. Чтобы закрепить успех, мы должны принять определенные меры.',22810),(34923,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks to you, we had time to rest and continue the rituals. You will be shadowed by the ancestor of the ravens.',22810),(34924,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There was a terrible fate in the clutches of the Bloody Claw. But now it\'s over, and we\'ll take care of them. Thank you!',22810),(34938,4,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, the news is that today the $gstranger defeated: the stranger defeated; the worst enemy of the pack! $b$bGlory to the Raven Ancestor!',22810),(34939,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это станет достойным подношением Прародительнице воронов! Да возрадуется она останкам наших врагов!',22810),(34947,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These orders appear to have come from Orgrim Doomhammer.',0),(34948,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Похоже, эти приказы поступили от Оргрима Молота Рока.',19342),(34951,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кто ты?$B$BНеужели ты не знаешь, как выглядит смерть, |3-6($c)?',20574),(34952,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gсделал:сделала; для нас большое дело, $gмальчик:девочка;, а мы добро помним.$B$BДавай через часок отпразднуем, выпьем по кружечке. Я угощаю.',20574),(34953,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You done us a solid with them Burning Blade, lad, and we\'re not the forgettin\' kind.$B$BLet\'s celebrate o\'er a pint in an hour. Drinks are on me.',0),(34954,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Раз уж ты $Gсмог:смогла; победить Лухка, значит, из тебя еще выйдет толк.',20574),(34955,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не думаю, что сейчас ты осознаешь важность содеянного.$B$BНо, может быть, такой день когда-нибудь придет.',20574),(34956,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Итак, ты здесь. Хорошо.$B$BДобраться сюда было нелегко, но это ничто по сравнению с тем, что нам предстоит.',20574),(34957,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы одержали над Пылающим Клинком славную победу!$B$BИх новый предводитель, Азука Ярость Клинка, очень опасна. ',20574),(34971,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The outpost is now fully up and running and we have enough material to outfit an army - your army!',0),(34972,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It took a lot of hard work but we have made a beautiful arsenal here.$B$BSir, I\'ve been able to outfit your soldiers here with new equipment but I\'d like to do more.$B$BI\'d be deeply honored if you would let me work for you in your main garrison.',0),(34993,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Оснащение твоей башни обернулось неплохим приключением. Если ты не против, мне бы хотелось принять участие в твоей кампании.',22810),(35009,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты много $Gсделал:сделала;, чтобы помочь моему гнездышку забытых. Эти бедняги не совсем в своем уме, и на них охотятся их же собратья. Ужасно.$B$BИх летающие сородичи – у вас они зовутся Приверженцами – желают уничтожить забытых и превратить моих детей в рабов.$B$BЭтого я допустить не могу!',22810),(35025,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, I owe you one.$B$BToday, the arrogant Iron Horde made a dangerous enemy.',19342),(35026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<No drinking water greedily. >',20574),(35035,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Смотри, как они горят!',19342),(35036,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Этот полуорк подпалил мне пальцы на ногах!',19342),(35037,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Они хотят подчинить себе гроннов? Похоже, ситуация более опасная, чем кажется на первый взгляд.',20574),(35038,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes ... We do not need their bones, but we need their crystals.',19342),(35041,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо, что ты еще не $gрастерял:растеряла; находчивости. Ты ведь... не $gрастерял:растеряла; находчивости?',19342),(35059,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Рада видеть тебя, командор. Когда до меня дошли вести об уничтожении вашего каравана...$B$BСкажем так, мне подумалось самое худшее.$B$BЕсть ли новости с Телаарской станции?',20574),(35060,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Командир $n.$B$B<Урук Гроза Врагов смотрит на вас и усмехается.>$B$BУсловия капитуляции? Хм... дай-ка подумать...',20574),(35061,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Too bad it happened. Well, at least you managed to get out of this trap alive ;.',20574),(35062,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If you had not gone; to the Loc\'rat, our warriors would have suffered a sad fate. I am sorry to hear there was a trap waiting for you. I think you\'ve won; a worthy reputation.',20574),(35066,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),(35067,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, командор. Я уж думал, что нам конец.',20574),(35068,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It’s a pity that it happened, but I understand perfectly the orcs of the War Song clan. I would not give up in their place either.',20574),(35069,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это ошейник той самой твари? Ее вой слышно было даже здесь!',20574),(35071,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),(35072,1,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Это как раз то, что надо, $n! Спасибо большое!',19342),(35073,1,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Как раз то, что нужно, $n! Спасибо!',19342),(35074,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),(35075,1,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Это как раз то, что надо, $n! Спасибо большое!',19342),(35093,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We saved everyone we could, $n. We were too late for the others... including my sister.$B$BProphet Velen is right. When it is asked of us, we ALL must fight. I promise this: I will never again let my loved ones suffer.$B$BNer\'zhul is close to calling down the Dark Star. We are the only ones who can stop him.',0),(35102,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have a lot of basic arms here but I\'ll get them improved in no time.$b$bThanks for giving me this chance.',19116),(35104,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What... happened? Where is my master?',0),(35106,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My heart is furious with you for stealing my kill, but my mind knows that I did not have the strength to avenge my master myself. I will forgive you, if you allow me to pay my debt of honor.',0),(35128,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не всякий справится в одиночку с огроном.',20574),(35129,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Результаты его исследований у нас... Посмотрим, что в них говорится о стратегии врага.',19342),(35136,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа, $n. Когда придет время, мы сможем использовать этот артефакт против Железной Орды.',19342),(35137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда у нас есть учителя, мы сможем обучить твоих солдат рубить не только дрова. Хе-хе.',20574),(35139,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо. Теперь мы точно знаем, где находится артефакт.',20574),(35140,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Потрясающе.$B$B<Воздаятельница Ирель подзывает вас к себе, чтобы вы могли тайно переговорить.>',20574),(35141,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, $n... Давай не будем спешить. Я уже понял, что у тебя в переноске.$B$BЭто же была просто безобидная шутка.$B$BПожалуйста, не надо!$B$BОстановись!$B$BНе открывай!!!',20574),(35142,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The peons will clean this mess, Commander. Rubble and holes everywhere. The rest of us will look for hiding goren so that we may apologize to them for butchering their warleader.',0),(35143,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A great victory over the Burning Blade!$B$BThis Flamebender Ka\'graz sounds formidable. We shall have to keep an eye on her and her blademasters.',0),(35152,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кас\'дракор идет сюда?! Ха! Однажды я видел, как дюжина орков Веселого Черепа схватила его сына, и он зарубил их всех.$b$bЧистое воплощение насилия.',19342),(35168,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me unpack that for you.$B$BI should let you know - while we managed to expedite this one, future work orders will take longer.',0),(35169,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s over. The Song of War clan is defeated. Garroche Hell\'s Creek is finally dead. But somehow I think Gromash will want revenge sooner or later.',19342),(35172,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We look forward to serving you again.',0),(35197,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... Socrethar\'s ambitions begin with Shattrath and Auchindoun, but they do not end there.$B$BThank you for bringing this information to me, $n.$B$BI will relay it to Archmage Khadgar immediately.',0),(35202,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, yes. Zach is one step closer to performing a miracle.',19342),(35210,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эти туннели горенов оказались полезными.',20574),(35217,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent! I admit I love the taste of those pears as well, but it is a small price to pay to destroy our enemy.',0),(35218,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These orders are written with terrible handwriting.',24742),(35238,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wenbot-8000. New host received: $n. Orders received: Massage enemies |3-1($n)... ...to death.',20574),(35247,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The spirits of my ancestors have betrayed me! Their skulls must be having fun now.',19342),(35248,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Как же я люблю убивать всякую нечисть. И кости тоже люблю.',19342),(35251,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This camp of yours could be fruitful, but it rests upon the footstep of Grom\'gar. The Thunderlords are not likely to be welcome neighbors.',0),(35264,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. You deserve this reward, friend.',0),(35332,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо, что ты $gдобрался:добралась; сюда в добром здравии.$B$BИдем, нам многое предстоит сделать.',20574),(35337,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twelve couples, huh? Not bad, commander. $B$BAlthough ... just the same amount I managed to get. Yes ... about a dozen pairs of ears. Yeah ...',20574),(35338,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twenty-four, huh? Great. $B$BI have fifty.$B$BNow I\'ll send someone for meat - why is it good to disappear?',20574),(35342,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О! Я вижу, тебе в руки попало творение дренорских алхимиков.',19342),(35343,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прошу. Помоги. Мне надо найти отца.',19342),(35344,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $gнезнакомец:незнакомка;. Видимо, остроклыкам не понравилось, что я охочусь на ту же жертву.',19342),(35345,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gсделал:сделала; это ради нашей семьи? После того, как $gспас:спасла; нашего отца? От всего сердца благодарю тебя, $n.$b$bХочешь обучиться дренорской алхимии? Я научу тебя всему, чему только сумею.',19342),(35350,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Magnificent trophy, commander. We\'re all proud of you.',20574),(35356,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это же моя стрела! Откуда она у тебя?',20574),(35357,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n. Ты $gдобился:добилась; успеха там, где это не удалось мне.$B$BВозможно, среди чужаков действительно есть хорошие охотники.',20574),(35416,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Превосходно, командир. Многие орки пытались завладеть силой генезотавров, но, по-моему, никому еще не удалось этого добиться.$b$bЭто даст нам значительное преимущество, когда мы в следующий раз сойдемся с Железной Ордой.',20574),(35450,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, Prelate Luari sent you, did she? Such a sweet woman, always looking out for others.',0),(35459,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming to assist us.',0),(35596,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Zlatogriv is quite stretching, stretching after being in a tight cage. He looks around, then looks at you carefully, as if waiting for some kind of reaction. Then he nods gratefully to you, showing that he will join you... at least for a while... >',20574),(35620,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эй, ты ведь с базы Орды, да?$B$BХорошо, что ты здесь – нам твоя помощь придется очень кстати!',20574),(35638,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),(35639,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $C! I will let Vindicator Maraad know of your bravery.',0),(35664,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Ancients won\'t slip into your outpost for long.',20574),(35665,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, друг. Я перед тобой в долгу.$B$BСегодня заносчивая Железная Орда нажила себе опасного врага.',20574),(35679,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to see you, $n. Your aid will be invaluable in this critical hour.',0),(35680,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to see you, $n. Your aid will be invaluable in this critical hour.',0),(35683,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. These insignias will surely bring Socrethar out of hiding.',0),(35684,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. These insignias will surely bring Socrethar out of hiding.',0),(35685,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Finally, it is done. Othaar... my old friend... be at peace now.',0),(35686,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эти существа рвутся в бой друг с другом с неукротимой яростью.',20574),(35687,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Finally, it is done. This creature of darkness shall torment us no longer. Shattrath is free of his taint.',0),(35689,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),(35690,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. You deserve this reward, friend.',0),(35691,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $C! I will let Vindicator Maraad know of your bravery.',0),(35693,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У тебя настоящий талант к битве.',20574),(35699,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think we can make a deal, savior; Skettisa. But first...',19342),(35702,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О да... Теперь, когда в наших руках такая сила, орки ничего не смогут нам противопоставить...',20574),(35704,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы с Перси хотим подарить тебе кое-что в знак нашей благодарности. Это мелочь, но, прошу, прими нашу скромную награду.',22810),(35713,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ого! Да ты $Gвооружен:вооружена; до зубов! Ух, что за доспех! Слушай, не поможешь усталому гному в беде?',19342),(35716,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я навеки твой должник! А теперь поехали на место раскопок.',19342),(35719,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О, наконец-то. У меня ведь и оружия-то нет!',19342),(35730,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо. Теперь ее раны закрылись.',20574),(35737,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work. Your service is always appreciated, $n.',0),(35739,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ого, сколько ты угля $Gпритащил:притащила;. Отлично!',19342),(35782,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не шутишь? Во дела! Чего только не бывает на свете!',19342),(35786,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With every victory, or claim here grows more strong.',0),(35787,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Without each battle, or sovereignty here grows, Commander.',0),(35788,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our foes cringe, Commander. Hah! They\'ll lick their wounds for days before even dreaming of another fight.',0),(35807,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Раньше разведчикам приходилось шастать между котлов, спасаясь от гроннов и одновременно рискуя попасть в раскаленные когти паровых элементалей. После смерти Эрозиана они вздохнут свободно!',19342),(35808,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One minute you are skirting the cauldrons avoiding the Gronn, the next a blast a steam followed by burning hot claws. Erosian\'s death should make our scouts lives a lot easier!',0),(35809,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have defeated yet another deadly beast in Gorgrond.$B$BDessicus cared little on who he preyed upon, they all went into his salt pools forever. You have saved many lives $n!',0),(35810,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $Gпобедил:победила; в Горгронде еще одного жуткого зверя.$B$BИссушитель убивал всех без разбора – и сбрасывал в соляные озера. Ты $Gспас:спасла; много жизней, $p!',19243),(35811,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кажется, земля теперь трясется меньше. Его ярость наносила этому миру неописуемый ущерб. Хорошо, что он пал от твоей руки.',19243),(35814,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Funny Skulls told me about Crimson Top - no one has ever returned from there. If the travelers died because of it, then we can all breathe a sigh of relief now.',19342),(35815,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Нам здесь и так приходится нелегко, а тут еще этот Чарл донимал разведчиков – мало им гроннов!$b$bХвала тебе, $p!',19243),(35816,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our purpose here was hard enough without a giant beast like Charl harassing our scouts and aggravating the Gronn.$B$BYou have saved the rangari a great deal of punishment with this kill $n!',0),(35817,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The calls of that giant bird could never be ignored.$B$BYou could never be sure if it was far away or if there would be a sudden shadow followed by your immediate death. Well done!',0),(35818,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The calls of that giant bird could never be ignored.$B$BYou could never be sure if it was far away or if there would be a sudden shadow followed by your immediate death. Well done!',0),(35819,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Funny Skulls have always avoided this place, because Kargaks, for all its sizes, was quite fast. They\'ll be glad to know that their eaten brothers have been avenged.',19342),(35828,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Теперь он у меня живо забегает.',22810),(35835,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, пора испробовать эту штуковину!',19342),(35837,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Judging by the marks on her body, the agent put up an impressive fight.>',0),(35838,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad I found you, $n. I\'ve been hiding out since the Warsong orcs ambushed our camp at the Hidden Camp.$B$BYou should have seen the fight that Jeanine put up. Even after they began torturing her, she never gave up that there were two of us.$B$BShe had a will of steel, that one.',0),(35839,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is remarkable, $n. We now have direct proof of Grommash\'s intentions.$B$BPerhaps now, we can stay a step ahead of the Iron Horde. Great work!',0),(35840,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n.',0),(35841,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have heard many reports about Vor\'gash. It is a relief to know he will trouble us no more.',0),(35842,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я про Вор\'гаша многое знаю. Теперь уж он нам не опасен. Здорово.',19342),(35843,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Down by the brutal wounds on his body, the dark hunter fought to the last. >',19342),(35844,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been looking for you, commander. I knew you were coming, but the orchid hurt fast before she could warn me.$B$BWell, though I\'d save you. Poor Zasta. He wasn\'t even expecting it.',19342),(35845,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So we have a certificate of Hell\'s Creek\'s designs.Maybe now we can get ahead of the Iron Horde. Okay, great.',19342),(35846,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо, $n. Прям вот очень хорошо.',19342),(35867,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы рады любой помощи.',20886),(35868,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. You deserve this reward, friend.',0),(35869,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $C! I will let Vindicator Maraad know of your bravery.',0),(35870,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Nothing greedily swallows meat. >',20574),(35871,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),(35872,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. You deserve this reward, friend.',0),(35873,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $C! I will let Grand Marshal Tremblade know of your bravery.',0),(35876,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У этих дикарей нет чести. Пора нам разобраться с Железной Ордой.',20886),(35878,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Фантастика! Приключение, прямо как в старые добрые времена!',19342),(35880,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я вижу судьбы своих врагов в костях. Все они умрут!',19342),(35882,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s how you get out of a gladiator pit! You\'re interesting... There\'s so much blood on your weapon, you can tell the shades. Now I\'ll follow you.',19342),(35883,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For years ogres made me fight, kill and greet them standing in the arena. With every greeting, my soul was bleeding. I will never have to greet an ogre again. You have helped; I will win my freedom, and I will use it to serve under your banner. Today I greet you, commander.',20574),(35907,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Трупы свежие. Убийцы, наверное, еще рядом.',20574),(35921,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey there, bub. Lucy sent you? Good kid.$B$BYeah... you look like you\'ll do nicely.',0),(35922,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Здравствуй, $Gдружище:подруга;. Тебя Люси прислала? Хорошая девочка.$B$BДа... ты как раз подойдешь.',24461),(35924,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что там у тебя? Дай посмотреть.',20574),(35925,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это жуткая новость, $n.',20574),(35927,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n. Перевозить мозги не так-то просто. Они скользкие до ужаса.',20490),(35934,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $n. Ниша уже почти здорова.',20574),(35935,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Iron Horde is a threat to us all. We must finish it off completely. For the Horde!',19342),(35937,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мда, ни сережек, ничего. Пусть тебе улыбнется удача, |3-6($C), – в другой раз!',20490),(35938,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha, yea, just some nose trivia for you there. This pointy trophy proves you slayed a Goblin out there. Good job, here\'s a lil\' something for your hard work.',0),(35939,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Конечно же не $gвидел:видела;! Ну, то есть... Как можно бесшумно красться на копытах?!',20490),(35940,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jeez... somebody didn\'t brush, eh? Hah, here take this reward $n.',0),(35941,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh man, <coughs> ... get that thing sealed into my bucket quick.',0),(35942,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m kidding! I\'m kidding! We all know you\'re a model $C of Stormshield, $n. Here, take this as a reward.',0),(35944,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы приятно удивлены твоей ловкости в охоте на горенов. Они безжалостны и свирепы и с легкостью могут разделаться с тем, кто не готов к встрече с ними.',19865),(35945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ох... Нога онемела... какая боль... Меня зовут Греблин Убыстрямс, я археолог.$b$bЧем могу помочь?',19342),(35947,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Gardoul Poisonous Knife may consider himself dead.',20574),(35948,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы приятно удивлены твоей ловкостью в охоте на горенов. Они безжалостны и свирепы и с легкостью могут разделаться с тем, кто не готов к встрече с ними.',19342),(35970,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично! Что у тебя?$b$bОжерелье? Неплохо... Еще одно, чудесно. Огромный камень в виде головы огра?$b$b<Греблин озадаченно смотрит на вас.>$b$bСерьезно? Камень в форме идиота? Ну да ладно. Ожерелья неплохие.$b$bВ общем, достойный улов. ',19342),(35972,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О, это гораздо лучше.$b$bБудут знать, как кидаться камнями. Э-э... Ну, то есть знали бы, если были бы живы.',19342),(35973,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кольцо у тебя? Отлично! За это добро Археологическое общество Хитрой Шестеренки выручит отличные деньги.$b$bНикси будет довольна.',19342),(35985,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re looking for what now? I mean, yeah sure... whatever. Just get me down alright?',0),(35990,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kadgar rolls the fire sphere in the palms of his hand. >$b$bYou know how to use it, $n? $b$bWell, I don\'t know. Okay, let\'s improvise, sometimes there\'s nothing else.',20779),(35991,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Замечательно. Давно хотел посмотреть на такое вблизи... Давай откроем.$b$bХм...$b$bЧто ж, творческим их подход не назовешь, но определенное своеобразное очарование в гоблинской работе есть – этого не отнять. Удивительно, как эта штука не взрывается. Хотя, может, и взрывается. По крайней мере, теперь я понимаю, для чего они используют \"самофланж\".$b$bВсе получится. Отлично, $n!',20779),(35992,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ого, еще живое! Ты чувствуешь?$b$bЯ обязательно верну его в землю Дренора, когда мы закончим. Надеюсь, Круг Кенария не допустит его превращения в еще одно оскверненное чудовище.$b$bОтличная работа, $n. Это было весьма непростое задание.',20779),(35993,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сегодня большой день, $n. Мы уничтожили одного из главных приспешников Гул\'дана и еще на один шаг приблизились к тому, чтобы найти его самого.',20779),(35994,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gul\'dan resists my magic, $n! Hiding, scoundrel! $b$bWell, nothing, we’ll find it on him. I know how to increase the strength and range of my spell ...',20779),(35995,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The upper magician is choking. >$b$b Give me...> one minute. Uh...$b$b.That was just unbelievable, $n! Perhaps you\'re $g-largest:greatest:c; |3-6($c), shoulder to shoulder with $gwhich..:who:c; I have had the honor of fighting.',20779),(35997,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Фолиант скверноломов пуст? Дай-ка я посмотрю. А печать короля-чародея у тебя? Ну конечно: смотри, проводишь печатью по странице, и появляется рунный текст. Ого... Это книга не для новичков.$b$bМне нужно время, чтобы полностью расшифровать твою находку, $n, но, похоже, первые страницы посвящены природе Скверны. То, что мне нужно! Отличная работа!',20886),(35998,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Cadgar lifts several stones to light, so thin threads of secret energy begin to wriggle from stone to stone. >$b$bI don\'t think it would ever occur to me to underestimate ogres again, $n. Take a couple who can think for themselves, and they blind a formidable army of others.',20886),(36000,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, Chromie agreed to help track down our bronze fugitive. $b$bShe may look miniature, but believe me, she\'s a hundred times older than you.',20779),(36004,6,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Как самочувствие? Хочешь что-нибудь выпить?$b$bХотелось бы сказать, что теперь дела пойдут легче, но все только начинается. Мне придется попросить тебя отправиться в самое сердце империи огров... Ты $gготов:готова;?',20779),(36005,6,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Колотая рана! Его ранили кинжалом!$b$bЧто за преступная беспечность... Надо было выставить часовых, надо было...$b$bВпрочем, что теперь говорить. Надо действовать, и быстро.',20886),(36006,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кирин-Тор выслал помощь незамедлительно. Джайна явилась вовремя. Но если бы ты не $gнашел:нашла; Гарону, верховный маг бы точно скончался. Спасибо тебе, $n!',20886),(36007,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Как ощущения?$b$bТвое кольцо – теперь один из самых мощных артефактов в этом мире. И это хорошо. Потому что мы собираемся нанести удар прямо в сердце врага...',20886),(36009,274,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Watch out! Put it down carefully. I\'ll take it from here.$b$bThe Heart of Rage is not a toy.',20886),(36010,274,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Посмотрим, что у нас тут... как интересно! Этот рунический язык чем-то похож на диалект игнан калимаг, на котором разговаривают огненные элементали Азерота. Полный перевод может занять целые годы.$b$bНо части на орочьем – да, эти я могу расшифровать. Чтобы научиться не только обрабатывать сталь, но и подчинять саму силу элементаля.$b$bГул\'дан силен, но если мы продолжим раскрывать тайны Дренора, то сумеем ответить на любой его удар...',20886),(36012,5,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gнашел:нашла; ее! Мне доводилось слышать рассказы об этих могущественных сферах. Как же мне хотелось изучить их во время долгого изгнания в Запределье. И вот, теперь сфера у меня в руках. Покажи-ка…$b$b<Кадгар с благоговением открывает ваш рюкзак и заглядывает внутрь. Его лицо долгое время остается неподвижным. Наконец он произносит:>$b$b...Не знаю, чего я ожидал.',20886),(36013,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Скрижали у тебя в руках. Отлично! Должно быть, на их сборку ушла уйма времени и сил. Повезло мне с тобой.$b$bНе будем откладывать. Покажи мне свое кольцо. Ага… Я справлюсь. Используем скрижали и сделаем тебя сильнее.',20886),(36014,6,1,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Что у нас тут? Надо же, легенды все-таки не врут. Чернорук принес свою руку в жертву стихиям. И теперь, после его смерти, ее не отличить от камня. Хотя…$b$b<Кадгар произносит несколько заклинаний из Фолианта укрощения огня. Отрубленная рука медленно сжимает пальцы в кулак.>$b$bХ-м-м-м. Ага. Скажу тебе честно, $n. Это было чертовски жутко.',20338),(36016,274,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kadgar is very upset. >$b$bI\'m sorry, commander. I already thought we\'d lost you.$b$bThis ring will serve you faith and truth. I\'ve never seen such a mighty and perfect artifact. Perhaps it can still be perfected, but... I don\'t know what the cost is.$b$bUse it wisely!',20886),(36017,274,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Магия Гул\'дана глубоко проникла в разум Гароны. Чем больше времени я провожу с ней, тем более мне очевидно, что мы ДОЛЖНЫ освободить ее от этой власти.$B$BЯ ни за что не отступлюсь, $n.',20886),(36018,274,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что ж, мои изыскания прошли неплохо. Думаю, теперь мы готовы к следующему шагу. Не факт, что он тебе понравится...',19865),(36022,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s great.',20574),(36024,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. We won\'t let you down.',0),(36025,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. We won\'t let you down.',0),(36026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. You deserve this reward, friend.',0),(36027,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, $n. It is wonderful to \"see\" you. As you are no doubt aware the state of Outland in our own timeline is constantly degrading.$B$BI wish to extend my remote services to your cause so that I might better investigate Draenor in the time before it was ripped asunder.$B$BThis projection may seem translucent, but I can assure you it acts as a perfect conduit for my own powers.$B$BWill you accept my service?',0),(36028,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы не дадим ему уйти.',20574),(36030,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),(36031,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. We won\'t let you down.<table class=\"iconlist\"><tr><th><ul><li><var></var></li></ul></th><td>Collect: <a href=\"/currency=944\">Artifact Fragment</a>(2500)</td></tr></table>',0),(36032,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. We won\'t let you down.',0),(36033,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'IT\'S SO PRETTTTY. WILL FIT NICE ON MY SPIKE OUTSIDE MY HUT. HAHAHA. HERE, TAKE THIS REWARD AND GET BACK OUT THERE.',0),(36034,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'УХ! А ВОТ ЭТОТ ДЛИННЫЙ. АХ-ХА-ХА! ТАК, ВОТ ТЕБЕ ЗА ТРУДЫ.',20779),(36038,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'WHATEVER, WHO LIKES PANDAS ANYHOW! <Laughs> TAKE THIS REWARD AND GET BACK OUT THERE!',0),(36040,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'WAIT, YOU JUST BROUGHT ME THEIR HAIR? UGH. I SAID I WANTED THEIR HEAD! UGHHH! <Stomps Feet> BUT I GUESS THIS IS ENOUGH TO PROVE YOU FOUGHT ONE IN BATTLE, SO TAKE YOUR REWARD. AND NEXT TIME, THEIR HEAD!',0),(36041,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A TAIL! WELL, YOU SHOULDN\'T HAVE! I\'LL CHERISH IT FOREVER!',0),(36042,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ОТЛИЧНАЯ РАБОТА! ПРИТАЩИ ЕЩЕ, И Я ПРИГОТОВЛЮ ТЕБЕ ТАРЕЛКУ МОЕГО ЛЮБИМОГО БУЛЬОНА ИЗ ЧЕЛОВЕЧЬИХ КОСТЕЙ! ХА-ХА-ХА!',20779),(36047,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Можем возвращаться на заставу.',20574),(36054,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Простой обмен с очень непростыми результатами. В этом и заключается искусство вести дела.',19243),(36056,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты чувствуешь себя в безопасности, $gнезнакомец:незнакомка;?',20886),(36063,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы рады любой помощи.',20779),(36064,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. Once we\'ve collected enough artifacts we\'ll summon the Mage portals back to Warspear within Ashran.',0),(36065,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. Once we\'ve collected enough artifacts we\'ll summon the Mage portals back to Warspear within Ashran.',0),(36066,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),(36067,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. We won\'t let you down.',0),(36068,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. We won\'t let you down.',0),(36075,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сложно поверить, что есть существо более жестокое, чем огр, но огрон определенно подходит под это определение. Сражение с пойманным огроном на арене – уже непростая задача, но сражение с диким огроном в его собственном логове гораздо опаснее. Слава тебе, герой!',19865),(36076,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы приятно удивлены твоей ловкости в охоте на горенов. Они безжалостны и свирепы и с легкостью могут разделаться с тем, кто не готов к встрече с ними.',19342),(36078,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The gladiator has seen you rip the scales off the back of a small throne, and it is unlikely that he parted with her willingly. It is more of a stone than scales, and the monsters themselves are half stone. It\'s not easy to get a trophy like that!',19865),(36080,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A gladiator saw you tear this off the back of a gronnling, which I am sure did not part with it easily. It is more like a stone than a true scale though as these brutes are part stone it seems. Not an easy trophy to collect!',0),(36081,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С глазами гронны по доброй воле не расстаются. Твой гладиатор рассказал про то, как ты $gпобедил:победила; в тяжелом бою. Этот трофей – доказательство твоих способностей. Молодчина! ',19342),(36083,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A gronn\'s eye is not something they part with alive. Your gladiator described a fight hard won and this trophy is a testament to your abilities. Well done!',0),(36084,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С ботани шутки плохи. Они невероятно хитрые, да еще и сильные, особенно на своей земле. Этот цветок – настоящее доказательство твоего воинского искусства! ',19865),(36085,5,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично!$B$BНастало время для следующей фазы нашего плана.',22810),(36086,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The botani are nothing to be trifled with. They are incredibly cunning and their powers are strong on their home land. Taking one of their blooms is an true example of your fighting skill!',0),(36090,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The infested appear to be mere husks animated by plant life. They are slow but very strong. Slaying even one is a strong demonstration of your own skill!',0),(36091,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sometimes we don\'t get turned into mulch for the jungle. Sometimes we get back up, filled with plants. The Infested are hard to kill. Slaying even one is a strong demonstration of your own skill!',0),(36092,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ancients here tend to be guardians and tenders, but that does not make them any less dangerous. An enraged ancient is something to be behold. Taking a branch from one is a worthy deed!',0),(36094,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ancients here tend to be guardians and tenders, but that does not make them any less dangerous. An enraged ancient is something to be behold. Taking a branch from one is a worthy deed!',0),(36095,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m sorry to hear Springslip didn\'t make it. He was a good agent.$B$BThis news of Azuka gaining even more power is troubling to say the least.',0),(36096,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even the insects of Gorgrond are larger and meaner than other parts of the world I have been to! Killing them, which you have obviously done, takes a great deal of strength and skill.',0),(36097,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even the insects of Gorgrond are larger and meaner than other parts of the world I have been to! Killing them, which you have obviously done, takes a great deal of strength and skill.',0),(36098,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As you can see, the venom Gorgrond wasps have is extremely powerful. To face one is to possibly face your own death. I would refrain from harvesting more of these, one enough to prove your strength here!',0),(36101,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As you can see, the venom Gorgrond wasps have is extremely powerful. To face one is to possibly face your own death. I would refrain from harvesting more of these, one enough to prove your strength here!',0),(36103,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A gruesome trophy from a gruesome beast. To be frozen and eaten slowly is not a death I would choose. The world is better with less of these basilisks in it!',0),(36104,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A gruesome trophy from a gruesome beast. To be frozen and eaten slowly is not a death I would choose. The world is better with less of these basilisks in it!',0),(36105,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have seen no elementals elsewhere in Draenor that compare in ferocity to those in Gorgrond. I wonder what caused them to be so angry. That crystal was hard-won I am sure!',0),(36106,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have seen no elementals elsewhere in Draenor that compare in ferocity to those in Gorgrond. I wonder what caused them to be so angry. That crystal was hard-won I am sure!',0),(36107,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I believe I speak for all of us when I say you are among the fiercest predators in Gorgrond! You have faced and slain Gorgrond\'s most dangerous creatures on their home ground and lived to bring something of them back here.$B$BThe gladiators have come together found something that will show the world your might! Bask in the glory champion!',0),(36108,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I believe I speak for all of us when I say you are among the fiercest predators in Gorgrond! You have faced and slain Gorgrond\'s most dangerous creatures on their home ground and lived to bring something of them back here.$B$BThe gladiators have come together found something that will show the world your might! Bask in the glory champion!',0),(36117,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты чего там рыщешь, а? Хотя, собственно, какая разница... Просто помоги мне спуститься, ладно?',19342),(36127,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, you see, $gis a real seeker: a real seeker; adventure, $n! Come to me anytime you want to look at Ashran with my eyes without leaving the Barrier of the Winds.',20886),(36133,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Потрясающе! Если найдешь еще фрагменты артефакта, принеси их мне или тем, кто в них нуждается. Так ты приблизишь час победы.',20886),(36134,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve never seen a magnaron of that size before. This is bad, $n.',0),(36136,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve never seen a magnaron of that size before. This is bad, $n.',0),(36137,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Из тебя выйдет прекрасный надзиратель, командир! Не давай спуску этим батракам!$b$bТеперь ты $gпостиг:постигла; основы заготовки леса и поиска древесины. Применим же эти знания на благо нашего гарнизона.',20886),(36158,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Чудесно, просто чудесно! Эти кристаллы пойдут на отделку твоего кольца, когда мы разберемся еще с парочкой заданий.',20779),(36160,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander! The Burning Blade attacked just a few moments ago, they are looking for the Heart of Gorgorek. $B$BThankfully, Lieutenant Thorn was here to protect us.$B$BWhat? You found a rose? Shh, hand it to me quickly. I\'ll hold onto this until the time to confess my love is right.',0),(36161,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The assassin appeared out of nowhere.$B$BBaros took the blade that was meant for my heart. I ripped out the throat of our attacker... but I was too late.$B$BBaros gave me this flower before he passed.$B$B<Thorn holds up the rose. A tear rolls down her cheek.>',0),(36162,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today was not a good day.',0),(36163,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming, $n.',0),(36164,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see that you and Yrel have stared into the eyes of the most primal of the elementals, and not waivered from your path.$B$BIt pleases me to say that your courage is not lacking.$B$BWell done.',0),(36166,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I swear by the spirits, by the spirits... how my head hurts...',20574),(36167,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News of your deeds precedes you. Rangari Saardar already sent word of your excellent work.$B$BThanks to the both of you, $n.',0),(36168,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It seems you have been successful in your journey.$B$BHow do I know this? If you had not passed the challenge of the ancestors, you would not have returned at all.',0),(36169,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, champion. Well done.',0),(36171,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We beat back nature, Commander. May I be excused? I\'d like to get all this sap out of my armor.',0),(36189,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Из тебя выйдет прекрасный надсмотрщик! Не давай спуску этим дровосекам!$b$bТеперь ты знаешь основы заготовки леса и поиска древесины. Применим же эти знания на благо твоего гарнизона.',22810),(36192,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Так-то, командир!$b$bТеперь мы работаем на полную мощность. Когда у вас будет достаточно древесины для размещения заказа, возвращайся ко мне, и мы приступим.$b$bГарнизон сам себя не построит!',19243),(36193,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank the Light! All of the rangari who were missing have returned accounted for. Thank you, hero.',0),(36194,1,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,'И это они еще даже не старались.$b$bУверен, помощь боевых дровосеков окажется незаменимой, командир. Средние деревья по всему Дренору отныне беззащитны перед тобой. А с каждого такого дерева мы получим еще больше древесины!',19243),(36195,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is fantastic! This sample indicates massive timber reserves in the large timber found across Draenor. And now with the Wood Annihilator XXI the Third, Jr. at your disposal you\'ll be able to chop those towering monstrosities down with ease.$B$BGet off my back, I didn\'t name it.',0),(36196,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты только $gявился:явилась;? Что ж, лучше поздно, чем никогда.',20779),(36197,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah, this Zurg is really evil, right?',20779),(36198,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Потрясающе! Если найдешь еще фрагменты артефакта, принеси их мне или тем, кто в них нуждается. Так ты приблизишь час победы.',20779),(36205,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My father\'s hammer, where did you find this!?',0),(36206,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С этим разобрались. Как только они прибыли на Дренор, Гаррош убил своего спасителя.$b$bНо он не довел дело до конца. Дух дракона все еще не упокоен.$b$bНадеюсь, ты $gготов:готова; к сражению.',20779),(36207,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where did you find this hammer!?',0),(36208,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Некоторые делают из кристаллов горенов оружие. Правда, оставшаяся на таком кристалле кислота смертельно опасна даже для того, кто им вооружен.',20574),(36209,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Поиски увенчались успехом?',20574),(36210,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Эти панцири – как раз то, что нужно.',20574),(36219,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I won\'t waste your time, champ. I\'ve got a once in a lifetime opportunity for you.',0),(36220,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If you\'ve killed; Lug\'dola, you\'re definitely in the test arena. $B$BI don\'t even care if you\'re gsmall:small; and not ogre.',19342),(36223,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну что ж, записи у нас. Посмотрим, что из них удастся узнать о вражеской стратегии.',20574),(36226,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have the spirit of a real researcher, $n.',20779),(36227,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ALL FIVE? PFF. TAKE YOUR REWARD AND GO BACK.',20779),(36228,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'YES YES! <Sniffs armor parts> MM-M ... BLOOD! FRESH!',20779),(36230,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, thank you for avenging my death.',0),(36236,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кажется, вам досталась особенная портновская книга.$B$BОна принадлежит Амике, лучшей портнихе в деревне Эмбаари.',19865),(36238,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This entire time... I have been so consumed with my own grief.$B$BI never once stopped to consider how much my father was suffering at the hands of our enemies.$B$BThank you so much, $C, for helping him to return to me. Please, allow me to repair his hammer.$B$BIn exchange for everything you have done for us, I will teach you whatever you wish to know.',0),(36239,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, my. One of my satchels! Where did you find this? I lost it weeks ago.$B$BI\'ve been so busy training I forgot to collect herbs for Master Ardule. I need your help $n, if you are willing, but I must warn you - the herbs can be quite dangerous!$B$BHand me the satchel and I\'ll restore the protective inscription to guard you from harmful toxins.',0),(36240,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was fast, $n! And such a generous delivery!$B$BI\'ve secured the ink in a vial for you, but please be careful.',0),(36241,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My, $n. Your delivery...$B$BI don\'t know how to thank you enough.$B$BThis is a substantial amount of ink. You\'ve helped ensure our history for generations to come.$B$BPerhaps I can repay you with a taste of the very knowledge you\'ve helped preserve?',0),(36242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew it was only a matter of time before Azuka would make her move.',0),(36248,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Azuka\'s reign of terror continues... we need a new plan.',0),(36255,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Interesting, an Arakkoa recently visited the garrison looking for an armor piece with a powerful enchantment like this. His name was Delath.$B$BThe enchantment on this bracer is beyond my skill, but perhaps this Delath can give you the necessary insight to replicate it.',0),(36256,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do I also detect that you have in your possession an artifact of our land? $B$BCan I see it?$B$BOne of Oru\'kai\'s bracers... Thank you!',0),(36257,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. I thought I was going to be stuck here forever.',0),(36260,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes... This is it, after so many years. Soon, I will have all of the Armaments of Oru\'kai.$B$BReturn my ring as well and I will fulfill the promise I made to that squeamish orc. $B$BTake this book. If you have any skill, you can use it to decipher and learn Draenor\'s enchantments. $B$BOf course, you will need a proper workplace as well. Here are plans; hopefully you can follow them.$B$BNow, be gone, and steer clear of the other armaments, for they are mine.',0),(36262,470,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это что, моя портновская книга? Точно! Какое счастье, она цела! Как я могу тебя отблагодарить?',20779),(36266,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'И вновь ты $gоказал:оказала; мне большую услугу.$b$bНачнем же.',20886),(36269,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Превосходно! Ткань и магия идеально сбалансированы и стабильны.\n\nРада признать, что ты $gовладел:овладела; основами моего портновского искусства. Я восхищаюсь твоим мастерством и неутомимым желанием учиться чему-то новому.\n\nДавай я дам тебе еще несколько отрезов и материалов. Надеюсь, они пригодятся тебе в путешествии.',20886),(36271,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great, commander! Before you know it, we\'ll have your skin or fur ready for you. Now that you know how to use the trap, you can hunt with it whenever you want. Really, our stable isn\'t rubber, so before you catch any new creatures, make sure there\'s room!',20886),(36272,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, commander! We\'ll get to grillin\' up those steaks right away. I can already smell them!',0),(36274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must have been quite a fight, commander!$B$BThe materials we obtain from beasts of this magnitude will last us for quite a while.',0),(36280,603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не стану тратить твое время. Такая возможность выпадает только раз в жизни.',19342),(36281,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I won\'t waste your time, champ. I\'ve got a once in a lifetime opportunity for you.',0),(36282,603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не стану тратить твое время. Такая возможность выпадает только раз в жизни.',19116),(36289,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ll need to keep an eye on this Azuka Bladefury character. Sounds dangerous.',0),(36301,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was chased by ogres and had to leave my bag behind. It looks like almost everything is here, except for... oh, no!',0),(36308,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Интересно. Недавно в гарнизон заглядывал араккоа по имени Делат и искал деталь доспеха, на которую наложены как раз такие мощные чары.\n\nЭти заклятья мне неподвластны. Возможно, как раз Делат сможет подсказать тебе, как их воспроизвести.',19865),(36309,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This... this is my satchel... but how?$B$BDid you see a boy - a young boy near this? You must tell me where you found it!$B$BI tried to fight them, but the looters... they were too strong! They almost killed me!$B$BPlease, please....$B$BI\'d give anything to have my only son back! I cannot fail him....',0),(36310,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я не ошибаюсь, у тебя в руках артефакт наших земель? \n\nПозволь мне взглянуть на него.\n\nОдин из браслетов Ору\'кая… Благодарю!',19116),(36311,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My boy!$B$B<A tear falls down his cheek, clearing a path down to the skin where soot once rested.>$B$BYou... no words can explain how grateful I am.$B$BI can only repay what I have to offer, which isn\'t much in terms of valued goods. Most of my work goes straight to our soldiers. I do, however, carry the wisdom of my people and my craft.$B$BIt would be an honor if you allowed me to share some of this wisdom with you.$B$BMay the light guide you, $n.',0),(36313,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе. Я думала, что застряла здесь навсегда.',19116),(36314,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Please, allow me to take a closer look.',0),(36315,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О да, наконец-то. После стольких лет! Скоро я соберу все артефакты Ору\'кая.\n\nВерни мое кольцо, и я исполню обещание, данное этой привередливой дренейке. \n\nВозьми эту книгу. Если ты хоть что-нибудь умеешь, то она поможет тебе расшифровывать и изучить чары Дренора. \n\nТебе также понадобится подходящее рабочее место. Вот чертежи, надеюсь, ты в состоянии следовать им.\n\nА теперь исчезни. И держись подальше от остального оружия – оно мое.',19116),(36316,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There may now be hope for a brighter future. I can only hope that some of the people in the Celestial Way have come to their senses.',20886),(36341,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your feats seem to know no limits, $n. Today, our garrison forces have struck a terrible blow to Warchief Hellscream and the Iron Horde.$B$BHowever, he is not defeated so easily. If anything, his hunger for vengeance will grow.$B$BWe must destroy the root of his operations in Tanaan Jungle, but first, there is much preparation to be done.$B$BUntil then, bask in the glow of our momentous victory.',0),(36342,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your feats seem to know no limits, $n. Today, you and your garrison forces have struck a terrible blow to Warchief Hellscream and the Iron Horde.$B$BHowever, he is not defeated so easily. If anything, his hunger for vengeance will grow.$B$BWe must destroy the root of his operations in Tanaan Jungle, but first, there is much preparation to be done.$B$BUntil then, bask in the glow of our momentous victory.',0),(36344,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ловушка выдержала! Уже чувствую запах мяса. Отличный будет пир для наших воинов!',19342),(36345,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Очень хорошо. Кожа или мех скоро будут готовы.$B$BТеперь ты умеешь обращаться с ловушкой и сможешь использовать ее в любое время. Правда, хлев у нас не резиновый. Не советую брать от земли больше, чем необходимо.',19243),(36346,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thunder and lightning! I bet it was a hell of a massacre!$B$BThat much material will last us long enough. ',19342),(36352,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$R, how can I repay you for returning this pendant to me?',0),(36376,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We sent them packing, Commander!',0),(36378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This diamond is marvelous! I shiver at the mere thought of the massive creature this must have come from...',0),(36380,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help $n, please take this pendant along with a copy of my research.$B$BI hope these will prove useful in helping you to better understand the secrets of Draenic gems.$B$BUntil we meet again, friend.',0),(36408,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What have you got here...$B$BOnly a keen eye would be able to spot the potential of this drained crystal. You may not be familiar with draenei crystals yet, but your familiarity with gems certainly shows.$B$BTell you what... if you would assist me in the troubles we\'re having with our local defense crystals I\'d gladly share some of my own expertise in jewelcrafting with you.',0),(36409,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve found it! This crystal is overflowing with energy. This is definitely what we were looking for.$B$BI fear even thinking about what kind of ritual this orc was planning to undergo with the power from this crystal.$B$BYou\'ve done a great thing for us, $C. As promised, I would like to show you my appreciation by teaching you how to work with some of our native gems and crystals. I trust you will put the knowledge to good use.',0),(36412,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You were a blaze amongst our foes, Commander. It looks like we\'ll see another dawn in Draenor.',0),(36414,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nothing like a little righteous bloodshed, to shake the chill from these old bones.',0),(36417,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This looks to be all of the cloth, but it appears that they tried to rip and pull the magic out by physical force. I think I see teeth marks...',0),(36419,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There, you\'re on the path to becoming a true Hexweave tailor.$B$BDo not share the secrets I\'ve shown you here with anyone.',0),(36423,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Let\'s see if your pets like their new space!',0),(36429,603,5,603,273,0,0,0,0,'Он говорил: \"Братья вновь объединились\".$B$BОн говорил: \"Мир полон сокровищ, которые можно присвоить себе\".$B$B\"Несметных богатств\", – так он говорил!$B$BА потом сбросил на меня бревно.$B$B\"В \"Баров Индастриз\" может быть только один генеральный директор\", – сказал он.$B$BНу, хоть в этим мы с ним сходимся...',19342),(36435,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have been studying these orcish texts feverishly since our arrival here. Allow me a moment to translate this for you.$B$BHmmm... The notes appear to contain a list of names.',0),(36438,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah, you have strong friends, $p! You need to hurry until the plants have realized that the path is clear.',20574),(36448,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Weldon holds Alexi\'s head up to his face and begins speaking.>$B$BYou no-good, backstabbing son-of-a-goat! Your greed is only surpassed by my own!$B$BAs for you my peasant friend, you have served me well. Here are your just rewards!',19116),(36457,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You know the trick to fooling a bunch of Orcs? Every once in a while you\'ve got to be holding all the cards!',0),(36469,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice job, brudda. I hope your pets be likin\' dere new home.',0),(36471,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Next time I won\'t go so easy on you!',0),(36475,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, this is it, THIS IS IT! Just give me a moment while I look through these.$B$BHmm... I think there are a few things here that you may find very useful. Here, take these plans with you.$B$BDon\'t worry about me, commander. I\'m just gonna take another look around before I sneak out of here.',0),(36477,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, I see that you\'ve found my lovelies. Beautiful, aren\'t they? It\'s a shame that the process drives them so... insane.$B$BThe ring is yours to keep, of course. Can you hear them whisper? Marvelous.',0),(36483,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew you could do it, kid.',0),(36495,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'C возвращением, $n.',22810),(36502,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мне доводилось видеть растения, имитирующие гидр, но чтобы имитация была лучше оригинала? Такое только в Горгронде возможно. Отличная работа, $p.',19116),(36503,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In these parts even plants turn into bloodthirsty monsters. Biogor was one of the most dangerous; it was motionless, like a plant, waiting in an ambush until the victim came too close. This monster deserved to die...',19342),(36505,603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Славный плащ! Жаль только, что у нас больше нет ресурсов, чтобы делать такие.',20886),(36508,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, что $gзамолвил:замолвила; за меня словечко, командир.',20574),(36510,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),(36511,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),(36513,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),(36514,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),(36515,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),(36516,11,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О, я смотрю, ты $gперемазан:перемазана; смолой с головы до ног, $n!$B$BЧто ж, как и было обещано, я помогу тебе починить твой плащ. У меня для тебя наверняка найдется и еще что-нибудь полезное.$B$BТак что заглядывай в гости, не стесняйся!',20886),(36517,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),(36573,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, we dealt a terrible blow to the Iron Horde\'s forces.',19342),(36576,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Командир, мы нанесли мощный удар Железной Орде. Мы еще ее разгромим.',20574),(36589,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think we could get into some serious trouble with this beauty!',0),(36594,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What did you think of my rapid disassembly tech? Pretty effective, yeah?',0),(36601,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Командир, хорошо, что ты снова здесь.\n\nВ Награнде что-то происходит. Сейчас расскажу все подробности.',20886),(36602,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Boss, it\'s good to have you back.\n\nSomething\'s going on at the Awards. Let me give you the details.',19342),(36608,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gпришел:пришла; из Дренора? Как такое вообще возможно?!',24015),(36609,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Чтобы произвести на Пэгла впечатление, нам нужно поймать что-то очень-очень большое!',24015),(36611,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s the fish, $n! All fish fish fish! You\'re doing great!',24015),(36612,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s good... Such a fish will impress even those who are far from fishing, and Nata!',24015),(36616,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты и в самом деле $gвеликий рыбак:великая рыбачка;!\n\nЯ с радостью присоединюсь к тебе, и вместе мы наловим целую прорву рыб-гигантов. Но сперва нужно захватить с собой выпить.',24015),(36617,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There\'s a small note in the gift that says: \"Happy holidays, $n!\".',19342),(36627,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmmm... sounds like it still needs a bit more punch. Let me get back to work on it, boss, I\'ll see what I can do!$B$BGood news is, we know a lot more about the Iron Horde tech now. I made a copy of my notes for ya.',0),(36632,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Gorgrond, Commander. We only just arrived ourselves.',0),(36641,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, сейчас распакую.$b$bСразу предупреждаю – этот заказ нам удалось выполнить сверхсрочно, но на все будущие будет уходить больше времени.',19342),(36643,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, сейчас распакую.$b$bСразу предупреждаю – этот заказ нам удалось выполнить сверхсрочно, но на все будущие будет уходить больше времени.',19865),(36644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me unpack that for you.$B$BI should let you know - while we managed to expedite this one, future work orders will take longer.',0),(36645,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, сейчас распакую.$b$bСразу предупреждаю – этот заказ нам удалось выполнить сверхсрочно, но на все будущие будет уходить больше времени.',19342),(36646,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, сейчас распакую.$b$bСразу предупреждаю – этот заказ нам удалось выполнить сверхсрочно, но на все будущие будет уходить больше времени.',19342),(36647,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, сейчас распакую.$b$bСразу предупреждаю – этот заказ нам удалось выполнить сверхсрочно, но на все будущие будет уходить больше времени.',20886),(36648,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of the assault has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),(36649,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Уже вернулись гонцы с вестями о ходе наступления – и с трофеями, конечно же.$B$BПоздравляю с успехом, командир.',19116),(36650,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nothing teaches a bully better than a bloody nose! Good fight, Commander. It\'s an honor to stand with you.',0),(36655,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t know what\'s worse, the brutality of this Iron Horde or the tempered menace of our old foes. It doesn\'t matter. Neither measures against our strength, Commander.',0),(36662,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You showed \'em, boss!',0),(36667,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы получили хорошие вести с полей, босс. Уже и первые трофеи есть.$B$BПусть знают, с кем связались.',19342),(36671,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Incredible! You\'ve got real moxy, kid.',0),(36674,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of the assault has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),(36675,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of the assault has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),(36676,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of the assault has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),(36677,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of the assault has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),(36678,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of the assault has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),(36679,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of the assault has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),(36680,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of the assault has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),(36681,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of the assault has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),(36682,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Уже вернулись гонцы с вестями о ходе наступления – и с трофеями, конечно же.$B$BПоздравляю с успехом, командир.',19243),(36683,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of the assault has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),(36684,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of your glory in battle has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),(36685,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Уже вернулись гонцы с вестями о ходе наступления – и с трофеями, конечно же.$B$BПоздравляю с успехом, командир.',19342),(36686,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Уже вернулись гонцы с вестями о ходе наступления – и с трофеями, конечно же.$B$BПоздравляю с успехом, командир.',19243),(36687,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hear you were a sight to see in the ring. I\'m proud to serve by your side, commander.',0),(36688,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News about da assault beat ya back, boss-mon. And some spoils of the fightin\'.$B$BYa be a force to be reckonin\' with.',0),(36689,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News about da assault beat ya back, boss-mon. And some spoils of the fightin\'.$B$BYa be a force to be reckonin\' with.',0),(36690,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News about da assault beat ya back, boss-mon. And some spoils of the fightin\'.$B$BYa be a force to be reckonin\' with.',0),(36692,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News about da assault beat ya back, boss-mon. And some spoils of the fightin\'.$B$BYa be a force to be reckonin\' with.',0),(36693,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News about da assault beat ya back, boss-mon. And some spoils of the fightin\'.$B$BYa be a force to be reckonin\' with.',0),(36694,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News about da assault beat ya back, boss-mon. And some spoils of the fightin\'.$B$BYa be a force to be reckonin\' with.',0),(36696,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News about da assault beat ya back, boss-mon. And some spoils of the fightin\'.$B$BYa be a force to be reckonin\' with.',0),(36698,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы получили хорошие вести с поля боя, босс. Уже и первые трофеи есть.$B$BПсы Альянса поджали хвост, увидев тебя в деле.',19342),(36699,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы получили хорошие вести с полей, босс. Уже и первые трофеи есть.$B$BПусть знают, с кем связались.',19342),(36700,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I been hearin\' ya were a sight ya see in the ring.$B$BWe made some bets on ya. Easy money.',0),(36701,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы получили хорошие вести с полей, босс. Уже и первые трофеи есть.$B$BПусть знают, с кем связались.',19342),(36702,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'МЯСЫШ ЧУВСТВУЕТ СЕБЯ ЛУЧШЕ!$B$BМЯСЫШ ТЕПЕРЬ ДРАТЬСЯ ЗА |3-3($N)!$B$BМЯСЫШ ТЕПЕРЬ ВСЕГДА ХОДИТЬ ЗА |3-4($N)!!!',23911),(36705,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it. You really did it! You\'re the new lord of the ring!',0),(36711,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gпринес:принесла; мое снаряжение! Видать, удача все-таки в кои-то веки решила повернуться ко мне лицом!$B$BАбу\'гар вернет тебе должок, уж будь $gспокоен:спокойна;!$B$BСперва только вот выловлю рыбу-гиганта...',20574),(36741,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And here\'s your potion, $n! If you don\'t have any use for it, maybe gift it to a friend who does?',0),(36742,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is made. If you don\'t have any use for it, give it to one of our melee.',0),(36790,2,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наши жизни слишком ценны.\nПриятно знать, что убийцы понесли заслуженную кару.\n\nСпасибо тебе, $n, ты $gоказал:оказала; нам великую честь.',22810),(36791,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here she is! Careful with her, these potions have a reputation for mysteriously disappearing.',0),(36800,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я готов купить у тебя всех рыб-гигантов, которых ты поймаешь, ну вроде этой. Заглядывай ко мне с уловом в любое время, и я предложу тебе самую лучшую цену!',24015),(36802,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will take any lunkers you like find like this off your hands. Come back and see me anytime you catch one and I will pay you top dollar!',0),(36803,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will take any lunkers you like find like this off your hands. Come back and see me anytime you catch one and I will pay you top dollar!',0),(36804,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will take any lunkers you like find like this off your hands. Come back and see me anytime you catch one and I will pay you top dollar!',0),(36805,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will take any lunkers you like find like this off your hands. Come back and see me anytime you catch one and I will pay you top dollar!',0),(36806,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will take any lunkers you like find like this off your hands. Come back and see me anytime you catch one and I will pay you top dollar!',0),(36813,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Within this pouch I have placed three Everbloom seeds. You merely have to crush the seed to release the spores within. Inhale deeply and let the subversive infestation take hold.$B$BOnce empowered you will become an unstoppable force of nature; though be warned, I have modified these seeds to cause you minimal harm, thus their potency is somewhat reduced.$B$BYou must not undergo the transformation too frequently.$B$BShould you require more seeds I will offer them to you - for a small price.',0),(36830,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They\'re defeated! I\'m glad we came here, Commander. To Draenor. Fighting against demons reminds me why we fight for the Alliance.',0),(36831,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Уфф! Мы отбились от этих проклятых демонов, командир. Но моя кровь до сих пор словно кипит. Посмотри – у меня глаза не красные?',19342),(36832,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If the perfume\'s not with Zach, Zach\'s not with it. But Zach likes you.',19342),(36833,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты очень меня $Gвпечатлил:впечатлила;, $n. Если не возражаешь, я бы хотела присоединиться к твоему гарнизону.',20574),(36843,603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is Ahan alive? Bless us, Light, that\'s the good news!',20779),(36848,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your efforts will be well rewarded, $n. The ancient waygates now serve you.',0),(36861,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey, you\'re from that Alliance base right?$B$BGlad you made the trip because we really could use your help!',0),(36870,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will do nicely... A fish like this would be hard for anyone to deny, especially Nat!',0),(36874,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We may kill from sky break to sky fall and still our work will never be done. Yet at the end of days when we are measured for our accomplishments, only the bloody wake that we have left behind us will show our true strength. For this reason you must never stop the slaughter of those that would seek to harm us and our loved ones.$B$BPromise me, $n.$B$BNever. Stop.',0),(36882,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We should really catch some big one\'s when Nat\'s gets here!',0),(36884,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'М-М... КАКОЕ МЯГКОЕ. И ВСЕ ЕЩЕ ТЕПЛОЕ. ОТЛИЧНО.',20779),(36889,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A last warning: once you have accepted this choice you cannot reverse it or make a new choice until you complete your mission$B$BIf your choice is certain, your aim will be true.$B$BStrike fear in the hearts and minds of the enemy! For the Horde. For Draenor.',0),(36897,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With this heart you will see and hear things as only the great spirits can. Your enemy will be unable to hide from your unrelenting assaults.',0),(36911,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That talbuk\'s already settled down for the night. It will need some rest and grooming before it\'s ready for the next stage in its training.',19116),(36912,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have bedded the clefthoof down for the night, it will need rest before it is ready for training.',0),(36913,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That boar has taken to the hay. We\'ll let it rest up a bit before more training.',0),(36914,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It almost bit me, but I\'ve got it bedded down and happy. A wolf, in my stables! Who\'d have thought?',0),(36915,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Quite a big one, but it fits! It\'s resting, we\'ll talk about training it tomorrow.',0),(36916,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Was it cold up there? This guy seems to appreciate the warmth, he\'s already snoozin\'!',0),(36917,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The talbuk appears to be doing well. Allow it to rest before you continue the beast\'s training.',0),(36918,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve gone and dried it off already. We\'ll see about training this thing tomorrow.',0),(36921,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The truth of your deeds is in your eyes. Your hunger for the enemy sated with cries for mercy and rivers of blood.$B$BTake now your place as manslayer.',0),(